:\"Analizuj i zalecaj\",\"Maintenance Mode\":\"Tryb konserwacji\",\"Every\":\"Co\",\"No suppression telemetry yet.\":\"Brak telemetrii tłumienia.\",\"Coordinates\":\"Współrzędne\",\"Map Help\":\"Pomoc mapy\",\"Send Back\":\"Odeślij\",\"Top entity types\":\"Najważniejsze typy encji\",\"Subsystem Self-Test\":\"Autotest podsystemów\",\"Feed\":\"Nakarm\",\"Native Web Map settings saved. Terrain export layer choices apply to the next terrain update/rebuild.\":\"Ustawienia natywnej mapy WWW zapisane. Wybór warstw eksportu terenu zostanie zastosowany przy następnej aktualizacji/przebudowie terenu.\",\"Public map title\":\"Tytuł publicznej mapy\",\"New Players — Last 30 Days\":\"Nowi gracze — ostatnie 30 dni\",\"No mod-environment change has been recorded yet.\":\"Nie zarejestrowano jeszcze zmian środowiska modów.\",\"Anti-Cheat Module\":\"Moduł Anti-Cheat\",\"Adaptive Server Baseline\":\"Adaptacyjna linia bazowa serwera\",\"Session time\":\"Czas sesji\",\"Manual\":\"Ręczne\",\"Export Schedule\":\"Harmonogram eksportu\",\"Recommended Rules\":\"Zalecane reguły\",\"Enable\":\"Włącz\",\"Profiler diagnostics are disabled or no lag evidence has been recorded.\":\"Diagnostyka profilera jest wyłączona lub nie zarejestrowano dowodów opóźnień.\",\"Limit\":\"Limit\",\"Map data unavailable.\":\"Dane mapy niedostępne.\",\"Daily low\":\"Dzienne minimum\",\"Download\":\"Pobierz\",\"Player Commands\":\"Polecenia gracza\",\"No slot selected.\":\"Nie wybrano slotu.\",\"Restrictions\":\"Ograniczenia\",\"Movement False-Positive Hardening\":\"Ograniczanie fałszywych alarmów ruchu\",\"Copied to clipboard.\":\"Skopiowano do schowka.\",\"Major\":\"Poważne\",\"Save depth\":\"Głębokość zapisu\",\"Scanner Health\":\"Stan skanera\",\"Chunk Pressure Heatmap\":\"Mapa cieplna obciążenia chunków\",\"In-game date\":\"Data w grze\",\"Watch\":\"Obserwuj\",\"Runtime behavior\":\"Zachowanie w czasie działania\",\"Configuration\":\"Konfiguracja\",\"Current Players\":\"Aktualni gracze\",\"Smart diagnosis is waiting for profiler diagnostics.\":\"Inteligentna diagnostyka czeka na dane profilera.\",\"Filters\":\"Filtry\"});\n\n// 1.2.28 client-only mod inventory + mobile navigation localization.\nObject.assign(WEB_COMMON_LITERALS.ru,{\n  'Navigation':'Навигация','File':'Файл','Policy':'Политика','All Reported Mods':'Все заявленные моды',\n  'Only mods reported by this player that are not present in the server-loaded mod baseline.':'Только моды, о которых сообщил этот игрок и которых нет в загруженной на сервере базовой линии модов.',\n  'Use this section first when checking for cosmetic, utility, automation, or other client-side additions. The full inventory remains below for shared-mod integrity comparison.':'Сначала используйте этот раздел для проверки косметических, служебных, автоматизирующих и других клиентских дополнений. Полный список ниже остаётся для сравнения целостности общих модов.',\n  'Shared server/client mods and client-only mods together.':'Общие серверные/клиентские и только клиентские моды вместе.',\n  'Shared mods are compared against the protected server baseline first. Client-only mods use policy and ModDB evidence where available.':'Общие моды сначала сравниваются с защищённой серверной базовой линией. Для клиентских модов используются политика и данные ModDB, если они доступны.',\n  'Separate true client-side additions from mods shared with the server, then review exact ModDB comparison, policy state, and loaded assemblies.':'Отделяйте реальные клиентские дополнения от модов, общих с сервером, затем проверяйте точное сравнение ModDB, состояние политики и загруженные сборки.',\n  'No client-only mods reported. Every reported mod is shared with the server baseline or no client mod inventory is available.':'Клиентские моды не обнаружены. Все заявленные моды общие с серверной базовой линией либо инвентарь клиентских модов недоступен.'\n});\nObject.assign(WEB_COMMON_LITERALS.fr,{\n  'Navigation':'Navigation','File':'Fichier','Policy':'Politique','All Reported Mods':'Tous les mods signalés',\n  'Only mods reported by this player that are not present in the server-loaded mod baseline.':'Uniquement les mods signalés par ce joueur qui ne sont pas présents dans la référence des mods chargés sur le serveur.',\n  'Use this section first when checking for cosmetic, utility, automation, or other client-side additions. The full inventory remains below for shared-mod integrity comparison.':'Utilisez d’abord cette section pour repérer les ajouts côté client cosmétiques, utilitaires, d’automatisation ou autres. L’inventaire complet reste disponible ci-dessous pour comparer l’intégrité des mods partagés.',\n  'Shared server/client mods and client-only mods together.':'Mods partagés serveur/client et mods exclusivement côté client.',\n  'Shared mods are compared against the protected server baseline first. Client-only mods use policy and ModDB evidence where available.':'Les mods partagés sont d’abord comparés à la référence serveur protégée. Les mods côté client utilisent la politique et les preuves ModDB lorsqu’elles sont disponibles.',\n  'Separate true client-side additions from mods shared with the server, then review exact ModDB comparison, policy state, and loaded assemblies.':'Séparez les véritables ajouts côté client des mods partagés avec le serveur, puis examinez la comparaison ModDB exacte, l’état de la politique et les assemblies chargés.',\n  'No client-only mods reported. Every reported mod is shared with the server baseline or no client mod inventory is available.':'Aucun mod exclusivement côté client signalé. Tous les mods signalés sont partagés avec la référence serveur, ou l’inventaire des mods client est indisponible.'\n});\nObject.assign(WEB_COMMON_LITERALS.de,{\n  'Navigation':'Navigation','File':'Datei','Policy':'Richtlinie','All Reported Mods':'Alle gemeldeten Mods',\n  'Only mods reported by this player that are not present in the server-loaded mod baseline.':'Nur Mods, die von diesem Spieler gemeldet wurden und nicht in der auf dem Server geladenen Mod-Basis vorhanden sind.',\n  'Use this section first when checking for cosmetic, utility, automation, or other client-side additions. The full inventory remains below for shared-mod integrity comparison.':'Verwende diesen Abschnitt zuerst, um kosmetische, Hilfs-, Automatisierungs- oder andere reine Client-Erweiterungen zu prüfen. Das vollständige Inventar bleibt darunter für Integritätsvergleiche gemeinsamer Mods verfügbar.',\n  'Shared server/client mods and client-only mods together.':'Gemeinsame Server-/Client-Mods und reine Client-Mods zusammen.',\n  'Shared mods are compared against the protected server baseline first. Client-only mods use policy and ModDB evidence where available.':'Gemeinsame Mods werden zuerst mit der geschützten Server-Basis verglichen. Für reine Client-Mods werden Richtlinie und ModDB-Nachweise verwendet, sofern verfügbar.',\n  'Separate true client-side additions from mods shared with the server, then review exact ModDB comparison, policy state, and loaded assemblies.':'Trenne echte reine Client-Erweiterungen von mit dem Server geteilten Mods und prüfe anschließend den exakten ModDB-Vergleich, den Richtlinienstatus und die geladenen Assemblies.',\n  'No client-only mods reported. Every reported mod is shared with the server baseline or no client mod inventory is available.':'Keine reinen Client-Mods gemeldet. Alle gemeldeten Mods sind mit der Server-Basis geteilt oder das Client-Mod-Inventar ist nicht verfügbar.'\n});\nObject.assign(WEB_COMMON_LITERALS.es,{\n  'Navigation':'Navegación','File':'Archivo','Policy':'Política','All Reported Mods':'Todos los mods reportados',\n  'Only mods reported by this player that are not present in the server-loaded mod baseline.':'Solo los mods reportados por este jugador que no están presentes en la línea base de mods cargados del servidor.',\n  'Use this section first when checking for cosmetic, utility, automation, or other client-side additions. The full inventory remains below for shared-mod integrity comparison.':'Usa primero esta sección para revisar complementos cosméticos, utilidades, automatización u otros añadidos solo de cliente. El inventario completo sigue debajo para comparar la integridad de los mods compartidos.',\n  'Shared server/client mods and client-only mods together.':'Mods compartidos entre servidor/cliente y mods solo de cliente juntos.',\n  'Shared mods are compared against the protected server baseline first. Client-only mods use policy and ModDB evidence where available.':'Los mods compartidos se comparan primero con la línea base protegida del servidor. Los mods solo de cliente usan la política y la evidencia de ModDB cuando están disponibles.',\n  'Separate true client-side additions from mods shared with the server, then review exact ModDB comparison, policy state, and loaded assemblies.':'Separa los añadidos realmente solo de cliente de los mods compartidos con el servidor y luego revisa la comparación exacta de ModDB, el estado de la política y los ensamblados cargados.',\n  'No client-only mods reported. Every reported mod is shared with the server baseline or no client mod inventory is available.':'No se reportaron mods solo de cliente. Todos los mods reportados se comparten con la línea base del servidor o el inventario de mods del cliente no está disponible.'\n});\nObject.assign(WEB_COMMON_LITERALS.pt,{\n  'Navigation':'Navegação','File':'Arquivo','Policy':'Política','All Reported Mods':'Todos os mods reportados',\n  'Only mods reported by this player that are not present in the server-loaded mod baseline.':'Apenas mods reportados por este jogador que não estão presentes na linha de base de mods carregados no servidor.',\n  'Use this section first when checking for cosmetic, utility, automation, or other client-side additions. The full inventory remains below for shared-mod integrity comparison.':'Use esta seção primeiro para verificar adições cosméticas, utilitárias, de automação ou outras exclusivas do cliente. O inventário completo continua abaixo para comparar a integridade dos mods compartilhados.',\n  'Shared server/client mods and client-only mods together.':'Mods compartilhados entre servidor/cliente e mods exclusivos do cliente juntos.',\n  'Shared mods are compared against the protected server baseline first. Client-only mods use policy and ModDB evidence where available.':'Os mods compartilhados são comparados primeiro com a linha de base protegida do servidor. Mods exclusivos do cliente usam a política e as evidências do ModDB quando disponíveis.',\n  'Separate true client-side additions from mods shared with the server, then review exact ModDB comparison, policy state, and loaded assemblies.':'Separe as adições realmente exclusivas do cliente dos mods compartilhados com o servidor e depois revise a comparação exata do ModDB, o estado da política e os assemblies carregados.',\n  'No client-only mods reported. Every reported mod is shared with the server baseline or no client mod inventory is available.':'Nenhum mod exclusivo do cliente foi reportado. Todos os mods reportados são compartilhados com a linha de base do servidor ou o inventário de mods do cliente não está disponível.'\n});\nObject.assign(WEB_COMMON_LITERALS.pl,{\n  'Navigation':'Nawigacja','File':'Plik','Policy':'Zasady','All Reported Mods':'Wszystkie zgłoszone mody',\n  'Only mods reported by this player that are not present in the server-loaded mod baseline.':'Tylko mody zgłoszone przez tego gracza, których nie ma w linii bazowej modów załadowanych na serwerze.',\n  'Use this section first when checking for cosmetic, utility, automation, or other client-side additions. The full inventory remains below for shared-mod integrity comparison.':'Najpierw użyj tej sekcji do sprawdzania kosmetycznych, użytkowych, automatyzujących i innych dodatków działających tylko po stronie klienta. Pełny wykaz poniżej pozostaje do porównywania integralności współdzielonych modów.',\n  'Shared server/client mods and client-only mods together.':'Współdzielone mody serwer/klient i mody tylko po stronie klienta razem.',\n  'Shared mods are compared against the protected server baseline first. Client-only mods use policy and ModDB evidence where available.':'Współdzielone mody są najpierw porównywane z chronioną linią bazową serwera. Dla modów tylko po stronie klienta używane są zasady i dane ModDB, jeśli są dostępne.',\n  'Separate true client-side additions from mods shared with the server, then review exact ModDB comparison, policy state, and loaded assemblies.':'Oddziel prawdziwe dodatki tylko po stronie klienta od modów współdzielonych z serwerem, a następnie sprawdź dokładne porównanie ModDB, stan zasad i załadowane zestawy.',\n  'No client-only mods reported. Every reported mod is shared with the server baseline or no client mod inventory is available.':'Nie zgłoszono modów działających tylko po stronie klienta. Wszystkie zgłoszone mody są współdzielone z linią bazową serwera albo wykaz modów klienta jest niedostępny.'\n});\n\nfunction translateCommonLiteralText(root=document.body){\n  if(!root)return;\n  const target=WEB_COMMON_LITERALS[currentWebLanguage]||{};\n  const reverse={};\n  for(const [canon] of Object.entries(WEB_COMMON_LITERALS.ru||{}))reverse[canon]=canon;\n  for(const map of Object.values(WEB_COMMON_LITERALS))for(const [canon,val] of Object.entries(map))reverse[val]=canon;\n  reverse['BlockLogger']='BlockLogger'; reverse['Block Logging']='BlockLogger';\n  const translatedValue=raw=>{\n    const trimmed=String(raw??'').trim(); if(!trimmed)return null;\n    const canonical=reverse[trimmed]||trimmed;\n    return currentWebLanguage==='en'?(canonical==='BlockLogger'?'Block Logging':canonical):(target[canonical]||target[trimmed]||null);\n  };\n  const translateNode=node=>{\n    if(!node||node.nodeType!==Node.TEXT_NODE)return;\n    const parent=node.parentElement;if(!parent||['SCRIPT','STYLE','TEXTAREA'].includes(parent.tagName))return;\n    const raw=node.nodeValue||''; const translated=translatedValue(raw); if(!translated)return;\n    const leading=raw.match(/^\\s*/)?.[0]||''; const trailing=raw.match(/\\s*$/)?.[0]||'';\n    const next=leading+translated+trailing;if(next!==raw)node.nodeValue=next;\n  };\n  const translateAttrs=el=>{\n    if(!el||el.nodeType!==Node.ELEMENT_NODE)return;\n    for(const attr of ['placeholder','title','aria-label','alt','data-tooltip']){\n      if(!el.hasAttribute(attr))continue;\n      const raw=el.getAttribute(attr)||''; const translated=translatedValue(raw);\n      if(translated&&translated!==raw)el.setAttribute(attr,translated);\n    }\n  };\n  if(root.nodeType===Node.TEXT_NODE){translateNode(root);return;}\n  if(root.nodeType===Node.ELEMENT_NODE)translateAttrs(root);\n  const walker=document.createTreeWalker(root,NodeFilter.SHOW_TEXT|NodeFilter.SHOW_ELEMENT);let n;\n  while((n=walker.nextNode())){if(n.nodeType===Node.TEXT_NODE)translateNode(n);else translateAttrs(n);}\n}\nlet webLiteralObserver=null;\nfunction initCommonLiteralLocalization(){\n  translateCommonLiteralText(document.body);\n  if(webLiteralObserver)webLiteralObserver.disconnect();\n  webLiteralObserver=new MutationObserver(muts=>{for(const m of muts){if(m.type==='characterData')translateCommonLiteralText(m.target);for(const n of m.addedNodes||[])translateCommonLiteralText(n);}});\n  webLiteralObserver.observe(document.body,{subtree:true,childList:true,characterData:true,attributes:true,attributeFilter:['placeholder','title','aria-label','alt','data-tooltip']});\n}\n\nlet currentWebLanguage = localStorage.getItem('nsu.language') || 'en';\nif(!WEB_LANGS[currentWebLanguage]) currentWebLanguage='en';\nlet currentUiScale=localStorage.getItem('nsu.uiScale')||'0.75';\nlet headerResizeObserver=null;\nfunction syncHeaderHeight(){const header=document.querySelector('#app>header');if(!header)return;const height=Math.max(62,Math.ceil(header.offsetHeight||62));document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--header-height',height+'px');}\nfunction initHeaderLayout(){const header=document.querySelector('#app>header');if(!header)return;if(headerResizeObserver)headerResizeObserver.disconnect();if('ResizeObserver' in window){headerResizeObserver=new ResizeObserver(()=>syncHeaderHeight());headerResizeObserver.observe(header);}syncHeaderHeight();}\nfunction applyUiScale(){let n=Number(currentUiScale);if(!Number.isFinite(n))n=.75;n=clamp(n,.70,1);currentUiScale=n.toFixed(2);document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--ui-scale',currentUiScale);const desktop=window.innerWidth>900,active=desktop?n:1,app=$('app');if(app){app.style.zoom=String(active);app.style.width='100%';}const sel=$('uiScaleSelect');if(sel)sel.value=currentUiScale;requestAnimationFrame(syncHeaderHeight);}\nfunction initUiScale(){const sel=$('uiScaleSelect');if(sel){sel.value=currentUiScale;sel.addEventListener('change',()=>{currentUiScale=sel.value;localStorage.setItem('nsu.uiScale',currentUiScale);applyUiScale();});}applyUiScale();}\nwindow.addEventListener('resize',()=>{applyUiScale();syncHeaderHeight();},{passive:true});\nlet currentMotionPreference=localStorage.getItem('nsu.motion')||'full';\nif(!['full','reduced','off'].includes(currentMotionPreference))currentMotionPreference='full';\nfunction applyMotionPreference(){\n  document.documentElement.dataset.motion=currentMotionPreference;\n  const sel=$('motionSelect');if(sel)sel.value=currentMotionPreference;\n}\nfunction initMotionPreference(){\n  const sel=$('motionSelect');\n  if(sel){sel.value=currentMotionPreference;sel.addEventListener('change',()=>{currentMotionPreference=sel.value;localStorage.setItem('nsu.motion',currentMotionPreference);applyMotionPreference();toast(`${t('ui.motion')}: ${sel.options[sel.selectedIndex]?.textContent||currentMotionPreference}`,'success');});}\n  applyMotionPreference();\n}\nfunction t(key){return WEB_LANGS[currentWebLanguage]?.[key] ?? WEB_LANGS.en[key] ?? key;}\nfunction formatIngameDate(raw){\n  const value=String(raw??'').trim();\n  if(!value)return '';\n  if(value.toLowerCase()==='unknown')return t('date.unknown');\n  const m=value.match(/^Year\\s+(-?\\d+)\\s*,\\s*Month\\s+(\\d+)\\s*,\\s*Day\\s+(\\d+)\\s*,\\s*(-?\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?)h$/i);\n  return m?`${t('date.year')} ${m[1]}, ${t('date.month')} ${m[2]}, ${t('date.day')} ${m[3]}, ${m[4]}h`:value;\n}\nconst SECTION_I18N_KEYS={dashboard:'nav.dashboard',serverStatus:'nav.serverStatus',reports:'nav.reports',playerlist:'nav.playerlist',playercommands:'nav.playercommands',warps:'nav.warps',anticheat:'nav.anticheat',chatguard:'nav.chatguard',logIntelligence:'nav.logIntelligence',actionCenter:'nav.actionCenter',performance:'nav.performance',tickDebug:'nav.tickDebug',memory:'nav.memory',profiler:'nav.profiler',optimizations:'nav.optimizations',blocklogger:'nav.blocklogger',animals:'nav.animals',loginProtection:'nav.loginProtection',announcements:'nav.announcements',restarts:'nav.restarts',console:'nav.console',webmap:'nav.webmap',customPatches:'nav.customPatches',communityMotd:'nav.communityMotd',compatibility:'nav.compatibility',mods:'nav.mods',admin:'nav.admin',health:'nav.health',operations:'nav.operations',customization:'nav.customization',databaseStorage:'nav.databaseStorage',discord:'nav.discord',web:'nav.web',help:'nav.help'};\nfunction applyText(selector,key){const el=document.querySelector(selector);if(el)el.textContent=t(key);}\nfunction applyWebLanguage(){\n  document.documentElement.lang=currentWebLanguage;\n  const sel=$('languageSelect'); if(sel)sel.value=currentWebLanguage;\n  applyText('#languageLabel','ui.language'); applyText('#uiScaleLabel','ui.scale'); applyText('#motionLabel','ui.motion');\n  const motionSel=$('motionSelect');\n  if(motionSel){\n    const full=motionSel.querySelector('option[value=\"full\"]'), reduced=motionSel.querySelector('option[value=\"reduced\"]'), off=motionSel.querySelector('option[value=\"off\"]');\n    if(full)full.textContent=t('motion.full');if(reduced)reduced.textContent=t('motion.reduced');if(off)off.textContent=t('motion.off');\n  }\n  applyText('#loginView [data-login-subtitle]','login.subtitle');\n  applyText('#loginView [data-login-kicker]','login.kicker');\n  const loginLabels=document.querySelectorAll('#loginForm label'); if(loginLabels[0])loginLabels[0].textContent=t('login.username'); if(loginLabels[1])loginLabels[1].textContent=t('login.password');\n  applyText('#loginForm button[type=\"submit\"]','login.signin');\n  const loginHttps=document.querySelector('#loginView [data-login-https] span:last-child'); if(loginHttps)loginHttps.textContent=t('login.https');\n  const passToggle=$('loginPassToggle'); if(passToggle)passToggle.textContent=$('loginPass')?.type==='text'?t('login.hide'):t('login.show');\n  const cmd=$('commandOpen'); if(cmd)cmd.childNodes[0].nodeValue=t('ui.search')+' ';\n  applyText('#quickReportBtn','ui.report'); applyText('#logoutBtn','ui.logout');\n  applyText('#acHistoryClearAll','ac.historyClear');\n  if($('liveBtn')&&!liveUpdates)$('liveBtn').textContent=t('ui.liveOff');\n  const groups=[['overview','group.overview'],['performance','group.performance'],['utilities','group.tools'],['moderation','group.moderation'],['administration','group.admin']];\n  groups.forEach(([g,k])=>{const e=document.querySelector(`[data-nav-group=\"${g}\"] .navGroupToggle span:first-child`);if(e)e.textContent=t(k);});\n  Object.entries(SECTION_I18N_KEYS).forEach(([section,key])=>{const e=document.querySelector(`#nav button[data-section=\"${section}\"] .navPageLabel`)||document.querySelector(`#nav button[data-section=\"${section}\"]`);if(e){if(e.classList.contains('navPageLabel'))e.textContent=t(key);else e.textContent=t(key);};sectionLabels[section]=t(key);});\n  [['#globalStatusBar .statusPill:nth-of-type(2)','status.health'],['#globalStatusBar .statusPill:nth-of-type(3)','status.cpu'],['#globalStatusBar .statusPill:nth-of-type(4)','status.delay'],['#globalStatusBar .statusPill:nth-of-type(5)','status.players'],['#globalStatusBar .statusPill:nth-of-type(6)','status.entities'],['#globalStatusBar .statusPill:nth-of-type(7)','status.alerts'],['#globalStatusBar .statusPill:nth-of-type(8)','status.queue'],['#globalStatusBar .statusPill:nth-of-type(9)','status.updated']].forEach(([sel,key])=>{const e=document.querySelector(sel);if(e&&e.firstChild)e.firstChild.nodeValue=t(key)+' ';});\n  [['server','status.server'],['anticheat','status.anticheat'],['packetguard','status.packetguard'],['memory','status.memory'],['webmap','status.webmap'],['blocklogger','status.blocklogger'],['chatguard','nav.chatguard'],['discord','nav.discord'],['loginprotection','nav.loginProtection']].forEach(([id,key])=>{const e=document.querySelector(`[data-summary-status=\"${id}\"] span:last-child`);if(e)e.textContent=t(key);});\n  const ob=document.querySelector('#offlineBanner b');if(ob)ob.textContent=t('offline.title'); applyText('#offlineDetail','offline.detail'); applyText('#retryConnectionBtn','offline.retry');\n  const ro=document.querySelector('#readOnlyNotice b');if(ro)ro.textContent=t('readonly.title'); const rs=document.querySelector('#readOnlyNotice span');if(rs)rs.textContent=t('readonly.text');\n  Object.keys(SECTION_I18N_KEYS).forEach(section=>{const h=document.querySelector(`#${section} .pageTitle h2`);const key='page.'+section;if(h&&WEB_LANGS.en[key])h.textContent=t(key);});\n  const crumb=$('breadcrumbCurrent');if(crumb)crumb.textContent=sectionLabels[currentSection]||t('nav.dashboard');\n  updateCurrentPageStatus();\n  translateCommonLiteralText(document.body);\n  if(warpState)renderWarps(warpState);\n  if(suiteCustomizationData)applySuiteCustomization(suiteCustomizationData,false);\n}\nfunction initLocalization(){\n  const sel=$('languageSelect'); if(sel){sel.value=currentWebLanguage;sel.addEventListener('change',()=>{currentWebLanguage=sel.value;localStorage.setItem('nsu.language',currentWebLanguage);applyWebLanguage();});}\n  applyWebLanguage();\n  initCommonLiteralLocalization();\n}\n\nconst BUILD_ID = '__NSS_BUILD_ID__';\nconst sectionLabels = {\n  dashboard:'Dashboard',\n  serverStatus:'Server Status',\n  reports:'Reports & Tickets',\n  playerlist:'Player List',\n  playercommands:'Player Commands',\n  roles:'Role Config',\n  warps:'Warp Management',\n  anticheat:'Anti-Cheat',\n  chatguard:'ChatGuard',\n  logIntelligence:'Log Intelligence',\n  actionCenter:'Action Center',\n  performance:'Performance Center',\n  tickDebug:'Tick Debugging',\n  memory:'Memory & GC',\n  profiler:'Profiler & Lag',\n  optimizations:'Optimizations',\n  blocklogger:'Block Logging',\n  animals:'Animal Limiter',\n  loginProtection:'Login Protection',\n  announcements:'Automated Announcements',\n  console:'Web Console',\n  webmap:'Web Map',\n  customPatches:'Patch Studio',\n  communityMotd:'Community MOTD',\n  compatibility:'Compatibility Center',\n  mods:'Mod Management',\n  admin:'Player Administration',\n  health:'Suite Health',\n  operations:'Operations & Audit',\n  customization:'Suite Customization',\n  databaseStorage:'Database Storage',\n  discord:'Discord',\n  web:'Web Server',\n  help:'Help & About'\n};\nconst pageStatusState = new Map();\nconst summaryStatusState = new Map();\nlet globalOverallState = 'neutral';\n\nfunction statusStateRank(state){return state==='bad'?3:state==='warn'?2:state==='good'?1:0;}\nfunction updateCurrentPageStatus(){\n  const box=$('globalPageContext'),name=$('globalPageName'),stateText=$('globalPageStateText');\n  if(!box||!name||!stateText)return;\n  const label=sectionLabels[currentSection]||'Dashboard';\n  let entry=pageStatusState.get(currentSection);\n  if(!entry&&currentSection==='dashboard')entry={state:globalOverallState,detail:globalOverallState==='good'?'Suite healthy':globalOverallState==='warn'?'Suite needs attention':globalOverallState==='bad'?'Suite has a problem':'Waiting for status data'};\n  entry=entry||{state:'neutral',detail:'No page-specific status available'};\n  const state=['good','warn','bad','neutral'].includes(entry.state)?entry.state:'neutral';\n  box.className=`globalPageContext ${state}`;\n  name.textContent=label;\n  stateText.textContent=pageStatusLabel(state,entry.detail);\n  box.title=entry.detail||`${label} status`;\n}\n\nfunction updateOverallStatus(){\n  const button=$('globalOverallStatus'),text=$('globalOverallText'),count=$('globalOverallCount');\n  if(!button||!text||!count)return;\n  const entries=[...summaryStatusState.entries()].filter(([key])=>key!=='healthcore');\n  const bad=entries.filter(([,x])=>x.state==='bad');\n  const warn=entries.filter(([,x])=>x.state==='warn');\n  const health=summaryStatusState.get('healthcore');\n  const alerts=Math.max(0,Number(globalStatusData?.operations?.activeAlerts||globalAlerts?.length||0));\n  let state='neutral',label='Waiting',attention=0;\n  if(bad.length||health?.state==='bad'){state='bad';attention=bad.length+(health?.state==='bad'?1:0);label='Problem';}\n  else if(warn.length||health?.state==='warn'||alerts>0){state='warn';attention=warn.length+(health?.state==='warn'?1:0)+(alerts>0?1:0);label='Attention';}\n  else if(entries.some(([,x])=>x.state==='good')||health?.state==='good'){state='good';label='Healthy';}\n  globalOverallState=state;\n  button.className=`globalOverallStatus ${state}`;\n  text.textContent=label;\n  count.textContent=attention>0?(attention>99?'99+':String(attention)):'';\n  count.className='globalStatusCount'+(attention>0?' visible':'');\n  const details=[...bad,...warn].slice(0,5).map(([key,x])=>x.detail||key);\n  if(health&&(health.state==='bad'||health.state==='warn'))details.unshift(health.detail);\n  if(alerts>0)details.unshift(`${alerts} active Action Center alert${alerts===1?'':'s'}`);\n  button.title=details.length?details.join(' · '):(state==='good'?'All monitored Suite modules are healthy':'Waiting for module status');\n  updateCurrentPageStatus();\n}\n\nfunction initGlobalStatusStrip(){\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-summary-section]').forEach(btn=>{\n    btn.onclick=()=>{const target=btn.dataset.summarySection;if(target)setSection(target,true);};\n  });\n  const overall=$('globalOverallStatus');\n  if(overall)overall.onclick=()=>setSection(globalOverallState==='good'?'health':'actionCenter',true);\n  updateCurrentPageStatus();\n  updateOverallStatus();\n}\n\nconst metricTooltips = {\n  'Health score':'Smart Diagnosis summary score derived from measured server signals. It is not a benchmark score.',\n  'Main-thread delay':'Scheduler lateness of the one-second diagnostic callback. Large values indicate the server main thread was busy or stalled.',\n  'Managed heap':'Managed .NET heap size. High usage alone is not evidence of a leak.',\n  'Loaded entities':'Currently loaded entities reported by the server.',\n  'BlockLogger queue':'Audit events waiting for the background SQLite writer, including emergency reserve rows.',\n  'BL overflow':'Emergency in-memory reserve used when the normal audit queue is saturated.',\n  'BL audit mode':'Full fidelity means entity spawn, death, and despawn are logged individually with aggregation and position sampling disabled.',\n  'BL writer batch':'Wall-clock duration of the most recent background SQLite write batch.',\n  'Pressure':'Triage score based on entity population, type diversity and players. Not measured CPU time.',\n  'Profile P95':'95% of measured profile ticks were at or below this duration.'\n};\n\nfunction tooltipForMetric(name){\n  return metricTooltips[name]||'';\n}\n\nfunction initNavIndicators(){\n  document.querySelectorAll('#nav .navGroupBody>button[data-section]').forEach(btn=>{\n    if(btn.querySelector('.navPageMeta'))return;\n    const label=document.createElement('span');\n    label.className='navPageLabel';\n    label.textContent=btn.textContent.trim();\n    const meta=document.createElement('span');\n    meta.className='navPageMeta';\n    const dot=document.createElement('span');\n    dot.className='navStatusDot';\n    dot.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');\n    const badge=document.createElement('span');\n    badge.className='navPageBadge';\n    badge.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');\n    meta.append(dot,badge);\n    btn.textContent='';\n    btn.append(label,meta);\n  });\n  uiInitModuleIcons();\n}\n\nfunction initPageStatusIndicators(){\n  document.querySelectorAll('main section[id] .pageTitle').forEach(title=>{\n    const section=title.closest('section[id]');\n    if(!section||section.id==='dashboard'||section.id==='help'||title.querySelector('.pageStatusIndicator'))return;\n    const indicator=document.createElement('span');\n    indicator.className='pageStatusIndicator neutral';\n    indicator.dataset.pageStatusFor=section.id;\n    indicator.innerHTML='<span class=\"pageStatusLight\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"pageStatusText\">Waiting</span>';\n    indicator.title='Waiting for status data';\n    title.appendChild(indicator);\n  });\n}\n\nfunction navButton(section){\n  return document.querySelector(`#nav .navGroupBody>button[data-section=\"${section}\"]`);\n}\n\nfunction pageStatusLabel(state,detail=''){\n  const text=String(detail||'').toLowerCase();\n  if(text.includes('unavailable'))return 'Unavailable';\n  if(text.includes('disabled')||text.includes(' off'))return 'Off';\n  if(text.includes('stopped'))return 'Stopped';\n  if(text.includes('learning')||text.includes('not currently producing'))return 'Learning';\n  if(state==='good')return 'Healthy';\n  if(state==='warn')return 'Attention';\n  if(state==='bad')return 'Problem';\n  return 'Idle';\n}\n\nfunction setPageStatus(section,state='',detail=''){\n  const valid=['good','warn','bad','neutral'];\n  const normalized=valid.includes(String(state||'').toLowerCase())?String(state).toLowerCase():'neutral';\n  pageStatusState.set(section,{state:normalized,detail:detail||''});\n  const indicator=document.querySelector(`[data-page-status-for=\"${section}\"]`);\n  if(indicator){\n    indicator.className=`pageStatusIndicator ${normalized}`;\n    const text=indicator.querySelector('.pageStatusText');\n    if(text)text.textContent=pageStatusLabel(normalized,detail);\n    indicator.title=detail||'Status available';\n  }\n  if(section===currentSection)updateCurrentPageStatus();\n}\n\nfunction setSummaryStatus(key,state='',detail=''){\n  const valid=['good','warn','bad','neutral'];\n  const normalized=valid.includes(String(state||'').toLowerCase())?String(state).toLowerCase():'neutral';\n  summaryStatusState.set(key,{state:normalized,detail:detail||''});\n  const el=document.querySelector(`[data-summary-status=\"${key}\"]`);\n  if(el){el.className=`summaryStatus ${normalized}`;el.title=detail||'Status available';}\n  updateOverallStatus();\n}\n\nfunction setNavStatus(section,state='',detail=''){\n  const valid=['good','warn','bad','neutral'];\n  const normalized=valid.includes(String(state||'').toLowerCase())?String(state).toLowerCase():'';\n  setPageStatus(section,normalized||'neutral',detail);\n  const summaryKey={serverStatus:'server',anticheat:'anticheat',memory:'memory',webmap:'webmap',blocklogger:'blocklogger',chatguard:'chatguard',discord:'discord',loginProtection:'loginprotection'}[section];\n  if(summaryKey)setSummaryStatus(summaryKey,normalized||'neutral',detail);\n  const btn=navButton(section);if(!btn)return;\n  const dot=btn.querySelector('.navStatusDot');if(!dot)return;\n  dot.className='navStatusDot'+(normalized?` visible ${normalized}`:'');\n  dot.title=detail||'';\n}\n\nfunction setNavBadge(section,count,tone='attention',detail=''){\n  const btn=navButton(section);if(!btn)return;\n  const badge=btn.querySelector('.navPageBadge');if(!badge)return;\n  const n=Math.max(0,Number(count||0));\n  const normalized=['attention','critical','info'].includes(tone)?tone:'attention';\n  badge.className='navPageBadge'+(n>0?` visible ${normalized}`:'');\n  badge.textContent=n>99?'99+':(n>0?String(Math.floor(n)):'');\n  badge.title=detail||'';\n}\n\nfunction setActionCenterNavState(count){\n  const n=Math.max(0,Number(count||0));\n  setNavBadge('actionCenter',n,n>0?'critical':'attention',n>0?`${n} active Action Center alert${n===1?'':'s'}`:'No active Action Center alerts');\n  setNavStatus('actionCenter',n>0?'warn':'good',n>0?'Action Center has active alerts':'No active Action Center alerts');\n}\n\nfunction setReportsNavState(openCount,investigatingCount){\n  const open=Math.max(0,Number(openCount||0)),investigating=Math.max(0,Number(investigatingCount||0)),total=open+investigating;\n  setNavBadge('reports',total,'attention',total>0?`${open} open · ${investigating} investigating`:'No unresolved issue reports');\n  setNavStatus('reports',total>0?'warn':'good',total>0?'Issue reports need staff attention':'No unresolved issue reports');\n}\n\nfunction setModUpdatesNavState(data){\n  const checked=Number(data?.checkedUnixMilliseconds||0)>0;\n  const count=Math.max(0,Number(data?.updateCount||0));\n  setNavBadge('mods',count,'attention',count>0?`${count} mod update${count===1?'':'s'} available`:'No mod updates available');\n  setNavStatus('mods',!checked?'neutral':(count>0?'warn':'good'),!checked?'Mod updates have not been checked yet':(count>0?`${count} update${count===1?'':'s'} available`:'Checked mods are current'));\n}\n\nfunction setAntiCheatNavState(data){\n  if(!data)return;\n  const suspicious=Math.max(0,Number(data.suspicious||0));\n  const review=Math.max(0,Number(data.review||0));\n  const missing=Math.max(0,Number(data.missingOrTimedOut||0));\n  const attention=suspicious+review+missing;\n  const unavailable=!!data.enabled&&!data.available;\n  const state=unavailable||suspicious>0?'bad':(!data.enabled||attention>0?'warn':'good');\n  const detail=!data.enabled?'Anti-Cheat is disabled':(unavailable?'Anti-Cheat runtime unavailable':(attention>0?`${attention} player${attention===1?'':'s'} need Anti-Cheat attention`:'Anti-Cheat healthy'));\n  setNavStatus('anticheat',state,detail);\n  const packetGuard=data.packetGuard||{};\n  const packetState=!data.enabled?'warn':(unavailable?'bad':(!packetGuard.enabled?'warn':packetGuard.ingressEnabled&&!packetGuard.ingressActive?'bad':'good'));\n  const packetDetail=!data.enabled?'PacketGuard inactive because Anti-Cheat is disabled':(unavailable?'PacketGuard unavailable with the Anti-Cheat runtime':(!packetGuard.enabled?'PacketGuard is disabled':packetGuard.ingressEnabled&&!packetGuard.ingressActive?String(packetGuard.ingressStatus||'Raw packet guard is unavailable'):'PacketGuard active'));\n  setSummaryStatus('packetguard',packetState,packetDetail);\n  setNavBadge('anticheat',attention,suspicious>0?'critical':'attention',detail);\n}\n\nfunction setCompatibilityNavState(data){\n  if(!data)return;\n  const critical=Math.max(0,Number(data.criticalCount||0));\n  const watch=Math.max(0,Number(data.watchCount||0));\n  const total=critical+watch;\n  const summary=String(data.summary||'').toLowerCase();\n  const state=critical>0||summary==='conflict'?'bad':(watch>0||summary==='watch'?'warn':'good');\n  const detail=total>0?`${critical} critical · ${watch} watch compatibility item${total===1?'':'s'}`:'No compatibility warnings';\n  setNavStatus('compatibility',state,detail);\n  setNavBadge('compatibility',total,critical>0?'critical':'attention',detail);\n}\n\nasync function refreshNavIndicators(includeStatic=true){\n  lastNavIndicatorRefresh=Date.now();\n  const jobs=[\n    api('/api/reports?status=all&limit=1').then(d=>setReportsNavState(d.openCount,d.investigatingCount)),\n    api('/api/mod-updates').then(d=>setModUpdatesNavState(d)),\n    api('/api/anticheat/status').then(d=>setAntiCheatNavState(d)),\n    api('/api/chatguard').then(d=>{\n      const available=!!d?.available;\n      const state=!available?'neutral':(!d.enabled?'neutral':(String(d.mode||'').toLowerCase()==='logonly'?'warn':'good'));\n      const detail=!available?'Standalone ChatGuard not installed':`${d.enabled?'Enabled':'Disabled'} · ${d.mode||'—'}`;\n      setNavStatus('chatguard',state,detail);\n    }),\n    api('/api/discord').then(d=>{\n      const available=!!(d.transportAvailable||d.linkAvailable);\n      const state=!available?'neutral':(d.transportConnected?'good':(d.transportEnabled?'warn':'neutral'));\n      const detail=!available?'Discord module not installed':(d.transportConnected?'Discord bot connected':(d.transportEnabled?'Discord enabled but bot disconnected':'Discord integration disabled'));\n      setNavStatus('discord',state,detail);\n    })\n  ];\n  if(includeStatic){\n    jobs.push(api('/api/compatibility').then(d=>setCompatibilityNavState(d)));\n    jobs.push(api('/api/webmap').then(d=>setNavStatus('webmap',d.running?'good':(d.enabled?'bad':'neutral'),d.running?'Web Map listener running':(d.enabled?'Web Map enabled but listener stopped':'Web Map disabled'))));\n    jobs.push(api('/api/loginprotection/config').then(d=>setNavStatus('loginProtection',!d.available?'bad':(d.config?.enabled?'good':'neutral'),!d.available?'Login Protection unavailable':(d.config?.enabled?'Login Protection enabled':'Login Protection disabled'))));\n    jobs.push(api('/api/tick-debug').then(d=>{\n      const enabled=d.enabled!==false;\n      setNavStatus('tickDebug',enabled?'good':'neutral',enabled?'Tick Debugging enabled':'Tick Debugging disabled');\n      if($('tickDebugNavState')){$('tickDebugNavState').textContent=enabled?'ON':'OFF';$('tickDebugNavState').className='navInlineState '+(enabled?'good':'neutral');}\n    }));\n  }\n  await Promise.allSettled(jobs);\n}\n\nfunction syncNavGroups(){\n  document.querySelectorAll('#nav .navGroup').forEach(group=>{\n    const key=group.dataset.navGroup||'';\n    const collapsed=!!navCollapsedGroups[key];\n    group.classList.toggle('collapsed',collapsed);\n    const toggle=group.querySelector('.navGroupToggle');\n    if(toggle)toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded',collapsed?'false':'true');\n  });\n}\n\nfunction initNavGroups(){\n  document.querySelectorAll('#nav .navGroupToggle').forEach(toggle=>{\n    toggle.onclick=()=>{\n      const group=toggle.closest('.navGroup');if(!group)return;\n      const key=group.dataset.navGroup||'';\n      navCollapsedGroups[key]=!group.classList.contains('collapsed');\n      localStorage.setItem('nsu.navCollapsedGroups',JSON.stringify(navCollapsedGroups));\n      syncNavGroups();\n    };\n  });\n  syncNavGroups();\n}\n\nfunction revealActiveNavGroup(section){\n  const btn=document.querySelector(`#nav button[data-section=\"${section}\"]`);\n  const group=btn&&btn.closest('.navGroup');\n  if(!group)return;\n  const key=group.dataset.navGroup||'';\n  if(navCollapsedGroups[key]){navCollapsedGroups[key]=false;localStorage.setItem('nsu.navCollapsedGroups',JSON.stringify(navCollapsedGroups));syncNavGroups();}\n}\n\nfunction setAntiCheatTab(tab){\n  const valid=['overview','players','clientmods','oreshield','packet','history','policy','enforcement','integrity'];\n  if(!valid.includes(tab))tab='overview';\n  antiCheatActiveTab=tab;\n  localStorage.setItem('nsu.antiCheatTab',tab);\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-tab]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.acTab===tab));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-panel]').forEach(p=>p.classList.toggle('active',p.dataset.acPanel===tab));\n  if(currentSection==='anticheat'&&tab==='history'&&typeof loadAntiCheatHistory==='function') loadAntiCheatHistory(($('acHistoryPlayerFilter')?.value||'').trim());\n  if(currentSection==='anticheat'&&tab==='clientmods') loadAntiCheatClientMods();\n}\n\nfunction initAntiCheatTabs(){\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-tab]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>setAntiCheatTab(b.dataset.acTab));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-jump]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>setAntiCheatTab(b.dataset.acJump));\n  setAntiCheatTab(antiCheatActiveTab);\n}\n\nfunction setBreadcrumb(detail=''){\n  const base=sectionLabels[currentSection]||'Dashboard';\n  $('breadcrumbCurrent').textContent=detail?`${base} › ${detail}`:base;\n}\n\nfunction setGlobalLiveState(){\n  const pulse=$('globalLivePulse');\n  const text=$('globalLiveText');\n  if(!pulse||!text)return;\n  pulse.className='livePulse '+(liveUpdates?'on':'');\n  if(liveUpdates){\n    const left=Math.max(0,(nextLiveRefreshAt-Date.now())/1000);\n    text.textContent=`LIVE ${left.toFixed(1)}s`;\n  }else text.textContent='MANUAL';\n}\n\nfunction updateGlobalStatusFromDashboard(d){\n  if(!d)return;\n  globalStatusData=d;\n  lastSuccessfulUpdate=Date.now();\n  const p=d.profiler||{},pc=p.current||{},smart=p.smart||{},b=d.blockLogger||{},ops=d.operations||{};\n  $('globalHealth').textContent=p.enabled&&smart.available?`${Number(smart.healthScore||0)}/100`:'—';\n  $('globalCpu').textContent=p.enabled?`${Number(pc.cpuPercent||0).toFixed(0)}%`:'—';\n  $('globalDelay').textContent=p.enabled?`${Number(pc.mainThreadDelayMs||0).toFixed(0)}ms`:'—';\n  $('globalPlayers').textContent=Number(d.playersOnline||0).toLocaleString();\n  $('globalEntities').textContent=p.enabled?Number(pc.loadedEntities||0).toLocaleString():'—';\n  $('globalAlerts').textContent=Number(ops.activeAlerts||0).toLocaleString();\n  $('globalQueue').textContent=Number(b.pending||0).toLocaleString();\n  $('globalUpdated').textContent=new Date().toLocaleTimeString();\n  $('notificationBadge').textContent=Number(ops.activeAlerts||0)>0?String(ops.activeAlerts):'';\n  setActionCenterNavState(Number(ops.activeAlerts||0));\n  setNavStatus('serverStatus','good','Server status data is responding');\n  const blDropped=Number(b.dropped||0),blRejected=Number(b.overflowRejected||0),blPending=Number(b.pending||0),blWriter=Number(b.writerMs||0);\n  const blState=(blDropped>0||blRejected>0)?'bad':(blPending>=1000||blWriter>=100?'warn':'good');\n  setNavStatus('blocklogger',blState,blState==='bad'?`BlockLogger has ${blDropped} dropped / ${blRejected} rejected event(s)`:blState==='warn'?`BlockLogger pressure: queue ${blPending}, writer ${blWriter}ms`:'BlockLogger healthy');\n  if(p.enabled&&smart.available){\n    const score=Number(smart.healthScore||0);\n    const state=score>=85?'good':score>=65?'warn':'bad';\n    setNavStatus('health',state,`System health ${score}/100`);\n    setNavStatus('performance',state,`Performance health ${score}/100`);\n    setSummaryStatus('healthcore',state,`System health ${score}/100`);\n  }else{\n    setNavStatus('health','neutral','Performance diagnostics are not currently producing a health score');\n    setNavStatus('performance','neutral','Performance diagnostics are not currently producing a health score');\n    setSummaryStatus('healthcore','neutral','Performance diagnostics are not currently producing a health score');\n  }\n  setGlobalLiveState();\n}\n\nasync function refreshGlobalStatus(force=false){\n  const now=Date.now();\n  if(!force && now-lastGlobalStatusFetch<15000)return;\n  lastGlobalStatusFetch=now;\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/dashboard');\n    updateGlobalStatusFromDashboard(d);\n  }catch{}\n}\n\nfunction alertTarget(category){\n  category=String(category||'').toLowerCase();\n  if(category.includes('memory')||category.includes('gc'))return 'memory';\n  if(category.includes('compat')||category.includes('command')||category.includes('harmony'))return 'compatibility';\n  if(category.includes('entity')||category.includes('chunk'))return 'performance';\n  if(category.includes('storage')||category.includes('blocklogger')||category.includes('worldsave'))return 'performance';\n  return 'profiler';\n}\n\nfunction updateNotifications(d){\n  const alerts=(d&&d.alerts)||[];\n  globalAlerts=alerts.filter(x=>x.status==='Active'||x.status==='Investigating');\n  $('notificationBadge').textContent=globalAlerts.length?String(globalAlerts.length):'';\n  setActionCenterNavState(globalAlerts.length);\n  $('notificationList').innerHTML=globalAlerts.length\n    ? globalAlerts.slice(0,40).map(x=>`<div class=\"notificationItem\" data-notify-id=\"${esc(x.id)}\">\n        <div><span class=\"badge ${String(x.severity||'').toLowerCase()==='critical'?'low':String(x.severity||'').toLowerCase()==='high'?'medium':'high'}\">${esc(x.severity)}</span> <b>${esc(x.title)}</b></div>\n        <div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:4px\">${esc(x.evidence||'')}</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px\">\n          <div class=\"small\" style=\"flex:1\">${esc(new Date(Number(x.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleString())}</div>\n          <button data-notify-remove=\"${esc(x.id)}\" title=\"Remove this warning from retained history\">Remove</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>`).join('')\n    : '<div class=\"emptyAction\"><b>No active alerts.</b><br>The bell will populate when the Action Center records something that needs attention.</div>';\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-notify-id]').forEach(el=>{\n    el.onclick=()=>{\n      const a=globalAlerts.find(x=>x.id===el.dataset.notifyId);\n      $('notificationPanel').classList.remove('open');\n      if(a)setSection(alertTarget(a.category),true);\n    };\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-notify-remove]').forEach(btn=>{\n    btn.onclick=async e=>{\n      e.stopPropagation();\n      await removeAlert(btn.dataset.notifyRemove||'');\n    };\n  });\n}\n\nasync function openNotifications(){\n  $('notificationPanel').classList.toggle('open');\n  if(!$('notificationPanel').classList.contains('open'))return;\n  try{\n    operationsData=await api('/api/operations/overview');\n    updateNotifications(operationsData);\n  }catch(e){\n    $('notificationList').innerHTML=`<div class=\"errorBox\">${esc(e.message)}</div>`;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction commandItems(){\n  const base=Object.entries(sectionLabels).map(([section,title])=>({\n    type:'Page',title,keywords:`${title} ${section}`,run:()=>setSection(section,true)\n  }));\n  base.push(\n    {type:'Action',title:'Run Entity / Chunk Hotspot Scan',keywords:'entity chunk scan hotspot pressure',run:()=>{setSection('performance',true);setTimeout(()=>scanPerformanceEntities(),250)}},\n    {type:'Action',title:'Download Diagnostic Bundle v2',keywords:'diagnostic support zip export bundle webops',run:()=>downloadPerformanceBundle()},\n    {type:'Action',title:'Run Compatibility Deep Scan',keywords:'compatibility harmony command conflict mods',run:()=>{setSection('compatibility',true);setTimeout(()=>loadCompatibility(true),250)}},\n    {type:'Action',title:'Open SQLite Health',keywords:'database sqlite wal integrity quick check',run:()=>setSection('health',true)},\n    {type:'Action',title:'Copy Quick Troubleshooting Report',keywords:'report support clipboard diagnostics',run:()=>copyQuickReport()},\n    {type:'Action',title:'Customize Dashboard',keywords:'dashboard hide cards layout widgets',run:()=>openDashboardCustomize()},\n    {type:'Action',title:'Toggle Live Updates',keywords:'live refresh polling',run:()=>toggleLiveUpdates()}\n  );\n  globalAlerts.forEach(a=>base.push({\n    type:'Alert',\n    title:a.title,\n    keywords:`${a.category} ${a.severity} ${a.evidence||''}`,\n    hint:a.severity,\n    run:()=>setSection(alertTarget(a.category),true)\n  }));\n  loadedMods.slice(0,200).forEach(m=>base.push({\n    type:'Mod',\n    title:`${m.modId} ${m.version||''}`.trim(),\n    keywords:`${m.modId} ${m.name||''} ${m.fileName||''}`,\n    run:()=>openModFilter(m.modId)\n  }));\n  watchItems.forEach(w=>base.push({\n    type:'Pinned',\n    title:w.label,\n    keywords:`${w.type} ${w.label} ${w.key}`,\n    run:()=>openWatchItem(w)\n  }));\n  return base;\n}\n\nfunction renderCommandResults(){\n  const q=String($('commandInput').value||'').trim().toLowerCase();\n  let rows=commandItems().filter(x=>!q||`${x.title} ${x.keywords||''}`.toLowerCase().includes(q)).slice(0,24);\n  commandResultCache=rows;\n  commandSelectedIndex=Math.min(commandSelectedIndex,Math.max(0,rows.length-1));\n  $('commandResults').innerHTML=rows.length\n    ? rows.map((x,i)=>`<div class=\"commandItem ${i===commandSelectedIndex?'selected':''}\" data-command-index=\"${i}\">\n        <span class=\"commandType\">${esc(x.type)}</span>\n        <span class=\"commandTitle\">${esc(x.title)}</span>\n        <span class=\"commandHint\">${esc(x.hint||'')}</span>\n      </div>`).join('')\n    : '<div class=\"emptyAction\"><b>No match.</b><br>Try a page name, alert category, mod ID, or action.</div>';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-command-index]').forEach(el=>{\n    el.onmouseenter=()=>{\n      commandSelectedIndex=Number(el.dataset.commandIndex||0);\n      document.querySelectorAll('[data-command-index]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('selected',Number(x.dataset.commandIndex||0)===commandSelectedIndex));\n    };\n    el.onclick=()=>runCommandIndex(Number(el.dataset.commandIndex||0));\n  });\n}\n\nfunction openCommandPalette(){\n  $('notificationPanel').classList.remove('open');\n  $('commandOverlay').classList.add('open');\n  $('commandInput').value='';\n  commandSelectedIndex=0;\n  renderCommandResults();\n  setTimeout(()=>$('commandInput').focus(),0);\n}\n\nfunction closeCommandPalette(){\n  $('commandOverlay').classList.remove('open');\n}\n\nfunction runCommandIndex(index){\n  const item=commandResultCache[index];\n  if(!item)return;\n  closeCommandPalette();\n  item.run();\n}\n\nfunction persistWatchlist(){\n  localStorage.setItem('nsu.watchItems',JSON.stringify(watchItems.slice(0,50)));\n}\n\nfunction addWatchItem(type,key,label,target,extra={}){\n  const id=`${type}:${key}`;\n  const existing=watchItems.find(x=>x.id===id);\n  if(existing){\n    toast('Already pinned.');\n    return;\n  }\n  watchItems.unshift({id,type,key,label,target,...extra});\n  watchItems=watchItems.slice(0,50);\n  persistWatchlist();\n  renderDashboardWatchlist();\n  toast('Pinned to Dashboard watchlist.','success');\n}\n\nfunction removeWatchItem(id){\n  watchItems=watchItems.filter(x=>x.id!==id);\n  persistWatchlist();\n  renderDashboardWatchlist();\n}\n\nfunction openWatchItem(item){\n  if(!item)return;\n  if(item.type==='chunk'){\n    openChunkInBlockLogger(Number(item.chunkX||0),Number(item.chunkZ||0),Number(item.dimension||0));\n    return;\n  }\n  if(item.type==='mod'){\n    openModFilter(item.key);\n    return;\n  }\n  setSection(item.target||'performance',true);\n  if(item.type==='entity')toast(`Pinned entity: ${item.label}`);\n}\n\nfunction renderDashboardWatchlist(){\n  const host=$('dashboardWatchlist');\n  if(!host)return;\n  $('watchCount').textContent=`${watchItems.length} pinned`;\n  host.innerHTML=watchItems.length\n    ? watchItems.map(w=>`<div class=\"watchItem\">\n        <span class=\"badge medium\">${esc(w.type)}</span>\n        <b>${esc(w.label)}</b>\n        <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n        <button class=\"iconBtn\" data-watch-open=\"${esc(w.id)}\">Open</button>\n        <button class=\"iconBtn\" data-watch-remove=\"${esc(w.id)}\">Remove</button>\n      </div>`).join('')\n    : '<div class=\"emptyAction\"><b>No pinned items yet.</b><br>Use Pin on entity growth, chunk hotspots, or loaded mods.</div>';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-watch-open]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openWatchItem(watchItems.find(x=>x.id===b.dataset.watchOpen)));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-watch-remove]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>removeWatchItem(b.dataset.watchRemove));\n}\n\nfunction applyDashboardCustomization(){\n  document.querySelectorAll('#dashboardMetrics .metric').forEach(card=>{\n    const name=card.dataset.metricName||'';\n    card.classList.toggle('dashboardMetricHidden',dashboardHiddenMetrics.includes(name));\n  });\n}\n\nfunction openDashboardCustomize(){\n  const names=[...document.querySelectorAll('#dashboardMetrics .metric')].map(x=>x.dataset.metricName).filter(Boolean);\n  const fallback=['Players online','Health score','Lag diagnosis','CPU','Main-thread delay','Working set','Managed heap','Loaded entities','Loaded chunks','BlockLogger queue','BL audit mode','BL overflow','BL writer batch','BL dropped','Animal tracked','Animal regions','Login protected','Active alerts','Open actions'];\n  const list=names.length?names:fallback;\n  $('dashboardCustomizeList').innerHTML=list.map(name=>`<label class=\"customizeItem\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-dashboard-metric=\"${esc(name)}\" ${dashboardHiddenMetrics.includes(name)?'':'checked'}> <span>${esc(name)}</span></label>`).join('');\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-dashboard-metric]').forEach(x=>x.onchange=()=>{\n    const name=x.dataset.dashboardMetric;\n    if(x.checked)dashboardHiddenMetrics=dashboardHiddenMetrics.filter(v=>v!==name);\n    else if(!dashboardHiddenMetrics.includes(name))dashboardHiddenMetrics.push(name);\n    localStorage.setItem('nsu.dashboardHiddenMetrics',JSON.stringify(dashboardHiddenMetrics));\n    applyDashboardCustomization();\n  });\n  $('dashboardCustomizeOverlay').classList.add('open');\n}\n\nfunction renderBlockLoggerSavedViews(){\n  const select=$('blSavedView');\n  if(!select)return;\n  const current=select.value;\n  select.innerHTML='<option value=\"\">— Saved searches —</option>'+blockLoggerSavedViews.map((v,i)=>`<option value=\"${i}\">${esc(v.name)}</option>`).join('');\n  if(current && Number(current)<blockLoggerSavedViews.length)select.value=current;\n}\n\nfunction currentBlockLoggerView(){\n  return {\n    view:$('blView').value,x:$('blX').value,y:$('blY').value,z:$('blZ').value,\n    dimension:$('blDim').value,radius:$('blRadius').value,limit:$('blLimit').value,\n    action:$('blAction').value,search:$('blSearch').value\n  };\n}\n\nfunction applyBlockLoggerView(v){\n  if(!v)return;\n  $('blView').value=v.view||'blocks';$('blX').value=v.x??0;$('blY').value=v.y??100;$('blZ').value=v.z??0;\n  $('blDim').value=v.dimension??0;$('blRadius').value=v.radius??5;$('blLimit').value=v.limit??50;$('blAction').value=v.action||'any';$('blSearch').value=v.search||'';\n}\n\nfunction openChunkInBlockLogger(chunkX,chunkZ,dimension){\n  setSection('blocklogger',false);\n  $('blView').value='blocks';\n  $('blX').value=chunkX*32+16;\n  $('blY').value=100;\n  $('blZ').value=chunkZ*32+16;\n  $('blDim').value=dimension;\n  $('blRadius').value=20;\n  $('blSearch').value='';\n  setBreadcrumb(`Chunk ${chunkX}, ${chunkZ}`);\n  toast('BlockLogger positioned near the selected chunk center. Adjust Y/radius if needed.');\n}\n\nfunction enhanceTableByBodyId(bodyId){\n  const tbody=$(bodyId);\n  if(!tbody)return;\n  const table=tbody.closest('table'),wrap=table&&table.closest('.tableWrap');\n  if(!table||!wrap)return;\n  table.classList.add('mobileTable');\n  const headers=[...table.querySelectorAll('thead th')].map(x=>x.textContent.trim());\n  table.querySelectorAll('tbody tr').forEach(row=>{\n    [...row.children].forEach((td,i)=>td.dataset.label=headers[i]||'');\n  });\n  [...table.querySelectorAll('thead th')].forEach((th,index)=>{\n    if(th.dataset.sortReady)return;\n    th.dataset.sortReady='1';\n    th.classList.add('sortable');th.tabIndex=0;th.setAttribute('aria-sort','none');th.onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'||e.key===' '){e.preventDefault();th.click();}};\n    th.innerHTML+=`<span class=\"sortMark\">↕</span>`;\n    th.onclick=()=>{\n      const dir=th.dataset.sortDir==='asc'?'desc':'asc';\n      [...table.querySelectorAll('thead th')].forEach(x=>{delete x.dataset.sortDir;x.setAttribute('aria-sort','none');const mark=x.querySelector('.sortMark');if(mark)mark.textContent='↕';});\n      th.dataset.sortDir=dir;th.setAttribute('aria-sort',dir==='asc'?'ascending':'descending');const mark=th.querySelector('.sortMark');if(mark)mark.textContent=dir==='asc'?'↑':'↓';\n      const rows=[...tbody.querySelectorAll(':scope > tr')].filter(r=>!r.classList.contains('expandRow'));\n      rows.sort((a,b)=>{\n        const av=(a.children[index]?.textContent||'').trim(),bv=(b.children[index]?.textContent||'').trim();\n        const numeric=value=>{const match=value.match(/^([+-]?(?:\\d[\\d,]*(?:\\.\\d+)?|\\.\\d+))\\s*(ms|s|us|µs|μs|ns|%|MB|MiB|GB|GiB|KB|KiB|B)?$/i);if(!match)return NaN;const units={s:1000,ms:1,us:.001,'µs':.001,'μs':.001,ns:.000001,kb:1000,kib:1024,mb:1000000,mib:1048576,gb:1000000000,gib:1073741824};return Number(match[1].replace(/,/g,''))*(units[(match[2]||'').toLowerCase()]||1);};\n        const an=numeric(av),bn=numeric(bv);\n        const cmp=Number.isFinite(an)&&Number.isFinite(bn)?an-bn:av.localeCompare(bv,undefined,{numeric:true,sensitivity:'base'});\n        return dir==='asc'?cmp:-cmp;\n      });\n      rows.forEach(r=>tbody.appendChild(r));\n    };\n  });\n  if(!wrap.dataset.toolsReady){\n    wrap.dataset.toolsReady='1';\n    const tools=document.createElement('div');\n    tools.className='tableTools';\n    tools.innerHTML='<input placeholder=\"Filter this table…\"><button data-table-copy>Copy</button><button data-table-csv>CSV</button><button data-table-json>JSON</button>';\n    wrap.parentNode.insertBefore(tools,wrap);\n    const input=tools.querySelector('input');\n    input.oninput=()=>{\n      const q=input.value.trim().toLowerCase();\n      tbody.querySelectorAll(':scope > tr').forEach(row=>{\n        if(row.classList.contains('expandRow'))return;\n        row.style.display=!q||row.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(q)?'':'none';\n      });\n    };\n    tools.querySelector('[data-table-copy]').onclick=()=>copyTable(table,'tsv');\n    tools.querySelector('[data-table-csv]').onclick=()=>copyTable(table,'csv');\n    tools.querySelector('[data-table-json]').onclick=()=>copyTable(table,'json');\n  }\n}\n\nasync function copyText(text,success='Copied.'){\n  try{\n    await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);\n    toast(success,'success');\n  }catch{\n    const ta=document.createElement('textarea');ta.value=text;document.body.appendChild(ta);ta.select();\n    try{document.execCommand('copy');toast(success,'success')}catch{toast('Browser blocked clipboard access.','error')}\n    ta.remove();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction copyTable(table,format){\n  const headers=[...table.querySelectorAll('thead th')].map(x=>x.textContent.replace('↕','').trim());\n  const rows=[...table.querySelectorAll('tbody tr')].filter(r=>!r.classList.contains('expandRow')&&r.style.display!=='none').map(r=>[...r.children].map(td=>td.textContent.trim()));\n  if(format==='json'){\n    const data=rows.map(row=>Object.fromEntries(headers.map((h,i)=>[h,row[i]||''])));\n    copyText(JSON.stringify(data,null,2),'Table JSON copied.');\n    return;\n  }\n  const sep=format==='csv'?',':'\\t';\n  const quote=v=>format==='csv'?`\"${String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')}\"`:String(v);\n  copyText([headers,...rows].map(r=>r.map(quote).join(sep)).join('\\n'),format==='csv'?'Table CSV copied.':'Table copied.');\n}\n\nfunction enhanceImportantTables(){\n  ['blRows','perfIncidents','perfEntityGrowth','perfChunks','perfBlockActivity','modsRows','auditRows','breakerRows','overheadRows','policyRows','actionRows','alertRows','playerLoadRows','performanceSnapshotRows','configSnapshotRows','incidentGroups','profIncidents','profMods'].forEach(enhanceTableByBodyId);\n}\n\nfunction severityLabelClass(sev){\n  sev=String(sev||'').toLowerCase();\n  return sev==='critical'?'bad':sev==='high'?'orange':sev==='watch'?'warn':sev==='healthy'||sev==='info'?'good':'';\n}\n\nasync function copyQuickReport(){\n  try{\n    if(!globalStatusData)await refreshGlobalStatus(true);\n    if(!operationsData){\n      try{operationsData=await api('/api/operations/overview');updateNotifications(operationsData)}catch{}\n    }\n    const d=globalStatusData||{},p=d.profiler||{},pc=p.current||{},smart=p.smart||{},b=d.blockLogger||{},ops=d.operations||{};\n    const lines=[\n      \"Newfies Server Essentials Suite\",\n      `Version: __NSS_VERSION__`,\n      `Build: ${BUILD_ID}`,\n      `Vintage Story target: 1.22.7`,\n      `Captured: ${new Date().toISOString()}`,\n      '',\n      `Health: ${p.enabled&&smart.available?`${Number(smart.healthScore||0)}/100 ${smart.state||''}`:'diagnostics unavailable/off'}`,\n      `Primary finding: ${smart.primaryFinding||'—'}`,\n      `Players: ${Number(d.playersOnline||0)}`,\n      `CPU: ${p.enabled?`${Number(pc.cpuPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%`:'—'}`,\n      `Main-thread delay: ${p.enabled?`${Number(pc.mainThreadDelayMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms`:'—'}`,\n      `Managed heap: ${p.enabled?`${Math.round(pc.managedHeapMb||0)} MB`:'—'}`,\n      `Loaded entities: ${p.enabled?Number(pc.loadedEntities||0):'—'}`,\n      `BlockLogger: ${b.fullFidelity?'full fidelity':'reduced fidelity'} · queue ${Number(b.pending||0)} · overflow ${Number(b.overflowPending||0)}/${Number(b.overflowCapacity||0)} · dropped ${Number(b.dropped||0)}`,\n      `Container sessions: ${Number(b.activeContainerSessions||0)}/${Number(b.containerSessionLimit||0)} · evicted ${Number(b.containerSessionsEvicted||0)} · expired inventory ${Number(b.containerSessionsWithExpiredInventory||0)}`,\n      `Active alerts: ${Number(ops.activeAlerts||0)} / open actions ${Number(ops.openActions||0)}`,\n      `Safe Diagnostics Mode: ${safeDiagnosticsModeGlobal?'ON':'OFF'}`,\n      '',\n      'Note: This quick report is a summary. Use Download Diagnostic Bundle for detailed evidence.'\n    ];\n    await copyText(lines.join('\\n'),'Quick troubleshooting report copied.');\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n}\n\nfunction toggleLiveUpdates(){\n  $('liveBtn').click();\n}\n\nfunction retryConnection(){\n  $('offlineDetail').textContent='Retrying…';\n  checkSession();\n}\n\nfunction toast(message,type='') {\n  const host=$('toastHost');\n  const el=document.createElement('div');\n  el.className='toast '+type;\n  el.textContent=message;\n  host.appendChild(el);\n  setTimeout(()=>{\n    el.classList.add('leaving');\n    const delay=(currentMotionPreference==='off'||window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches||document.body.classList.contains('suiteReducedMotion'))?0:180;\n    setTimeout(()=>el.remove(),delay);\n  },4020);\n}\n\nfunction markConnection(ok) {\n  $('connectionDot').className='dot '+(ok?'online':'offline');\n  $('connectionText').textContent=ok?'Connected':'Connection problem';\n  setNavStatus('serverStatus',ok?'good':'bad',ok?'Dashboard connection healthy':'Dashboard connection problem');\n  setNavStatus('console',ok?'good':'bad',ok?'Web Console reachable':'Web Console unavailable while dashboard connection is down');\n  setNavStatus('web',ok?'good':'bad',ok?'Web dashboard listener reachable':'Web dashboard listener connection problem');\n  if(ok){\n    lastSuccessfulUpdate=Date.now();\n    $('lastUpdate').textContent='Updated '+new Date().toLocaleTimeString();\n    $('offlineBanner').classList.remove('visible');\n  }else{\n    $('offlineBanner').classList.add('visible');\n    const age=lastSuccessfulUpdate?Math.max(0,Math.round((Date.now()-lastSuccessfulUpdate)/1000)):null;\n    $('offlineDetail').textContent=age===null\n      ? 'The browser could not reach the dashboard listener.'\n      : `Displaying the last successful data. Last good response ${age}s ago.`;\n    $('globalLivePulse').className='livePulse stale';\n    $('globalLiveText').textContent='STALE';\n  }\n}\n\nasync function verifyDashboardConnection(){\n  if(connectionProbeInFlight)return;\n  connectionProbeInFlight=true;\n  try{\n    const r=await fetch('/api/session',{headers:{'Accept':'application/json'},cache:'no-store'});\n    if(r.ok||r.status===401){\n      consecutiveProbeFailures=0;\n      markConnection(true);\n      return;\n    }\n    consecutiveProbeFailures++;\n  }catch{\n    consecutiveProbeFailures++;\n  }finally{\n    connectionProbeInFlight=false;\n  }\n  if(consecutiveProbeFailures>=2)markConnection(false);\n}\n\nfunction acquireDashboardGetSlot(){\n  return new Promise(resolve=>{\n    if(activeDashboardGets<MAX_PARALLEL_DASHBOARD_GETS){activeDashboardGets++;resolve();return;}\n    queuedDashboardGets.push(resolve);\n  });\n}\nfunction releaseDashboardGetSlot(){\n  activeDashboardGets=Math.max(0,activeDashboardGets-1);\n  const next=queuedDashboardGets.shift();\n  if(next){activeDashboardGets++;next();}\n}\n\nasync function apiCore(path, options={}) {\n  options=Object.assign({},options);\n  options.headers = Object.assign({'Accept':'application/json'}, options.headers || {});\n  if (options.method && options.method !== 'GET') {\n    options.headers['Content-Type']='application/json';\n    if (csrfToken) options.headers['X-CSRF-Token']=csrfToken;\n  }\n\n  let responseReceived=false;\n  try {\n    const r=await fetch(path,options);\n    responseReceived=true;\n    consecutiveProbeFailures=0;\n    markConnection(true);\n    let data={};\n    try{data=await r.json();}catch{}\n    if(r.status===401){showLogin();throw new Error('Authentication required');}\n    if(!r.ok)throw new Error(data.error||data.message||`HTTP ${r.status}`);\n    return data;\n  } catch(e) {\n    if(e?.name==='AbortError')throw e;\n    // A failed section request does not prove the server/dashboard is offline.\n    // Verify with a lightweight session probe before showing the global banner.\n    if(!responseReceived && path!=='/api/session')verifyDashboardConnection();\n    else if(!responseReceived && path==='/api/session'){\n      consecutiveProbeFailures++;\n      if(consecutiveProbeFailures>=2)markConnection(false);\n    }\n    throw e;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction api(path, options={}) {\n  const method=String(options.method||'GET').toUpperCase();\n  if(method!=='GET')return apiCore(path,options);\n\n  // Coalesce identical GETs already in flight so two UI components asking for the\n  // same snapshot do not consume two server workers.\n  const key=path;\n  const existing=inFlightDashboardGets.get(key);\n  if(existing)return existing;\n\n  const request=(async()=>{\n    await acquireDashboardGetSlot();\n    try{return await apiCore(path,options);}\n    finally{releaseDashboardGetSlot();}\n  })();\n  inFlightDashboardGets.set(key,request);\n  request.then(\n    ()=>{if(inFlightDashboardGets.get(key)===request)inFlightDashboardGets.delete(key);},\n    ()=>{if(inFlightDashboardGets.get(key)===request)inFlightDashboardGets.delete(key);}\n  );\n  return request;\n}\n\nfunction showLogin() {\n  document.body.classList.add('loginMode');\n  document.body.classList.remove('loginAuthenticated');\n  const loginView=$('loginView');\n  if(loginView){loginView.style.display='block';loginView.classList.remove('isSubmitting','loginSuccess');}\n  document.querySelector('.loginShell')?.classList.remove('loginHidden');\n  $('app').style.display='none';\n  csrfToken=\"\";\n  liveUpdates=false;\n  if(liveTimer)clearInterval(liveTimer);\n  liveTimer=null;\n  if(consoleLiveTimer)clearInterval(consoleLiveTimer);\n  consoleLiveTimer=null;consoleLiveEnabled=false;\n  setTimeout(()=>{$('loginUser')?.focus();},20);\n}\n\nfunction setLoginBusy(busy){\n  const loginView=$('loginView');\n  const submit=$('loginForm')?.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]');\n  if(loginView)loginView.classList.toggle('isSubmitting',!!busy);\n  if(submit){\n    submit.disabled=!!busy;\n    submit.classList.toggle('loading',!!busy);\n    submit.setAttribute('aria-busy',busy?'true':'false');\n    submit.textContent=busy?t('login.signingIn'):t('login.signin');\n  }\n}\n\nasync function playLoginSuccess(){\n  const loginView=$('loginView');\n  if(!loginView)return;\n  if(document.activeElement instanceof HTMLElement)document.activeElement.blur();\n  if(mobileNavViewport()||window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches||document.body.classList.contains('suiteReducedMotion'))return;\n  loginView.classList.add('loginSuccess');\n  document.body.classList.add('loginAuthenticated');\n  await new Promise(resolve=>setTimeout(resolve,340));\n}\n\n\nfunction mobileNavViewport(){return window.matchMedia('(max-width:880px)').matches;}\nfunction setMobileNavOpen(open){\n  const shouldOpen=!!open&&mobileNavViewport();\n  document.body.classList.toggle('mobileNavOpen',shouldOpen);\n  const toggle=$('mobileNavToggle');if(toggle){toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded',shouldOpen?'true':'false');toggle.setAttribute('aria-label',shouldOpen?'Close navigation':'Open navigation');}\n  const backdrop=$('mobileNavBackdrop');if(backdrop)backdrop.setAttribute('aria-hidden',shouldOpen?'false':'true');\n}\nfunction initMobileNavigation(){\n  const toggle=$('mobileNavToggle'),close=$('mobileNavClose'),backdrop=$('mobileNavBackdrop');\n  if(toggle)toggle.onclick=()=>setMobileNavOpen(!document.body.classList.contains('mobileNavOpen'));\n  if(close)close.onclick=()=>setMobileNavOpen(false);\n  if(backdrop)backdrop.onclick=()=>setMobileNavOpen(false);\n  if(document.body.dataset.mobileNavInitialized!=='1'){\n    document.body.dataset.mobileNavInitialized='1';\n    document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'&&document.body.classList.contains('mobileNavOpen'))setMobileNavOpen(false);});\n    window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{if(!mobileNavViewport())setMobileNavOpen(false);},{passive:true});\n  }\n}\n\nfunction setSection(section,load=true) {\n  if(!$(section)) section='dashboard';\n  const previousSection=currentSection;\n  if(previousSection&&previousSection!==section)rememberSectionScroll(previousSection);\n  currentSection=section;\n  localStorage.setItem('nsu.section',section);\n  if(mobileNavViewport())setMobileNavOpen(false);\n  document.querySelectorAll('#nav button').forEach(x=>{const active=x.dataset.section===section;x.classList.toggle('active',active);if(x.dataset.section)x.setAttribute('aria-current',active?'page':'false');});\n  revealActiveNavGroup(section);\n  document.querySelectorAll('main > section').forEach(x=>{\n    const active=x.id===section;\n    x.classList.toggle('active',active);\n    if(active&&previousSection!==section){x.classList.remove('sectionEntering');void x.offsetWidth;x.classList.add('sectionEntering');setTimeout(()=>x.classList.remove('sectionEntering'),420);}\n  });\n  setBreadcrumb();\n  syncWorkspacePage();\n  clearWorkspacePageSearch();\n  updateCurrentPageStatus();\n  $('notificationPanel').classList.remove('open');\n  refreshGlobalStatus(false);\n  setTimeout(enhanceImportantTables,60);\n  if(previousSection!==section)restoreSectionScroll(section);\n\n  if(!load)return;\n  if(section==='dashboard')loadDashboard();\n  if(section==='serverStatus')loadServerStatus(true);\n  if(section==='reports')loadReports(true);\n  if(section==='playerlist')loadPlayerListConfig();\n  if(section==='roles')loadRoles();\n  if(section==='playercommands')loadPlayerCommands(true);\n  if(section==='warps')loadWarps(true);\n  if(section==='anticheat'){loadAntiCheat(true);if(antiCheatActiveTab==='history')loadAntiCheatHistory(($('acHistoryPlayerFilter')?.value||'').trim());}\n  if(section==='chatguard')loadChatGuard(true);\n  if(section==='logIntelligence')loadLogIntelligence(true);\n  if(section==='actionCenter')loadActionCenter(true);\n  if(section==='performance')loadPerformanceCenter(true);\n  if(section==='tickDebug')loadTickDebug(true);\n  if(section==='memory')loadMemoryCenter(true);\n  if(section==='optimizations')loadOptimizations();\n  if(section==='blocklogger')loadBlockLoggerMaintenance();\n  if(section==='animals'){loadAnimalStatus();loadAnimalRules();}\n  if(section==='loginProtection')loadLoginProtection();\n  if(section==='announcements')loadAnnouncements();\n  if(section==='restarts')loadRestartSchedule(true);\n  if(section==='chatDisplay')loadChatDisplay(true);\n  if(section==='console')loadConsole(true);\n  if(section==='webmap')loadWebMap(true);\n  if(section==='customPatches')loadCustomPatches(true);\n  if(section==='communityMotd')loadCommunityMotd(true);\n  if(section!=='console'&&consoleLiveTimer){clearInterval(consoleLiveTimer);consoleLiveTimer=null;consoleLiveEnabled=false;if($('consoleLive'))$('consoleLive').textContent='Auto Refresh: OFF';}\n  if(section==='compatibility')loadCompatibility(false);\n  if(section==='mods')loadMods();\n  if(section==='admin')loadAdmin(true);\n  if(section==='databaseStorage')loadAdminDatabaseStorage(false);\n  if(section==='health')loadSystemHealth(true);\n  if(section==='operations')loadOperationsAudit(true);\n  if(section==='customization')loadSuiteCustomization(true);\n  if(section==='discord')loadDiscord(true);\n  if(section==='profiler')loadProfiler();\n  if(section==='web'){loadWebStatus();loadFeatureGates();if(currentSessionOwner)loadWebAccounts(true);}\n}\n\nfunction showApp(session) {\n  document.body.classList.remove('loginMode');\n  $('loginView')?.classList.remove('isSubmitting','loginSuccess');\n  document.body.scrollLeft=0;document.body.scrollTop=0;\n  window.scrollTo(0,0);\n  document.body.classList.add('loginAuthenticated');\n  $('loginView').style.display='none';\n  document.querySelector('.loginShell')?.classList.add('loginHidden');\n  $('app').style.display='block';\n  csrfToken=session.csrfToken||\"\";\n  currentSessionUser=session.localAnonymous?\"local\":(session.username||\"admin\");\n  currentSessionRole=session.role||(session.localAnonymous?\"Owner\":\"Administrator\");\n  currentSessionOwner=!!session.owner||!!session.localAnonymous;\n  safeDiagnosticsModeGlobal=!!session.safeDiagnosticsMode;\n  if(safeDiagnosticsModeGlobal){\n    liveUpdates=false;\n    if(liveTimer)clearInterval(liveTimer);\n    liveTimer=null;\n    $('liveBtn').textContent=t('ui.liveOff');\n    $('liveBtn').classList.remove('active');\n  }\n  $('headerUser').textContent=`${currentSessionUser} · ${currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly'?'Read Only':currentSessionRole}`;\n  if($('readOnlyNotice'))$('readOnlyNotice').classList.toggle('visible',currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly');\n  initNavIndicators();\n  initPageStatusIndicators();\n  initGlobalStatusStrip();\n  initNavGroups();\n  initMobileNavigation();\n  initAntiCheatTabs();\n  $('logoutBtn').style.display=session.localAnonymous?'none':'inline-block';\n  if($('webAccountsCard'))$('webAccountsCard').style.display=currentSessionOwner?'block':'none';\n  setGlobalLiveState();\n  renderBlockLoggerSavedViews();\n  renderDashboardWatchlist();\n  loadSuiteCustomization(false);\n  setSection(currentSection,true);\n  refreshGlobalStatus(true);\n  refreshNavIndicators(true);\n  if(/\\/leaderboard(?:\\.html)?\\/?$/i.test(location.pathname)) setTimeout(()=>openPanelLeaderboard(),0);\n}\n\nasync function checkSession() {\n  try{\n    const s=await api('/api/session');\n    if(s.authenticated)showApp(s);else showLogin();\n  }catch{showLogin();}\n}\n\n$('loginPassToggle')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{\n  const input=$('loginPass'); if(!input)return;\n  input.type=input.type==='password'?'text':'password';\n  $('loginPassToggle').textContent=input.type==='text'?t('login.hide'):t('login.show');\n  input.focus();\n});\n\n$('loginForm').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{\n  e.preventDefault();\n  const error=$('loginError');\n  error.textContent=\"\"; error.classList.remove('loginErrorActive');\n  setLoginBusy(true);\n  try{\n    const data=await api('/api/login',{\n      method:'POST',\n      body:JSON.stringify({username:$('loginUser').value,password:$('loginPass').value})\n    });\n    csrfToken=data.csrfToken||\"\";\n    $('loginPass').value=\"\"; $('loginPass').type='password';\n    await playLoginSuccess();\n    showApp(data);\n  }catch(e){error.textContent=e.message;error.classList.add('loginErrorActive');}\n  finally{setLoginBusy(false);}\n});\n\n$('logoutBtn').onclick=async()=>{\n  try{await api('/api/logout',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});}catch{}\n  showLogin();\n};\n\nconst backToTop=$('backToTop');\nlet scrollUiQueued=false;\nfunction updateScrollUi(){\n  scrollUiQueued=false;\n  if(backToTop)backToTop.classList.toggle('visible',(window.scrollY||0)>700);\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('scroll',()=>{\n  rememberSectionScroll();\n  if(!scrollUiQueued){scrollUiQueued=true;requestAnimationFrame(updateScrollUi)}\n},{passive:true});\nwindow.addEventListener('beforeunload',()=>rememberSectionScroll());\nif(backToTop)backToTop.onclick=()=>window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches||document.body.classList.contains('suiteReducedMotion')?'auto':'smooth'});\nupdateScrollUi();\n\ndocument.querySelectorAll('#nav button[data-section]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>{setSection(btn.dataset.section,true);setMobileNavOpen(false);});\n$('dashRefresh').onclick=()=>loadDashboard(true);\n$('dashCustomize').onclick=openDashboardCustomize;\n$('dashServerStatus').onclick=()=>setSection('serverStatus',true);\n$('dashActionCenter').onclick=()=>setSection('actionCenter',true);\n$('dashProfiler').onclick=()=>setSection('profiler',true);\n$('commandOpen').onclick=openCommandPalette;\n$('commandClose').onclick=closeCommandPalette;\n$('commandOverlay').onclick=e=>{if(e.target===$('commandOverlay'))closeCommandPalette()};\n$('commandInput').addEventListener('input',()=>{commandSelectedIndex=0;renderCommandResults()});\n$('notificationBtn').onclick=openNotifications;\n$('notificationClose').onclick=()=>$('notificationPanel').classList.remove('open');\n$('quickReportBtn').onclick=copyQuickReport;\n$('retryConnectionBtn').onclick=retryConnection;\n$('dashboardCustomizeClose').onclick=()=>$('dashboardCustomizeOverlay').classList.remove('open');\n$('dashboardCustomizeReset').onclick=()=>{\n  dashboardHiddenMetrics=[];\n  localStorage.removeItem('nsu.dashboardHiddenMetrics');\n  applyDashboardCustomization();\n  openDashboardCustomize();\n};\n$('dashboardCustomizeOverlay').onclick=e=>{if(e.target===$('dashboardCustomizeOverlay'))$('dashboardCustomizeOverlay').classList.remove('open')};\n\nfunction applyLiveSnapshot(d){\n  if(!d)return;\n  lastSuccessfulUpdate=Date.now();\n  const c=d.current||{},b=d.blockLogger||{},ops=d.operations||{};\n  if(d.diagnosticsEnabled){\n    $('globalCpu').textContent=`${Number(c.cpuPercent||0).toFixed(0)}%`;\n    $('globalDelay').textContent=`${Number(c.mainThreadDelayMs||0).toFixed(0)}ms`;\n    $('globalEntities').textContent=Number(c.loadedEntities||0).toLocaleString();\n  }else{\n    $('globalCpu').textContent='—';$('globalDelay').textContent='—';$('globalEntities').textContent='—';\n  }\n  $('globalPlayers').textContent=Number(c.players||0).toLocaleString();\n  $('globalAlerts').textContent=Number(ops.activeAlerts||0).toLocaleString();\n  $('globalQueue').textContent=Number(b.pending||0).toLocaleString();\n  $('globalUpdated').textContent=new Date(Number(d.unixMilliseconds||Date.now())).toLocaleTimeString();\n  $('notificationBadge').textContent=Number(ops.activeAlerts||0)>0?String(ops.activeAlerts):'';\n  setActionCenterNavState(Number(ops.activeAlerts||0));\n  setNavStatus('serverStatus','good','Live server snapshot is responding');\n}\n\nfunction refreshCurrentSectionV2(){\n  if(document.hidden)return;\n  if(currentSection==='dashboard')loadDashboard(false);\n  if(currentSection==='serverStatus')loadServerStatus(false);\n  if(currentSection==='reports')loadReports(false);\n  if(currentSection==='logIntelligence')loadLogIntelligence(false);\n  if(currentSection==='customPatches')loadCustomPatches(false);\n  if(currentSection==='actionCenter')loadActionCenter(false);\n  // Only the lightweight overview refreshes live. Timeline/history/provider/conflict data\n  // is loaded when Performance is opened or explicitly refreshed.\n  if(currentSection==='performance')loadPerformanceOverview(false);\n  if(currentSection==='tickDebug')loadTickDebug(false);\n  if(currentSection==='memory')loadMemoryCenter(false);\n  if(currentSection==='profiler')loadProfiler(false);\n  if(currentSection==='animals')loadAnimalStatus(false);\n  if(currentSection==='loginProtection')loadLoginProtection(false);\n  // Refresh the player list/status while the Admin page is visible, but do not reload\n  // selected-player history/inventory on every live tick.\n  if(currentSection==='admin')loadAdmin(false,false);\n  if(currentSection==='web')loadWebStatus();\n  // Compatibility, Loaded Mods, Suite Health, Operations, configuration and historical\n  // views remain open/refresh driven because they change slowly or have larger payloads.\n}\n\nasync function refreshLiveV2(){\n  if(!liveUpdates||liveRequestInFlight||document.hidden)return;\n  const requestNow=Date.now();\n  const idle=requestNow-lastUserActivityAt>=LIVE_IDLE_AFTER_MS;\n  const networkInterval=idle?LIVE_IDLE_INTERVAL_MS:LIVE_ACTIVE_INTERVAL_MS;\n  if(lastLiveNetworkAt&&requestNow-lastLiveNetworkAt<networkInterval){\n    nextLiveRefreshAt=lastLiveNetworkAt+networkInterval;\n    setGlobalLiveState();\n    return;\n  }\n  liveRequestInFlight=true;\n  lastLiveNetworkAt=requestNow;\n  nextLiveRefreshAt=requestNow+networkInterval;\n  setGlobalLiveState();\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/live');\n    applyLiveSnapshot(d);\n    const now=Date.now();\n    const baseInterval=SECTION_REFRESH_INTERVAL_MS[currentSection]||30000;\n    const sectionInterval=idle?Math.max(30000,baseInterval*2):baseInterval;\n    const last=sectionRefreshAt.get(currentSection)||0;\n    if(now-last>=sectionInterval){\n      sectionRefreshAt.set(currentSection,now);\n      lastSectionLiveRefresh=now;\n      refreshCurrentSectionV2();\n    }\n  }catch(e){}finally{liveRequestInFlight=false;}\n}\n\n$('liveBtn').onclick=()=>{\n  if(safeDiagnosticsModeGlobal){\n    toast('Safe Diagnostics Mode keeps Web Live Updates OFF. Disable Safe Diagnostics Mode from Suite Health first.');\n    return;\n  }\n  liveUpdates=!liveUpdates;\n  $('liveBtn').textContent=liveUpdates?t('ui.liveOn'):t('ui.liveOff');\n  $('liveBtn').classList.toggle('active',liveUpdates);\n  setGlobalLiveState();\n  if(liveTimer)clearInterval(liveTimer);\n  liveTimer=null;\n\n  if(liveUpdates){\n    lastSectionLiveRefresh=0;\n    lastLiveNetworkAt=0;\n    nextLiveRefreshAt=Date.now()+LIVE_ACTIVE_INTERVAL_MS;\n    refreshLiveV2();\n    liveTimer=setInterval(refreshLiveV2,LIVE_ACTIVE_INTERVAL_MS);\n    toast('Live updates enabled: 4s lightweight status with visibility-aware, slower page refreshes.','success');\n  }else{\n    toast('Live updates disabled.');\n  }\n};\n\nfunction metric(name,value,klass='',detail=''){\n  const tip=tooltipForMetric(name);\n  return `<div class=\"card metric\" data-metric-name=\"${esc(name)}\"><div class=\"name\">${esc(name)}${tip?`<span class=\"tooltipHelp\" title=\"${esc(tip)}\">?</span>`:''}</div><div class=\"value ${klass}\">${esc(value)}</div>${detail?`<div class=\"detail\">${esc(detail)}</div>`:''}</div>`;\n}\n\nfunction severityClass(sev){\n  sev=String(sev||'').toLowerCase();\n  return sev==='critical'?'bad':sev==='high'?'orange':'warn';\n}\n\nfunction incidentDot(sev){\n  sev=String(sev||'').toLowerCase();\n  return `<span class=\"incidentDot ${sev}\"></span>`;\n}\n\nasync function loadDashboard(showError=true){\n  if(dashboardRequestInFlight)return;\n  dashboardRequestInFlight=true;\n  try{\n    const [d,cg]=await Promise.all([\n      api('/api/dashboard'),\n      api('/api/chatguard').catch(()=>null)\n    ]);\n    const b=d.blockLogger||{},p=d.profiler||{},a=d.animalLimiter||{},l=d.loginProtection||{},ops=d.operations||{};\n    const cgWarnings=Array.isArray(cg?.warnings)?cg.warnings:[];\n    const cgWarnedPlayers=cgWarnings.filter(x=>Number(x.ActiveWarnings||0)>0).length;\n    const pc=p.current||{},pd=p.diagnostic||{},smart=p.smart||{};\n    const diagState=p.enabled?String(pd.state||'Collecting'):'Profiler off';\n    const diagClass=diagState==='Investigate'?'bad':diagState==='Watch'?'warn':(p.enabled?'good':'muted');\n\n    if(p.enabled && smart.available){\n      const score=Number(smart.healthScore||0);\n      const state=String(smart.state||'Watch');\n      const scoreClass=state.toLowerCase();\n      $('dashboardSmart').innerHTML=`\n        <div class=\"smartHero\">\n          <div class=\"healthScore ${scoreClass}\">${score}</div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"small\">SMART SERVER HEALTH</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;margin:2px 0\">${esc(state)} — ${esc(smart.primaryFinding||'No primary finding')}</div>\n            <div class=\"small\">Finding confidence: <b>${esc(smart.primaryConfidence||'Low')}</b> · Analysis confidence: <b>${esc(smart.analysisConfidence||'Low')}</b> · Data quality ${Number(smart.dataQualityScore||0)}/100</div>\n            <div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:3px\">Recovery: <b>${esc(smart.recoveryState||'Unknown')}</b> · adaptive baseline + incident correlation + sustained trends</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>`;\n    }else{\n      $('dashboardSmart').innerHTML='<div class=\"empty\">Enable Profiler diagnostics to let Smart Diagnosis learn the server baseline and correlate lag evidence.</div>';\n    }\n\n    const attention=[];\n    const addAttention=(state,title,detail,section)=>attention.push({state,title,detail,section});\n    if(Number(ops.criticalAlerts||0)>0)addAttention('bad',`${Number(ops.criticalAlerts||0)} critical Action Center alert(s)`,`${Number(ops.activeAlerts||0)} total active/investigating alerts. Review the highest-severity items first.`,'actionCenter');\n    else if(Number(ops.activeAlerts||0)>0)addAttention('warn',`${Number(ops.activeAlerts||0)} active Action Center alert(s)`,`${Number(ops.openActions||0)} open/investigating action(s) are also waiting.`,'actionCenter');\n    if(p.enabled&&Number(pc.mainThreadDelayMs||0)>=100)addAttention('bad',`Main-thread delay ${Number(pc.mainThreadDelayMs||0).toFixed(0)} ms`,pd.summary||'Open Performance Center to inspect the current bottleneck and nearby lag incidents.','performance');\n    else if(p.enabled&&Number(pc.mainThreadDelayMs||0)>=50)addAttention('warn',`Main-thread delay ${Number(pc.mainThreadDelayMs||0).toFixed(0)} ms`,pd.summary||'Delay is elevated above the normal healthy range.','performance');\n    if(Number(b.dropped||0)>0||Number(b.overflowRejected||0)>0)addAttention('bad','BlockLogger has lost/rejected audit events',`Dropped ${Number(b.dropped||0).toLocaleString()} · overflow rejected ${Number(b.overflowRejected||0).toLocaleString()}.`,'blocklogger');\n    else if(Number(b.pending||0)>=1000||Number(b.overflowPending||0)>0)addAttention('warn','BlockLogger queue pressure',`Pending ${Number(b.pending||0).toLocaleString()} · overflow ${Number(b.overflowPending||0).toLocaleString()}.`,'blocklogger');\n    if(cg?.available&&String(cg.mode||'').toLowerCase()==='logonly')addAttention('warn','ChatGuard is in LogOnly mode','Rules are being recorded but automatic rule actions are not being enforced.','chatguard');\n    if(p.enabled&&smart.available&&String(smart.state||'').toLowerCase()==='investigate')addAttention('bad',smart.primaryFinding||'Smart Diagnosis requests investigation',`Confidence ${smart.primaryConfidence||'Low'} · ${smart.recoveryState||'Unknown'} recovery state.`,'performance');\n\n    $('dashboardAttentionMeta').textContent=attention.length?`${attention.length} item${attention.length===1?'':'s'}`:'All clear';\n    $('dashboardAttention').innerHTML=attention.length\n      ? attention.slice(0,6).map(x=>`<div class=\"emptyAction\" style=\"margin-bottom:7px;text-align:left\"><b class=\"${x.state}\">${x.state==='bad'?'Problem':'Watch'}:</b> <b>${esc(x.title)}</b><br><span class=\"small\">${esc(x.detail)}</span>${x.section?`<div style=\"margin-top:6px\"><button class=\"smallButton\" data-dash-jump=\"${esc(x.section)}\">Open ${esc(sectionLabels[x.section]||x.section)}</button></div>`:''}</div>`).join('')\n      : '<div class=\"emptyAction\"><b>No urgent Suite/server issues detected.</b><br>Current lightweight health, audit queue, moderation mode, and Action Center state are within their normal ranges.</div>';\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-dash-jump]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>setSection(btn.dataset.dashJump||'dashboard',true));\n\n    const latestGroup=Array.isArray(p.recentIncidentGroups)&&p.recentIncidentGroups.length?p.recentIncidentGroups[0]:null;\n    const cgState=!cg?.available?'Not installed':(!cg.enabled?'Disabled':String(cg.mode||'—'));\n    $('dashboardOpsSummary').innerHTML=`<div class=\"grid\">\n      ${metric('Players',Number(d.playersOnline||0))}\n      ${metric('Alerts',Number(ops.activeAlerts||0),Number(ops.criticalAlerts||0)>0?'bad':Number(ops.activeAlerts||0)>0?'warn':'good',`${Number(ops.openActions||0)} open action(s)`)}\n      ${metric('ChatGuard',cgState,cg?.available&&cg.enabled?(String(cg.mode||'').toLowerCase()==='logonly'?'warn':'good'):'muted',cg?.available?`${Number(cg.activeMutes||0)} mute(s) · ${cgWarnedPlayers} warned player(s)`:'Standalone module not detected')}\n      ${metric('BlockLogger',Number(b.dropped||0)>0?'Data loss':Number(b.pending||0)>=1000?'Backlog':'Healthy',Number(b.dropped||0)>0?'bad':Number(b.pending||0)>=1000?'warn':'good',`${Number(b.pending||0).toLocaleString()} queued`)}\n      ${metric('Latest lag',latestGroup?`${Number(latestGroup.worstDelayMs||0).toFixed(0)} ms`:'None',latestGroup?(String(latestGroup.severity||'').toLowerCase()==='critical'?'bad':String(latestGroup.severity||'').toLowerCase()==='high'?'orange':'warn'):'good',latestGroup?`${latestGroup.primaryCategory||'Unknown'} · ${latestGroup.confidence||'Low'} confidence`:'No grouped incident retained')}\n      ${metric('WebPanel',d.web?.running?'Online':'Offline',d.web?.running?'good':'bad',`${Number(d.web?.sessions||0)} active session(s)`)}\n    </div>`;\n\n    $('dashboardMetrics').innerHTML=\n      metric('Players online',d.playersOnline??0) +\n      metric('Health score',p.enabled&&smart.available?`${Number(smart.healthScore||0)}/100`:'Learning',p.enabled&&smart.available?(Number(smart.healthScore||0)<55?'bad':Number(smart.healthScore||0)<75?'orange':Number(smart.healthScore||0)<90?'warn':'good'):'muted',smart.available?`${smart.analysisConfidence||'Low'} analysis confidence · data quality ${Number(smart.dataQualityScore||0)}/100 · ${smart.recoveryState||'Unknown'}`:'') +\n      metric('Lag diagnosis',diagState,diagClass,p.enabled?(pd.summary||'5-minute evidence summary'):'Enable diagnostics to collect health evidence') +\n      metric('CPU',p.enabled?`${Number(pc.cpuPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%`:'Profiler off',Number(pc.cpuPercent||0)>=90?'warn':'') +\n      metric('Main-thread delay',p.enabled?`${Number(pc.mainThreadDelayMs||0).toFixed(1)} ms`:'Profiler off',Number(pc.mainThreadDelayMs||0)>=100?'bad':Number(pc.mainThreadDelayMs||0)>=50?'warn':'') +\n      metric('Working set',p.enabled?`${Math.round(pc.workingSetMb||0)} MB`:'Profiler off') +\n      metric('Managed heap',p.enabled?`${Math.round(pc.managedHeapMb||0)} MB`:'Profiler off') +\n      metric('Loaded entities',p.enabled?Number(pc.loadedEntities||0).toLocaleString():'Profiler off') +\n      metric('Loaded chunks',p.enabled?Number(pc.loadedChunks||0).toLocaleString():'Profiler off') +\n      metric('BlockLogger queue',Number(b.pending||0).toLocaleString(),Number(b.pending||0)>=1000?'warn':'') +\n      metric('Container sessions',`${Number(b.activeContainerSessions||0).toLocaleString()} / ${Number(b.containerSessionLimit||0).toLocaleString()}`,Number(b.activeContainerSessions||0)>=Number(b.containerSessionLimit||1)?'warn':'good',`Evicted ${Number(b.containerSessionsEvicted||0).toLocaleString()} · expired inventory ${Number(b.containerSessionsWithExpiredInventory||0).toLocaleString()}`) +\n      metric('BL audit mode',b.fullFidelity?'Full fidelity':'Reduced',b.fullFidelity?'good':'warn',b.fullFidelity?'Individual entity lifecycle logging is active.':'Review entity logging/aggregation settings.') +\n      metric('BL overflow',`${Number(b.overflowPending||0).toLocaleString()} / ${Number(b.overflowCapacity||0).toLocaleString()}`,Number(b.overflowRejected||0)>0?'bad':Number(b.overflowPending||0)>0?'warn':'good',`Accepted ${Number(b.overflowAccepted||0).toLocaleString()} · rejected ${Number(b.overflowRejected||0).toLocaleString()}`) +\n      metric('BL writer batch',`${Number(b.writerMs||0)} ms`,Number(b.writerMs||0)>=100?'warn':'') +\n      metric('BL dropped',Number(b.dropped||0).toLocaleString(),Number(b.dropped||0)>0?'bad':'good') +\n      metric('Animal tracked',a.available?Number(a.trackedEntities||0).toLocaleString():'Unavailable') +\n      metric('Animal regions',a.available?Number(a.trackedRegions||0).toLocaleString():'Unavailable') +\n      metric('Login protected',l.available?Number(l.activeProtected||0).toLocaleString():'Unavailable') +\n      metric('Active alerts',Number(ops.activeAlerts||0),Number(ops.criticalAlerts||0)>0?'bad':Number(ops.activeAlerts||0)>0?'warn':'good') +\n      metric('Open actions',Number(ops.openActions||0),Number(ops.openActions||0)>0?'warn':'good');\n\n    $('dashboardWarning').innerHTML=!p.enabled\n      ? '<div class=\"warning\"><b>Profiler diagnostics are OFF.</b> The expensive manual profiler remains off too. Enable diagnostics only when you want rolling CPU/GC/lag evidence.</div>'\n      : '';\n\n    const groups=p.recentIncidentGroups||[];\n    $('dashboardIncidents').className=groups.length?'tableWrap':'empty';\n    $('dashboardIncidents').innerHTML=groups.length\n      ? `<table><thead><tr><th>Start</th><th>Severity</th><th>Likely area</th><th>Likely mod</th><th>Confidence</th><th>Worst delay</th><th>Next action</th></tr></thead><tbody>${groups.map(x=>\n          `<tr class=\"clickableRow\" data-dashboard-incident=\"${Number(x.startUnixMilliseconds||0)}\"><td>${esc(new Date(Number(x.startUnixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleTimeString())}</td><td class=\"${severityClass(x.severity)}\">${incidentDot(x.severity)}<b>${esc(x.severity)}</b></td><td><b>${esc(x.primaryCategory)}</b></td><td>${x.likelyModId?`<b>${esc(x.likelyModName||x.likelyModId)}</b><br><span class=\"small\"><code>${esc(x.likelyModId)}</code> · ${esc(x.modConfidence||'Low')}</span>`:'<span class=\"muted\">Not attributed</span>'}</td><td>${confidenceBadge(x.confidence)}</td><td>${Number(x.worstDelayMs||0).toFixed(0)}ms</td><td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.nextAction)}\">${esc(x.nextAction)}</td></tr>`\n        ).join('')}</tbody></table>`\n      : `<div class=\"emptyAction\"><b>${p.enabled?'No recent grouped lag incidents.':'Diagnostics are off.'}</b><br>${p.enabled?'That is a good sign. Keep diagnostics on during the workload you want to study.':'Enable lightweight diagnostics to build automatic incident evidence.'}${p.enabled?'':`<div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><button id=\"dashboardEnableDiagnostics\">Enable Diagnostics</button></div>`}</div>`;\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-dashboard-incident]').forEach(row=>row.onclick=()=>{\n      setSection('performance',true);\n      setTimeout(()=>openPerformanceIncident(Number(row.dataset.dashboardIncident||0)),350);\n    });\n    if($('dashboardEnableDiagnostics'))$('dashboardEnableDiagnostics').onclick=async()=>{\n      try{await api('/api/profiler/enabled',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({enabled:true})});toast('Lightweight diagnostics enabled.','success');loadDashboard(true)}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n    };\n\n    updateGlobalStatusFromDashboard(d);\n    applyDashboardCustomization();\n    renderDashboardWatchlist();\n    setTimeout(enhanceImportantTables,20);\n  }catch(e){\n    if(showError)$('dashboardWarning').innerHTML=`<div class=\"errorBox\">${esc(e.message)}</div>`;\n  }finally{\n    dashboardRequestInFlight=false;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction actionClass(action){\n  action=String(action||'').toLowerCase();\n  if(action.includes('break'))return'action-break';\n  if(action.includes('place'))return'action-place';\n  if(action.includes('container'))return'action-container';\n  if(action.includes('entity'))return'action-entity';\n  return'action-use';\n}\n\nfunction renderLogRows(data){\n  const offset=Number(data.offset||0), count=Number(data.count||0);\n  const range=count>0?`rows ${offset+1}-${offset+count}`:'no rows';\n  $('blResultInfo').textContent=`${count} result(s) · ${range} · max paging depth 2,000`;\n  $('blPrev').disabled=!data.hasPrevious;\n  $('blNext').disabled=!data.hasNext;\n  $('blRows').innerHTML=(data.rows||[]).map(r=>`\n    <tr><td>${esc(r.timestamp)}</td><td><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-bl-player=\"${esc(r.actor)}\"><b>${esc(r.actor)}</b></button></td><td class=\"${actionClass(r.action)}\">${esc(r.action)}</td>\n    <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(r.detail)}\">${esc(r.detail)}</td><td><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-bl-coord=\"${Number(r.x)},${Number(r.y)},${Number(r.z)}\"><b>${esc(`${r.x},${r.y},${r.z}`)}</b></button></td><td>${esc(formatIngameDate(r.ingameDate))}</td></tr>`\n  ).join('');\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-bl-player]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>{\n    $('playerName').value=btn.dataset.blPlayer||'';\n    $('playerSearchBtn').click();\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-bl-coord]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>{\n    const [x,y,z]=btn.dataset.blCoord.split(',');\n    $('blX').value=x;$('blY').value=y;$('blZ').value=z;\n    toast('Nearby search coordinates updated.');\n  });\n  setTimeout(enhanceImportantTables,20);\n}\n\nasync function runBlockLoggerSearch(kind,offset=0){\n  if(blockLoggerSearchController)blockLoggerSearchController.abort();\n  blockLoggerSearchController=new AbortController();\n  const controller=blockLoggerSearchController;\n  $('blResultInfo').textContent='Searching…';\n  $('blPrev').disabled=true;$('blNext').disabled=true;\n  try{\n    let path='';\n    if(kind==='nearby'){\n      const q=new URLSearchParams({\n        view:$('blView').value,x:$('blX').value,y:$('blY').value,z:$('blZ').value,\n        dimension:$('blDim').value,radius:$('blRadius').value,limit:$('blLimit').value,\n        action:$('blAction').value,search:$('blSearch').value,offset:String(Math.max(0,offset))\n      });\n      path='/api/blocklogger/nearby?'+q;\n    }else{\n      const q=new URLSearchParams({player:$('playerName').value,category:$('playerCategory').value,limit:$('playerLimit').value,offset:String(Math.max(0,offset))});\n      path='/api/blocklogger/player?'+q;\n    }\n    const data=await api(path,{signal:controller.signal});\n    if(controller!==blockLoggerSearchController)return;\n    blockLoggerLastSearch={kind,offset:Number(data.offset||0),limit:Math.max(1,Number(data.limit||1))};\n    renderLogRows(data);\n  }catch(e){\n    if(e?.name!=='AbortError')$('blResultInfo').textContent=e.message;\n  }\n}\n\nasync function loadBlockLoggerMaintenance(){\n  const out=$('blMaintenanceStatus');\n  if(!out)return;\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/blocklogger/maintenance');\n    $('blRetentionDaysWeb').value=Number(d.retentionDays??180);\n    $('blBackupHours').value=Number(d.autoBackupIntervalHours??72);\n    $('blBackupCount').value=Number(d.backupRetentionCount??2);\n    out.innerHTML=d.available?`<b>Live DB:</b> ${formatFileBytes(Number(d.databaseBytes||0))} · <b>WAL:</b> ${formatFileBytes(Number(d.walBytes||0))} · <b>Backups:</b> ${Number(d.backupCount||0)} file(s), ${formatFileBytes(Number(d.backupBytes||0))}<br><span class=\"muted\">${esc(d.note||'')}</span>`:'<span class=\"warn\">BlockLogger storage is unavailable.</span>';\n  }catch(e){out.innerHTML=`<span class=\"bad\">${esc(e.message)}</span>`}\n}\n\nasync function saveBlockLoggerMaintenance(){\n  const btn=$('blMaintenanceSave');\n  btn.disabled=true;\n  try{\n    const body={\n      retentionDays:Number($('blRetentionDaysWeb').value||0),\n      autoBackupIntervalHours:Number($('blBackupHours').value||0),\n      backupRetentionCount:Number($('blBackupCount').value||2)\n    };\n    const d=await api('/api/blocklogger/maintenance/config',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(body)});\n    toast(d.message||'BlockLogger storage policy saved.','success');\n    await loadBlockLoggerMaintenance();\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n  finally{btn.disabled=false}\n}\n\nasync function purgeBlockLoggerData(){\n  const keepDays=Math.max(0,Number($('blPurgeKeepDays').value||0));\n  const body={\n    keepDays,\n    purgeEvents:$('blPurgeEvents').checked,\n    purgeSnapshots:$('blPurgeSnapshots').checked,\n    purgeEntityActivity:$('blPurgeEntity').checked,\n    compactAfter:$('blPurgeCompact').checked\n  };\n  if(!body.purgeEvents&&!body.purgeSnapshots&&!body.purgeEntityActivity){toast('Select at least one data category to purge.','error');return}\n  const scope=[body.purgeEvents?'events':'',body.purgeSnapshots?'container snapshots':'',body.purgeEntityActivity?'entity activity':''].filter(Boolean).join(', ');\n  const age=keepDays===0?'ALL selected history':`data older than ${keepDays} day(s)`;\n  const compact=body.compactAfter?' The database will also be compacted if the purge completes in this pass.':'';\n  if(!confirm(`Permanently purge ${age} from: ${scope}?${compact}\\n\\nThis cannot be undone.`))return;\n  const btn=$('blPurgeBtn'),out=$('blPurgeResult');\n  btn.disabled=true;btn.textContent='Purging…';out.textContent='Running bounded database maintenance…';\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/blocklogger/purge',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(body)});\n    const removed=Number(d.totalRemoved??((d.eventsRemoved||0)+(d.snapshotsRemoved||0)+(d.entityActivityRemoved||0)));\n    const before=Number(d.databaseBytesBefore||0)+Number(d.walBytesBefore||0),after=Number(d.databaseBytesAfter||0)+Number(d.walBytesAfter||0);\n    out.innerHTML=`<b>${esc(d.message||'Purge completed.')}</b><br>Removed ${removed.toLocaleString()} row(s): events ${Number(d.eventsRemoved||0).toLocaleString()}, snapshots ${Number(d.snapshotsRemoved||0).toLocaleString()}, entity activity ${Number(d.entityActivityRemoved||0).toLocaleString()}.<br>DB + WAL: ${formatFileBytes(before)} → ${formatFileBytes(after)}${d.compactMessage?`<br>${esc(d.compactMessage)}`:''}`;\n    toast(d.moreRowsMayRemain?'Purge pass finished; more matching rows may remain.':'Purge completed.','success');\n    await loadBlockLoggerMaintenance();\n  }catch(e){out.innerHTML=`<span class=\"bad\">${esc(e.message)}</span>`;toast(e.message,'error')}\n  finally{btn.disabled=false;btn.textContent='Purge Selected Data'}\n}\n\n$('blMaintenanceRefresh').onclick=loadBlockLoggerMaintenance;\n$('blMaintenanceSave').onclick=saveBlockLoggerMaintenance;\n$('blPurgeBtn').onclick=purgeBlockLoggerData;\n\n$('blSearchBtn').onclick=()=>runBlockLoggerSearch('nearby',0);\n$('playerSearchBtn').onclick=()=>runBlockLoggerSearch('player',0);\n$('blPrev').onclick=()=>{if(blockLoggerLastSearch)runBlockLoggerSearch(blockLoggerLastSearch.kind,Math.max(0,blockLoggerLastSearch.offset-blockLoggerLastSearch.limit));};\n$('blNext').onclick=()=>{if(blockLoggerLastSearch)runBlockLoggerSearch(blockLoggerLastSearch.kind,Math.min(2000,blockLoggerLastSearch.offset+blockLoggerLastSearch.limit));};\n\n\n$('blSavedApply').onclick=()=>{\n  const index=Number($('blSavedView').value);\n  if(!Number.isInteger(index)||!blockLoggerSavedViews[index]){toast('Choose a saved view first.');return;}\n  applyBlockLoggerView(blockLoggerSavedViews[index].values);\n  toast(`Applied saved view: ${blockLoggerSavedViews[index].name}`,'success');\n};\n\n$('blSavedSave').onclick=()=>{\n  const suggested=`${$('blView').value} around ${$('blX').value},${$('blZ').value}`;\n  const name=prompt('Name this BlockLogger view:',suggested);\n  if(!name||!name.trim())return;\n  blockLoggerSavedViews.unshift({name:name.trim().slice(0,80),values:currentBlockLoggerView()});\n  blockLoggerSavedViews=blockLoggerSavedViews.slice(0,30);\n  localStorage.setItem('nsu.blockLoggerSavedViews',JSON.stringify(blockLoggerSavedViews));\n  renderBlockLoggerSavedViews();\n  $('blSavedView').value='0';\n  toast('BlockLogger view saved in this browser.','success');\n};\n\n$('blSavedDelete').onclick=()=>{\n  const index=Number($('blSavedView').value);\n  if(!Number.isInteger(index)||!blockLoggerSavedViews[index]){toast('Choose a saved view first.');return;}\n  const name=blockLoggerSavedViews[index].name;\n  blockLoggerSavedViews.splice(index,1);\n  localStorage.setItem('nsu.blockLoggerSavedViews',JSON.stringify(blockLoggerSavedViews));\n  renderBlockLoggerSavedViews();\n  toast(`Deleted saved view: ${name}`);\n};\n\nlet animalStatusInFlight=false;\nlet animalStatusLastRefresh=0;\nlet animalScanInFlight=false;\nlet animalRecommendInFlight=false;\nlet animalRulesData={rules:[],exclusions:[]};\n\nasync function loadAnimalStatus(showLoading=true){\n  if(animalStatusInFlight)return;\n  if(!showLoading && Date.now()-animalStatusLastRefresh<8000)return;\n  animalStatusInFlight=true;\n  if(showLoading && !$('animalStatus').textContent.trim())$('animalStatus').textContent='Loading…';\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/animals/status');\n    const next=(d.lines||[]).join('\\n');\n    if($('animalStatus').textContent!==next)$('animalStatus').textContent=next;\n    setNavStatus('animals','good','Animal Limiter status is responding');\n    animalStatusLastRefresh=Date.now();\n  }catch(e){\n    if(showLoading)$('animalStatus').textContent=e.message;\n    setNavStatus('animals','bad','Animal Limiter status could not be loaded');\n  }finally{animalStatusInFlight=false;}\n}\n\nfunction clearAnimalRuleEditor(){\n  $('animalRulePattern').value='';\n  $('animalRuleLimit').value=String(Number(animalRulesData.defaultLimit||20));\n  $('animalRuleRadius').value=String(Number(animalRulesData.defaultRadiusChunks||3));\n  $('animalRuleSave').textContent='Add / Update Rule';\n}\n\nfunction renderAnimalRules(){\n  const d=animalRulesData||{},rows=d.rules||[],exclusions=Array.isArray(d.exclusions)?d.exclusions:[];\n  $('animalRulesSummary').textContent=`${rows.length} rule(s) · default ${Number(d.defaultLimit||0)} / ${Number(d.defaultRadiusChunks||0)}ch`;\n  $('animalRuleState').textContent=`Limiter ${d.enabled?'enabled':'disabled'} · universal limiting ${d.limitAllEntities?'ON':'OFF'} · ${exclusions.length} exclusion(s)`;\n  $('animalRuleRows').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(r=>`<tr>\n    <td><b>${esc(r.pattern)}</b>${r.usesDefaultRadius?'<div class=\"small\">inherits default radius</div>':''}</td>\n    <td><b>${Number(r.limit||0)}</b></td>\n    <td>${Number(r.radiusChunks||0)} ch</td>\n    <td>${Number(r.registeredMatches||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n    <td><div class=\"rowActions\"><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-animal-edit=\"${esc(r.pattern)}\">Edit</button><button class=\"iconBtn danger\" data-animal-remove=\"${esc(r.pattern)}\">Remove</button></div></td>\n  </tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">No explicit Animal Limiter rules are configured.</td></tr>';\n  if($('animalExclusionSummary'))$('animalExclusionSummary').textContent=`${exclusions.length} exclusion(s)`;\n  if($('animalExclusionRows'))$('animalExclusionRows').innerHTML=exclusions.length?exclusions.map(pattern=>`<tr>\n    <td><code>${esc(pattern)}</code>${String(pattern).toLowerCase()==='game:player'?'<div class=\"small\">Built-in safety exclusion</div>':''}</td>\n    <td>${String(pattern).toLowerCase()==='game:player'?'<span class=\"badge low\">Protected</span>':`<button class=\"iconBtn danger\" data-animal-exclusion-remove=\"${esc(pattern)}\">Remove</button>`}</td>\n  </tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"muted\">No exclusions are configured.</td></tr>';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-animal-edit]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{\n    const r=(animalRulesData.rules||[]).find(x=>String(x.pattern)===String(b.dataset.animalEdit));if(!r)return;\n    $('animalRulePattern').value=r.pattern||'';$('animalRuleLimit').value=String(Number(r.limit||0));$('animalRuleRadius').value=String(Number(r.radiusChunks||0));$('animalRuleSave').textContent='Update Rule';$('animalRulePattern').focus();\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-animal-remove]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>removeAnimalRule(b.dataset.animalRemove));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-animal-exclusion-remove]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>removeAnimalExclusion(b.dataset.animalExclusionRemove));\n}\n\nasync function loadAnimalRules(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading)$('animalRulesSummary').textContent='Loading…';\n  try{animalRulesData=await api('/api/animals/rules');renderAnimalRules();}\n  catch(e){$('animalRulesSummary').textContent='Load failed';$('animalRuleRows').innerHTML=`<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"bad\">${esc(e.message)}</td></tr>`;}\n}\n\nasync function saveAnimalRule(pattern=null,limit=null,radius=null){\n  pattern=pattern??$('animalRulePattern').value.trim();\n  limit=limit??Math.max(0,Math.min(1000000,Math.floor(Number($('animalRuleLimit').value||0))));\n  radius=radius??Math.max(0,Math.min(32,Math.floor(Number($('animalRuleRadius').value||0))));\n  if(!pattern){toast('Enter an entity code or wildcard pattern.','error');return false;}\n  if((pattern.includes('*')||Number(limit)===0)&&!confirm(`Apply Animal Limiter rule?\\n\\n${pattern}\\nLimit: ${limit}\\nRadius: ${radius} chunks\\n\\nWildcard and zero-limit rules can affect many entities immediately.`))return false;\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/animals/rules/set',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({pattern,limit,radiusChunks:radius})});\n    toast(d.message||'Animal Limiter rule saved.','success');await Promise.all([loadAnimalRules(false),loadAnimalStatus(false)]);return true;\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');return false;}\n}\n\nasync function removeAnimalRule(pattern){\n  if(!confirm(`Remove Animal Limiter rule ${pattern}?`))return;\n  try{const d=await api('/api/animals/rules/remove',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({pattern})});toast(d.message||'Rule removed.','success');await Promise.all([loadAnimalRules(false),loadAnimalStatus(false)]);}\n  catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nasync function addAnimalExclusion(){\n  const pattern=String($('animalExclusionPattern')?.value||'').trim();\n  if(!pattern){toast('Enter an entity code or wildcard exclusion.','error');return;}\n  if(pattern.includes('*')&&!confirm(`Add Animal Limiter wildcard exclusion?\\n\\n${pattern}\\n\\nEvery matching entity will be protected from limiter removal.`))return;\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/animals/exclusions/add',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({pattern})});\n    toast(d.message||'Exclusion added.','success');\n    if($('animalExclusionPattern'))$('animalExclusionPattern').value='';\n    await Promise.all([loadAnimalRules(false),loadAnimalStatus(false)]);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\nasync function removeAnimalExclusion(pattern){\n  if(!pattern||!confirm(`Remove Animal Limiter exclusion ${pattern}?\\n\\nMatching entities may become eligible for limiting immediately.`))return;\n  try{const d=await api('/api/animals/exclusions/remove',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({pattern})});toast(d.message||'Exclusion removed.','success');await Promise.all([loadAnimalRules(false),loadAnimalStatus(false)]);}\n  catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\n$('animalRefresh').onclick=()=>Promise.all([loadAnimalStatus(true),loadAnimalRules(true)]);\n$('animalRuleClear').onclick=clearAnimalRuleEditor;\n$('animalRuleSave').onclick=()=>saveAnimalRule();\nif($('animalExclusionAdd'))$('animalExclusionAdd').onclick=addAnimalExclusion;\nif($('animalExclusionPattern'))$('animalExclusionPattern').addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'){e.preventDefault();addAnimalExclusion();}});\n\nfunction renderAnimalScanProgress(d){\n  const pct=Math.max(0,Math.min(100,Number(d.progressPercent||0)));\n  const processed=Number(d.processedEntities||0).toLocaleString();\n  const total=Number(d.totalEntities||0).toLocaleString();\n  const regions=Number(d.processedRegions||0).toLocaleString();\n  const totalRegions=Number(d.totalRegions||0).toLocaleString();\n  if(!$('animalScanProgressText')){\n    $('animalPopulation').innerHTML=`<div><b>Population scan running</b></div>\n      <div id=\"animalScanProgressText\" class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:5px\"></div>\n      <progress id=\"animalScanProgressBar\" value=\"0\" max=\"100\" style=\"width:100%;height:18px;margin-top:10px\"></progress>\n      <div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Incremental scan: work is spread across server ticks to avoid a long main-thread stall or HTTP timeout.</div>`;\n  }\n  $('animalScanProgressText').textContent=`${d.mode||''} · ${pct}% · ${processed}/${total} entities · ${regions}/${totalRegions} regions`;\n  $('animalScanProgressBar').value=pct;\n}\n\nfunction renderAnimalScanResult(d){\n  const lines=d.lines||[];\n  const mode=lines.find(x=>x.startsWith('MODE\\t'));\n  const truncated=lines.find(x=>x.startsWith('TRUNCATED\\t'));\n  const totals=lines.filter(x=>x.startsWith('TOTAL\\t')).map(x=>x.split('\\t'));\n  const rows=lines.filter(x=>x.startsWith('ROW\\t')).map(x=>x.split('\\t'));\n  const trunc=truncated?truncated.split('\\t'):null;\n  const duration=Math.max(0,Number(d.durationMilliseconds||0));\n  const summary=`${esc(mode?mode.substring(5):(d.mode||''))} · ${Number(d.totalEntities||0).toLocaleString()} entities · ${Number(d.totalRegions||0).toLocaleString()} regions · ${(duration/1000).toFixed(1)}s`;\n  const truncNote=trunc?`<div class=\"warning\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><b>Regional table capped for browser performance.</b> Showing the highest-priority ${rows.length.toLocaleString()} of ${Number(trunc[2]||rows.length).toLocaleString()} regions; ${Number(trunc[1]||0).toLocaleString()} lower-priority rows are hidden. Mob totals still include the full scan.</div>`:'';\n\n  $('animalPopulation').innerHTML=\n    `<div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px\">${summary}</div>`+truncNote+\n    `<div class=\"small\" style=\"margin:4px 0 6px\"><b>Totals by Mob</b> — aggregate counts across all scanned regions.</div>`+\n    `<div class=\"tableWrap\" style=\"margin-bottom:14px\"><table><thead><tr><th>Mob</th><th>Total</th><th>Protected</th><th>Eligible</th><th>Regions</th><th>Over-limit Regions</th></tr></thead><tbody>`+\n    (totals.length?totals.map(r=>{\n      const total=Number(r[2]||0),prot=Number(r[3]||0),eligible=Number(r[4]||0),regions=Number(r[5]||0),overRegions=Number(r[6]||0);\n      return `<tr><td><b>${esc(r[1])}</b></td><td><b>${total}</b></td><td>${prot}</td><td>${eligible}</td><td>${regions}</td><td class=\"${overRegions>0?'bad':'good'}\"><b>${overRegions}</b></td></tr>`;\n    }).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No matching tracked population was found.</td></tr>')+'</tbody></table></div>'+ \n    `<div class=\"small\" style=\"margin:4px 0 6px\"><b>Regional Breakdown</b> — over-limit regions are shown first.</div>`+\n    `<div class=\"tableWrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Mob</th><th>Region</th><th>Rule</th><th>Tracked</th><th>Mob Total</th><th>Limit</th><th>Radius</th><th>Protected</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>`+\n    (rows.length?rows.map(r=>{\n      const tracked=Number(r[4]||0),limit=Number(r[5]||0),prot=Number(r[7]||0),eligible=Number(r[8]||0);\n      const over=Math.max(0,eligible-limit);\n      const mobTotal=(totals.find(t=>String(t[1]).toLowerCase()===String(r[1]).toLowerCase())||[])[2]||tracked;\n      return `<tr><td><b>${esc(r[1])}</b></td><td>${esc(r[2])}</td><td>${esc(r[3])}</td><td>${tracked}</td><td><b>${esc(mobTotal)}</b></td><td>${limit}</td><td>${esc(r[6])} ch</td><td>${prot}</td><td class=\"${over>0?'bad':'good'}\"><b>${over>0?'OVER +'+over:'OK'}</b></td></tr>`;\n    }).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"9\" class=\"muted\">No regional rows.</td></tr>')+'</tbody></table></div>';\n}\n\n$('animalScan').onclick=async()=>{\n  if(animalScanInFlight||animalRecommendInFlight)return;\n  const btn=$('animalScan');\n  animalScanInFlight=true;\n  btn.disabled=true;\n  btn.textContent='Scanning…';\n  $('animalPopulation').innerHTML='<div><b>Starting population scan…</b></div><div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Preparing a bounded incremental scan.</div>';\n  try{\n    let d=await api('/api/animals/scan',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});\n    if(d.error)throw new Error(d.error);\n    const scanId=Number(d.scanId||0);\n    while(!d.completed){\n      renderAnimalScanProgress(d);\n      await new Promise(resolve=>setTimeout(resolve,500));\n      d=await api(`/api/animals/scan-status?id=${encodeURIComponent(scanId)}`);\n      if(d.error)throw new Error(d.error);\n    }\n    renderAnimalScanResult(d);\n    toast('Population scan complete.','success');\n  }catch(e){\n    $('animalPopulation').innerHTML=`<div class=\"warning\"><b>Population scan failed safely.</b><div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">${esc(e.message||String(e))}</div></div>`;\n    toast(e.message||String(e),'error');\n  }finally{\n    animalScanInFlight=false;\n    btn.disabled=false;\n    btn.textContent='Scan Population';\n  }\n};\n\nfunction renderAnimalRecommendations(d){\n  const rows=d.recommendations||[];\n  $('animalRecommendationState').textContent=rows.length?`${rows.length} candidate rule(s) from scan ${d.scanId||'—'}`:(d.note||'No candidates');\n  $('animalRecommendationRows').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(r=>{\n    const observed=`${Number(r.regionsObserved||0)} region(s)<div class=\"small\">avg ${Number(r.averageEligible||0).toFixed(1)} · median ${Number(r.medianEligible||0)} · peak ${Number(r.peakEligible||0)}</div>`;\n    const current=r.hasEffectiveRule?`<div class=\"small\">current ${esc(r.effectiveRule||'rule')} = ${Number(r.effectiveLimit||0)}</div>`:'<div class=\"small\">currently unruled</div>';\n    const conf=String(r.confidence||'Low');\n    return `<tr><td><b>${esc(r.pattern)}</b>${current}</td><td>${observed}</td><td><b>${Number(r.suggestedLimit||0)}</b></td><td>${Number(r.radiusChunks||0)} ch</td><td class=\"${Number(r.estimatedWouldRemoveNow||0)>0?'warn':'good'}\"><b>${Number(r.estimatedWouldRemoveNow||0)}</b> would be over cap now</td><td><span class=\"badge ${conf==='High'?'low':conf==='Medium'?'medium':'muted'}\">${esc(conf)}</span></td><td class=\"small\" style=\"white-space:normal;min-width:260px\">${esc(r.reason||'')}</td><td><div class=\"rowActions\"><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-animal-rec-edit=\"${esc(r.pattern)}\" data-limit=\"${Number(r.suggestedLimit||0)}\" data-radius=\"${Number(r.radiusChunks||0)}\">Use in editor</button><button class=\"iconBtn primary\" data-animal-rec-apply=\"${esc(r.pattern)}\" data-limit=\"${Number(r.suggestedLimit||0)}\" data-radius=\"${Number(r.radiusChunks||0)}\">Apply</button></div></td></tr>`;\n  }).join(''):`<tr><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"muted\">${esc(d.note||'No strong recommendation candidates were found in currently loaded player areas.')}</td></tr>`;\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-animal-rec-edit]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{$('animalRulePattern').value=b.dataset.animalRecEdit||'';$('animalRuleLimit').value=b.dataset.limit||'0';$('animalRuleRadius').value=b.dataset.radius||'0';$('animalRuleSave').textContent='Add / Update Rule';$('animalRulePattern').focus();});\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-animal-rec-apply]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{\n    const pattern=b.dataset.animalRecApply||'',limit=Number(b.dataset.limit||0),radius=Number(b.dataset.radius||0);\n    if(!confirm(`Apply recommended rule?\\n\\n${pattern}\\nLimit: ${limit}\\nRadius: ${radius} chunks\\n\\nThis changes the live Animal Limiter configuration immediately.`))return;\n    if(await saveAnimalRule(pattern,limit,radius))b.disabled=true;\n  });\n}\n\n$('animalRecommend').onclick=async()=>{\n  if(animalScanInFlight||animalRecommendInFlight)return;\n  const btn=$('animalRecommend');animalRecommendInFlight=true;btn.disabled=true;btn.textContent='Analyzing…';\n  $('animalRecommendationState').textContent='Starting recommendation scan…';\n  $('animalRecommendationRows').innerHTML='<tr><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"muted\">Scanning loaded non-player agents near online players…</td></tr>';\n  try{\n    let d=await api('/api/animals/recommendations/start',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});if(d.error)throw new Error(d.error);\n    const scanId=Number(d.scanId||0);\n    while(!d.completed){\n      const pct=Math.max(0,Math.min(100,Number(d.progressPercent||0)));\n      $('animalRecommendationState').textContent=`Analyzing ${pct}% · ${Number(d.processedEntities||0).toLocaleString()}/${Number(d.totalEntities||0).toLocaleString()} entities`;\n      await new Promise(resolve=>setTimeout(resolve,500));\n      d=await api(`/api/animals/scan-status?id=${encodeURIComponent(scanId)}`);if(d.error)throw new Error(d.error);\n    }\n    const rec=await api(`/api/animals/recommendations?id=${encodeURIComponent(scanId)}`);renderAnimalRecommendations(rec);toast('Animal Limiter recommendation analysis complete.','success');\n  }catch(e){$('animalRecommendationState').textContent='Analysis failed';$('animalRecommendationRows').innerHTML=`<tr><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"bad\">${esc(e.message||String(e))}</td></tr>`;toast(e.message||String(e),'error');}\n  finally{animalRecommendInFlight=false;btn.disabled=false;btn.textContent='Analyze & Recommend';}\n};\n\nasync function loadLoginProtection(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading)$('loginProtStatus').textContent='Loading…';\n  try{\n    const [status,cfg]=await Promise.all([api('/api/loginprotection/status'),api('/api/loginprotection/config')]);\n    $('loginProtStatus').textContent=(status.lines||[]).join('\\n');\n    if(cfg.available){\n      const c=cfg.config||{};\n      setNavStatus('loginProtection',c.enabled?'good':'neutral',c.enabled?'Login Protection enabled':'Login Protection disabled');\n      $('lpEnabled').checked=!!c.enabled;\n      $('lpSeconds').value=String(Number(c.protectionSeconds||60));\n      $('lpJoin').checked=!!c.protectOnJoin;\n      $('lpRespawn').checked=!!c.protectOnRespawn;\n      $('lpAnnounceJoin').checked=!!c.announceOnJoin;\n      $('lpAnnounceEnd').checked=!!c.announceOnEnd;\n      $('lpBlockPvp').checked=!!c.blockPvP;\n      $('lpCancelAttack').checked=!!c.cancelOnAttack;\n      $('lpFall').checked=!!c.protectFallDamage;\n      $('lpFire').checked=!!c.extinguishFire;\n      $('lpSwim').checked=!!c.recoverSwimmingOnLogin;\n      $('loginProtConfigState').textContent=`${Number(cfg.activeProtected||0)} player(s) currently protected`;\n    }else { $('loginProtConfigState').textContent='Module unavailable'; setNavStatus('loginProtection','bad','Login Protection module unavailable'); }\n  }catch(e){$('loginProtStatus').textContent=e.message;$('loginProtConfigState').textContent='Load failed';setNavStatus('loginProtection','bad','Login Protection status could not be loaded');}\n}\n\nasync function saveLoginProtection(){\n  const payload={\n    enabled:$('lpEnabled').checked,\n    protectionSeconds:Math.max(1,Math.min(3600,Math.floor(Number($('lpSeconds').value||60)))),\n    protectOnJoin:$('lpJoin').checked,\n    protectOnRespawn:$('lpRespawn').checked,\n    announceOnJoin:$('lpAnnounceJoin').checked,\n    announceOnEnd:$('lpAnnounceEnd').checked,\n    blockPvP:$('lpBlockPvp').checked,\n    cancelOnAttack:$('lpCancelAttack').checked,\n    protectFallDamage:$('lpFall').checked,\n    extinguishFire:$('lpFire').checked,\n    recoverSwimmingOnLogin:$('lpSwim').checked\n  };\n  if(!confirm('Save these Login Protection settings? Changes take effect immediately.'))return;\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/loginprotection/config',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(payload)});\n    toast(d.message||'Login Protection configuration saved.','success');\n    await loadLoginProtection(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n$('loginProtRefresh').onclick=()=>loadLoginProtection(true);\n$('loginProtSave').onclick=saveLoginProtection;\n\nfunction clearAnnouncementEditor(){\n  announcementEditingId='';\n  $('annName').value='';$('annMessage').value='';$('annEnabled').checked=true;$('annMode').value='interval';$('annInterval').value='60';$('annStartTime').value='';$('annDailyTimes').value='';$('annMaxRuns').value='0';\n  $('annApplyEditor').textContent='Add / Update Rule';\n}\n\nfunction announcementScheduleText(r){\n  if(String(r.mode||'interval').toLowerCase()==='daily')return `Daily at ${(r.dailyTimes||[]).join(', ')||'12:00'}`;\n  return `Every ${Number(r.intervalMinutes||60)} min${r.startTime?` from ${r.startTime}`:''}`;\n}\n\nfunction restartFormatRemaining(seconds){\n  seconds=Math.max(0,Number(seconds||0));\n  const d=Math.floor(seconds/86400);seconds%=86400;\n  const h=Math.floor(seconds/3600);seconds%=3600;\n  const m=Math.floor(seconds/60);const sec=Math.floor(seconds%60);\n  return d?`${d}d ${h}h ${m}m`:h?`${h}h ${m}m`:m?`${m}m ${sec}s`:`${sec}s`;\n}\nfunction renderRestartSchedule(){\n  const d=restartScheduleData||{};\n  if(!$('restartState'))return;\n  $('restartState').textContent=d.available===false?'Service unavailable':(d.enabled?'Enabled':'Disabled');\n  $('restartEnabled').checked=!!d.enabled;\n  $('restartPrimaryTime').value=d.restartTimeUtc||'00:00:00';\n  $('restartTimes').value=(d.restartTimesUtc||[]).join(', ');\n  $('restartWarnings').value=(d.warningMinutes||[]).join(', ');\n  $('restartReason').value=d.reason||'Scheduled server restart';\n  $('restartGameAnnouncements').checked=d.announceInGame!==false;\n  $('restartDiscordAnnouncements').checked=d.announceToDiscord!==false;\n  const next=Number(d.nextRestartUnixMilliseconds||0);\n  $('restartMetrics').innerHTML=\n    metric('Scheduler',d.enabled?'Enabled':'Disabled',d.enabled?'good':'muted')+\n    metric('Next restart',next?new Date(next).toLocaleString():'Not scheduled',next?'warn':'muted',d.nextRestartUtc||'UTC schedule')+\n    metric('Remaining',next?restartFormatRemaining(d.remainingSeconds):'—')+\n    metric('/restarttime',d.rootRestartTimeOwner||'Unregistered',d.rootRestartTimeOwner==='Newfies Server Essentials'?'good':'warn',d.fallbackCommand||'/nse restarttime');\n  $('restartNext').innerHTML=next\n    ? `<b>Next restart:</b> ${esc(d.nextRestartUtc||new Date(next).toISOString())} &nbsp; <span class=\"warn\">(${esc(restartFormatRemaining(d.remainingSeconds))})</span>`\n    : '<span class=\"muted\">No automatic restart is currently scheduled.</span>';\n  $('restartCompat').innerHTML=d.th3EssentialsDetected\n    ? '<div class=\"infoBox\"><b>Th3Essentials detected:</b> NSE leaves root <code>/restarttime</code> to Th3Essentials. NSE status remains available as <code>/nse restarttime</code>.</div>'\n    : '<div class=\"infoBox\">NSE owns <code>/restarttime</code> only when no other mod already registered it. The namespaced <code>/nse restarttime</code> fallback remains available.</div>';\n  const custom=!!d.customRestartScheduled,customAt=Number(d.customRestartUnixMilliseconds||0);\n  if($('restartCustomState'))$('restartCustomState').textContent=custom?'Pending':'No one-off restart scheduled.';\n  if($('restartCustomSummary'))$('restartCustomSummary').innerHTML=custom\n    ? `<b>One-off restart:</b> ${esc(d.customRestartUtc||new Date(customAt).toLocaleString())} · <span class=\"warn\">${esc(restartFormatRemaining(d.customRestartRemainingSeconds))}</span><br><b>Reason:</b> ${esc(d.customRestartReason||'Maintenance')}`\n    : 'This one-off schedule is runtime-only and does not modify the recurring UTC schedule.';\n  if($('restartCustomCancel'))$('restartCustomCancel').disabled=!custom||currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly';\n  if($('restartCustomSchedule'))$('restartCustomSchedule').disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly';\n}\nasync function loadRestartSchedule(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading&&$('restartState'))$('restartState').textContent='Loading…';\n  try{restartScheduleData=await api('/api/restarts');renderRestartSchedule();}\n  catch(e){if($('restartState'))$('restartState').textContent=e.message;}\n}\nfunction parseRestartTimes(value){return String(value||'').split(',').map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean)}\nfunction parseRestartWarnings(value){return String(value||'').split(',').map(x=>Number(x.trim())).filter(x=>Number.isInteger(x)&&x>0)}\nasync function saveRestartSchedule(){\n  const payload={\n    enabled:$('restartEnabled').checked,\n    restartTimeUtc:$('restartPrimaryTime').value.trim()||'00:00:00',\n    restartTimesUtc:parseRestartTimes($('restartTimes').value),\n    warningMinutes:parseRestartWarnings($('restartWarnings').value),\n    announceInGame:$('restartGameAnnouncements').checked,\n    announceToDiscord:$('restartDiscordAnnouncements').checked,\n    reason:$('restartReason').value.trim()||'Scheduled server restart'\n  };\n  try{const d=await api('/api/restarts/settings',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(payload)});restartScheduleData=d.restarts||restartScheduleData;renderRestartSchedule();toast(d.message||'Automated restart settings saved.','success');}\n  catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n}\nasync function restartScheduleAction(action,extra={}){\n  const dangerous=action==='skip';\n  if(dangerous&&!confirm('Skip the next scheduled automatic restart?'))return;\n  try{const d=await api('/api/restarts/action',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action,...extra})});restartScheduleData=d.restarts||restartScheduleData;renderRestartSchedule();toast(d.message||'Restart schedule updated.','success');}\n  catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n}\nasync function scheduleCustomRestart(){\n  const minutes=Math.max(1,Math.min(1440,Math.round(Number($('restartCustomMinutes')?.value||10))));\n  const reason=String($('restartCustomReason')?.value||'Maintenance').trim()||'Maintenance';\n  if(!confirm(`Schedule a server restart in ${minutes} minute${minutes===1?'':'s'}?\\n\\nReason: ${reason}`))return;\n  await restartScheduleAction('schedule-custom',{minutes,reason});\n}\n\nfunction renderAnnouncements(){\n  const d=announcementData||{},rows=d.rules||[];\n  $('annGlobalEnabled').checked=!!d.enabled;$('annPrefix').value=d.prefix||'';\n  $('annState').textContent=`${Number(d.enabledRules||rows.filter(x=>x.enabled).length)}/${Number(d.totalRules||rows.length)} enabled · ${d.timezone||'server local time'}`;\n  $('annMetrics').innerHTML=metric('Automation',d.enabled?'Enabled':'Disabled',d.enabled?'good':'warn')+metric('Rules',rows.length)+metric('Enabled rules',rows.filter(x=>x.enabled).length)+metric('Finite schedules',rows.filter(x=>Number(x.maxRuns||0)>0).length);\n  $('annRows').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(r=>{\n    const next=Number(r.nextRunUnixMilliseconds||0);const last=Number(r.lastRunUnixMilliseconds||0);const max=Number(r.maxRuns||0);\n    return `<tr><td>${r.enabled?'<span class=\"badge low\">ON</span>':'<span class=\"badge muted\">OFF</span>'}</td><td><b>${esc(r.name||'Announcement')}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(r.message||'')}</div></td><td>${esc(announcementScheduleText(r))}</td><td>${Number(r.runsCompleted||0)}${max>0?` / ${max}`:' / ∞'}${last?`<div class=\"small\">last ${esc(new Date(last).toLocaleString())}</div>`:''}</td><td>${next?esc(new Date(next).toLocaleString()):'—'}</td><td><div class=\"rowActions\"><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-ann-edit=\"${esc(r.id)}\">Edit</button><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-ann-test=\"${esc(r.id)}\">Test</button><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-ann-reset=\"${esc(r.id)}\">Reset runs</button><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-ann-delete=\"${esc(r.id)}\">Delete</button></div></td></tr>`;\n  }).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No announcements configured.</td></tr>';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ann-edit]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>editAnnouncement(b.dataset.annEdit));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ann-test]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>announcementAction('test',b.dataset.annTest));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ann-reset]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>announcementAction('reset',b.dataset.annReset));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ann-delete]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>deleteAnnouncement(b.dataset.annDelete));\n}\n\nasync function loadAnnouncements(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading)$('annState').textContent='Loading…';\n  try{announcementData=await api('/api/announcements');renderAnnouncements();}\n  catch(e){$('annState').textContent='Load failed';toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nfunction editAnnouncement(id){\n  const r=(announcementData.rules||[]).find(x=>String(x.id)===String(id));if(!r)return;\n  announcementEditingId=r.id;$('annName').value=r.name||'';$('annMessage').value=r.message||'';$('annEnabled').checked=!!r.enabled;$('annMode').value=String(r.mode||'interval').toLowerCase()==='daily'?'daily':'interval';$('annInterval').value=String(Number(r.intervalMinutes||60));$('annStartTime').value=r.startTime||'';$('annDailyTimes').value=(r.dailyTimes||[]).join(', ');$('annMaxRuns').value=String(Number(r.maxRuns||0));$('annApplyEditor').textContent='Update Rule';\n}\n\nfunction editorAnnouncement(){\n  const existing=(announcementData.rules||[]).find(x=>String(x.id)===String(announcementEditingId));\n  return {id:announcementEditingId||Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,12),name:$('annName').value.trim()||'Announcement',enabled:$('annEnabled').checked,message:$('annMessage').value.trim(),mode:$('annMode').value,intervalMinutes:Math.max(1,Math.min(10080,Math.floor(Number($('annInterval').value||60)))),startTime:$('annStartTime').value||'',dailyTimes:String($('annDailyTimes').value||'').split(',').map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean),maxRuns:Math.max(0,Math.floor(Number($('annMaxRuns').value||0))),runsCompleted:Number(existing?.runsCompleted||0),lastRunUnixMilliseconds:Number(existing?.lastRunUnixMilliseconds||0),nextRunUnixMilliseconds:Number(existing?.nextRunUnixMilliseconds||0)};\n}\n\nasync function saveAnnouncements(){\n  const payload={schemaVersion:1,enabled:$('annGlobalEnabled').checked,prefix:$('annPrefix').value.trim(),rules:announcementData.rules||[]};\n  try{const d=await api('/api/announcements/save',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(payload)});announcementData=d.announcements||announcementData;renderAnnouncements();toast(d.message||'Announcement schedule saved.','success');}\n  catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nasync function applyAnnouncementEditor(){\n  const rule=editorAnnouncement();if(!rule.message){toast('Announcement message is required.','error');return;}\n  if(rule.mode==='daily'&&!rule.dailyTimes.length){toast('Add at least one daily HH:mm time.','error');return;}\n  const rows=[...(announcementData.rules||[])];const idx=rows.findIndex(x=>String(x.id)===String(rule.id));if(idx>=0)rows[idx]=rule;else rows.push(rule);announcementData.rules=rows;await saveAnnouncements();clearAnnouncementEditor();\n}\n\nasync function deleteAnnouncement(id){if(!confirm('Delete this announcement rule?'))return;announcementData.rules=(announcementData.rules||[]).filter(x=>String(x.id)!==String(id));await saveAnnouncements();if(announcementEditingId===id)clearAnnouncementEditor();}\nasync function announcementAction(action,id){try{const d=await api('/api/announcements/action',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action,id})});toast(d.message||'Announcement action complete.','success');await loadAnnouncements(false);}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}}\n$('restartRefresh').onclick=()=>loadRestartSchedule(true);\n$('restartSave').onclick=saveRestartSchedule;\n$('restartSkip').onclick=()=>restartScheduleAction('skip');\n$('restartReload').onclick=()=>restartScheduleAction('reload');\nif($('restartCustomSchedule'))$('restartCustomSchedule').onclick=scheduleCustomRestart;\nif($('restartCustomCancel'))$('restartCustomCancel').onclick=()=>{if(confirm('Cancel the pending one-off restart?'))restartScheduleAction('cancel-custom');};\n$('annRefresh').onclick=()=>loadAnnouncements(true);$('annSave').onclick=saveAnnouncements;$('annClear').onclick=clearAnnouncementEditor;$('annApplyEditor').onclick=applyAnnouncementEditor;\n\nfunction consoleLineClass(line){\n  if(String(line).includes('[Game Chat]'))return 'good';\n  const x=String(line||''),l=x.toLowerCase();\n  if(/\\[[^\\]]*(fatal|error)[^\\]]*\\]|\\bfatal\\b|\\berror\\b|exception(:|\\s)/i.test(x))return 'error';\n  if(/\\[[^\\]]*warn(ing)?[^\\]]*\\]|\\bwarning\\b|\\bwarn\\b/i.test(x))return 'warning';\n  if(/\\bchat\\b|\\bmessage\\b|broadcast|said:/i.test(x))return 'chat';\n  if(/\\bcommand\\b|executed|caller|webconsole/i.test(x))return 'command';\n  if(/\\[[^\\]]*debug[^\\]]*\\]|\\bdebug\\b|verbose/i.test(x))return 'debug';\n  if(/\\[[^\\]]*(notification|event)[^\\]]*\\]|joined|left the game|server started|server shutdown/i.test(x))return 'event';\n  return 'info';\n}\n\nfunction renderConsoleBlockEntityAlerts(snapshot){\n  const host=$('consoleBlockAlerts');if(!host)return;\n  const rows=(snapshot?.entries||[]);\n  if(!rows.length){host.innerHTML='';return;}\n  host.innerHTML=rows.map(x=>{\n    const key=esc(x.key||'');\n    const pos=`${Number(x.x||0)}, ${Number(x.y||0)}, ${Number(x.z||0)}${Number(x.dimension||0)?` · dim ${Number(x.dimension||0)}`:''}`;\n    let controls=`<button data-console-bbe-inspect=\"${key}\">Inspect</button>`;\n    if(currentSessionRole!=='ReadOnly'){\n      controls+=` <button data-console-bbe-teleport=\"${key}\">Teleport</button>`;\n      controls+=` <button data-console-bbe-stop=\"${key}\">Stop Tracking</button>`;\n      controls+=` <button class=\"danger\" data-console-bbe-remove=\"${key}\">Remove Block Entity</button>`;\n      controls+=` <button class=\"danger\" data-console-bbe-replace=\"${key}\" data-block-code=\"${esc(x.blockCode||'')}\">Replace Block</button>`;\n    }\n    return `<div class=\"consoleSpamAlert\"><div class=\"alertHead\"><div><div class=\"alertTitle\">⚠ Block Entity Spam · ${Number(x.occurrences||0).toLocaleString()} errors</div><div class=\"alertMeta\"><code>${esc(pos)}</code> · <b>${esc(x.blockCode||'')}</b> · <code>${esc(x.blockEntityType||'')}</code> · last ${x.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds?esc(new Date(Number(x.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleTimeString()):'—'}</div></div><div class=\"spacer\"></div><div class=\"rowActions\">${controls}</div></div><div class=\"alertError\">${esc(x.lastException||'Unknown exception')}<br>${esc(x.lastTopFrame||'')}</div></div>`;\n  }).join('');\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-console-bbe-inspect]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>inspectBadBlockEntity(b.dataset.consoleBbeInspect||''));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-console-bbe-teleport]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>teleportToBadBlockEntity(b.dataset.consoleBbeTeleport||''));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-console-bbe-stop]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{await badBlockEntityAction(b.dataset.consoleBbeStop||'','stop');await loadConsole(false);});\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-console-bbe-remove]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{await removeBadBlockEntity(b.dataset.consoleBbeRemove||'');await loadConsole(false);});\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-console-bbe-replace]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{await replaceBadBlockEntity(b.dataset.consoleBbeReplace||'',b.dataset.blockCode||'');await loadConsole(false);});\n}\n\nfunction collapseConsoleBlockEntitySpam(lines,hasAlerts){\n  if(!hasAlerts)return {lines,suppressed:0};\n  const kept=[];let suppress=false,suppressed=0;\n  for(const raw of lines){\n    const line=String(raw||'');\n    const isHeader=line.includes('[Error] At position ')&&line.includes(' threw an error when ticked');\n    if(isHeader){suppress=true;suppressed++;continue;}\n    if(suppress){\n      const trimmed=line.trimStart();\n      const isStack=trimmed.startsWith('at ');\n      const isException=line.includes('[Error] Exception:');\n      if(isStack||isException||!line.includes('[')){suppressed++;continue;}\n      suppress=false;\n    }\n    kept.push(line);\n  }\n  return {lines:kept,suppressed};\n}\n\nfunction renderConsole(d,keepPosition=false){\n  const out=$('consoleOutput'),nearBottom=out.scrollHeight-out.scrollTop-out.clientHeight<70;const rawLines=[...(d.lines||[])];if(d.playerChatIncluded){rawLines.push('── Recent public game chat (current server session) ──',...(d.chatLines||[]));}\n  const alertRows=d.blockEntityAlerts?.entries||[];const collapsed=collapseConsoleBlockEntitySpam(rawLines,alertRows.length>0);const lines=collapsed.lines;\n  $('consoleMetrics').innerHTML=metric('CPU',`${Number(d.cpuPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%`,Number(d.cpuPercent||0)>=90?'bad':Number(d.cpuPercent||0)>=75?'warn':'')+metric('RAM',`${Number(d.ramMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)+metric('Players',Number(d.playersOnline||0))+metric('Console input',d.commandInputEnabled?'ON':'OFF',d.commandInputEnabled?'warn':'good',d.commandInputEnabled&&d.commandInputExpiresUnixMilliseconds?`expires ${new Date(Number(d.commandInputExpiresUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleTimeString()}`:'read-only');\n  $('consoleState').textContent=`${lines.length} visible line(s)${collapsed.suppressed?` · ${collapsed.suppressed} block-entity spam line(s) collapsed into alert cards`:''} · ${d.logPath||'server-main.log'}`;\n  renderConsoleBlockEntityAlerts(d.blockEntityAlerts||{});\n  out.innerHTML=lines.map(line=>`<span class=\"consoleLine ${consoleLineClass(line)}\">${esc(line)}</span>`).join('');\n  $('consoleInputToggle').textContent=d.commandInputEnabled?'Console Input: ON':'Console Input: OFF';$('consoleInputToggle').classList.toggle('primary',!!d.commandInputEnabled);\n  $('consoleCommand').disabled=!d.commandInputEnabled;$('consoleSend').disabled=!d.commandInputEnabled;$('consoleInputMode').disabled=!d.commandInputEnabled;$('consoleInputRow').classList.toggle('consoleInputOff',!d.commandInputEnabled);\n  if(!keepPosition||nearBottom)out.scrollTop=out.scrollHeight;\n}\n\nasync function loadConsole(showLoading=false){\n  if(showLoading)$('consoleState').textContent='Loading…';\n  if(consoleRequestInFlight){consoleRefreshPending=true;return consoleRequestInFlight;}\n  consoleRequestInFlight=(async()=>{\n    do{\n      consoleRefreshPending=false;\n      const includeChat=$('consoleIncludeChat').checked;\n      try{\n        const d=await api('/api/console?lines=350&includeChat='+(includeChat?'true':'false'));\n        // A previous opt-in result must not put chat back on screen after the\n        // checkbox changed while its request was in flight.\n        if(includeChat!==$('consoleIncludeChat').checked){consoleRefreshPending=true;continue;}\n        renderConsole(d,true);\n      }catch(e){$('consoleState').textContent='Load failed';toast(e.message,'error');}\n    }while(consoleRefreshPending&&!document.hidden&&currentSection==='console');\n  })();\n  try{await consoleRequestInFlight;}finally{consoleRequestInFlight=null;consoleRefreshPending=false;}\n}\nasync function toggleConsoleInput(){const on=$('consoleInputToggle').textContent.includes('OFF');if(on&&!confirm('Enable web console input for 15 minutes? This allows the authenticated dashboard session to run Vintage Story server commands and broadcast server messages.'))return;try{await api('/api/console/input',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({enabled:on})});await loadConsole(false);toast(on?'Console input enabled for 15 minutes.':'Console input disabled.','success');}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}}\nasync function sendConsoleCommand(){const command=$('consoleCommand').value.trim();if(!command)return;const mode=$('consoleInputMode').value||'auto';try{const d=await api('/api/console/command',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({command,mode})});$('consoleCommand').value='';toast(d.message||d.status||'Console input sent.',d.success?'success':'error');setTimeout(()=>loadConsole(false),250);}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}}\nasync function consoleServerControl(action){\n  if(action==='start'){toast('Start is unavailable from the in-process dashboard. Start the Vintage Story process from Stratum or your external host/supervisor.','warn');return;}\n  const restart=action==='restart';\n  const label=restart?'restart':'stop';\n  if(!confirm(`Gracefully ${label} the server in 5 seconds?${restart?' The process must be relaunched by Stratum or your external supervisor.':''}`))return;\n  const expected=restart?'RESTART':'SHUTDOWN';\n  const confirmation=prompt(`Safety check: type ${expected} to ${label} the server:`,'')||'';\n  if(confirmation.toUpperCase()!==expected)return;\n  try{\n    $('consoleRestartServer').disabled=true;$('consoleStopServer').disabled=true;\n    const d=await api('/api/admin/shutdown',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:restart?'restart':'schedule',duration:'5s',reason:restart?'Web console restart':'Web console stop',confirmation:expected})});\n    $('consoleState').textContent=restart?'Restart scheduled…':'Shutdown scheduled…';\n    toast(d.message||`Server ${label} scheduled.`,'success');\n  }catch(e){\n    $('consoleRestartServer').disabled=false;$('consoleStopServer').disabled=false;toast(e.message,'error');\n  }\n}\nfunction toggleConsoleLive(){consoleLiveEnabled=!consoleLiveEnabled;$('consoleLive').textContent=`Auto Refresh: ${consoleLiveEnabled?'ON':'OFF'}`;$('consoleLive').classList.toggle('active',consoleLiveEnabled);if(consoleLiveTimer)clearInterval(consoleLiveTimer);consoleLiveTimer=consoleLiveEnabled?setInterval(()=>{if(!document.hidden&&currentSection==='console')loadConsole(false);},5000):null;if(consoleLiveEnabled)loadConsole(false);}\n$('consoleIncludeChat').checked=localStorage.getItem('nsu.console.includeChat')==='true';\n$('consoleIncludeChat').onchange=()=>{localStorage.setItem('nsu.console.includeChat',String($('consoleIncludeChat').checked));loadConsole(true);};\n$('consoleRefresh').onclick=()=>loadConsole(true);$('consoleLive').onclick=toggleConsoleLive;$('consoleInputToggle').onclick=toggleConsoleInput;$('consoleSend').onclick=sendConsoleCommand;$('consoleStartServer').onclick=()=>consoleServerControl('start');$('consoleRestartServer').onclick=()=>consoleServerControl('restart');$('consoleStopServer').onclick=()=>consoleServerControl('stop');$('consoleCommand').addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'){e.preventDefault();sendConsoleCommand();}});\n$('consoleInputMode').onchange=()=>{const m=$('consoleInputMode').value;$('consoleCommand').placeholder=m==='command'?'Vintage Story command, slash optional':m==='message'?'Server message to broadcast to online players':'Auto: /command executes; plain text broadcasts to players';};\n\nlet actionClearBusy=false;\nasync function clearActionCenter(target,selected=null){\n if(actionClearBusy||currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly')return;\n const rows=target==='alerts'?(operationsData?.alerts||[]):(operationsData?.actions||[]).filter(x=>x.status!=='Cleared');\n const ids=selected||rows.map(x=>x.id);if(!ids.length)return;\n if(!confirm('Clear '+ids.length+' displayed '+target+'? '+(target==='alerts'?'Ongoing conditions can create new alerts.':'Recommendations return after their condition clears and occurs again.')))return;\n actionClearBusy=true;if(operationsData)renderActionCenter(operationsData);\n try{const result=await api('/api/operations/clear',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({target,ids})});toast('Cleared '+Number(result.cleared||0)+' '+target+'.','success');await loadActionCenter(false);}\n catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n finally{actionClearBusy=false;if(operationsData)renderActionCenter(operationsData);}\n}\n$('actionClearAll').onclick=()=>clearActionCenter('actions');\n$('alertClearAll').onclick=()=>clearActionCenter('alerts');\n\nasync function loadActionCenter(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading)$('actionState').textContent='Loading…';\n\n  try{\n    operationsData=await api('/api/operations/overview');\n    updateNotifications(operationsData);\n    renderActionCenter(operationsData);\n    setTimeout(enhanceImportantTables,20);\n  }catch(e){\n    $('actionState').textContent='Load failed';\n    $('actionRows').innerHTML=`<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"bad\">${esc(e.message)}</td></tr>`;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction renderActionCenter(d){\n  const alerts=d.alerts||[];\n  const actions=(d.actions||[]).filter(x=>x.status!=='Cleared');\n  const memory=d.memory||{};\n  const playerLoad=d.playerLoad||{};\n\n  const activeAlerts=alerts.filter(x=>x.status==='Active'||x.status==='Investigating');\n  const openActions=actions.filter(x=>x.status==='Open'||x.status==='Investigating');\n\n  $('actionState').textContent=d.diagnosticsEnabled\n    ? `${activeAlerts.length} active alert(s) · ${openActions.length} open action(s)`\n    : 'Diagnostics OFF';\n\n  $('actionMetrics').innerHTML=\n    metric('Active alerts',activeAlerts.length,activeAlerts.some(x=>x.severity==='Critical')?'bad':activeAlerts.length?'warn':'good')+\n    metric('Open actions',openActions.length,openActions.length?'warn':'good')+\n    metric('Memory score',memory.available?`${Number(memory.score||0)}/100`:'Learning',memory.state==='Critical'?'bad':memory.state==='Investigate'?'orange':memory.state==='Watch'?'warn':'good',memory.state||'')+\n    metric('Comfortable player range',playerLoad.comfortableRange||'Insufficient history','','Observed, not a hard limit')+\n    metric('Audit entries',Number(d.auditCount||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Config snapshots',(d.configSnapshots||[]).length);\n\n  const scorecard=d.scorecard||[];\n  $('scorecardRows').innerHTML=scorecard.length\n    ? scorecard.map(x=>`<div class=\"card smartSignal ${String(x.state||'').toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z]+/g,'')} clickableRow\" data-score-target=\"${esc(x.targetSection||'performance')}\">\n        <div class=\"small\">${esc(x.state)}</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:850\">${esc(x.name)} · ${Number(x.score||0)}/100</div>\n        <div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:5px\">${esc(x.reason||'')}</div>\n      </div>`).join('')\n    : '<div class=\"empty\">Enable diagnostics to build the scorecard.</div>';\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-score-target]').forEach(card=>{\n    card.onclick=()=>setSection(card.dataset.scoreTarget||'performance',true);\n  });\n\n  $('actionClearAll').disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly'||!actions.length||actionClearBusy;\n  $('alertClearAll').disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly'||!alerts.length||actionClearBusy;\n  $('actionCount').textContent=`${openActions.length} open / ${actions.length} current`;\n  $('actionRows').innerHTML=actions.length\n    ? actions.map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td class=\"${x.priority==='High'?'bad':x.priority==='Medium'?'warn':''}\"><b>${esc(x.priority)}</b></td>\n        <td>${esc(x.category)}</td>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.title)}</b></td>\n        <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.reason)}\">${esc(x.reason)}</td>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.status)}</b></td>\n        <td><div class=\"actionStatus\">\n          <button data-action-open=\"${esc(x.targetSection||'performance')}\">Open</button>\n          <button data-action-status=\"${esc(x.id)}\" data-status=\"Investigating\">Investigating</button>\n          <button data-action-status=\"${esc(x.id)}\" data-status=\"Resolved\">Resolved</button>\n          <button data-action-status=\"${esc(x.id)}\" data-status=\"Ignored\">Ignore</button>\n          <button data-action-clear=\"${esc(x.id)}\" ${currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly'?'disabled':''}>Clear</button>\n        </div></td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No recommended actions currently require attention.</td></tr>';\n\n  $('alertCount').textContent=`${activeAlerts.length} active / ${alerts.length} retained`;\n  $('alertRows').innerHTML=alerts.length\n    ? alerts.map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td class=\"${severityClass(x.severity)}\"><b>${esc(x.severity)}</b></td>\n        <td>${esc(x.category)}</td>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.title)}</b></td>\n        <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.evidence)}\">${esc(x.evidence)}</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.occurrences||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n        <td>${esc(new Date(Number(x.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleString())}</td>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.status)}</b></td>\n        <td><div class=\"actionStatus\">\n          <button data-alert-status=\"${esc(x.id)}\" data-status=\"Investigating\">Investigating</button>\n          <button data-alert-status=\"${esc(x.id)}\" data-status=\"Resolved\">Resolved</button>\n          <button data-alert-status=\"${esc(x.id)}\" data-status=\"Ignored\">Ignore</button>\n          <button data-alert-remove=\"${esc(x.id)}\" title=\"Delete this retained warning\">Remove</button>\n        </div></td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"muted\">No alerts have been recorded.</td></tr>';\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-action-clear]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>clearActionCenter('actions',[btn.dataset.actionClear]));\n  document.querySelectorAll('#actionCenter [data-alert-remove],#actionCenter [data-alert-status],#actionCenter [data-action-status]').forEach(btn=>btn.disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly');\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-action-open]').forEach(btn=>{\n    btn.onclick=()=>setSection(btn.dataset.actionOpen||'performance',true);\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-action-status]').forEach(btn=>{\n    btn.onclick=()=>setOperationStatus('/api/operations/action-status',btn.dataset.actionStatus||'',btn.dataset.status||'Open');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-alert-status]').forEach(btn=>{\n    btn.onclick=()=>setOperationStatus('/api/operations/alert-status',btn.dataset.alertStatus||'',btn.dataset.status||'Active');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-alert-remove]').forEach(btn=>{\n    btn.onclick=()=>removeAlert(btn.dataset.alertRemove||'');\n  });\n\n  const rows=playerLoad.rows||[];\n  const excludedLoadSamples=Number(playerLoad.excludedLifecycleSamples||0);\n  $('playerLoadComfort').textContent=`Observed comfortable range: ${playerLoad.comfortableRange||'Insufficient history'}${excludedLoadSamples?` · ${excludedLoadSamples} lifecycle sample${excludedLoadSamples===1?'':'s'} filtered`:''}`;\n  $('playerLoadRows').innerHTML=rows.length\n    ? rows.map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.label)}</b></td>\n        <td>${Number(x.samples||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.averageDelayMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n        <td class=\"${Number(x.delayMaxMs||0)>=250?'bad':Number(x.delayMaxMs||0)>=100?'warn':''}\">${Number(x.delayMaxMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.averageCpuPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.cpuMaxPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.stallSamples||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.stallPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%</td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"muted\">Player-load history has not been collected yet.</td></tr>';\n\n  const saves=d.worldSaves||[];\n  $('worldSaveState').textContent=saves.length\n    ? `${saves.length} retained · worst ${Math.max(...saves.map(x=>Number(x.observedMainThreadWindowMs||0))).toFixed(0)}ms`\n    : 'No save observation yet';\n  $('worldSaveRows').innerHTML=saves.length\n    ? saves.slice(0,12).map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td>${esc(new Date(Number(x.unixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleString())}</td>\n        <td class=\"${Number(x.observedMainThreadWindowMs||0)>=5000?'bad':Number(x.observedMainThreadWindowMs||0)>=2000?'orange':Number(x.observedMainThreadWindowMs||0)>=750?'warn':''}\"><b>${Number(x.observedMainThreadWindowMs||0).toFixed(0)}ms</b></td>\n        <td>${Number(x.players||0)}</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.delayAtStartMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n        <td class=\"${severityClass(x.severity)}\">${esc(x.severity)}</td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">Waiting for the next world save.</td></tr>';\n\n  const network=d.networkSamples||[];\n  $('networkState').textContent=network.length\n    ? `${formatBytesRate(Number(network[0].sentBytesPerSecond||0))} out · ${formatBytesRate(Number(network[0].receivedBytesPerSecond||0))} in`\n    : 'Collecting';\n  $('networkRows').innerHTML=network.length\n    ? network.slice(0,12).map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td>${esc(new Date(Number(x.unixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleTimeString())}</td>\n        <td>${formatBytesRate(Number(x.sentBytesPerSecond||0))}</td>\n        <td>${formatBytesRate(Number(x.receivedBytesPerSecond||0))}</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.players||0)}</td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"4\" class=\"muted\">Collecting network history.</td></tr>';\n\n  renderInstrumentationCards(d.instrumentation||{});\n}\n\nfunction renderInstrumentationCards(d){\n  const rows=[\n    ['World Save Timing',d.worldSave],\n    ['Block-Entity Cost',d.blockEntities],\n    ['Network Diagnostics',d.network],\n    ['Optimization Safety',d.optimizationSafety]\n  ];\n\n  $('instrumentationCards').innerHTML=rows.map(([title,x])=>{\n    x=x||{};\n    const measured=!!x.measuredNow;\n    let extra='';\n    if(title==='World Save Timing' && measured){\n      extra=`<div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"><b>Last:</b> ${Number(x.lastObservedMs||0).toFixed(0)}ms · <b>Avg:</b> ${Number(x.averageObservedMs||0).toFixed(0)}ms · <b>Worst:</b> ${Number(x.worstObservedMs||0).toFixed(0)}ms</div>`;\n    }\n    if(title==='Network Diagnostics' && measured){\n      extra=`<div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"><b>Out:</b> ${formatBytesRate(Number(x.sentBytesPerSecond||0))} · <b>In:</b> ${formatBytesRate(Number(x.receivedBytesPerSecond||0))} · ${Number(x.players||0)} player(s)</div>`;\n    }\n    return `<div class=\"card instrumentCard ${measured?'available':'ready'}\">\n      <div class=\"small\">${esc(x.status||'Unknown')}</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:800\">${esc(title)}</div>\n      <div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">${esc(x.summary||'')}</div>\n      ${extra}\n      ${x.next?`<div class=\"nextAction\"><b>Note:</b> ${esc(x.next)}</div>`:''}\n    </div>`;\n  }).join('');\n}\n\nfunction formatBytesRate(value){\n  if(value>=1024*1024)return `${(value/(1024*1024)).toFixed(2)} MB/s`;\n  if(value>=1024)return `${(value/1024).toFixed(1)} KB/s`;\n  return `${value.toFixed(0)} B/s`;\n}\n\nasync function setOperationStatus(path,id,status){\n  try{\n    await api(path,{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({id,status})});\n    toast(`Status changed to ${status}.`,'success');\n    await loadActionCenter(false);\n  }catch(e){\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }\n}\n\nasync function removeAlert(id){\n  if(!id)return;\n  if(!confirm('Remove this warning from retained alert history? If the condition is still present, diagnostics may create it again.'))return;\n  try{\n    await api('/api/operations/alert-remove',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({id})});\n    toast('Warning removed.','success');\n    await loadActionCenter(false);\n  }catch(e){\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }\n}\n\nasync function loadMemoryCenter(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading)$('memoryState').textContent='Loading…';\n\n  try{\n    memoryData=await api('/api/operations/memory');\n    renderMemoryCenter(memoryData);\n  }catch(e){\n    $('memoryState').textContent='Load failed';\n    setNavStatus('memory','bad','Memory / GC status could not be loaded');\n    $('memoryHero').innerHTML=`<div class=\"errorBox\">${esc(e.message)}</div>`;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction renderMemoryCenter(d){\n  const a=d.analysis||{};\n  $('memoryState').textContent=d.diagnosticsEnabled\n    ? `${esc(a.state||'Collecting')} · ${Number(a.sampleCount||0)} sample(s)`\n    : 'Diagnostics OFF';\n  const memoryState=String(a.state||'Collecting').toLowerCase();\n  const memoryTone=!d.diagnosticsEnabled?'neutral':(memoryState==='critical'?'bad':(memoryState==='investigate'||memoryState==='watch'?'warn':'good'));\n  setNavStatus('memory',memoryTone,d.diagnosticsEnabled?`Memory / GC ${a.state||'Collecting'} · score ${Number(a.score||0)}/100`:'Memory / GC diagnostics off');\n\n  if(!d.diagnosticsEnabled){\n    $('memoryHero').innerHTML='<div class=\"warning\"><b>Diagnostic sampling is OFF.</b> Enable it to build memory/GC history. The expensive manual engine profiler remains separate.</div>';\n  }else{\n    const cls=a.state==='Critical'?'critical':a.state==='Investigate'?'investigate':a.state==='Watch'?'watch':'healthy';\n    $('memoryHero').innerHTML=`<div class=\"smartHero\">\n      <div class=\"healthScore ${cls}\">${Number(a.score||0)}</div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"small\">MEMORY / GC HEALTH</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800\">${esc(a.state||'Collecting')}</div>\n        <div>${esc(a.finding||'')}</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>`;\n  }\n\n  $('memoryMetrics').innerHTML=\n    metric('Managed heap',`${Number(a.heapCurrentMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)+\n    metric('Heap min / max',`${Number(a.heapMinimumMb||0).toFixed(0)} / ${Number(a.heapMaximumMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)+\n    metric('Heap slope',`${Number(a.heapSlopeMbPerMinute||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(a.heapSlopeMbPerMinute||0).toFixed(1)} MB/min`,Number(a.heapSlopeMbPerMinute||0)>=50?'warn':'')+\n    metric('Private memory',`${Number(a.privateCurrentMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)+\n    metric('Private slope',`${Number(a.privateSlopeMbPerMinute||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(a.privateSlopeMbPerMinute||0).toFixed(1)} MB/min`,Number(a.privateSlopeMbPerMinute||0)>=100?'bad':Number(a.privateSlopeMbPerMinute||0)>=50?'warn':'')+\n    metric('Native estimate',`${Number(a.estimatedNativeCurrentMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)+\n    metric('Native slope',`${Number(a.estimatedNativeSlopeMbPerMinute||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(a.estimatedNativeSlopeMbPerMinute||0).toFixed(1)} MB/min`,Number(a.estimatedNativeSlopeMbPerMinute||0)>=100?'bad':Number(a.estimatedNativeSlopeMbPerMinute||0)>=50?'warn':'')+\n    metric('GC committed / fragmented',`${Number(a.gcCommittedCurrentMb||0).toFixed(0)} / ${Number(a.gcFragmentedCurrentMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)+\n    metric('Gen0',`+${Number(a.gen0Increase||0)}`)+\n    metric('Gen1',`+${Number(a.gen1Increase||0)}`)+\n    metric('Gen2',`+${Number(a.gen2Increase||0)}`,Number(a.gen2Increase||0)>=6?'warn':'')+\n    metric('Post-GC floor start',`${Number(a.estimatedPostGcFloorStartMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)+\n    metric('Post-GC floor end',`${Number(a.estimatedPostGcFloorEndMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)+\n    metric('Floor growth',`${Number(a.estimatedPostGcFloorGrowthMb||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(a.estimatedPostGcFloorGrowthMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB`,Number(a.estimatedPostGcFloorGrowthMb||0)>=256?'bad':Number(a.estimatedPostGcFloorGrowthMb||0)>=128?'warn':'');\n\n  $('memoryFinding').innerHTML=`<p><b>Finding:</b> ${esc(a.finding||'')}</p><p><b>Recommended:</b> ${esc(a.recommendation||'')}</p>`;\n  renderMemoryInspector(d.inspector||{});\n  renderMemoryChart();\n}\n\n\nfunction renderMemoryInspector(inspector){\n  inspector=inspector||{};\n  const current=inspector.current||{};\n  const snapshots=Array.isArray(inspector.snapshots)?inspector.snapshots:[];\n  const deep=inspector.deepCapture||{};\n\n  $('memoryInspectorStatus').textContent=snapshots.length?`${snapshots.length} saved`:'Ready';\n  $('memorySnapshotCount').textContent=`${snapshots.length} saved snapshot${snapshots.length===1?'':'s'}`;\n  $('memoryInspectorSummary').innerHTML=\n    metric('Current heap',`${Number(current.managedHeapMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)+\n    metric('Private memory',`${Number(current.privateMemoryMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)+\n    metric('GC committed',`${Number(current.gcCommittedMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)+\n    metric('Fragmented',`${Number(current.gcFragmentedMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB`,Number(current.gcFragmentedMb||0)>=2048?'warn':'')+\n    metric('Total allocated',`${Number(current.totalAllocatedMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)+\n    metric('Gen2 collections',String(Number(current.gen2Collections||0)))+\n    metric('Entities / chunks',`${Number(current.loadedEntities||0).toLocaleString()} / ${Number(current.loadedChunks||0).toLocaleString()}`)+\n    metric('Players',String(Number(current.players||0)));\n\n  const rows=snapshots.map(s=>`<tr>\n    <td>${fmtAdminTime(s.unixMilliseconds)}</td>\n    <td>${esc(s.label||'Memory snapshot')}</td>\n    <td>${Number(s.managedHeapMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB</td>\n    <td>${Number(s.privateMemoryMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB</td>\n    <td>${Number(s.gcCommittedMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB</td>\n    <td>${Number(s.gcFragmentedMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB</td>\n    <td>${Number(s.gen2Collections||0)}</td>\n    <td>${Number(s.players||0)}</td>\n    <td><button class=\"danger mini\" onclick=\"deleteMemoryInspectorSnapshot('${esc(s.id||'')}')\">Delete</button></td>\n  </tr>`).join('');\n  $('memoryInspectorSnapshots').innerHTML=rows||'<tr><td colspan=\"9\" class=\"muted\">No snapshots captured.</td></tr>';\n\n  const structures=Array.isArray(current.structures)?current.structures:[];\n  $('memoryInspectorStructures').innerHTML=structures.map(x=>`<tr>\n    <td>${esc(x.category||'')}</td><td>${esc(x.name||'')}</td><td><code>${esc(x.runtimeType||'')}</code></td>\n    <td>${Number(x.count||0).toLocaleString()}</td><td class=\"small\">${esc(x.note||'')}</td>\n  </tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">No tracked structures available.</td></tr>';\n\n  $('memoryDeepCapture').innerHTML=`\n    <p><b>${deep.available?'Deep capture tooling detected':'Deep capture tooling not detected'}</b></p>\n    <p>${esc(deep.tool||'')}</p>\n    <p>${esc(deep.note||'')}</p>\n    <div class=\"warning\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">${esc(deep.warning||'Deep heap capture may pause the server.')}</div>`;\n\n  const options=[{id:'__current',label:'Current live state',unixMilliseconds:Date.now()},...snapshots];\n  const optionHtml=options.map(x=>`<option value=\"${esc(x.id)}\">${esc(x.label||'Snapshot')} · ${x.id==='__current'?'now':fmtAdminTime(x.unixMilliseconds)}</option>`).join('');\n  const a=$('memoryCompareA'),b=$('memoryCompareB');\n  const oldA=a.value,oldB=b.value;\n  a.innerHTML=optionHtml;b.innerHTML=optionHtml;\n  if(options.some(x=>x.id===oldA))a.value=oldA;\n  else a.value=snapshots.length>1?snapshots[1].id:(snapshots.length?snapshots[0].id:'__current');\n  if(options.some(x=>x.id===oldB))b.value=oldB;\n  else b.value='__current';\n  renderMemoryInspectorComparison();\n}\n\nfunction memoryInspectorSnapshotById(id){\n  const inspector=(memoryData&&memoryData.inspector)||{};\n  if(id==='__current')return inspector.current||null;\n  return (inspector.snapshots||[]).find(x=>x.id===id)||null;\n}\n\nfunction signedMemoryDelta(value){\n  const n=Number(value||0);\n  return `${n>=0?'+':''}${n.toFixed(1)} MB`;\n}\n\nfunction renderMemoryInspectorComparison(){\n  const a=memoryInspectorSnapshotById($('memoryCompareA').value);\n  const b=memoryInspectorSnapshotById($('memoryCompareB').value);\n  if(!a||!b){$('memoryInspectorComparison').innerHTML='Capture at least one snapshot to compare memory state.';return;}\n  const delta=(key)=>Number(b[key]||0)-Number(a[key]||0);\n  const structureA=new Map((a.structures||[]).map(x=>[`${x.category}|${x.runtimeType}|${x.name}`,x]));\n  const structureB=new Map((b.structures||[]).map(x=>[`${x.category}|${x.runtimeType}|${x.name}`,x]));\n  const keys=new Set([...structureA.keys(),...structureB.keys()]);\n  const growth=[...keys].map(k=>{\n    const x=structureA.get(k)||{},y=structureB.get(k)||{};\n    return {category:y.category||x.category||'',name:y.name||x.name||'',runtimeType:y.runtimeType||x.runtimeType||'',before:Number(x.count||0),after:Number(y.count||0),delta:Number(y.count||0)-Number(x.count||0)};\n  }).filter(x=>x.delta!==0).sort((x,y)=>Math.abs(y.delta)-Math.abs(x.delta)).slice(0,10);\n  const elapsed=Math.abs(Number(b.unixMilliseconds||0)-Number(a.unixMilliseconds||0));\n  $('memoryInspectorComparison').innerHTML=`\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      ${metric('Heap Δ',signedMemoryDelta(delta('managedHeapMb')),delta('managedHeapMb')>256?'warn':'')}\n      ${metric('Private Δ',signedMemoryDelta(delta('privateMemoryMb')),delta('privateMemoryMb')>512?'warn':'')}\n      ${metric('Committed Δ',signedMemoryDelta(delta('gcCommittedMb')))}\n      ${metric('Fragmented Δ',signedMemoryDelta(delta('gcFragmentedMb')),delta('gcFragmentedMb')>512?'warn':'')}\n      ${metric('Native estimate Δ',signedMemoryDelta(delta('estimatedNativeMb')))}\n      ${metric('Allocated since process start Δ',signedMemoryDelta(delta('totalAllocatedMb')))}\n      ${metric('Gen2 Δ',`${delta('gen2Collections')>=0?'+':''}${delta('gen2Collections').toFixed(0)}`)}\n      ${metric('Elapsed',`${(elapsed/60000).toFixed(1)} min`)}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"compactNote\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Growth is evidence to investigate, not automatic proof of a leak. Tracked structure counts cover Suite-owned collections and runtime context only.</div>\n    <div class=\"tableWrap\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><table><thead><tr><th>Tracked structure</th><th>Before</th><th>After</th><th>Δ</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n      ${growth.map(x=>`<tr><td>${esc(x.category)} · ${esc(x.name)}<div class=\"small\"><code>${esc(x.runtimeType)}</code></div></td><td>${x.before.toLocaleString()}</td><td>${x.after.toLocaleString()}</td><td class=\"${x.delta>0?'warnText':''}\">${x.delta>0?'+':''}${x.delta.toLocaleString()}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan=\"4\" class=\"muted\">No tracked structure count changes.</td></tr>'}\n    </tbody></table></div>`;\n}\n\nasync function captureMemoryInspectorSnapshot(){\n  const label=($('memoryInspectorLabel').value||'').trim()||`Memory snapshot ${new Date().toLocaleTimeString()}`;\n  try{\n    await api('/api/operations/memory-snapshot',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:'capture',label})});\n    $('memoryInspectorLabel').value='';\n    toast('Memory snapshot captured.','success');\n    await loadMemoryCenter(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nasync function deleteMemoryInspectorSnapshot(id){\n  if(!id||!confirm('Delete this MemLeakInspector snapshot?'))return;\n  try{\n    await api('/api/operations/memory-snapshot',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:'delete',id})});\n    toast('Memory snapshot deleted.','success');\n    await loadMemoryCenter(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nasync function clearMemoryInspectorSnapshots(){\n  if(!confirm('Clear all saved MemLeakInspector snapshots?'))return;\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/operations/memory-snapshot',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:'clear'})});\n    toast(`Cleared ${Number(d.removed||0)} memory snapshot(s).`,'success');\n    await loadMemoryCenter(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nfunction renderMemoryChart(){\n  const canvas=$('memoryChart');\n  if(!canvas||!memoryData)return;\n\n  const rows=memoryData.samples||[];\n  const rect=canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n  const dpr=Math.min(2,window.devicePixelRatio||1);\n  const w=Math.max(300,rect.width),h=Math.max(200,rect.height);\n  canvas.width=Math.floor(w*dpr);canvas.height=Math.floor(h*dpr);\n  const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');\n  ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);\n  ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);\n  ctx.font='11px system-ui';\n\n  if(!rows.length){\n    ctx.fillStyle='#8492a0';\n    ctx.fillText('No memory samples yet.',18,24);\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const pad={l:62,r:12,t:14,b:28};\n  const values=rows.map(x=>Number(x.managedHeapMb||0));\n  let min=Math.min(...values),max=Math.max(...values);\n  const range=Math.max(1,max-min);\n  min=Math.max(0,min-range*.08);max=max+range*.08;\n  const first=Number(rows[0].unixMilliseconds),last=Number(rows[rows.length-1].unixMilliseconds);\n  const span=Math.max(1,last-first);\n  const xFor=t=>pad.l+((Number(t)-first)/span)*(w-pad.l-pad.r);\n  const yFor=v=>h-pad.b-((Number(v)-min)/(max-min))*(h-pad.t-pad.b);\n\n  chartPlotBackground(ctx,pad,w,h,4,5);\n  for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){\n    const y=pad.t+(h-pad.t-pad.b)*i/4;\n    const v=max-(max-min)*i/4;\n    ctx.fillStyle='#748797';ctx.fillText(`${Math.round(v)}MB`,7,y+4);\n  }\n  const memoryPoints=rows.map(row=>[xFor(row.unixMilliseconds),yFor(row.managedHeapMb)]);\n  chartAreaFill(ctx,memoryPoints,h-pad.b,'rgba(93,155,208,.09)');chartLine(ctx,memoryPoints,'#75afe0',2.2);chartEndPoint(ctx,memoryPoints,'#dcebf6');\n\n  for(let i=1;i<rows.length;i++){\n    if(Number(rows[i].gen2Collections||0)>Number(rows[i-1].gen2Collections||0)){\n      const x=xFor(rows[i].unixMilliseconds);\n      ctx.strokeStyle='#ffad66';ctx.setLineDash([4,4]);ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x,pad.t);ctx.lineTo(x,h-pad.b);ctx.stroke();ctx.setLineDash([]);\n    }\n  }\n\n  ctx.fillStyle='#7d8b99';\n  [first,first+span/2,last].forEach((t,i)=>{\n    ctx.fillText(new Date(t).toLocaleTimeString(),Math.max(pad.l,Math.min(w-75,pad.l+(w-pad.l-pad.r)*i/2-25)),h-8);\n  });\n}\n\nasync function loadSystemHealth(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading)$('healthSummary').innerHTML='<div class=\"empty\">Running self-test…</div>';\n  try{\n    healthData=await api('/api/health');\n    renderSystemHealth(healthData);\n    loadCollectionAudit();\n  }catch(e){\n    $('healthSummary').innerHTML=`<div class=\"errorBox\">${esc(e.message)}</div>`;\n  }\n}\n\nasync function loadCollectionAudit(){\n  try{\n    collectionAuditData=await api('/api/collection-audit');\n    renderCollectionAudit(collectionAuditData);\n  }catch(e){\n    $('collectionAuditState').textContent='Audit unavailable';\n    $('collectionAuditRows').innerHTML=`<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"bad\">${esc(e.message)}</td></tr>`;\n  }\n}\nfunction renderCollectionAudit(d){\n  const rows=d.collectors||[];\n  $('collectionAuditState').textContent=`${rows.length} collector(s) documented · policy v${Number(d.version||1)}`;\n  $('collectionSafeguards').innerHTML='<b>Safeguards:</b> '+(d.safeguards||[]).map(esc).join(' · ');\n  $('collectionAuditRows').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(x=>`<tr><td><b>${esc(x.name)}</b></td><td>${esc(x.cadence)}</td><td>${esc(x.thread)}</td><td class=\"${String(x.cost).includes('High')?'warn':''}\">${esc(x.cost)}</td><td>${x.automatic?'Yes':'No / manual'}</td><td>${x.cached?'Yes':'No'}</td><td>${esc(x.detail)}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No collectors documented.</td></tr>';\n}\n\nfunction renderSystemHealth(d){\n  const st=d.selfTest||{};\n  const db=d.database||{};\n  const adb=d.adminDatabase||{};\n  const webDiag=d.webDiagnostics||{};\n  const smart=d.smartDiagnosis||{};\n  const diagSummary=d.diagnosticSummary||{};\n  const rp=d.retentionAndPrivacy||{};\n  const retention=rp.retention||{};\n  const privacy=rp.exportPrivacy||{};\n  const checks=st.checks||[];\n  const breakers=st.circuitBreakers||[];\n  const overhead=st.overhead||[];\n  const policies=st.webPolicies||[];\n  safeDiagnosticsModeGlobal=!!d.safeDiagnosticsMode;\n\n  $('healthBuild').textContent=`${st.modVersion||'__NSS_VERSION__'} · ${d.buildId||st.buildId||''} · VS target ${d.targetGameVersion||st.targetGameVersion||''}`;\n\n  const overall=String(st.overall||'Unknown');\n  const cls=overall==='Failed'?'bad':overall==='Warning'?'warn':'good';\n  $('healthSummary').innerHTML=`\n    <div class=\"smartHero\">\n      <div class=\"healthScore ${overall==='Failed'?'critical':overall==='Warning'?'watch':'healthy'}\">${overall==='OK'?'✓':overall==='Warning'?'!':'×'}</div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"small\">STARTUP / RUNTIME SELF-TEST</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:850\" class=\"${cls}\">${esc(overall)}</div>\n        <div class=\"small\">${checks.length} subsystem check(s) · ${breakers.filter(x=>x.open).length} open circuit breaker(s) · heavy operation: ${esc(d.activeHeavyOperation||'none')}</div>\n        <div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:5px\"><b>Safe Diagnostics Mode:</b> ${d.safeDiagnosticsMode?'ON':'OFF'}</div>\n        <div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:5px\"><b>Smart Diagnosis:</b> ${smart.available?`${esc(smart.state||'Unknown')} · health ${Number(smart.healthScore||0)}/100 · ${esc(smart.analysisConfidence||'Low')} confidence · data quality ${Number(smart.dataQualityScore||0)}/100 · ${esc(smart.recoveryState||'Unknown')}`:'Learning / unavailable'}</div>\n        ${smart.primaryFinding?`<div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:4px\"><b>Current finding:</b> ${esc(smart.primaryFinding)}</div>`:''}\n      </div>\n    </div>`;\n\n  $('healthSafeMode').textContent=`Safe Diagnostics: ${d.safeDiagnosticsMode?'ON':'OFF'}`;\n  $('healthSafeMode').classList.toggle('primary',!!d.safeDiagnosticsMode);\n\n  if(d.safeDiagnosticsMode && liveUpdates){\n    liveUpdates=false;\n    if(liveTimer)clearInterval(liveTimer);\n    liveTimer=null;\n    $('liveBtn').textContent=t('ui.liveOff');\n    $('liveBtn').classList.remove('active');\n  }\n\n  $('healthCheckCount').textContent=`${checks.filter(x=>x.status==='OK').length} OK · ${checks.filter(x=>x.status==='Warning').length} warning · ${checks.filter(x=>x.status==='Failed').length} failed`;\n  $('healthChecks').innerHTML=checks.map(x=>`<div class=\"card healthCheck ${String(x.status||'unknown').toLowerCase()}\">\n      <div class=\"small\">${esc(x.status)} · <span class=\"safetyBadge\">${esc(x.safety)}</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800\">${esc(x.name)}</div>\n      <div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:5px\">${esc(x.detail)}</div>\n    </div>`).join('');\n\n  $('databaseState').textContent=db.available?(db.ready?'Ready':'Initializing'):'Unavailable';\n  $('databaseHealth').innerHTML=db.available?`\n    <p><b>Path:</b> ${esc(db.path||'')}</p>\n    <p><b>Database:</b> ${formatFileBytes(Number(db.databaseBytes||0))} · <b>WAL:</b> ${formatFileBytes(Number(db.walBytes||0))} · <b>SHM:</b> ${formatFileBytes(Number(db.shmBytes||0))}</p>\n    <p><b>Queue:</b> ${Number(db.pendingEvents||0).toLocaleString()} / ${Number(db.queueCapacity||0).toLocaleString()} normal · <b>Emergency overflow:</b> ${Number(db.pendingOverflowEvents||0).toLocaleString()} / ${Number(db.overflowCapacity||0).toLocaleString()} · accepted ${Number(db.overflowAcceptedEvents||0).toLocaleString()} / rejected ${Number(db.overflowRejectedEvents||0).toLocaleString()} · <b>Dropped:</b> ${Number(db.droppedEvents||0).toLocaleString()} · <b>Write gate:</b> ${db.writeGateBusy?'<span class=\"warn\">busy</span>':'idle'}</p>\n    <p><b>Writer:</b> last ${Number(db.lastBatchRows||0).toLocaleString()} row(s) / ${Number(db.lastBatchMilliseconds||0)}ms · avg ${Number(db.averageBatchMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms · P95 ${Number(db.p95BatchMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms · max ${Number(db.maxBatchMilliseconds||0)}ms</p>\n    <p><b>Throughput:</b> ${Number(db.rowsPerMinute||0).toLocaleString()} rows/min · <b>Batches:</b> ${Number(db.batchCount||0).toLocaleString()} · <b>Query queues:</b> ${Number(db.queryQueueDepth||0)} events / ${Number(db.snapshotQueryQueueDepth||0)} snapshots</p>\n    <p><b>Queries:</b> ${Number(db.queryCount||0).toLocaleString()} · avg ${Number(db.averageQueryMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms · P95 ${Number(db.p95QueryMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms · max ${Number(db.maxQueryMilliseconds||0)}ms · slow ≥100ms ${Number(db.slowQueryCount||0)} · last ${esc(db.lastQueryKind||'—')} ${Number(db.lastQueryMilliseconds||0)}ms</p>\n    <p><b>SQLite busy/locked:</b> ${Number(db.busyOrLockedErrors||0).toLocaleString()} · <b>Last integrity check:</b> ${db.lastIntegrityCheckUnixMilliseconds?`${esc(new Date(Number(db.lastIntegrityCheckUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleString())} / ${Number(db.lastIntegrityCheckMilliseconds||0)}ms`:'not run this session'}</p>\n    <p><b>Backups:</b> ${Number(db.backupCount||0)} / ${Number(db.backupRetentionCount??2)} retained · ${formatFileBytes(Number(db.backupBytes||0))} · ${Number(db.autoBackupIntervalHours||0)>0?`auto every ${Number(db.autoBackupIntervalHours)}h`:'automatic backups disabled'} · ${db.backupInProgress?'<span class=\"warn\">backup running</span>':(db.lastBackupUnixMilliseconds?`last ${esc(new Date(Number(db.lastBackupUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleString())}`:'not recorded')}</p>\n    <p><b>Last successful write:</b> ${db.lastSuccessfulWriteUnixMilliseconds?esc(new Date(Number(db.lastSuccessfulWriteUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleString()):'not recorded yet'}</p>\n    <p><b>Last storage error:</b> ${esc(db.lastError||'none')}</p>\n    <p><b>Retention:</b> ${Number(db.retentionDays||0)} day(s) · <b>Integrity:</b> ${esc(db.integrity||'Not run')}</p>\n  `:'<span class=\"bad\">BlockLogger storage unavailable.</span>';\n\n  $('adminDatabaseState').textContent=adb.available?'Ready':'Unavailable';\n  $('adminDatabaseHealth').innerHTML=adb.available?`\n    <p><b>Path:</b> ${esc(adb.path||'')}</p>\n    <p><b>Database:</b> ${formatFileBytes(Number(adb.databaseBytes||0))} · <b>WAL:</b> ${formatFileBytes(Number(adb.walBytes||0))} · <b>SHM:</b> ${formatFileBytes(Number(adb.shmBytes||0))}</p>\n    <p><b>Players:</b> ${Number(adb.players||0).toLocaleString()} · <b>Audit rows:</b> ${Number(adb.auditRows||0).toLocaleString()} · <b>Inventory snapshots:</b> ${Number(adb.inventorySnapshots||0).toLocaleString()}</p>\n    <p><b>Writer:</b> ${adb.dirty?'<span class=\"warn\">pending coalesced save</span>':'idle'} · last save ${Number(adb.lastSaveMilliseconds||0)}ms · saves ${Number(adb.saveCount||0).toLocaleString()}</p>\n    <p><b>Backups:</b> ${Number(adb.backupCount||0)} retained · last ${adb.lastBackupUnixMilliseconds?esc(new Date(Number(adb.lastBackupUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleString()):'not recorded'}</p>\n    <p><b>Integrity:</b> ${esc(adb.integrity||'Not run')} ${adb.lastIntegrityUnixMilliseconds?`· ${Number(adb.lastIntegrityMilliseconds||0)}ms`:''}</p>\n    <p><b>Last storage error:</b> ${esc(adb.lastError||'none')}</p>\n  `:'<span class=\"bad\">Admin storage unavailable.</span>';\n\n  const endpoints=webDiag.endpoints||[];\n  const slowRequests=webDiag.recentSlowRequests||[];\n  $('webDiagState').textContent=`${Number(webDiag.requestsLastMinute||0)} req/min · workers ${Number(webDiag.activeWorkers||0)}/${Number(webDiag.workerCount||0)} · queue ${Number(webDiag.queueDepth||0)}/${Number(webDiag.queueCapacity||0)}`;\n  $('webDiagSummary').innerHTML=\n    metric('Requests',Number(webDiag.totalRequests||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Workers',`${Number(webDiag.activeWorkers||0)} / ${Number(webDiag.workerCount||0)}`,Number(webDiag.queueDepth||0)>0?'warn':'good',`queue ${Number(webDiag.queueDepth||0)}/${Number(webDiag.queueCapacity||0)} · peak ${Number(webDiag.peakQueueDepth||0)}`)+\n    metric('Queue wait avg / P95',`${Number(webDiag.averageQueueWaitMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(webDiag.p95QueueWaitMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} ms`,Number(webDiag.p95QueueWaitMilliseconds||0)>=100?'warn':'good',`busy rejects ${Number(webDiag.rejectedBusyRequests||0)}`)+\n    metric('Snapshot cache',`${Number(webDiag.snapshotCacheHits||0).toLocaleString()} hit / ${Number(webDiag.snapshotCacheMisses||0).toLocaleString()} miss`,'',`${Number(webDiag.snapshotRefreshes||0).toLocaleString()} refreshes`)+\n    metric('Avg / P95',`${Number(webDiag.averageRequestMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(webDiag.p95RequestMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} ms`,Number(webDiag.p95RequestMilliseconds||0)>=250?'warn':'')+\n    metric('Main-thread wait avg',`${Number(webDiag.averageMainThreadWaitMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} ms`,Number(webDiag.averageMainThreadWaitMilliseconds||0)>=50?'warn':'good')+\n    metric('Main-thread work avg',`${Number(webDiag.averageMainThreadWorkMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} ms`,Number(webDiag.averageMainThreadWorkMilliseconds||0)>=20?'warn':'good')+\n    metric('HTTP errors',Number(webDiag.errorResponses||0).toLocaleString(),Number(webDiag.errorResponses||0)>0?'warn':'good')+\n    metric('Auth / rate limits',`${Number(webDiag.unauthorizedResponses||0)} / ${Number(webDiag.rateLimitedResponses||0)}`,'');\n\n  $('webDiagEndpoints').innerHTML=endpoints.length\n    ? endpoints.map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td class=\"codeCell\"><b>${esc(x.method)}</b> ${esc(x.path)}</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.requests||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n        <td class=\"${Number(x.errors||0)>0?'warn':''}\">${Number(x.errors||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.averageMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n        <td class=\"${Number(x.p95Milliseconds||0)>=250?'warn':''}\">${Number(x.p95Milliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.maxMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n        <td class=\"${Number(x.averageQueueWaitMilliseconds||0)>=100?'warn':''}\">${Number(x.averageQueueWaitMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n        <td class=\"${Number(x.averageMainThreadWaitMilliseconds||0)>=50?'warn':''}\">${Number(x.averageMainThreadWaitMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n        <td class=\"${Number(x.averageMainThreadWorkMilliseconds||0)>=20?'warn':''}\">${Number(x.averageMainThreadWorkMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n        <td>${formatFileBytes(Number(x.responseBytes||0))}</td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"10\" class=\"muted\">No web request samples yet.</td></tr>';\n\n  $('webDiagSlow').innerHTML=slowRequests.length\n    ? slowRequests.map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td>${esc(new Date(Number(x.unixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleTimeString())}</td>\n        <td class=\"codeCell\"><b>${esc(x.method)}</b> ${esc(x.path)}</td>\n        <td class=\"${Number(x.statusCode||0)>=500?'bad':Number(x.statusCode||0)>=400?'warn':''}\">${Number(x.statusCode||0)}</td>\n        <td><b>${Number(x.totalMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</b></td>\n        <td class=\"${Number(x.queueWaitMilliseconds||0)>=100?'warn':''}\">${Number(x.queueWaitMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.mainThreadWaitMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.mainThreadWorkMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n        <td>${formatFileBytes(Number(x.responseBytes||0))}</td>\n        <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.note||'')}\">${esc(x.note||'—')}</td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"9\" class=\"muted\">No slow/error web requests in the retained window.</td></tr>';\n\n  $('retentionPrivacy').innerHTML=`\n    <p><b>Retention caps</b></p>\n    <p class=\"small\">\n      BlockLogger ${Number(retention.blockLoggerDays||0)}d · incidents ${Number(retention.incidents||0)} · entity scans ${Number(retention.entityScans||0)} · environment changes ${Number(retention.environmentChanges||0)} ·\n      alerts ${Number(retention.alerts||0)} · actions ${Number(retention.actions||0)} · audit ${Number(retention.webAudit||0)} · config snapshots ${Number(retention.configSnapshots||0)} ·\n      performance snapshots ${Number(retention.performanceSnapshots||0)} · world saves ${Number(retention.worldSaveObservations||0)} · network samples ${Number(retention.networkSamples||0)} · optimization tests ${Number(retention.optimizationExperiments||0)}.\n    </p>\n    <p><b>Diagnostic bundle privacy</b></p>\n    <p class=\"small\">${esc(privacy.note||'')}</p>\n    <p class=\"small\">Session tokens: <b>${privacy.sessionTokensExported?'EXPORTED':'excluded'}</b> · Password hashes/salts: <b>${privacy.passwordHashesExported||privacy.passwordSaltsExported?'EXPORTED':'excluded'}</b> · Remote audit IPs: <b>${privacy.remoteAuditAddressesExported?'EXPORTED':'redacted'}</b></p>`;\n\n  $('breakerRows').innerHTML=breakers.length\n    ? breakers.map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.name)}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.key)}</div></td>\n        <td><span class=\"safetyBadge\">${esc(x.safety)}</span></td>\n        <td class=\"${x.open?'bad':'good'}\"><b>${x.open?'OPEN':'CLOSED'}</b></td>\n        <td>${Number(x.consecutiveFailures||0)}</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.totalFailures||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n        <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.lastError||'')}\">${esc(x.lastError||'—')}</td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No feature failures recorded.</td></tr>';\n\n  const overheadCalls=overhead.reduce((sum,x)=>sum+Number(x.calls||0),0);\n  const overheadWorst=overhead.slice().sort((a,b)=>Number(b.maxMilliseconds||0)-Number(a.maxMilliseconds||0))[0]||null;\n  const background=overhead.filter(x=>String(x.key||'').includes('maintenance')||String(x.key||'').includes('network-sampling')||String(x.key||'').includes('world-save-observer'));\n  const backgroundAvg=background.length?background.reduce((sum,x)=>sum+Number(x.averageMilliseconds||0),0):0;\n  $('overheadSummary').innerHTML=\n    metric('Tracked features',overhead.length.toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Recorded calls',overheadCalls.toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Background avg total',`${backgroundAvg.toFixed(2)} ms`,backgroundAvg>=10?'warn':'good','sum of tracked background averages')+\n    metric('Worst recorded action',overheadWorst?`${overheadWorst.name} · ${Number(overheadWorst.maxMilliseconds||0).toFixed(2)} ms`:'—',overheadWorst&&Number(overheadWorst.maxMilliseconds||0)>=100?'warn':'');\n  $('overheadRows').innerHTML=overhead.length\n    ? overhead.map(x=>{\n        const max=Number(x.maxMilliseconds||0),avg=Number(x.averageMilliseconds||0);\n        const status=max>=250?'High':max>=100?'Watch':avg>=10?'Watch':'Normal';\n        return `<tr>\n          <td><b>${esc(x.name)}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.key)}</div></td>\n          <td>${Number(x.calls||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n          <td>${Number(x.lastMilliseconds||0).toFixed(2)}ms</td>\n          <td>${avg.toFixed(2)}ms</td>\n          <td class=\"${max>=100?'warn':''}\">${max.toFixed(2)}ms</td>\n          <td class=\"${status==='High'?'bad':status==='Watch'?'warn':'good'}\"><b>${status}</b></td>\n        </tr>`;\n      }).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No overhead samples yet.</td></tr>';\n\n  $('policyRows').innerHTML=policies.length\n    ? policies.map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.method)}</b></td>\n        <td class=\"codeCell\">${esc(x.path)}</td>\n        <td>${esc(x.access)}</td>\n        <td class=\"policyRisk\">${esc(x.risk)}</td>\n        <td><span class=\"safetyBadge\">${esc(x.safety)}</span></td>\n        <td>${Number(x.cooldownSeconds||0)>0?`${Number(x.cooldownSeconds)}s`:'—'}</td>\n        <td>${x.exclusiveHeavyOperation?'<b class=\"warn\">YES</b>':'No'}</td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No explicit policy rows.</td></tr>';\n}\n\nfunction formatFileBytes(v){\n  if(v>=1024*1024*1024)return `${(v/(1024*1024*1024)).toFixed(2)} GB`;\n  if(v>=1024*1024)return `${(v/(1024*1024)).toFixed(1)} MB`;\n  if(v>=1024)return `${(v/1024).toFixed(1)} KB`;\n  return `${Math.round(v)} B`;\n}\n\nasync function runDatabaseIntegrity(){\n  const btn=$('healthIntegrity');\n  btn.disabled=true;\n  btn.textContent='Checking SQLite…';\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/health/database-integrity',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});\n    toast(`SQLite quick_check: ${d.integrity||'complete'}`,'success');\n    await loadSystemHealth(false);\n  }catch(e){\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{\n    btn.disabled=false;\n    btn.textContent='Check BlockLogger DB';\n  }\n}\n\nasync function backupBlockLoggerDatabase(){\n  const btn=$('healthBackup');\n  btn.disabled=true; btn.textContent='Backing up BlockLogger…';\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/health/database-backup',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});\n    toast(d.message||'BlockLogger database backup created.','success');\n    await loadSystemHealth(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n  finally{btn.disabled=false;btn.textContent='Backup BlockLogger DB';}\n}\n\nasync function runAdminDatabaseIntegrity(){\n  const btn=$('healthAdminIntegrity');\n  btn.disabled=true; btn.textContent='Checking Admin DB…';\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/health/admin-database-integrity',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});\n    toast(`Admin DB quick_check: ${d.integrity||'complete'}`,'success');\n    await loadSystemHealth(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n  finally{btn.disabled=false;btn.textContent='Check Admin DB';}\n}\n\nasync function backupAdminDatabase(){\n  const btn=$('healthAdminBackup');\n  btn.disabled=true; btn.textContent='Backing up…';\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/health/admin-database-backup',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});\n    toast(d.message||'Admin database backup created.','success');\n    await loadSystemHealth(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n  finally{btn.disabled=false;btn.textContent='Backup Admin DB';}\n}\n\nasync function toggleSafeDiagnostics(){\n  const enabled=!(healthData&&healthData.safeDiagnosticsMode);\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/health/safe-mode',{\n      method:'POST',\n      body:JSON.stringify({enabled})\n    });\n    toast(d.message||'Safe Diagnostics Mode changed.','success');\n    await loadSystemHealth(false);\n  }catch(e){\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }\n}\n\nasync function resetFeatureBreakers(){\n  try{\n    await api('/api/health/circuit-reset',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({key:''})});\n    toast('Feature circuit breakers reset.','success');\n    await loadSystemHealth(false);\n  }catch(e){\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }\n}\n\n$('healthRefresh').onclick=()=>loadSystemHealth(true);\n$('healthIntegrity').onclick=runDatabaseIntegrity;\n$('healthBackup').onclick=backupBlockLoggerDatabase;\n$('healthAdminIntegrity').onclick=runAdminDatabaseIntegrity;\n$('healthAdminBackup').onclick=backupAdminDatabase;\n$('healthSafeMode').onclick=toggleSafeDiagnostics;\n$('healthResetBreakers').onclick=resetFeatureBreakers;\n\nasync function loadOperationsAudit(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading)$('auditSummary').textContent='Loading…';\n\n  try{\n    const [overview,audit]=await Promise.all([\n      api('/api/operations/overview'),\n      api('/api/operations/audit')\n    ]);\n    operationsData=overview;\n    renderOperationsAudit(overview,audit);\n  }catch(e){\n    $('auditSummary').innerHTML=`<span class=\"bad\">${esc(e.message)}</span>`;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction renderOperationsAudit(overview,audit){\n  const performanceSnapshots=overview.performanceSnapshots||[];\n  const current=overview.currentPerformance||null;\n\n  $('performanceSnapshotRows').innerHTML=performanceSnapshots.length\n    ? performanceSnapshots.map(x=>{\n        const m=x.metrics||{};\n        return `<tr>\n          <td>${esc(new Date(Number(x.unixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleString())}</td>\n          <td><b>${esc(x.label)}</b></td>\n          <td>${Number(x.players||0)}</td>\n          <td>${Number(m.healthScore||0)}/100</td>\n          <td>${Number(m.delayMedianMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n          <td>${Number(m.cpuMedianPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%</td>\n          <td>${Number(m.p95ProfileTickMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n          <td><button data-performance-compare=\"${esc(x.id)}\">Compare Current</button></td>\n        </tr>`;\n      }).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"muted\">No performance snapshots yet.</td></tr>';\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-performance-compare]').forEach(btn=>{\n    btn.onclick=()=>comparePerformanceSnapshot(btn.dataset.performanceCompare||'',performanceSnapshots,current);\n  });\n\n  const snapshots=overview.configSnapshots||[];\n  $('configSnapshotState').textContent=`${snapshots.length} stored snapshot(s)`;\n  $('configSnapshotRows').innerHTML=snapshots.length\n    ? snapshots.map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td>${esc(new Date(Number(x.unixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleString())}</td>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.label)}</b></td>\n        <td>${esc(x.createdBy)}</td>\n        <td><span class=\"badge medium\">BlockLogger</span> <span class=\"badge medium\">Web</span> <span class=\"badge medium\">Animals</span> <span class=\"badge medium\">Login Protection</span></td>\n        <td><button data-config-restore=\"${esc(x.id)}\">Restore…</button></td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">No configuration snapshots yet. Create one before a major tuning or mod/config change.</td></tr>';\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-config-restore]').forEach(btn=>{\n    btn.onclick=()=>restoreConfigSnapshot(btn.dataset.configRestore||'');\n  });\n\n  const rows=audit.rows||[];\n  $('auditCount').textContent=`${Number(audit.count||0).toLocaleString()} retained`;\n  $('auditSummary').innerHTML=`\n    <p><b>${rows.length}</b> recent web administration events are shown below.</p>\n    <p class=\"small\">The audit records web logins/logouts and supported administrative actions performed through this dashboard. It is separate from BlockLogger's world interaction log.</p>`;\n\n  $('auditRows').innerHTML=rows.length\n    ? rows.map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td>${esc(new Date(Number(x.unixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleString())}</td>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.actor)}</b></td>\n        <td>${esc(x.remote)}</td>\n        <td>${esc(x.action)}</td>\n        <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.detail)}\">${esc(x.detail)}</td>\n        <td class=\"auditResult ${String(x.result||'').toLowerCase().includes('fail')?'bad':'good'}\">${esc(x.result)}</td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No audit entries recorded yet.</td></tr>';\n}\n\nasync function createPerformanceSnapshot(){\n  const label=String($('performanceSnapshotLabel').value||'').trim()||'Performance snapshot';\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/operations/performance-snapshot',{\n      method:'POST',\n      body:JSON.stringify({label})\n    });\n    $('performanceSnapshotLabel').value='';\n    toast(d.message||'Performance snapshot captured.','success');\n    await loadOperationsAudit(false);\n  }catch(e){\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction comparePerformanceSnapshot(id,snapshots,current){\n  const snap=(snapshots||[]).find(x=>x.id===id);\n  if(!snap||!current){\n    $('performanceCompareResult').innerHTML='<span class=\"warn\">Current diagnostic metrics are not available.</span>';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const b=snap.metrics||{},a=current||{};\n  const pct=(before,after,floor=1)=>{\n    const denom=Math.max(Math.abs(Number(before||0)),floor);\n    return (Number(after||0)-Number(before||0))*100/denom;\n  };\n  const lower=(name,before,after,suffix,floor=1)=>{\n    const delta=pct(before,after,floor);\n    const cls=delta>8?'bad':delta<-8?'good':'muted';\n    return `<div>${esc(name)}: ${Number(before||0).toFixed(1)}${suffix} → ${Number(after||0).toFixed(1)}${suffix} <span class=\"${cls}\">(${delta>=0?'+':''}${delta.toFixed(1)}%)</span></div>`;\n  };\n\n  const healthDelta=Number(a.healthScore||0)-Number(b.healthScore||0);\n  $('performanceCompareResult').innerHTML=`\n    <b>${esc(snap.label)} → Current</b>\n    ${lower('Delay',b.delayMedianMs,a.delayMedianMs,'ms',5)}\n    ${lower('CPU',b.cpuMedianPercent,a.cpuMedianPercent,'%',10)}\n    ${lower('Heap',b.heapMedianMb,a.heapMedianMb,' MB',100)}\n    ${lower('Entities',b.entityMedian,a.entityMedian,'',100)}\n    ${lower('BL writer',b.writerMedianMs,a.writerMedianMs,'ms',5)}\n    ${lower('Profile P95',b.p95ProfileTickMs,a.p95ProfileTickMs,'ms',10)}\n    <div>Health: ${Number(b.healthScore||0)} → ${Number(a.healthScore||0)} <span class=\"${healthDelta< -5?'bad':healthDelta>5?'good':'muted'}\">(${healthDelta>=0?'+':''}${healthDelta.toFixed(0)} points)</span></div>`;\n}\n\nasync function createConfigSnapshot(){\n  const label=String($('configSnapshotLabel').value||'').trim()||'Manual snapshot';\n  try{\n    await api('/api/operations/config-snapshot',{\n      method:'POST',\n      body:JSON.stringify({label})\n    });\n    $('configSnapshotLabel').value='';\n    toast('Configuration snapshot created.','success');\n    await loadOperationsAudit(false);\n  }catch(e){\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }\n}\n\nasync function restoreConfigSnapshot(id){\n  if(!id)return;\n  if(!confirm('Restore this Newfies Server Essentials Suite configuration snapshot? A backup of the current configuration will be created first.'))return;\n  const confirmation=prompt('Safety check: type RESTORE CONFIG to continue:','')||'';\n  if(confirmation.toUpperCase()!=='RESTORE CONFIG')return;\n\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/operations/config-restore',{\n      method:'POST',\n      body:JSON.stringify({id,confirmation})\n    });\n    toast(d.message||'Configuration restored.','success');\n    await loadOperationsAudit(false);\n  }catch(e){\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }\n}\n\n$('actionRefresh').onclick=()=>loadActionCenter(true);\n$('actionEnableDiagnostics').onclick=async()=>{\n  try{\n    await api('/api/profiler/enabled',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({enabled:true})});\n    toast('Lightweight diagnostics enabled.','success');\n    await loadActionCenter(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n};\n$('memoryRefresh').onclick=()=>loadMemoryCenter(true);\n$('memoryEnableDiagnostics').onclick=async()=>{\n  try{\n    await api('/api/profiler/enabled',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({enabled:true})});\n    toast('Lightweight diagnostics enabled.','success');\n    await loadMemoryCenter(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n};\n$('memoryInspectorCapture').onclick=captureMemoryInspectorSnapshot;\n$('memoryInspectorClear').onclick=clearMemoryInspectorSnapshots;\n$('memoryInspectorCompare').onclick=renderMemoryInspectorComparison;\n$('memoryCompareA').onchange=renderMemoryInspectorComparison;\n$('memoryCompareB').onchange=renderMemoryInspectorComparison;\n$('performanceSnapshotCreate').onclick=createPerformanceSnapshot;\n$('configSnapshotCreate').onclick=createConfigSnapshot;\n$('auditRefresh').onclick=()=>loadOperationsAudit(true);\n\nfunction performanceWindowSeconds(){\n  const el=$('perfWindow');\n  const value=Number(el?.value||1800);\n  return [300,900,1800].includes(value)?value:1800;\n}\n\nfunction performanceWindowLabel(){\n  const seconds=performanceWindowSeconds();\n  return seconds===300?'5-minute':seconds===900?'15-minute':'30-minute';\n}\n\nasync function loadPerformanceCenter(full=true){\n  if(!full){\n    await loadPerformanceOverview(true);\n    return;\n  }\n\n  try{\n    // One cached page snapshot replaces the old burst of seven main-thread-backed GETs.\n    // Block activity stays separate because it is a database query with its own worker.\n    const page=await api(`/api/performance/page-snapshot?window=${performanceWindowSeconds()}`);\n    await Promise.allSettled([\n      loadPerformanceOverview(true,page.overview||null),\n      loadPerformanceTimeline(false,page.timeline||null),\n      loadPerformanceEntityScan(false,page.entityScan||null),\n      loadPerformanceEntityGrowth(false,page.entityGrowth||null),\n      loadPerformanceEnvironment(false,page.environment||null),\n      loadPerformanceProviders(false,page.providers||null),\n      loadPerformanceConflicts(false,page.conflicts||null)\n    ]);\n  }catch(e){\n    // Compatibility fallback for a mixed deployment during upgrades. Keep requests\n    // sequential so the browser still does not stampede the web worker queue.\n    await loadPerformanceOverview(true);\n    await loadPerformanceTimeline(false);\n    await loadPerformanceEntityScan(false);\n    await loadPerformanceEntityGrowth(false);\n    await loadPerformanceEnvironment(false);\n    await loadPerformanceProviders(false);\n    await loadPerformanceConflicts(false);\n  }\n\n  // Historical BlockLogger activity is open/refresh driven, never part of Live Updates.\n  await loadPerformanceBlockActivity(false);\n}\n\nasync function loadPerformanceOverview(showError=true,preloaded=null){\n  try{\n    const d=preloaded||await api(`/api/performance/overview?window=${performanceWindowSeconds()}`);\n    performanceOverviewData=d;\n    renderPerformanceOverview(d);\n  }catch(e){\n    if(showError)$('perfNotice').innerHTML=`<div class=\"errorBox\">${esc(e.message)}</div>`;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction renderPerformanceOverview(d){\n  if(!d||!d.available){\n    $('perfNotice').innerHTML=`<div class=\"warning\">${esc((d||{}).message||'Performance diagnostics unavailable.')}</div>`;\n    $('perfMetrics').innerHTML='';\n    if($('perfQuickRead'))$('perfQuickRead').innerHTML='<div class=\"empty\">Performance diagnostics unavailable.</div>';\n    if($('perfWindowSummary'))$('perfWindowSummary').innerHTML='';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const cur=d.current||{};\n  const smart=d.smart||{};\n  const diag=d.diagnosticSummary||{};\n  const enabled=!!d.diagnosticsEnabled;\n\n  $('perfNotice').innerHTML=!enabled\n    ? '<div class=\"warning\"><b>Diagnostic sampling is OFF.</b> Enable it to build automatic lag incidents and server-specific Smart Diagnosis. The expensive 10s/30s engine profiler remains separate and manual.</div>'\n    : '<div class=\"infoBox\"><b>Performance Center active.</b> Automatic diagnostics are lightweight. Major unexplained stalls can trigger a short cooldown-limited 3s engine profile to identify a likely mod; entity/chunk population scans remain manual-only.</div>';\n\n  const score=smart.available?Number(smart.healthScore||0):null;\n  $('perfMetrics').innerHTML=\n    metric('Smart health',score===null?'Learning':`${score}/100`,score===null?'muted':score<55?'bad':score<75?'orange':score<90?'warn':'good',smart.available?`${smart.state||''} · ${smart.analysisConfidence||'Low'} confidence · data quality ${Number(smart.dataQualityScore||0)}/100 · ${smart.recoveryState||''}`:(smart.state||''))+\n    metric('Main-thread delay',enabled?`${Number(cur.mainThreadDelayMs||0).toFixed(1)} ms`:'Off',Number(cur.mainThreadDelayMs||0)>=100?'bad':'')+\n    metric('CPU',enabled?`${Number(cur.cpuPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%`:'Off',Number(cur.cpuPercent||0)>=90?'warn':'')+\n    metric('Managed heap',enabled?`${Math.round(cur.managedHeapMb||0).toLocaleString()} MB`:'Off')+\n    metric('Loaded entities',enabled?Number(cur.loadedEntities||0).toLocaleString():'Off')+\n    metric('Loaded chunks',enabled?Number(cur.loadedChunks||0).toLocaleString():'Off')+\n    metric('Lag incidents',Number(d.incidentCount||0).toLocaleString(),Number(d.incidentCount||0)>0?'warn':'good','rolling diagnostic window')+\n    metric('Worst delay',enabled?`${Number(diag.worstDelayMs||0).toFixed(0)} ms`:'Off',Number(diag.worstDelayMs||0)>=250?'bad':Number(diag.worstDelayMs||0)>=100?'warn':'')+\n    metric('Gen2 collections',enabled?`+${Number(diag.gen2Collections||0)}`:'Off')+\n    metric('BL max queue',enabled?Number(diag.maxBlockLoggerQueue||0).toLocaleString():'Off');\n\n  renderPerformanceQuickRead(d);\n\n  const suiteTimings=d.suiteTimings||[];\n  $('perfSuiteTimings').innerHTML=suiteTimings.length\n    ? suiteTimings.slice().sort((a,b)=>Number(b.timePerMinuteMilliseconds||0)-Number(a.timePerMinuteMilliseconds||0)||Number(b.p95Milliseconds||0)-Number(a.p95Milliseconds||0)).slice(0,20).map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.name||'')}</b></td>\n        <td>${Number(x.callsPerMinute||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n        <td class=\"${Number(x.timePerMinuteMilliseconds||0)>=1000?'bad':Number(x.timePerMinuteMilliseconds||0)>=250?'warn':''}\"><b>${Number(x.timePerMinuteMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} ms</b></td>\n        <td>${Number(x.lastMilliseconds||0).toFixed(2)} ms</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.averageMilliseconds||0).toFixed(2)} ms</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.p95Milliseconds||0).toFixed(2)} ms</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.maxMilliseconds||0).toFixed(2)} ms</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.samples||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"muted\">No suite timing samples yet.</td></tr>';\n\n  const incidents=d.incidents||[];\n  $('perfIncidentCount').textContent=`${incidents.length} grouped incident(s)`;\n  if($('perfClearLagHistory'))$('perfClearLagHistory').disabled=!incidents.length;\n  $('perfIncidents').innerHTML=incidents.length\n    ? incidents.map(x=>{\n        const ts=Number(x.startUnixMilliseconds||0);\n        return `<tr class=\"clickableRow\" data-perf-incident=\"${ts}\">\n          <td><input class=\"incidentCompareSelect\" type=\"checkbox\" data-incident-compare=\"${ts}\" ${incidentCompareStarts.includes(ts)?'checked':''} title=\"Select up to two incidents to compare\"></td>\n          <td><b>${esc(new Date(ts).toLocaleString())}</b></td>\n          <td>${Number(x.durationSeconds||0).toFixed(0)}s</td>\n          <td class=\"${severityClass(x.severity)}\">${incidentDot(x.severity)}<b>${esc(x.severity)}</b></td>\n          <td><b>${esc(x.primaryCategory)}</b></td>\n          <td>${x.likelyModId?`<b>${esc(x.likelyModName||x.likelyModId)}</b><div class=\"small\"><code>${esc(x.likelyModId)}</code> · ${esc(x.modConfidence||'Low')}</div>`:'<span class=\"muted\">Not attributed</span>'}</td>\n          <td>${confidenceBadge(x.confidence)}</td>\n          <td>${Number(x.worstDelayMs||0).toFixed(0)}ms</td>\n          <td>${Number(x.maxCpuPercent||0).toFixed(0)}%</td>\n          <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.evidence)}\">${esc(x.evidence)}</td>\n          <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.nextAction)}\">${esc(x.nextAction)}</td>\n        </tr>`;\n      }).join('')\n    : `<tr><td colspan=\"11\" class=\"muted\">${enabled?'No grouped lag incident is currently retained in the rolling window.':'Enable diagnostics to collect automatic lag incidents.'}</td></tr>`;\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-perf-incident]').forEach(row=>{\n    row.onclick=e=>{\n      if(e.target.matches('[data-incident-compare]'))return;\n      openLagIncidentDrawer(Number(row.dataset.perfIncident||0));\n    };\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-incident-compare]').forEach(box=>{\n    box.onchange=()=>{\n      const ts=Number(box.dataset.incidentCompare||0);\n      if(box.checked){\n        if(incidentCompareStarts.length>=2){\n          box.checked=false;\n          toast('Select at most two incidents to compare.');\n          return;\n        }\n        if(!incidentCompareStarts.includes(ts))incidentCompareStarts.push(ts);\n      }else incidentCompareStarts=incidentCompareStarts.filter(x=>x!==ts);\n      updateIncidentCompareButton();\n    };\n  });\n  updateIncidentCompareButton();\n\n  if(d.entityScan){\n    performanceEntityScanData=d.entityScan;\n    renderPerformanceEntityScan(d.entityScan);\n  }\n}\n\n\nfunction renderPerformanceQuickRead(d){\n  const host=$('perfQuickRead'),windowHost=$('perfWindowSummary');\n  if(!host||!windowHost)return;\n\n  const enabled=!!d.diagnosticsEnabled,cur=d.current||{},smart=d.smart||{},suite=d.suiteTimings||[];\n  if(!enabled){\n    host.innerHTML='<div class=\"card smartSignal watch\"><div class=\"signalTitle\">Diagnostics are off</div><div class=\"small\">Enable lightweight diagnostics to identify current bottlenecks and build a rolling performance baseline.</div></div>';\n    windowHost.innerHTML='';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const score=smart.available?Number(smart.healthScore||0):null;\n  const overallClass=score===null?'info':score<55?'critical':score<75?'high':score<90?'watch':'info';\n  const primary=(smart.primaryFinding||'').trim()||((smart.signals||[])[0]||{}).title||'No active bottleneck identified';\n  const primaryDetail=smart.available\n    ? `${smart.state||'Learning'} · ${smart.analysisConfidence||'Low'} confidence · data quality ${Number(smart.dataQualityScore||0)}/100`\n    : 'Building the adaptive server baseline.';\n\n  const hottest=suite.slice().sort((a,b)=>Number(b.timePerMinuteMilliseconds||0)-Number(a.timePerMinuteMilliseconds||0)||Number(b.p95Milliseconds||0)-Number(a.p95Milliseconds||0))[0];\n  const suiteTime=hottest?Number(hottest.timePerMinuteMilliseconds||0):0;\n  const suiteClass=suiteTime>=1000?'critical':suiteTime>=250?'watch':'info';\n  const w=d.windowSummary||{};\n  const droppedRecent=Number(w.blockLoggerDroppedIncrease||0),droppedTotal=Number(cur.blockLoggerDropped||0),queue=Number(cur.blockLoggerQueue||0),writer=Number(cur.blockLoggerWriterMs||0);\n  const backClass=droppedRecent>0||queue>=1000||writer>=100?'critical':queue>=250||writer>=50?'watch':'info';\n  const committed=Number(cur.gcCommittedMb||0),frag=Number(cur.gcFragmentedMb||0),fragPct=committed>0?(frag/committed*100):0;\n  const memClass=fragPct>=30?'high':fragPct>=15?'watch':'info';\n  const autoAttr=d.automaticModAttribution||{};\n  const autoProfile=String(autoAttr.latestProfileKind||'').toLowerCase().includes('automatic');\n  const autoMod=autoProfile\n    ? (autoAttr.likelyModId?`${autoAttr.likelyModName||autoAttr.likelyModId} (${autoAttr.confidence||'Low'})`:'No strong mod match')\n    : (autoAttr.enabled?'Armed':'Disabled');\n  const autoSub=autoProfile\n    ? (autoAttr.likelyModId?`${Number(autoAttr.tickSharePercent||0).toFixed(1)}% profiled tick share · max ${Number(autoAttr.maxSegmentMs||0).toFixed(1)} ms segment`:'The latest automatic burst completed without strong non-core mod attribution.')\n    : (autoAttr.enabled?`${Number(autoAttr.profileDurationSeconds||3)}s capture after unexplained 750ms+ stall · ${Number(autoAttr.cooldownSeconds||300)}s cooldown`:'Safe Diagnostics Mode or policy has disabled automatic bursts.');\n\n  host.innerHTML=`\n    <div class=\"card smartSignal ${overallClass}\"><div class=\"signalMeta\"><b>Current diagnosis</b>${score===null?'':`<span class=\"badge ${score<75?'medium':'low'}\">${score}/100</span>`}</div><div class=\"signalTitle\">${esc(primary)}</div><div class=\"small\">${esc(primaryDetail)}</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card smartSignal ${suiteClass}\"><div class=\"signalMeta\"><b>Highest Suite workload</b></div><div class=\"signalTitle\">${hottest?esc(hottest.name||'Unknown'):'No timing samples yet'}</div><div class=\"small\">${hottest?`${suiteTime.toFixed(1)} ms recorded / min · ${Number(hottest.callsPerMinute||0).toLocaleString()} calls / min · P95 ${Number(hottest.p95Milliseconds||0).toFixed(2)} ms`:'Suite timing registry is still collecting samples.'}</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card smartSignal ${backClass}\"><div class=\"signalMeta\"><b>BlockLogger backpressure</b></div><div class=\"signalTitle\">${queue.toLocaleString()} queued · ${writer.toFixed(0)} ms writer</div><div class=\"small\">Dropped in window: ${droppedRecent.toLocaleString()} · lifetime ${droppedTotal.toLocaleString()}. Queue and writer pressure are correlation evidence, not automatic blame.</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card smartSignal ${memClass}\"><div class=\"signalMeta\"><b>Memory pressure</b></div><div class=\"signalTitle\">${Math.round(Number(cur.privateMemoryMb||0)).toLocaleString()} MB private</div><div class=\"small\">Managed ${Math.round(Number(cur.managedHeapMb||0)).toLocaleString()} MB · GC fragmentation ${fragPct.toFixed(1)}% · native estimate ${Math.round(Number(cur.estimatedNativeMb||0)).toLocaleString()} MB</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card smartSignal ${autoProfile&&autoAttr.likelyModId?'watch':'info'}\"><div class=\"signalMeta\"><b>Automatic mod attribution</b></div><div class=\"signalTitle\">${esc(autoMod)}</div><div class=\"small\">${esc(autoSub)}</div></div>`;\n\n  if(!w.available){windowHost.innerHTML='';return;}\n  const signed=(v,digits=0,unit='')=>{const n=Number(v||0);return `${n>0?'+':''}${n.toFixed(digits)}${unit}`;};\n  windowHost.innerHTML=\n    metric('Window',`${Math.max(1,Math.round(Number(w.durationSeconds||0)/60))} min`,'',`${Number(w.sampleCount||0).toLocaleString()} samples`)+\n    metric('Delay P95',`${Number(w.delayP95Ms||0).toFixed(1)} ms`,Number(w.delayP95Ms||0)>=100?'bad':Number(w.delayP95Ms||0)>=50?'warn':'good',`median ${Number(w.delayMedianMs||0).toFixed(1)} ms · max ${Number(w.delayMaxMs||0).toFixed(0)} ms`)+\n    metric('CPU P95',`${Number(w.cpuP95Percent||0).toFixed(1)}%`,Number(w.cpuP95Percent||0)>=90?'bad':Number(w.cpuP95Percent||0)>=75?'warn':'',`average ${Number(w.cpuAveragePercent||0).toFixed(1)}% · max ${Number(w.cpuMaxPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%`)+\n    metric('Heap change',signed(w.heapDeltaMb,0,' MB'),Number(w.heapDeltaMb||0)>=512?'warn':'',`private ${signed(w.privateMemoryDeltaMb,0,' MB')}`)+\n    metric('Entity change',signed(w.entityDelta,0),Math.abs(Number(w.entityDelta||0))>=1000?'warn':'',`current ${Number(cur.loadedEntities||0).toLocaleString()}`)+\n    metric('Slow samples',`${Number(w.delayOver100Count||0).toLocaleString()}` ,Number(w.delayOver250Count||0)>0?'warn':'good',`${Number(w.delayOver250Count||0).toLocaleString()} at 250ms+`)+\n    metric('Gen2 collections',`+${Number(w.gen2CollectionsIncrease||0)}`,Number(w.gen2CollectionsIncrease||0)>=5?'warn':'')+\n    metric('BL peak queue',Number(w.maxBlockLoggerQueue||0).toLocaleString(),Number(w.maxBlockLoggerQueue||0)>=1000?'bad':Number(w.maxBlockLoggerQueue||0)>=250?'warn':'',`writer max ${Number(w.maxBlockLoggerWriterMs||0).toFixed(0)} ms · dropped +${Number(w.blockLoggerDroppedIncrease||0).toLocaleString()}`);\n}\n\nfunction updateIncidentCompareButton(){\n  const btn=$('perfCompareBtn');\n  if(!btn)return;\n  btn.textContent=`Compare Selected (${incidentCompareStarts.length}/2)`;\n  btn.disabled=incidentCompareStarts.length!==2;\n  if(incidentCompareStarts.length!==2)$('perfIncidentCompare').style.display='none';\n}\n\nfunction compareSelectedIncidents(){\n  const incidents=(performanceOverviewData&&performanceOverviewData.incidents)||[];\n  const selected=incidentCompareStarts.map(ts=>incidents.find(x=>Number(x.startUnixMilliseconds||0)===Number(ts))).filter(Boolean);\n  if(selected.length!==2){\n    toast('Select exactly two incidents.');\n    return;\n  }\n  const [a,b]=selected;\n  const row=(label,av,bv,fmt=v=>esc(v))=>`<div class=\"label\">${esc(label)}</div><div>${fmt(av)}</div><div>${fmt(bv)}</div>`;\n  const host=$('perfIncidentCompare');\n  host.style.display='block';\n  host.innerHTML=`<div class=\"cardHeader\"><h3>Incident Comparison</h3><div class=\"spacer\"></div><button id=\"incidentCompareClear\">Clear</button></div>\n    <div class=\"compareGrid\">\n      <div class=\"label\">Metric</div>\n      <div><b>${esc(new Date(Number(a.startUnixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleString())}</b></div>\n      <div><b>${esc(new Date(Number(b.startUnixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleString())}</b></div>\n      ${row('Severity',a.severity,b.severity)}\n      ${row('Likely area',a.primaryCategory,b.primaryCategory)}\n      ${row('Likely mod',a.likelyModId?`${a.likelyModName||a.likelyModId} (${a.modConfidence||'Low'})`:'Not attributed',b.likelyModId?`${b.likelyModName||b.likelyModId} (${b.modConfidence||'Low'})`:'Not attributed')}\n      ${row('Confidence',a.confidence,b.confidence)}\n      ${row('Duration',a.durationSeconds,b.durationSeconds,v=>`${Number(v||0).toFixed(0)}s`)}\n      ${row('Worst delay',a.worstDelayMs,b.worstDelayMs,v=>`<b>${Number(v||0).toFixed(0)}ms</b>`)}\n      ${row('Max CPU',a.maxCpuPercent,b.maxCpuPercent,v=>`${Number(v||0).toFixed(0)}%`)}\n      ${row('Evidence',a.evidence,b.evidence)}\n      ${row('Next action',a.nextAction,b.nextAction)}\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"small\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\">Comparison highlights recurring patterns; similar metrics are still correlation evidence, not automatic proof of the same root cause.</p>`;\n  $('incidentCompareClear').onclick=()=>{\n    incidentCompareStarts=[];\n    host.style.display='none';\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-incident-compare]').forEach(x=>x.checked=false);\n    updateIncidentCompareButton();\n  };\n  host.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});\n}\n\n$('perfCompareBtn').onclick=compareSelectedIncidents;\n\nlet lagIncidentDrawerTimestamp=0;\nlet lagIncidentDrawerPayload=null;\n\nfunction lagIncidentPhaseSummary(rows){\n  const a=Array.isArray(rows)?rows:[];\n  if(!a.length)return {samples:0};\n  const avg=k=>a.reduce((n,x)=>n+Number(x[k]||0),0)/a.length;\n  const max=k=>Math.max(...a.map(x=>Number(x[k]||0)));\n  const first=a[0]||{},last=a[a.length-1]||{};\n  return {\n    samples:a.length,\n    delayAvg:avg('mainThreadDelayMs'),delayMax:max('mainThreadDelayMs'),\n    cpuAvg:avg('cpuPercent'),cpuMax:max('cpuPercent'),\n    heapAvg:avg('managedHeapMb'),heapMax:max('managedHeapMb'),\n    workingAvg:avg('workingSetMb'),privateAvg:avg('privateMemoryMb'),nativeAvg:avg('estimatedNativeMb'),\n    entitiesAvg:avg('loadedEntities'),entitiesMax:max('loadedEntities'),chunksAvg:avg('loadedChunks'),chunksMax:max('loadedChunks'),\n    playersMax:max('players'),queueMax:max('blockLoggerQueue'),writerMax:max('blockLoggerWriterMs'),dropsDelta:Number(last.blockLoggerDropped||0)-Number(first.blockLoggerDropped||0),\n    gen0Delta:Number(last.gen0Collections||0)-Number(first.gen0Collections||0),gen1Delta:Number(last.gen1Collections||0)-Number(first.gen1Collections||0),gen2Delta:Number(last.gen2Collections||0)-Number(first.gen2Collections||0)\n  };\n}\n\nfunction lagPhaseCard(title,s){\n  s=s||{};\n  const row=(k,v)=>`<div class=\"lagPhaseRow\"><span>${esc(k)}</span><b>${v}</b></div>`;\n  return `<div class=\"lagPhaseCard\"><h4>${esc(title)}</h4>\n    ${row('Samples',Number(s.samples||0).toLocaleString())}\n    ${row('Delay avg / max',`${Number(s.delayAvg||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(s.delayMax||0).toFixed(1)} ms`)}\n    ${row('CPU avg / max',`${Number(s.cpuAvg||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(s.cpuMax||0).toFixed(1)}%`)}\n    ${row('Heap avg / max',`${Number(s.heapAvg||0).toFixed(0)} / ${Number(s.heapMax||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)}\n    ${row('Working / private avg',`${Number(s.workingAvg||0).toFixed(0)} / ${Number(s.privateAvg||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)}\n    ${row('Estimated native avg',`${Number(s.nativeAvg||0).toFixed(0)} MB`)}\n    ${row('Entities avg / max',`${Number(s.entitiesAvg||0).toFixed(0)} / ${Number(s.entitiesMax||0).toFixed(0)}`)}\n    ${row('Chunks avg / max',`${Number(s.chunksAvg||0).toFixed(0)} / ${Number(s.chunksMax||0).toFixed(0)}`)}\n    ${row('Players max',Number(s.playersMax||0).toLocaleString())}\n    ${row('BlockLogger queue / writer max',`${Number(s.queueMax||0).toLocaleString()} / ${Number(s.writerMax||0).toFixed(0)} ms`)}\n    ${row('GC Δ 0 / 1 / 2',`+${Number(s.gen0Delta||0)} / +${Number(s.gen1Delta||0)} / +${Number(s.gen2Delta||0)}`)}\n    ${row('Audit drops Δ',`${Number(s.dropsDelta||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(s.dropsDelta||0)}`)}\n  </div>`;\n}\n\nfunction closeLagIncidentDrawer(){\n  const drawer=$('lagIncidentDrawer'),backdrop=$('lagIncidentBackdrop');\n  if(drawer){drawer.classList.remove('open');drawer.style.display='none';drawer.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');}\n  if(backdrop){backdrop.classList.remove('open');backdrop.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');}\n  document.body.classList.remove('lagIncidentDrawerOpen');\n}\n\nfunction renderLagIncidentDrawer(d){\n  const host=$('lagIncidentDrawerBody');if(!host)return;\n  const x=d.incident||{};\n  const before=lagIncidentPhaseSummary(x.before||[]),during=lagIncidentPhaseSummary(x.during||[]),after=lagIncidentPhaseSummary(x.after||[]);\n  const causes=(x.causeScores||[]).slice().sort((a,b)=>Number(b.score||0)-Number(a.score||0));\n  const db=x.database||{},web=x.webServer||{},audit=x.recentAdminActions||[];\n  const growth=(d.entityGrowth||[]).slice(0,10),env=d.environment||null,scan=d.latestEntityScan||null;\n  const severity=String(x.severity||'Watch'),sevClass=severity.toLowerCase()==='critical'?'critical':severity.toLowerCase()==='high'?'high':'watch';\n  const samples=[...(x.before||[]).map(r=>({...r,_phase:'Before'})),...(x.during||[]).map(r=>({...r,_phase:'Incident'})),...(x.after||[]).map(r=>({...r,_phase:'After'}))].sort((a,b)=>Number(a.unixMilliseconds||0)-Number(b.unixMilliseconds||0));\n  const rawRows=samples.map(r=>`<tr><td>${esc(r._phase)}</td><td>${esc(new Date(Number(r.unixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleTimeString())}</td><td class=\"${Number(r.mainThreadDelayMs||0)>=250?'bad':Number(r.mainThreadDelayMs||0)>=100?'warn':''}\"><b>${Number(r.mainThreadDelayMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</b></td><td>${Number(r.cpuPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%</td><td>${Number(r.managedHeapMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB</td><td>${Number(r.workingSetMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB</td><td>${Number(r.loadedEntities||0).toLocaleString()}</td><td>${Number(r.loadedChunks||0).toLocaleString()}</td><td>${Number(r.blockLoggerQueue||0).toLocaleString()}</td><td>${Number(r.blockLoggerWriterMs||0)}ms</td><td>${Number(r.gen0Collections||0)}/${Number(r.gen1Collections||0)}/${Number(r.gen2Collections||0)}</td><td>${Number(r.blockLoggerDropped||0).toLocaleString()}</td></tr>`).join('');\n  const topTypes=scan&&(scan.entityTypes||[]).slice(0,8);\n  const topChunks=scan&&(scan.chunks||[]).slice(0,8);\n  $('lagIncidentTitle').textContent=`${severity} Lag Spike`;\n  $('lagIncidentSubtitle').textContent=`${new Date(Number(x.startUnixMilliseconds||lagIncidentDrawerTimestamp)).toLocaleString()} · archived black-box incident ${x.id||''}`;\n  host.innerHTML=`\n    <div class=\"lagDrawerHero\">\n      <div class=\"lagDrawerScore ${sevClass}\"><div class=\"value\">${Number(x.worstDelayMs||0).toFixed(0)}</div><div class=\"label\">Worst delay ms</div></div>\n      <div><div class=\"small\">${esc(severity.toUpperCase())} · ${esc(x.confidence||'Low')} confidence · ${Number(x.durationSeconds||0).toFixed(0)}s grouped window</div><div style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:880;margin:2px 0 5px\">${esc(x.primaryCategory||'Unknown cause')}</div><div>${esc(x.evidence||'No diagnostic explanation was stored for this incident.')}</div><div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:7px\"><b>Next action:</b> ${esc(x.nextAction||'Reproduce the slowdown and run Incident Capture for deeper engine profiling.')}</div>${x.likelyModId?`<div class=\"compactNote\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Likely mod:</b> ${esc(x.likelyModName||x.likelyModId)} <code>${esc(x.likelyModId)}</code> · ${esc(x.modConfidence||'Low')} confidence${x.modEvidence?`<br>${esc(x.modEvidence)}`:''}${x.modAttributionSource?`<br><span class=\"small\">Source: ${esc(x.modAttributionSource)}${x.modProfileCompletedUnixMilliseconds?` · profile ${esc(new Date(Number(x.modProfileCompletedUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleString())}`:''}</span>`:''}</div>`:''}</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lagDrawerMetricGrid\">\n      <div class=\"lagDrawerMetric\"><div class=\"label\">Started</div><div class=\"value\">${esc(new Date(Number(x.startUnixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleTimeString())}</div><div class=\"sub\">${esc(new Date(Number(x.startUnixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleDateString())}</div></div>\n      <div class=\"lagDrawerMetric\"><div class=\"label\">Duration</div><div class=\"value\">${Number(x.durationSeconds||0).toFixed(0)}s</div><div class=\"sub\">Ends ${esc(new Date(Number(x.endUnixMilliseconds||x.startUnixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleTimeString())}</div></div>\n      <div class=\"lagDrawerMetric\"><div class=\"label\">Max CPU</div><div class=\"value\">${Number(x.maxCpuPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%</div><div class=\"sub\">during grouped incident</div></div>\n      <div class=\"lagDrawerMetric\"><div class=\"label\">Captured</div><div class=\"value\">${x.capturedUnixMilliseconds?esc(new Date(Number(x.capturedUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleTimeString()):'—'}</div><div class=\"sub\">black-box archive completion</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"cardHeader\"><div><h3>Before / During / After</h3><div class=\"small\">Raw rolling health samples summarized around the lag spike.</div></div></div><div class=\"lagPhaseGrid\">${lagPhaseCard('30s Before',before)}${lagPhaseCard('Incident',during)}${lagPhaseCard('15s After',after)}</div></div>\n    ${causes.length?`<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><div class=\"cardHeader\"><div><h3>Ranked Cause Evidence</h3><div class=\"small\">Correlation score and evidence captured at the time; this is triage evidence, not automatic proof.</div></div></div><div class=\"lagCauseGrid\">${causes.map(c=>`<div class=\"lagCauseCard ${Number(c.score||0)>=70?'critical':Number(c.score||0)>=40?'high':Number(c.score||0)>=20?'watch':''}\"><div class=\"cardHeader\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px\"><b>${esc(c.category||'Unknown')}</b><div class=\"spacer\"></div>${confidenceBadge(c.confidence||'Low')}</div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:880\">${Number(c.score||0)}/100</div><div class=\"small\">${esc(c.evidence||'')}</div></div>`).join('')}</div></div>`:''}\n    <div class=\"grid\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"cardHeader\"><h3>SQLite / BlockLogger</h3></div><div class=\"small\"><b>Queue:</b> ${Number(db.pendingEvents||0).toLocaleString()} / ${Number(db.queueCapacity||0).toLocaleString()}<br><b>Writer last / avg / P95 / max:</b> ${Number(db.lastBatchMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(db.averageBatchMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(db.p95BatchMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(db.maxBatchMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} ms<br><b>Query avg / P95 / max:</b> ${Number(db.averageQueryMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(db.p95QueryMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(db.maxQueryMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} ms<br><b>Rows/min:</b> ${Number(db.rowsPerMinute||0).toLocaleString()} · <b>Busy/locked:</b> ${Number(db.busyOrLockedErrors||0).toLocaleString()} · <b>Dropped:</b> ${Number(db.droppedEvents||0).toLocaleString()}<br><b>WAL:</b> ${fmtBytesCompact(db.walBytes||0)} · <b>DB:</b> ${fmtBytesCompact(db.databaseBytes||0)}</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"cardHeader\"><h3>WebPanel / HTTP</h3></div><div class=\"small\"><b>Request avg / P95 / max:</b> ${Number(web.averageRequestMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(web.p95RequestMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(web.maxRequestMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} ms<br><b>Queue wait avg / P95:</b> ${Number(web.averageQueueWaitMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(web.p95QueueWaitMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} ms<br><b>Workers:</b> ${Number(web.activeWorkers||0)} / ${Number(web.workerCount||0)} · <b>Queue:</b> ${Number(web.queueDepth||0)} / ${Number(web.queueCapacity||0)}<br><b>Main-thread wait / work avg:</b> ${Number(web.averageMainThreadWaitMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(web.averageMainThreadWorkMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} ms<br><b>Requests/min:</b> ${Number(web.requestsLastMinute||0).toLocaleString()} · <b>HTTP failures:</b> ${Number(web.failedRequests||web.httpFailures||0).toLocaleString()}</div></div>\n    </div>\n    ${audit.length?`<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><div class=\"cardHeader\"><div><h3>Admin Actions Near Spike</h3><div class=\"small\">Useful for spotting cleanup, teleport, configuration, inventory or server-control actions that overlap the event.</div></div></div><div class=\"acTimeline acTimelineCompact\">${audit.slice(0,12).map(a=>`<div class=\"acTimelineItem accent\"><div class=\"acTimelineDot\"></div><div class=\"acTimelineWhen\"><b>${esc(new Date(Number(a.unixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleTimeString())}</b>${esc(a.actor||'')}</div><div class=\"acTimelineBody\"><div class=\"title\">${esc(a.action||'Admin action')}</div><div class=\"meta\">${esc(a.result||'')} ${a.detail?`· ${esc(a.detail)}`:''}</div></div></div>`).join('')}</div></div>`:''}\n    ${growth.length?`<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><div class=\"cardHeader\"><div><h3>Entity Growth Evidence</h3><div class=\"small\">Latest manual scan-to-scan growth rows retained by Performance Center.</div></div></div><div class=\"tableWrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Entity</th><th>Before</th><th>After</th><th>Δ</th><th>Change</th><th>Severity</th></tr></thead><tbody>${growth.map(g=>`<tr><td><code>${esc(g.code||'')}</code></td><td>${Number(g.before||0).toLocaleString()}</td><td>${Number(g.after||0).toLocaleString()}</td><td>${Number(g.delta||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(g.delta||0).toLocaleString()}</td><td>${Number(g.percentChange||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(g.percentChange||0).toFixed(1)}%</td><td class=\"${severityClass(g.severity)}\"><b>${esc(g.severity||'')}</b></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div></div>`:''}\n    ${scan?`<div class=\"grid\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"cardHeader\"><h3>Latest Manual Entity Scan</h3></div><div class=\"small\"><b>Captured:</b> ${esc(new Date(Number(scan.unixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleString())}<br><b>Total:</b> ${Number(scan.totalLoadedEntities||0).toLocaleString()} · positioned ${Number(scan.positionedEntities||0).toLocaleString()} · unpositioned ${Number(scan.unpositionedEntities||0).toLocaleString()}</div>${topTypes&&topTypes.length?`<div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:7px\"><b>Top types:</b><br>${topTypes.map(t=>`${esc(t.code||t.runtimeType||'unknown')} — ${Number(t.count||0).toLocaleString()} in ${Number(t.chunkCount||0).toLocaleString()} chunk(s)`).join('<br>')}</div>`:''}</div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"cardHeader\"><h3>Highest-pressure Chunks</h3></div>${topChunks&&topChunks.length?`<div class=\"small\">${topChunks.map(c=>`(${Number(c.chunkX||0)}, ${Number(c.chunkZ||0)}) dim ${Number(c.dimension||0)} — ${Number(c.entityCount||0)} entities, ${Number(c.playerCount||0)} players, pressure ${Number(c.pressureScore||0)}${c.topEntityTypes?` · ${esc(c.topEntityTypes)}`:''}`).join('<br>')}</div>`:'<div class=\"muted\">No chunk hotspot rows in latest manual scan.</div>'}</div></div>`:''}\n    ${env?`<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><div class=\"cardHeader\"><div><h3>Nearby Mod-Environment Change</h3><div class=\"small\">Closest retained mod fingerprint change within ±30 minutes.</div></div></div><div class=\"small\"><b>Detected:</b> ${esc(new Date(Number(env.detectedUnixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleString())}<br><b>Result:</b> ${esc(env.result||'')} · ${esc(env.confidence||'Low')} confidence · regression score ${Number(env.regressionScore||0).toFixed(1)}<br><b>Changed mods:</b> ${(env.changedMods||[]).length?(env.changedMods||[]).map(esc).join(' · '):'None listed'}<br><b>Reason:</b> ${esc(env.reason||'')}</div></div>`:''}\n    <details class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><summary>Raw captured health samples (${samples.length})</summary><div class=\"small\" style=\"margin:7px 0\">Every before/during/after sample retained in this archived incident.</div><div class=\"tableWrap lagRawTable\"><table><thead><tr><th>Phase</th><th>Time</th><th>Delay</th><th>CPU</th><th>Heap</th><th>Working set</th><th>Entities</th><th>Chunks</th><th>BL queue</th><th>Writer</th><th>GC 0/1/2</th><th>Drops</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rawRows||'<tr><td colspan=\"12\" class=\"muted\">No raw samples retained.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div></details>\n  `;\n}\n\nfunction renderLagDiagnosticFallback(sample){\n  const host=$('lagIncidentDrawerBody');if(!host)return;sample=sample||{};\n  $('lagIncidentTitle').textContent=`${sample.severity||'Lag'} Spike`;\n  $('lagIncidentSubtitle').textContent=`${new Date(Number(sample.unixMilliseconds||lagIncidentDrawerTimestamp)).toLocaleString()} · live diagnostic sample (no grouped archive)`;\n  host.innerHTML=`<div class=\"warning\"><b>This spike does not have a retained grouped black-box archive.</b> Showing every data point still available from the live diagnostic sample.</div>\n    <div class=\"lagDrawerMetricGrid\">\n      <div class=\"lagDrawerMetric\"><div class=\"label\">Scheduler delay</div><div class=\"value\">${Number(sample.delayMs||0).toFixed(1)} ms</div></div>\n      <div class=\"lagDrawerMetric\"><div class=\"label\">CPU</div><div class=\"value\">${Number(sample.cpuPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%</div></div>\n      <div class=\"lagDrawerMetric\"><div class=\"label\">Managed heap</div><div class=\"value\">${Number(sample.managedHeapMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB</div><div class=\"sub\">private ${Number(sample.privateMemoryMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB · native est. ${Number(sample.estimatedNativeMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB</div></div>\n      <div class=\"lagDrawerMetric\"><div class=\"label\">GC delta 0 / 1 / 2</div><div class=\"value\">+${Number(sample.gen0Delta||0)} / +${Number(sample.gen1Delta||0)} / +${Number(sample.gen2Delta||0)}</div></div>\n      <div class=\"lagDrawerMetric\"><div class=\"label\">Entities</div><div class=\"value\">${Number(sample.loadedEntities||0).toLocaleString()}</div><div class=\"sub\">${Number(sample.entityDelta||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(sample.entityDelta||0)} near spike</div></div>\n      <div class=\"lagDrawerMetric\"><div class=\"label\">Chunks</div><div class=\"value\">${Number(sample.loadedChunks||0).toLocaleString()}</div><div class=\"sub\">${Number(sample.chunkDelta||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(sample.chunkDelta||0)} near spike</div></div>\n      <div class=\"lagDrawerMetric\"><div class=\"label\">BlockLogger</div><div class=\"value\">${Number(sample.blockLoggerQueue||0).toLocaleString()} queued</div><div class=\"sub\">writer ${Number(sample.blockLoggerWriterMs||0)} ms · drops +${Number(sample.blockLoggerDroppedDelta||0)}</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"cardHeader\"><h3>Captured Evidence</h3></div><div>${esc(sample.evidence||'No additional correlation evidence was retained for this sample.')}</div></div>\n    <div class=\"infoBox\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">For a full before/during/after archive, reproduce the issue with Performance diagnostics enabled or use <b>Tick Debugging → Capture Incident + Profile</b>.</div>`;\n}\n\nasync function openLagIncidentDrawer(ts){\n  lagIncidentDrawerTimestamp=Number(ts||0);\n  lagIncidentDrawerPayload=null;\n  const drawer=$('lagIncidentDrawer'),backdrop=$('lagIncidentBackdrop'),host=$('lagIncidentDrawerBody');\n  if(!drawer||!backdrop||!host)return;\n  drawer.style.display='block';drawer.classList.add('open');drawer.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');\n  backdrop.classList.add('open');backdrop.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');document.body.classList.add('lagIncidentDrawerOpen');\n  $('lagIncidentTitle').textContent='Lag Spike Investigation';$('lagIncidentSubtitle').textContent=`Loading archived evidence near ${new Date(lagIncidentDrawerTimestamp).toLocaleString()}…`;host.innerHTML='<div class=\"empty\">Loading every retained data source for this lag spike…</div>';\n  try{\n    const d=await api(`/api/performance/incident?start=${encodeURIComponent(lagIncidentDrawerTimestamp)}`);\n    if(!d.found){\n      const live=((lastProfilerPayload||{}).diagnosticIncidents||[]).slice().sort((a,b)=>Math.abs(Number(a.unixMilliseconds||0)-lagIncidentDrawerTimestamp)-Math.abs(Number(b.unixMilliseconds||0)-lagIncidentDrawerTimestamp))[0];\n      if(live&&Math.abs(Number(live.unixMilliseconds||0)-lagIncidentDrawerTimestamp)<=5000){renderLagDiagnosticFallback(live);return;}\n      host.innerHTML=`<div class=\"warning\">${esc(d.message||'No archived black-box incident matched this marker.')}</div>`;return;\n    }\n    lagIncidentDrawerPayload=d;renderLagIncidentDrawer(d);\n  }catch(e){host.innerHTML=`<div class=\"errorBox\">${esc(e.message)}</div>`;}\n}\n\nfunction lagIncidentTextSummary(){\n  const d=lagIncidentDrawerPayload||{},x=d.incident||{};\n  return [`${x.severity||'Lag'} incident — ${new Date(Number(x.startUnixMilliseconds||lagIncidentDrawerTimestamp)).toLocaleString()}`,`Worst delay: ${Number(x.worstDelayMs||0).toFixed(1)} ms`,`Duration: ${Number(x.durationSeconds||0).toFixed(0)} s`,`Max CPU: ${Number(x.maxCpuPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%`,`Primary category: ${x.primaryCategory||'Unknown'}`,`Confidence: ${x.confidence||'Low'}`,x.likelyModId?`Likely mod: ${x.likelyModName||x.likelyModId} (${x.modConfidence||'Low'} confidence)`:null,`Evidence: ${x.evidence||''}`,`Next action: ${x.nextAction||''}`].filter(Boolean).join('\\n');\n}\n\nif($('lagIncidentClose'))$('lagIncidentClose').onclick=closeLagIncidentDrawer;\nif($('lagIncidentBackdrop'))$('lagIncidentBackdrop').onclick=closeLagIncidentDrawer;\nif($('lagIncidentCopy'))$('lagIncidentCopy').onclick=async()=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(lagIncidentTextSummary());toast('Lag-spike summary copied.','success');}catch(e){toast('Could not copy summary.','error');}};\nif($('lagIncidentOpenTick'))$('lagIncidentOpenTick').onclick=()=>{closeLagIncidentDrawer();setSection('tickDebug',true);};\ndocument.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'&&$('lagIncidentDrawer')?.classList.contains('open'))closeLagIncidentDrawer();});\n\nasync function openPerformanceIncident(ts){\n  selectedPerformanceIncidentStart=ts;\n  setBreadcrumb(`Incident ${new Date(Number(ts||0)).toLocaleTimeString()}`);\n  $('perfIncidentDetailCard').style.display='block';\n  $('perfIncidentDetail').innerHTML='<div class=\"empty\">Loading archived black-box context…</div>';\n\n  try{\n    const d=await api(`/api/performance/incident?start=${encodeURIComponent(ts)}`);\n    if(!d.found){\n      $('perfIncidentDetail').innerHTML=`<div class=\"warning\">${esc(d.message||'Incident archive not found.')}</div>`;\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const x=d.incident||{};\n    const phase=(title,s)=>`<div class=\"incidentPhase\">\n      <h4>${esc(title)}</h4>\n      <div>Samples <b>${Number((s||{}).samples||0)}</b></div>\n      <div>Delay avg/max <b>${Number((s||{}).delayAvg||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number((s||{}).delayMax||0).toFixed(1)} ms</b></div>\n      <div>CPU avg/max <b>${Number((s||{}).cpuAvg||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number((s||{}).cpuMax||0).toFixed(1)}%</b></div>\n      <div>Heap avg <b>${Number((s||{}).heapAvg||0).toFixed(0)} MB</b></div>\n      <div>Entities avg <b>${Number((s||{}).entitiesAvg||0).toFixed(0)}</b></div>\n      <div>BL queue/writer max <b>${Number((s||{}).queueMax||0)} / ${Number((s||{}).writerMax||0)}ms</b></div>\n    </div>`;\n\n    const growth=(d.entityGrowth||[]).slice(0,5);\n    const env=d.environment||null;\n    const causes=(x.causeScores||[]).slice(0,6);\n    const idb=x.database||{};\n    const iweb=x.webServer||{};\n    const iaudit=(x.recentAdminActions||[]).slice(0,8);\n\n    $('perfIncidentDetail').innerHTML=`\n      <div class=\"smartHero\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px\">\n        <div class=\"healthScore ${String(x.severity||'Watch').toLowerCase()==='critical'?'critical':'investigate'}\">${Number(x.worstDelayMs||0).toFixed(0)}</div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"small\">ARCHIVED INCIDENT · ${esc(new Date(Number(x.startUnixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleString())}</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800\">${esc(x.primaryCategory||'Unknown')} · ${esc(x.severity||'')}</div>\n          ${x.likelyModId?`<div style=\"margin-top:5px\"><span class=\"stateChip ${String(x.modConfidence||'').toLowerCase()==='high'?'warn':''}\">Likely mod: ${esc(x.likelyModName||x.likelyModId)} · ${esc(x.modConfidence||'Low')} confidence</span></div>`:''}\n          <div>${esc(x.evidence||'')}</div>\n          ${x.modEvidence?`<div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:5px\"><b>Profiler evidence:</b> ${esc(x.modEvidence)}${x.modAttributionSource?` · ${esc(x.modAttributionSource)}`:''}</div>`:''}\n          <div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:5px\"><b>Next:</b> ${esc(x.nextAction||'')}</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"incidentDetailGrid\">\n        ${phase('30s Before',d.beforeSummary)}\n        ${phase('Incident',d.duringSummary)}\n        ${phase('15s After',d.afterSummary)}\n      </div>\n      ${causes.length?`<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><div class=\"cardHeader\"><h4>Ranked cause evidence</h4><div class=\"spacer\"></div><span class=\"small\">heuristic correlation, not automatic blame</span></div>\n        <div class=\"smartGrid\">${causes.map(c=>`<div class=\"smartSignal ${Number(c.score||0)>=70?'critical':Number(c.score||0)>=40?'high':Number(c.score||0)>=20?'watch':'info'}\"><div class=\"signalMeta\"><b>${esc(c.category)}</b><span class=\"badge ${String(c.confidence||'Low').toLowerCase()}\">${esc(c.confidence)} confidence</span></div><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:850\">${Number(c.score||0)}/100</div><div class=\"small\">${esc(c.evidence||'')}</div></div>`).join('')}</div>\n      </div>`:''}\n      <div class=\"grid\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\n        <div class=\"card\"><h4>SQLite at capture</h4><div class=\"small\">Queue <b>${Number(idb.pendingEvents||0).toLocaleString()}</b> / ${Number(idb.queueCapacity||0).toLocaleString()} · writer last/P95 <b>${Number(idb.lastBatchMilliseconds||0)} / ${Number(idb.p95BatchMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</b> · query P95 <b>${Number(idb.p95QueryMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</b> · rows/min <b>${Number(idb.rowsPerMinute||0).toLocaleString()}</b> · busy/locked <b>${Number(idb.busyOrLockedErrors||0)}</b> · drops <b>${Number(idb.droppedEvents||0)}</b></div></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><h4>Web server near capture</h4><div class=\"small\">P95 <b>${Number(iweb.p95RequestMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</b> · queue P95 <b>${Number(iweb.p95QueueWaitMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</b> · workers <b>${Number(iweb.activeWorkers||0)}/${Number(iweb.workerCount||0)}</b> · queue <b>${Number(iweb.queueDepth||0)}/${Number(iweb.queueCapacity||0)}</b> · main wait/work avg <b>${Number(iweb.averageMainThreadWaitMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(iweb.averageMainThreadWorkMilliseconds||0).toFixed(1)}ms</b> · ${Number(iweb.requestsLastMinute||0)} req/min</div></div>\n      </div>\n      ${iaudit.length?`<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><h4>Admin actions near incident</h4><div class=\"small\">${iaudit.map(a=>`${esc(new Date(Number(a.unixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleTimeString())} · ${esc(a.action)} · ${esc(a.result)}`).join('<br>')}</div></div>`:''}\n      ${growth.length?`<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><h4>Nearby entity growth evidence</h4><div class=\"small\">${growth.map(g=>`${esc(g.code)}: ${Number(g.delta)>=0?'+':''}${Number(g.delta)} (${Number(g.percentChange)>=0?'+':''}${Number(g.percentChange).toFixed(0)}%)`).join(' · ')}</div></div>`:''}\n      ${env?`<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><h4>Nearby mod-environment change</h4><div class=\"small\">${(env.changedMods||[]).map(esc).join(' · ')} · ${esc(env.result)} · ${esc(env.reason||'')}</div></div>`:''}`;\n\n    $('perfIncidentDetailCard').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});\n  }catch(e){\n    $('perfIncidentDetail').innerHTML=`<div class=\"errorBox\">${esc(e.message)}</div>`;\n  }\n}\n\nasync function loadPerformanceTimeline(showLoading=true,preloaded=null){\n  if(showLoading)$('perfTimelineState').textContent=`Loading ${performanceWindowLabel()} timeline…`;\n  try{\n    performanceTimelineData=preloaded||await api(`/api/performance/timeline?window=${performanceWindowSeconds()}`);\n    renderPerformanceTimeline();\n  }catch(e){\n    $('perfTimelineState').textContent=e.message;\n  }\n}\n\nlet performanceIncidentHitAreas=[];\nfunction renderPerformanceTimeline(){\n  const canvas=$('perfTimelineCanvas');\n  if(!canvas||!performanceTimelineData)return;\n  performanceIncidentHitAreas=[];\n\n  const data=performanceTimelineData;\n  const samples=data.samples||[];\n  const rect=canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n  const dpr=Math.min(2,window.devicePixelRatio||1);\n  const w=Math.max(300,rect.width),h=Math.max(200,rect.height);\n  canvas.width=Math.floor(w*dpr);canvas.height=Math.floor(h*dpr);\n  const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');\n  ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);\n  ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);\n  ctx.font='10px system-ui';\n\n  if(!samples.length){\n    ctx.fillStyle='#8492a0';ctx.fillText('No performance samples yet.',18,24);\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const pad={l:75,r:12,t:12,b:26};\n  const first=Number(samples[0].unixMilliseconds),last=Number(samples[samples.length-1].unixMilliseconds);\n  const span=Math.max(1,last-first);\n  const xFor=t=>pad.l+((Number(t)-first)/span)*(w-pad.l-pad.r);\n  const bands=[\n    {label:'Delay',key:'mainThreadDelayMs',suffix:'ms'},\n    {label:'CPU',key:'cpuPercent',suffix:'%'},\n    {label:'Entities',key:'loadedEntities',suffix:''},\n    {label:'Heap',key:'managedHeapMb',suffix:'MB'}\n  ];\n  const bh=(h-pad.t-pad.b)/bands.length;\n\n  bands.forEach((band,bi)=>{\n    const vals=samples.map(s=>Number(s[band.key]||0));\n    let min=Math.min(...vals),max=Math.max(...vals);\n    if(band.key==='mainThreadDelayMs'||band.key==='cpuPercent')min=0;\n    if(max<=min)max=min+1;\n    const top=pad.t+bi*bh,bottom=top+bh-6;\n    ctx.fillStyle=bi%2===0?'#0c141a':'#0a1218';ctx.fillRect(pad.l,top,w-pad.l-pad.r,bh-6);\n    ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(84,105,121,.22)';ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(pad.l,bottom);ctx.lineTo(w-pad.r,bottom);ctx.stroke();\n    ctx.fillStyle='#91a0ae';ctx.fillText(band.label,8,top+14);\n    ctx.fillStyle='#708392';ctx.fillText(`${Math.round(max).toLocaleString()}${band.suffix}`,8,top+28);\n    const bandPoints=samples.map(row=>{const x=xFor(row.unixMilliseconds);const v=Number(row[band.key]||0);const y=bottom-((v-min)/(max-min))*(bh-20);return[x,y];});\n    chartAreaFill(ctx,bandPoints,bottom,'rgba(93,155,208,.055)');chartLine(ctx,bandPoints,'#75afe0',1.8);\n  });\n\n  (data.incidents||[]).forEach(x=>{\n    const px=xFor(x.startUnixMilliseconds);\n    performanceIncidentHitAreas.push({x:px,start:Number(x.startUnixMilliseconds||0),severity:String(x.severity||'Watch')});\n    ctx.strokeStyle=String(x.severity||'').toLowerCase()==='critical'?'#ff7474':'#ffad66';\n    ctx.globalAlpha=.85;ctx.lineWidth=2;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(px,pad.t);ctx.lineTo(px,h-pad.b);ctx.stroke();ctx.lineWidth=1;ctx.globalAlpha=1;\n    ctx.fillStyle=String(x.severity||'').toLowerCase()==='critical'?'#ff7474':'#ffad66';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(px,pad.t+5,4,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();\n  });\n  (data.environmentChanges||[]).forEach(x=>{\n    const px=xFor(x.detectedUnixMilliseconds);\n    ctx.strokeStyle='#c69cff';ctx.setLineDash([4,4]);ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(px,pad.t);ctx.lineTo(px,h-pad.b);ctx.stroke();ctx.setLineDash([]);\n  });\n  (data.entityScans||[]).forEach(x=>{\n    const px=xFor(x.unixMilliseconds);\n    ctx.strokeStyle='#8fda72';ctx.setLineDash([2,5]);ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(px,pad.t);ctx.lineTo(px,h-pad.b);ctx.stroke();ctx.setLineDash([]);\n  });\n\n  ctx.fillStyle='#748392';\n  [first,first+span/2,last].forEach((t,i)=>{\n    const label=new Date(t).toLocaleTimeString();\n    const px=pad.l+(w-pad.l-pad.r)*i/2;\n    ctx.fillText(label,Math.max(pad.l,Math.min(w-80,px-25)),h-7);\n  });\n\n  $('perfTimelineState').textContent=`${performanceWindowLabel()} · ${samples.length} sample points · orange/red=lag (click for incident drawer) · purple=mod change · green=entity scan`;\n}\n\nif($('perfTimelineCanvas')){\n  $('perfTimelineCanvas').addEventListener('mousemove',e=>{\n    const canvas=$('perfTimelineCanvas'),rect=canvas.getBoundingClientRect(),x=e.clientX-rect.left;\n    const hit=performanceIncidentHitAreas.slice().sort((a,b)=>Math.abs(a.x-x)-Math.abs(b.x-x))[0];\n    canvas.classList.toggle('lagIncidentMarkerHover',!!hit&&Math.abs(hit.x-x)<=9);\n    canvas.title=hit&&Math.abs(hit.x-x)<=9?`${hit.severity} lag spike — click for full incident breakdown`:'';\n  });\n  $('perfTimelineCanvas').addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>{$('perfTimelineCanvas').classList.remove('lagIncidentMarkerHover');$('perfTimelineCanvas').title='';});\n  $('perfTimelineCanvas').addEventListener('click',e=>{\n    const canvas=$('perfTimelineCanvas'),rect=canvas.getBoundingClientRect(),x=e.clientX-rect.left;\n    const hit=performanceIncidentHitAreas.slice().sort((a,b)=>Math.abs(a.x-x)-Math.abs(b.x-x))[0];\n    if(hit&&Math.abs(hit.x-x)<=10)openLagIncidentDrawer(hit.start);\n  });\n}\n\nasync function loadPerformanceEntityGrowth(showLoading=true,preloaded=null){\n  if(showLoading)$('perfGrowthState').textContent='Loading growth history…';\n  try{\n    const d=preloaded||await api('/api/performance/entity-growth');\n    const rows=d.rows||[];\n    $('perfGrowthState').textContent=`${Number(d.scans||0)} stored scan(s)`;\n    const flagged=rows.filter(x=>x.severity==='Critical'||x.severity==='High'||x.severity==='Watch');\n    const biggest=rows.slice().sort((a,b)=>Number(b.delta||0)-Number(a.delta||0))[0]||null;\n    $('perfGrowthSummary').innerHTML=\n      metric('Stored scans',Number(d.scans||0).toLocaleString())+\n      metric('Changed entity types',rows.length.toLocaleString())+\n      metric('Flagged for review',flagged.length.toLocaleString(),flagged.some(x=>x.severity==='Critical')?'bad':flagged.length?'warn':'good')+\n      metric('Largest increase',biggest?`${biggest.code} · ${Number(biggest.delta||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(biggest.delta||0).toLocaleString()}`:'—',biggest&&Number(biggest.delta||0)>0?'warn':'');\n    $('perfEntityGrowth').innerHTML=rows.length\n      ? rows.slice(0,50).map((x,i)=>`<tr>\n          <td><b>${esc(x.code)}</b></td>\n          <td>${Number(x.before||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n          <td>${Number(x.after||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n          <td class=\"${Number(x.delta||0)>0?'warn':'good'}\"><b>${Number(x.delta||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(x.delta||0).toLocaleString()}</b></td>\n          <td class=\"${Number(x.percentChange||0)>=40?'warn':''}\"><b>${Number(x.percentChange||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(x.percentChange||0).toFixed(1)}%</b></td>\n          <td class=\"${severityClass(x.severity)}\"><b>${esc(x.severity)}</b></td>\n          <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.reason)}\">${esc(x.reason)}</td>\n          <td><div class=\"rowActions\"><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-growth-expand=\"${i}\">Details</button><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-growth-pin=\"${esc(x.code)}\">Pin</button></div></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"expandRow\" id=\"growthDetail${i}\" style=\"display:none\"><td colspan=\"8\"><div class=\"expandPanel\">\n          <div><b>${esc(x.code)}</b><div class=\"small\">Before ${Number(x.before||0).toLocaleString()} → After ${Number(x.after||0).toLocaleString()}</div><div class=\"${severityClass(x.severity)}\" style=\"margin-top:5px\"><b>${esc(x.severity)}</b></div></div>\n          <div><b>Why it was classified this way</b><div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:4px\">${esc(x.reason)}</div><div class=\"rowActions\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-growth-pin=\"${esc(x.code)}\">Pin entity</button><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-growth-animals>Open Animal Limiter</button><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-growth-rescan>Run another scan</button></div></div>\n        </div></td></tr>`).join('')\n      : '<tr><td colspan=\"8\"><div class=\"emptyAction\"><b>Two manual entity scans are required.</b><br>Run a scan now, wait for the workload you want to compare, then run a second scan.<div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><button id=\"growthEmptyScan\">Run Entity / Chunk Scan</button></div></div></td></tr>';\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-growth-expand]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>{\n      const row=$(`growthDetail${btn.dataset.growthExpand}`);\n      if(row)row.style.display=row.style.display==='none'?'table-row':'none';\n    });\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-growth-pin]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>addWatchItem('entity',btn.dataset.growthPin,btn.dataset.growthPin,'performance'));\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-growth-animals]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>setSection('animals',true));\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-growth-rescan]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>scanPerformanceEntities());\n    if($('growthEmptyScan'))$('growthEmptyScan').onclick=()=>scanPerformanceEntities();\n    setTimeout(enhanceImportantTables,20);\n  }catch(e){\n    $('perfGrowthState').textContent=e.message;\n  }\n}\n\nasync function loadPerformanceEnvironment(showLoading=true,preloaded=null){\n  if(showLoading)$('perfEnvironmentState').textContent='Loading…';\n  try{\n    performanceEnvironmentData=preloaded||await api('/api/performance/environment');\n    const history=performanceEnvironmentData.history||[];\n    const current=performanceEnvironmentData.current||null;\n    $('perfEnvironmentState').textContent=current\n      ? `${(current.mods||[]).length} mods · fingerprint ${String(current.fingerprint||'').slice(0,10)}`\n      : 'Waiting for diagnostics';\n\n    $('perfEnvironmentHistory').innerHTML=history.length\n      ? history.map(x=>`<tr>\n          <td>${esc(new Date(Number(x.detectedUnixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleString())}</td>\n          <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc((x.changedMods||[]).join(' | '))}\">${(x.changedMods||[]).map(m=>`<span class=\"badge medium\">${esc(m)}</span>`).join(' ')}</td>\n          <td class=\"${String(x.result||'').toLowerCase()==='regressed'?'bad':String(x.result||'').toLowerCase()==='improved'?'good':'warn'}\"><b>${esc(x.result)}</b></td>\n          <td>${Number(x.regressionScore||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(x.regressionScore||0).toFixed(1)}%</td>\n          <td>${esc(x.confidence)}</td>\n          <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.reason)}\">${esc(x.reason)}</td>\n        </tr>`).join('')\n      : '<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No mod/version environment change has been recorded yet.</td></tr>';\n  }catch(e){\n    $('perfEnvironmentState').textContent=e.message;\n  }\n}\n\nasync function downloadPerformanceBundle(){\n  const btn=$('perfDownloadBundle');\n  btn.disabled=true;\n  try{\n    const r=await fetch('/api/performance/bundle',{headers:{'Accept':'application/zip'}});\n    if(r.status===401){showLogin();throw new Error('Authentication required');}\n    if(!r.ok){\n      let message=`HTTP ${r.status}`;\n      try{const j=await r.json();message=j.error||message;}catch{}\n      throw new Error(message);\n    }\n    const blob=await r.blob();\n    const disposition=r.headers.get('Content-Disposition')||'';\n    const match=/filename=\"([^\"]+)\"/.exec(disposition);\n    const name=match?match[1]:`newfies-diagnostics-${new Date().toISOString().replace(/[:.]/g,'-')}.zip`;\n    const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n    const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=name;document.body.appendChild(a);a.click();a.remove();\n    setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1200);\n    toast('Diagnostic Bundle v2 downloaded.','success');\n  }catch(e){\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{\n    btn.disabled=false;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction focusPerformanceIncident(ts){\n  profilerRangeSeconds=1800;\n  localStorage.setItem('nsu.profilerRange','1800');\n  \n\n\n\ndocument.querySelectorAll('#rangeButtons button').forEach(\n    btn=>btn.classList.toggle('active',Number(btn.dataset.range)===1800)\n  );\n  chartHoverTimestamp=ts;\n  setSection('profiler',true);\n  setTimeout(()=>redrawProfilerCharts(),350);\n}\n\nasync function loadPerformanceEntityScan(showLoading=true,preloaded=null){\n  if(showLoading)$('perfLastScan').textContent='Loading last entity scan…';\n  try{\n    const d=preloaded||await api('/api/performance/entity-scan');\n    if(d.available&&d.snapshot){\n      performanceEntityScanData=d.snapshot;\n      renderPerformanceEntityScan(d.snapshot);\n    }else if(!performanceEntityScanData){\n      $('perfLastScan').textContent='No entity/chunk scan yet';\n    }\n  }catch(e){\n    if(showLoading)toast(e.message,'error');\n  }\n}\n\nasync function scanPerformanceEntities(){\n  const btn=$('perfEntityScan');\n  btn.disabled=true;\n  $('perfLastScan').textContent='Scanning loaded entities…';\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/performance/entity-scan',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});\n    performanceEntityScanData=d.snapshot||null;\n    if(performanceEntityScanData)renderPerformanceEntityScan(performanceEntityScanData);\n    await Promise.allSettled([\n      loadPerformanceEntityGrowth(false),\n      loadPerformanceTimeline(false)\n    ]);\n    toast('Manual entity/chunk hotspot scan complete.','success');\n  }catch(e){\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{\n    btn.disabled=false;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction renderPerformanceEntityScan(scan){\n  const when=new Date(Number(scan.unixMilliseconds||0));\n  $('perfLastScan').textContent=`Entity scan ${when.toLocaleTimeString()} · ${Number(scan.positionedEntities||0).toLocaleString()} positioned`;\n  $('perfEntityCount').textContent=`${Number(scan.totalLoadedEntities||0).toLocaleString()} loaded`;\n  const types=scan.entityTypes||[];\n  $('perfEntityTypes').innerHTML=types.length\n    ? types.slice(0,40).map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.code)}</b></td>\n        <td>${esc(x.runtimeType)}</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.count||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.chunkCount||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n        <td><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-pin-entity=\"${esc(x.code)}\">Pin</button></td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">No loaded entity types were found.</td></tr>';\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-pin-entity]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>addWatchItem('entity',btn.dataset.pinEntity,btn.dataset.pinEntity,'performance'));\n\n  const chunks=scan.chunks||[];\n  $('perfChunkCount').textContent=`${chunks.length} retained hotspot chunk(s)`;\n  $('perfChunks').innerHTML=chunks.length\n    ? chunks.slice(0,60).map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td><b>${Number(x.chunkX)}, ${Number(x.chunkZ)}</b></td>\n        <td>${Number(x.dimension||0)}</td>\n        <td class=\"${Number(x.pressureScore||0)>=250?'bad':Number(x.pressureScore||0)>=120?'warn':''}\"><b>${Number(x.pressureScore||0)}</b></td>\n        <td>${Number(x.entityCount||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.playerCount||0)}</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.uniqueEntityTypes||0)}</td>\n        <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.topEntityTypes)}\">${esc(x.topEntityTypes)}</td>\n        <td><div class=\"rowActions\"><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-open-chunk=\"${Number(x.chunkX)},${Number(x.chunkZ)},${Number(x.dimension||0)}\">BlockLogger</button><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-pin-chunk=\"${Number(x.chunkX)},${Number(x.chunkZ)},${Number(x.dimension||0)}\">Pin</button></div></td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"muted\">No positioned chunk data was found.</td></tr>';\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-open-chunk]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>{\n    const [cx,cz,dim]=btn.dataset.openChunk.split(',').map(Number);\n    openChunkInBlockLogger(cx,cz,dim);\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-pin-chunk]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>{\n    const [cx,cz,dim]=btn.dataset.pinChunk.split(',').map(Number);\n    addWatchItem('chunk',`${dim}:${cx}:${cz}`,`Chunk ${cx}, ${cz} · dim ${dim}`,'blocklogger',{chunkX:cx,chunkZ:cz,dimension:dim});\n  });\n\n  renderPerformanceHeatmap(chunks);\n}\n\nfunction renderPerformanceHeatmap(chunks){\n  const host=$('perfHeatmap');\n  if(!chunks||!chunks.length){\n    host.innerHTML='<div class=\"empty\" style=\"grid-column:1/-1\">Run the manual entity/chunk hotspot scan.</div>';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const hottest=chunks[0];\n  const dimension=Number(hottest.dimension||0);\n  const cx=Number(hottest.chunkX||0),cz=Number(hottest.chunkZ||0);\n  const sameDim=chunks.filter(x=>Number(x.dimension||0)===dimension);\n  const map=new Map(sameDim.map(x=>[`${Number(x.chunkX)},${Number(x.chunkZ)}`,x]));\n  const maxPressure=Math.max(1,...sameDim.map(x=>Number(x.pressureScore||0)));\n  const cells=[];\n\n  for(let dz=-3;dz<=3;dz++){\n    for(let dx=-3;dx<=3;dx++){\n      const x=cx+dx,z=cz+dz,row=map.get(`${x},${z}`);\n      if(!row){\n        cells.push(`<div class=\"heatCell empty\" title=\"No hotspot data retained for this chunk\"><div class=\"coord\">${x},${z}</div><div>—</div></div>`);\n        continue;\n      }\n      const ratio=Number(row.pressureScore||0)/maxPressure;\n      const cls=ratio>=.75?'p4':ratio>=.5?'p3':ratio>=.25?'p2':'p1';\n      cells.push(`<div class=\"heatCell ${cls}\" data-heat-chunk=\"${x},${z},${dimension}\" title=\"${esc(row.topEntityTypes||'')} · click to open BlockLogger near this chunk\">\n        <div class=\"coord\">${x},${z}</div>\n        <div class=\"count\">${Number(row.entityCount||0).toLocaleString()}</div>\n        <div>${Number(row.uniqueEntityTypes||0)} types · ${Number(row.playerCount||0)} players</div>\n      </div>`);\n    }\n  }\n\n  host.innerHTML=cells.join('');\n  host.querySelectorAll('[data-heat-chunk]').forEach(cell=>cell.onclick=()=>{\n    const [x,z,dim]=cell.dataset.heatChunk.split(',').map(Number);\n    openChunkInBlockLogger(x,z,dim);\n  });\n}\n\nfunction dotNetTicksToDate(ticks){\n  const n=Number(ticks||0);\n  if(!n)return null;\n  const unixMs=(n-621355968000000000)/10000;\n  return new Date(unixMs);\n}\n\nasync function loadPerformanceBlockActivity(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading)$('perfActivityCount').textContent='Loading…';\n  try{\n    const minutes=Number($('perfActivityWindow').value||30);\n    const d=await api(`/api/performance/block-activity?minutes=${minutes}&limit=75`);\n    const rows=d.rows||[];\n    $('perfActivityCount').textContent=`${rows.length} hotspot(s) / ${d.minutes} min`;\n    $('perfBlockActivity').innerHTML=rows.length\n      ? rows.map(x=>{\n          const last=dotNetTicksToDate(x.lastTimestampTicks);\n          return `<tr>\n            <td><b>${Number(x.x)}, ${Number(x.y)}, ${Number(x.z)}</b></td>\n            <td>${esc(x.dimension)}</td>\n            <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.blockCode)}\">${esc(x.blockCode)}</td>\n            <td class=\"${Number(x.eventCount||0)>=100?'warn':''}\"><b>${Number(x.eventCount||0).toLocaleString()}</b></td>\n            <td>${Number(x.distinctActions||0)}</td>\n            <td>${last?esc(last.toLocaleString()):'—'}</td>\n          </tr>`;\n        }).join('')\n      : '<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No BlockLogger block/container activity was found in this time window.</td></tr>';\n  }catch(e){\n    $('perfBlockActivity').innerHTML=`<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"bad\">${esc(e.message)}</td></tr>`;\n  }\n}\n\nasync function loadPerformanceProviders(showLoading=true,preloaded=null){\n  if(showLoading)$('perfProviders').innerHTML='<div class=\"empty\">Loading providers…</div>';\n  try{\n    performanceProvidersData=preloaded||await api('/api/performance/providers');\n    const providers=(performanceProvidersData||{}).providers||[];\n    $('perfProviders').innerHTML=providers.map(x=>`<div class=\"card providerCard ${x.installed?'installed':'missing'}\">\n      <div class=\"small\">${esc(x.role)}</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:800\">${esc(x.name)} ${x.version?`<span class=\"small\">${esc(x.version)}</span>`:''}</div>\n      <div class=\"${x.installed?'good':'muted'}\"><b>${x.installed?'INSTALLED':'NOT INSTALLED'}</b></div>\n      <div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:5px\">${esc(x.detail)}</div>\n    </div>`).join('');\n  }catch(e){\n    $('perfProviders').innerHTML=`<div class=\"errorBox\">${esc(e.message)}</div>`;\n  }\n}\n\nasync function loadPerformanceConflicts(showLoading=true,preloaded=null){\n  if(showLoading)$('perfConflictSummary').textContent='Inspecting…';\n  try{\n    performanceConflictsData=preloaded||await api('/api/performance/conflicts');\n    const d=performanceConflictsData||{};\n    $('perfConflictSummary').textContent=d.harmonyDetected\n      ? `${Number(d.patchedMethodCount||0).toLocaleString()} patched methods · ${Number(d.conflictCount||0).toLocaleString()} overlap(s)`\n      : 'Harmony not detected';\n\n    const rows=d.conflicts||[];\n    $('perfConflicts').innerHTML=rows.length\n      ? rows.slice(0,100).map(x=>`<tr>\n          <td class=\"${severityClass(x.severity)}\"><b>${esc(x.severity)}</b></td>\n          <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.declaringType)}\">${esc(x.declaringType)}</td>\n          <td><b>${esc(x.method)}</b></td>\n          <td class=\"patchOwners\">${(x.owners||[]).map(o=>`<span class=\"badge medium\">${esc(o)}</span>`).join(' ')}</td>\n          <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.note)}\">${esc(x.note)}</td>\n        </tr>`).join('')\n      : `<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">${esc(d.message||'No multi-owner Harmony patch overlaps found.')}</td></tr>`;\n  }catch(e){\n    $('perfConflictSummary').textContent='Inspection failed';\n    $('perfConflicts').innerHTML=`<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"bad\">${esc(e.message)}</td></tr>`;\n  }\n}\n\n$('perfRefresh').onclick=()=>loadPerformanceCenter(true);\n$('perfWindow').onchange=()=>loadPerformanceCenter(true);\n$('perfEnableDiagnostics').onclick=async()=>{\n  try{\n    await api('/api/profiler/enabled',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({enabled:true})});\n    toast('Lightweight performance diagnostics enabled.','success');\n    await loadPerformanceOverview(true);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n};\n$('perfEntityScan').onclick=scanPerformanceEntities;\n$('perfActivityRefresh').onclick=()=>loadPerformanceBlockActivity(true);\n$('perfActivityWindow').onchange=()=>loadPerformanceBlockActivity(true);\n$('perfConflictRefresh').onclick=()=>loadPerformanceConflicts(true);\n$('perfProvidersRefresh').onclick=()=>loadPerformanceProviders(true);\n$('perfEnvironmentRefresh').onclick=()=>loadPerformanceEnvironment(true);\n$('perfDownloadBundle').onclick=downloadPerformanceBundle;\n$('healthBundle').onclick=downloadPerformanceBundle;\n$('perfIncidentClose').onclick=()=>{\n  $('perfIncidentDetailCard').style.display='none';\n  selectedPerformanceIncidentStart=0;\n  setBreadcrumb();\n};\n$('perfIncidentProfiler').onclick=()=>{\n  if(selectedPerformanceIncidentStart)focusPerformanceIncident(selectedPerformanceIncidentStart);\n};\n\nfunction tungstenSetBusy(value){\n  tungstenBusy=value;\n  document.querySelectorAll('#optimizations button').forEach(btn=>{\n    const tungstenControl=btn.id.startsWith('tungsten') || btn.hasAttribute('data-tungsten-code') || btn.hasAttribute('data-tungsten-test');\n    if(!tungstenControl)return;\n    if(btn.id!=='tungstenRefresh')btn.disabled=value || !(tungstenStatusData&&tungstenStatusData.installed&&tungstenStatusData.commandRegistered);\n  });\n}\n\nfunction recommendationBadge(rec){\n  const level=String((rec||{}).level||'Not indicated');\n  const cls=level==='High'?'high':level==='Medium'?'medium':level==='Low'?'low':'none';\n  return `<span class=\"recBadge ${cls}\">${esc(level)}${Number((rec||{}).score||0)>0?` · ${Number(rec.score)}`:''}</span>`;\n}\n\nfunction renderOptimizationExperiment(d){\n  const pending=d.pendingExperiment||null;\n  const history=d.experimentHistory||[];\n\n  if(pending){\n    const b=pending.baseline||{};\n    $('optimizationExperiment').innerHTML=`\n      <div><b>${esc(pending.providerName||'Optimizer')} · ${esc(pending.optimizationName)}</b> → ${pending.targetEnabled?'ENABLE':'DISABLE'}</div>\n      <div class=\"warn\" style=\"margin:5px 0\"><b>${esc(pending.status)}</b></div>\n      <div>${esc(pending.reason||'')}</div>\n      <div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:7px\">\n        Baseline: health ${Number(b.healthScore||0)}/100 · delay ${Number(b.delayMedianMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms ·\n        CPU ${Number(b.cpuMedianPercent||0).toFixed(1)}% · writer ${Number(b.writerMedianMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms ·\n        players ${Number(b.players||0)}\n      </div>`;\n  }else{\n    const latest=history[0]||null;\n    $('optimizationExperiment').innerHTML=latest\n      ? `<div class=\"experimentResult ${String(latest.result||'').toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z]+/g,'')}\">${esc(latest.result)}</div>\n         <div><b>${esc(latest.providerName||'Optimizer')} · ${esc(latest.optimizationName)}</b> · ${Number(latest.improvementScore||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(latest.improvementScore||0).toFixed(1)}% weighted score · ${esc(latest.confidence)} confidence</div>\n         <div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">${esc(latest.reason||'')}</div>`\n      : 'No measured experiment is pending. Use <b>Measure ON</b> on one optimization after diagnostics have collected for at least 60 seconds.';\n  }\n\n  $('optimizationHistory').innerHTML=history.length\n    ? history.map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.providerName||'Optimizer')} · ${esc(x.optimizationName)}</b></td>\n        <td>${x.targetEnabled?'ON':'OFF'}</td>\n        <td class=\"${String(x.result||'').toLowerCase()==='improved'?'good':String(x.result||'').toLowerCase()==='regressed'?'bad':'warn'}\"><b>${esc(x.result)}</b></td>\n        <td>${Number(x.improvementScore||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(x.improvementScore||0).toFixed(1)}%</td>\n        <td>${esc(x.confidence)}</td>\n        <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.reason)}\">${esc(x.reason)}</td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No completed optimization measurements yet.</td></tr>';\n}\n\nfunction renderTungsten(){\n  const d=tungstenStatusData||{};\n  const installed=!!d.installed;\n  const ready=installed&&!!d.commandRegistered;\n  const safeModeLocked=!!d.safeDiagnosticsMode;\n  const experimentLocked=!!d.pendingExperiment;\n\n  $('tungstenBanner').innerHTML=`\n    <div class=\"optStatusHero\">\n      <div class=\"optStatusIcon ${ready?'good':'bad'}\">${ready?'✓':'!'}</div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"small\">EXTERNAL OPTIMIZER INTEGRATION</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">${installed?`${esc(d.name||'Tungsten')} ${esc(d.version||'')}`:'Tungsten required for optimization controls'}</div>\n        <div class=\"small\">${esc(d.note||'')}</div>\n        ${!installed?'<div class=\"warning\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0\"><b>Install Tungsten to use these 27 optimization toggles.</b> BlockLogger provides recommendations, measurement, and the web control surface, but it does not copy Tungsten&#39;s optimization patches. <a href=\"https://mods.vintagestory.at/show/mod/35001\">Open Tungsten on the Vintage Story Mod DB</a>.</div>':''}\n        ${safeModeLocked?'<div class=\"warning\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0\"><b>Safe Diagnostics Mode is ON.</b> Tungsten state-changing controls and manual engine profiling are locked. Read-only status/health/manifest/diagnostic dump actions remain available.</div>':''}\n        ${installed&&!ready?'<div class=\"bad\" style=\"margin-top:5px\">Tungsten is loaded but its /tungsten command is not registered. Check the server log/version compatibility.</div>':''}\n      </div>\n    </div>`;\n\n  $('tungstenAdvisorState').textContent=d.recommendationState||'';\n  const opts=d.optimizations||[];\n  const recommended=opts\n    .filter(x=>Number((x.recommendation||{}).score||0)>0)\n    .sort((a,b)=>Number((b.recommendation||{}).score||0)-Number((a.recommendation||{}).score||0))\n    .slice(0,5);\n\n  $('tungstenAdvisor').innerHTML=recommended.length\n    ? recommended.map((x,i)=>`<div style=\"margin-bottom:9px\">\n        <b>${i+1}. ${esc(x.name)}</b> ${recommendationBadge(x.recommendation)}<br>\n        <span class=\"small\">${esc((x.recommendation||{}).reason||'')}</span>\n      </div>`).join('')\n    : (String(d.recommendationState||'').includes('OFF')\n        ? 'Enable lightweight Profiler diagnostics and let them collect for at least 60 seconds. The advisor will then rank Tungsten optimizations using CPU, GC, entity, chunk, memory, and player-load evidence.'\n        : 'No Tungsten optimization is strongly indicated by the current Smart Diagnosis. That is a useful result—avoid enabling optimizations just because they exist.');\n\n  renderOptimizationExperiment(d);\n\n  const categories=[...new Set(opts.map(x=>x.category).filter(Boolean))].sort();\n  const currentCategory=$('tungstenCategory').value;\n  $('tungstenCategory').innerHTML='<option value=\"\">All categories</option>'+categories.map(x=>`<option value=\"${esc(x)}\">${esc(x)}</option>`).join('');\n  if(categories.includes(currentCategory))$('tungstenCategory').value=currentCategory;\n\n  const moduleValue=$('tungstenDiagModule').value;\n  $('tungstenDiagModule').innerHTML='<option value=\"all\">All modules</option>'+opts.map(x=>`<option value=\"${esc(x.code)}\">${esc(x.name)}</option>`).join('');\n  if(moduleValue==='all'||opts.some(x=>x.code===moduleValue))$('tungstenDiagModule').value=moduleValue;\n\n  const q=String($('tungstenFilter').value||'').trim().toLowerCase();\n  const category=$('tungstenCategory').value;\n  const rows=opts\n    .filter(x=>\n      (!category||x.category===category) &&\n      (!q||[x.code,x.name,x.description,x.category,(x.recommendation||{}).reason].some(v=>String(v||'').toLowerCase().includes(q)))\n    )\n    .sort((a,b)=>Number((b.recommendation||{}).score||0)-Number((a.recommendation||{}).score||0));\n\n  $('tungstenCount').textContent=`${rows.length} / ${opts.length}`;\n  $('tungstenRows').innerHTML=rows.length\n    ? rows.map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.name)}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.code)}</div></td>\n        <td>${recommendationBadge(x.recommendation)}<div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:4px;max-width:310px\">${esc((x.recommendation||{}).reason||'')}</div></td>\n        <td><span class=\"optCategory\">${esc(x.category)}</span></td>\n        <td>${esc(x.description)}</td>\n        <td class=\"${x.commandAvailable?'good':'bad'}\"><b>${x.commandAvailable?'YES':'NO'}</b></td>\n        <td><div class=\"optActions\">\n          <button data-tungsten-code=\"${esc(x.code)}\" data-enabled=\"true\" class=\"primary\" ${!ready||!x.commandAvailable||experimentLocked||safeModeLocked?'disabled':''}>ON</button>\n          <button data-tungsten-code=\"${esc(x.code)}\" data-enabled=\"false\" ${!ready||!x.commandAvailable||experimentLocked||safeModeLocked?'disabled':''}>OFF</button>\n          <button data-tungsten-test=\"${esc(x.code)}\" ${!ready||!x.commandAvailable||experimentLocked||safeModeLocked?'disabled':''}>Measure ON</button>\n        </div></td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No optimization matches the current filter.</td></tr>';\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-tungsten-code]').forEach(btn=>{\n    btn.onclick=()=>toggleTungstenOptimization(\n      btn.dataset.tungstenCode||'',\n      btn.dataset.enabled==='true');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-tungsten-test]').forEach(btn=>{\n    btn.onclick=()=>measureTungstenOptimization(btn.dataset.tungstenTest||'');\n  });\n\n  const supports=d.supports||{};\n  [\n    'tungstenStatus','tungstenStats','tungstenReload',\n    'tungstenStatsOn','tungstenStatsOff'\n  ].forEach(id=>$(id).disabled=!ready);\n  ['tungstenAllOn','tungstenAllOff'].forEach(id=>$(id).disabled=!ready||experimentLocked||safeModeLocked);\n  $('tungstenHealth').disabled=!ready||!supports.health;\n  $('tungstenManifest').disabled=!ready||!supports.manifest;\n  $('tungstenBenchmarkOn').disabled=!ready||!supports.benchmarkHarness;\n  $('tungstenBenchmarkOff').disabled=!ready||!supports.benchmarkHarness;\n  $('tungstenFrameOn').disabled=!ready||!supports.frameProfiler;\n  $('tungstenFrameOff').disabled=!ready||!supports.frameProfiler;\n  $('tungstenDiagOn').disabled=!ready||!supports.diagnostics;\n  $('tungstenDiagOff').disabled=!ready||!supports.diagnostics;\n  $('tungstenDiagDump').disabled=!ready||!supports.diagnostics;\n  $('tungstenDiagReset').disabled=!ready||!supports.diagnostics;\n  $('optimizationEvaluate').disabled=!d.pendingExperiment;\n}\n\n\nasync function loadTungsten(){\n  $('tungstenBanner').innerHTML='<div class=\"empty\">Checking Tungsten installation and command catalog…</div>';\n  try{\n    tungstenStatusData=await api('/api/optimizations/tungsten');\n    renderTungsten();\n  }catch(e){\n    tungstenStatusData=null;\n    $('tungstenBanner').innerHTML=`<div class=\"errorBox\">${esc(e.message)}</div>`;\n    $('tungstenRows').innerHTML='<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"bad\">Unable to load Tungsten integration status.</td></tr>';\n  }\n}\n\nfunction synergySetBusy(value){\n  synergyBusy=value;\n  document.querySelectorAll('#optimizations button').forEach(btn=>{\n    const synergyControl=btn.id.startsWith('synergy') || btn.hasAttribute('data-synergy-code') || btn.hasAttribute('data-synergy-test');\n    if(!synergyControl)return;\n    if(btn.id!=='synergyRefresh')btn.disabled=value || !(synergyStatusData&&synergyStatusData.installed&&synergyStatusData.commandRegistered);\n  });\n}\n\nfunction renderSynergy(){\n  const d=synergyStatusData||{};\n  const installed=!!d.installed;\n  const ready=installed&&!!d.commandRegistered;\n  const safeModeLocked=!!d.safeDiagnosticsMode;\n  const experimentLocked=!!d.pendingExperiment;\n  const compatibility=d.compatibilityWarning||'';\n\n  $('synergyBanner').innerHTML=`\n    <div class=\"optStatusHero\">\n      <div class=\"optStatusIcon ${ready?'good':'bad'}\">${ready?'✓':'!'}</div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"small\">EXTERNAL OPTIMIZER INTEGRATION</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">${installed?`${esc(d.name||'Synergy')} ${esc(d.version||'')}`:'Synergy not installed'}</div>\n        <div class=\"small\">${esc(d.note||'')}</div>\n        ${!installed?'<div class=\"warning\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0\"><b>Install Synergy separately to use these controls.</b> Server Essentials only supplies the advisor, measurement workflow, and command surface.</div>':''}\n        ${compatibility?`<div class=\"warning\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0\"><b>Version compatibility:</b> ${esc(compatibility)}</div>`:''}\n        ${safeModeLocked?'<div class=\"warning\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0\"><b>Safe Diagnostics Mode is ON.</b> Synergy state-changing controls are locked; read-only status/stats/diagnostic dump remain available.</div>':''}\n        ${installed&&!ready?'<div class=\"bad\" style=\"margin-top:5px\">Synergy is loaded but its /synergy command is not registered. Check the server log and version compatibility.</div>':''}\n        ${installed&&ready&&!d.statusCommandSucceeded?`<div class=\"warn\" style=\"margin-top:5px\">Synergy loaded, but status could not be read: ${esc(d.statusError||'unknown error')}</div>`:''}\n      </div>\n    </div>`;\n\n  $('synergyAdvisorState').textContent=d.recommendationState||'';\n  const opts=d.optimizations||[];\n  const recommended=opts\n    .filter(x=>Number((x.recommendation||{}).score||0)>0)\n    .sort((a,b)=>Number((b.recommendation||{}).score||0)-Number((a.recommendation||{}).score||0))\n    .slice(0,6);\n\n  $('synergyAdvisor').innerHTML=recommended.length\n    ? recommended.map((x,i)=>`<div style=\"margin-bottom:9px\">\n        <b>${i+1}. ${esc(x.name)}</b> ${recommendationBadge(x.recommendation)}<br>\n        <span class=\"small\">${esc((x.recommendation||{}).reason||'')}</span>\n      </div>`).join('')\n    : (String(d.recommendationState||'').includes('OFF')\n        ? 'Enable lightweight diagnostics and let them collect for at least 60 seconds. The advisor will rank Synergy options from your actual CPU, entity, GC, chunk, player, and lag evidence.'\n        : 'No Synergy optimization is strongly indicated by the current diagnostics. Avoid toggling features without evidence just because they are available.');\n\n  const categories=[...new Set(opts.map(x=>x.category).filter(Boolean))].sort();\n  const currentCategory=$('synergyCategory').value;\n  $('synergyCategory').innerHTML='<option value=\"\">All categories</option>'+categories.map(x=>`<option value=\"${esc(x)}\">${esc(x)}</option>`).join('');\n  if(categories.includes(currentCategory))$('synergyCategory').value=currentCategory;\n\n  const q=String($('synergyFilter').value||'').trim().toLowerCase();\n  const category=$('synergyCategory').value;\n  const rows=opts\n    .filter(x=>(!category||x.category===category) && (!q||[x.code,x.name,x.description,x.category,x.scope,x.caution,(x.recommendation||{}).reason].some(v=>String(v||'').toLowerCase().includes(q))))\n    .sort((a,b)=>Number((b.recommendation||{}).score||0)-Number((a.recommendation||{}).score||0));\n\n  $('synergyCount').textContent=`${rows.length} / ${opts.length}`;\n  $('synergyRows').innerHTML=rows.length\n    ? rows.map(x=>`<tr>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.name)}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.code)}</div></td>\n        <td class=\"${x.enabled===true?'good':x.enabled===false?'warn':'muted'}\"><b>${x.enabled===true?'ON':x.enabled===false?'OFF':'UNKNOWN'}</b></td>\n        <td>${recommendationBadge(x.recommendation)}<div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:4px;max-width:300px\">${esc((x.recommendation||{}).reason||'')}</div></td>\n        <td><span class=\"optCategory\">${esc(x.scope||'')}</span></td>\n        <td><span class=\"optCategory\">${esc(x.category||'')}</span></td>\n        <td>${esc(x.description||'')}</td>\n        <td class=\"small\" style=\"max-width:300px\">${esc(x.caution||'')}</td>\n        <td><div class=\"optActions\">\n          <button data-synergy-code=\"${esc(x.code)}\" data-enabled=\"true\" class=\"primary\" ${!ready||!x.commandAvailable||experimentLocked||safeModeLocked?'disabled':''}>ON</button>\n          <button data-synergy-code=\"${esc(x.code)}\" data-enabled=\"false\" ${!ready||!x.commandAvailable||experimentLocked||safeModeLocked?'disabled':''}>OFF</button>\n          <button data-synergy-test=\"${esc(x.code)}\" ${!ready||!x.commandAvailable||experimentLocked||safeModeLocked?'disabled':''}>Measure ON</button>\n        </div></td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"muted\">No Synergy optimization matches the current filter.</td></tr>';\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-synergy-code]').forEach(btn=>{\n    btn.onclick=()=>toggleSynergyOptimization(btn.dataset.synergyCode||'',btn.dataset.enabled==='true');\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-synergy-test]').forEach(btn=>{\n    btn.onclick=()=>measureSynergyOptimization(btn.dataset.synergyTest||'');\n  });\n\n  const supports=d.supports||{};\n  $('synergyStatus').disabled=!ready;\n  $('synergyStats').disabled=!ready||!supports.stats;\n  $('synergyReload').disabled=!ready||!supports.reload||safeModeLocked;\n  $('synergyDiagOn').disabled=!ready||!supports.diagnostics||safeModeLocked;\n  $('synergyDiagOff').disabled=!ready||!supports.diagnostics||safeModeLocked;\n  $('synergyDiagDump').disabled=!ready||!supports.diagnostics;\n  $('synergyDiagReset').disabled=!ready||!supports.diagnostics||safeModeLocked;\n  $('synergyAllOn').disabled=!ready||!supports.all||experimentLocked||safeModeLocked;\n  $('synergyAllOff').disabled=!ready||!supports.all||experimentLocked||safeModeLocked;\n}\n\nasync function loadSynergy(){\n  $('synergyBanner').innerHTML='<div class=\"empty\">Checking Synergy installation, status, and command catalog…</div>';\n  try{\n    synergyStatusData=await api('/api/optimizations/synergy');\n    renderSynergy();\n    if(!tungstenStatusData)renderOptimizationExperiment(synergyStatusData);\n  }catch(e){\n    synergyStatusData=null;\n    $('synergyBanner').innerHTML=`<div class=\"errorBox\">${esc(e.message)}</div>`;\n    $('synergyRows').innerHTML='<tr><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"bad\">Unable to load Synergy integration status.</td></tr>';\n  }\n}\n\nasync function loadOptimizations(){\n  await Promise.allSettled([loadTungsten(),loadSynergy()]);\n}\n\nfunction synergyCommandOutput(result){\n  const when=new Date().toLocaleTimeString();\n  $('synergyOutput').textContent=`[${when}]\\nCommand: ${result.command||'(unknown)'}\\nStatus: ${result.status||'Unknown'}\\nSuccess: ${result.success?'YES':'NO'}\\n\\n${result.message||'No message returned.'}`;\n}\n\nasync function runSynergyAction(action){\n  if(synergyBusy)return;\n  synergySetBusy(true);\n  try{\n    const result=await api('/api/optimizations/synergy/action',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action,module:'all'})});\n    synergyCommandOutput(result);\n    toast(result.message||'Synergy command completed.',result.success?'success':'error');\n    if(action==='status'||action==='reload')await loadSynergy();\n  }catch(e){\n    $('synergyOutput').textContent=`Command failed: ${e.message}`;\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{\n    synergySetBusy(false);\n    if(synergyStatusData)renderSynergy();\n  }\n}\n\nasync function toggleSynergyOptimization(code,enabled){\n  if(synergyBusy)return;\n  synergySetBusy(true);\n  try{\n    const result=await api('/api/optimizations/synergy/toggle',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({code,enabled})});\n    synergyCommandOutput(result);\n    toast(`${code}: ${enabled?'ON':'OFF'} saved. Restart required.`,'success');\n    await loadSynergy();\n  }catch(e){\n    $('synergyOutput').textContent=`${code}: ${e.message}`;\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{\n    synergySetBusy(false);\n    if(synergyStatusData)renderSynergy();\n  }\n}\n\nasync function measureSynergyOptimization(code){\n  if(synergyBusy)return;\n  synergySetBusy(true);\n  try{\n    const result=await api('/api/optimizations/synergy/test',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({code,enabled:true})});\n    synergyCommandOutput(result);\n    toast(result.message||'Measured Synergy baseline saved.','success');\n    await loadOptimizations();\n  }catch(e){\n    $('synergyOutput').textContent=`Measured test failed: ${e.message}`;\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{\n    synergySetBusy(false);\n    if(synergyStatusData)renderSynergy();\n  }\n}\n\nasync function toggleAllSynergy(enabled){\n  if(synergyBusy)return;\n  synergySetBusy(true);\n  try{\n    const result=await api('/api/optimizations/synergy/all',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({enabled})});\n    synergyCommandOutput(result);\n    toast(`Synergy all ${enabled?'ON':'OFF'} saved. Restart required.`,'success');\n    await loadSynergy();\n  }catch(e){\n    $('synergyOutput').textContent=e.message;\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{\n    synergySetBusy(false);\n    if(synergyStatusData)renderSynergy();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction tungstenCommandOutput(result){\n  const when=new Date().toLocaleTimeString();\n  $('tungstenOutput').textContent=\n`[${when}]\nCommand: ${result.command||'(unknown)'}\nStatus: ${result.status||'Unknown'}\nSuccess: ${result.success?'YES':'NO'}\n\n${result.message||'No message returned.'}`;\n}\n\nasync function runTungstenAction(action,extra={}){\n  if(tungstenBusy)return;\n  tungstenSetBusy(true);\n  try{\n    const result=await api('/api/optimizations/tungsten/action',{\n      method:'POST',\n      body:JSON.stringify(Object.assign({action},extra))\n    });\n    tungstenCommandOutput(result);\n    toast(result.message||'Tungsten command completed.',result.success?'success':'error');\n  }catch(e){\n    $('tungstenOutput').textContent=`Command failed: ${e.message}`;\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{\n    tungstenSetBusy(false);\n    renderTungsten();\n  }\n}\n\nasync function toggleTungstenOptimization(code,enabled){\n  if(tungstenBusy)return;\n  tungstenSetBusy(true);\n  try{\n    const result=await api('/api/optimizations/tungsten/toggle',{\n      method:'POST',\n      body:JSON.stringify({code,enabled})\n    });\n    tungstenCommandOutput(result);\n    toast(`${code}: ${enabled?'ON':'OFF'} requested. Restart may be required.`,'success');\n  }catch(e){\n    $('tungstenOutput').textContent=`${code}: ${e.message}`;\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{\n    tungstenSetBusy(false);\n    renderTungsten();\n  }\n}\n\nasync function measureTungstenOptimization(code){\n  if(tungstenBusy)return;\n  tungstenSetBusy(true);\n  try{\n    const result=await api('/api/optimizations/tungsten/test',{\n      method:'POST',\n      body:JSON.stringify({code,enabled:true})\n    });\n    tungstenCommandOutput(result);\n    toast(result.message||'Measured optimization baseline saved.','success');\n    await loadOptimizations();\n  }catch(e){\n    $('tungstenOutput').textContent=`Measured test failed: ${e.message}`;\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{\n    tungstenSetBusy(false);\n    if(tungstenStatusData)renderTungsten();\n  }\n}\n\nasync function evaluateOptimizationExperiment(allowSameRuntime=false){\n  if(tungstenBusy||synergyBusy)return;\n  tungstenSetBusy(true);\n  try{\n    const result=await api('/api/optimizations/experiment/evaluate',{\n      method:'POST',\n      body:JSON.stringify({allowSameRuntime})\n    });\n    toast(result.message||'Optimization experiment evaluated.','success');\n    await loadOptimizations();\n  }catch(e){\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n    await loadOptimizations();\n  }finally{\n    tungstenSetBusy(false);\n    if(tungstenStatusData)renderTungsten();\n  }\n}\n\nasync function toggleAllTungsten(enabled){\n  if(tungstenBusy)return;\n  tungstenSetBusy(true);\n  try{\n    const result=await api('/api/optimizations/tungsten/all',{\n      method:'POST',\n      body:JSON.stringify({enabled})\n    });\n    tungstenCommandOutput(result);\n    toast(`Tungsten all ${enabled?'ON':'OFF'} requested. Restart may be required.`,'success');\n  }catch(e){\n    $('tungstenOutput').textContent=e.message;\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{\n    tungstenSetBusy(false);\n    renderTungsten();\n  }\n}\n\n$('tungstenRefresh').onclick=loadTungsten;\n$('synergyRefresh').onclick=loadSynergy;\n$('synergyStatus').onclick=()=>runSynergyAction('status');\n$('synergyStats').onclick=()=>runSynergyAction('stats');\n$('synergyReload').onclick=()=>runSynergyAction('reload');\n$('synergyDiagOn').onclick=()=>runSynergyAction('diag-on');\n$('synergyDiagOff').onclick=()=>runSynergyAction('diag-off');\n$('synergyDiagDump').onclick=()=>runSynergyAction('diag-dump');\n$('synergyDiagReset').onclick=()=>runSynergyAction('diag-reset');\n$('synergyAllOn').onclick=()=>toggleAllSynergy(true);\n$('synergyAllOff').onclick=()=>toggleAllSynergy(false);\n$('synergyClearOutput').onclick=()=>{$('synergyOutput').textContent='No Synergy command has been run from the web dashboard yet.';};\n$('synergyFilter').oninput=renderSynergy;\n$('synergyCategory').onchange=renderSynergy;\n$('tungstenEnableDiagnostics').onclick=async()=>{\n  try{\n    await api('/api/profiler/enabled',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({enabled:true})});\n    toast('Diagnostic sampling enabled. Let it collect for at least 60 seconds before Measure ON.','success');\n    await loadOptimizations();\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n};\n$('tungstenOpenProfiler').onclick=()=>setSection('profiler',true);\n$('optimizationEvaluate').onclick=()=>evaluateOptimizationExperiment(false);\n$('tungstenStatus').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('status');\n$('tungstenStats').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('stats');\n$('tungstenHealth').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('health');\n$('tungstenManifest').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('manifest');\n$('tungstenReload').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('reload');\n$('tungstenAllOn').onclick=()=>toggleAllTungsten(true);\n$('tungstenAllOff').onclick=()=>toggleAllTungsten(false);\n$('tungstenBenchmarkOn').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('benchmark-on');\n$('tungstenBenchmarkOff').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('benchmark-off');\n$('tungstenFrameOn').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('frameprofiler-on',{thresholdMs:Number($('tungstenFrameThreshold').value||100)});\n$('tungstenFrameOff').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('frameprofiler-off');\n$('tungstenDiagOn').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('diag-on',{module:$('tungstenDiagModule').value});\n$('tungstenDiagOff').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('diag-off',{module:$('tungstenDiagModule').value});\n$('tungstenDiagDump').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('diag-dump',{module:$('tungstenDiagModule').value});\n$('tungstenDiagReset').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('diag-reset',{module:$('tungstenDiagModule').value});\n$('tungstenStatsOn').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('stats-on');\n$('tungstenStatsOff').onclick=()=>runTungstenAction('stats-off');\n$('tungstenClearOutput').onclick=()=>$('tungstenOutput').textContent='No Tungsten command has been run from the web dashboard yet.';\n$('tungstenFilter').addEventListener('input',renderTungsten);\n$('tungstenCategory').addEventListener('change',renderTungsten);\n\nfunction fmtAdminDuration(seconds){\n  seconds=Math.max(0,Number(seconds||0));\n  if(seconds>=86400)return `${(seconds/86400).toFixed(1)}d`;\n  if(seconds>=3600)return `${(seconds/3600).toFixed(1)}h`;\n  if(seconds>=60)return `${(seconds/60).toFixed(1)}m`;\n  return `${Math.round(seconds)}s`;\n}\n\nfunction fmtAdminTime(ms){\n  ms=Number(ms||0);\n  return ms>0?new Date(ms).toLocaleString():'—';\n}\n\nfunction fmtAdminRelativeTime(ms){\n  ms=Number(ms||0);\n  if(ms<=0)return 'Never';\n  let seconds=Math.max(0,Math.floor((Date.now()-ms)/1000));\n  if(seconds<60)return 'Just now';\n  const minutes=Math.floor(seconds/60);\n  if(minutes<60)return `${minutes}m ago`;\n  const hours=Math.floor(minutes/60);\n  if(hours<24)return `${hours}h ago`;\n  const days=Math.floor(hours/24);\n  if(days<30)return `${days}d ago`;\n  const months=Math.floor(days/30);\n  if(months<12)return `${months}mo ago`;\n  return `${Math.floor(days/365)}y ago`;\n}\n\nfunction playerIdentityText(p,realKey='name'){\n  const real=String(p?.[realKey]||'').trim();\n  const nick=String(p?.nickname||'').trim();\n  return nick&&(!real||nick.toLowerCase()!==real.toLowerCase())?`${nick} (${real})`:real;\n}\n\nfunction playerIdentityHtml(p,realKey='name',showUid=false){\n  const real=String(p?.[realKey]||'').trim();\n  const nick=String(p?.nickname||'').trim();\n  const hasNick=!!nick&&(!real||nick.toLowerCase()!==real.toLowerCase());\n  const uid=showUid?String(p?.playerUid||'').trim():'';\n  if(hasNick)return `<b>${esc(nick)}</b><div class=\"small\">${real?`Real: ${esc(real)}`:''}${real&&uid?' · ':''}${uid?esc(uid):''}</div>`;\n  return `<b>${esc(real||nick||'Unknown')}</b>${uid?`<div class=\"small\">${esc(uid)}</div>`:''}`;\n}\n\nfunction renderAdminPlayerList(){\n  const onlineRows=adminPlayersData.filter(x=>!!x.online);\n  const offlineRows=adminPlayersData.filter(x=>!x.online);\n  $('adminOnlineCount').textContent=onlineRows.length;\n  $('adminOfflineCount').textContent=offlineRows.length;\n  document.querySelectorAll('#adminPlayerTabs button').forEach(btn=>btn.classList.toggle('active',btn.dataset.playerTab===adminPlayerTab));\n  $('adminLastSeenFilter').disabled=adminPlayerTab==='online';\n\n  const q=String($('adminPlayerFilter')?.value||'').trim().toLowerCase();\n  const lastSeenWindow=Number($('adminLastSeenFilter')?.value||0);\n  const sortMode=String($('adminPlayerSort')?.value||'recent');\n  const now=Date.now();\n  const visible=(adminPlayerTab==='online'?onlineRows:offlineRows).filter(p=>{\n    if(q&&!`${p.nickname||''} ${p.name||''} ${p.playerUid||''} ${p.role||''}`.toLowerCase().includes(q))return false;\n    if(adminPlayerTab==='offline'&&lastSeenWindow>0&&now-Number(p.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds||0)>lastSeenWindow*1000)return false;\n    return true;\n  }).slice();\n  if(sortMode==='name')visible.sort((a,b)=>playerIdentityText(a).localeCompare(playerIdentityText(b)));\n  else if(sortMode==='playtime')visible.sort((a,b)=>Number(b.totalPlaySeconds||0)-Number(a.totalPlaySeconds||0));\n  else if(sortMode==='warnings')visible.sort((a,b)=>Number(b.activeWarnings||0)-Number(a.activeWarnings||0)||playerIdentityText(a).localeCompare(playerIdentityText(b)));\n  else if(adminPlayerTab==='online')visible.sort((a,b)=>Number(a.afk)-Number(b.afk)||playerIdentityText(a).localeCompare(playerIdentityText(b)));\n  else visible.sort((a,b)=>Number(b.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds||0)-Number(a.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds||0)||String(a.name||'').localeCompare(String(b.name||'')));\n\n  $('adminPlayerTabSummary').textContent=adminPlayerTab==='online'\n    ? `${visible.length}${q?` of ${onlineRows.length}`:''} online · ${onlineRows.filter(x=>x.afk).length} AFK`\n    : `${visible.length}${(q||Number($('adminLastSeenFilter')?.value||0)>0)?` of ${offlineRows.length}`:''} offline · ${String($('adminPlayerSort')?.value||'recent')==='recent'?'newest Last Seen first':'sorted '+String($('adminPlayerSort')?.value||'recent')}`;\n\n  $('adminPlayerRows').innerHTML=visible.length?visible.map(p=>{\n    const restrictions=[p.muted?'Muted':'',p.banned?'Temp banned':'',p.frozen?'Frozen':'',p.jailed?'Jailed':''].filter(Boolean).join(', ')||'—';\n    const status=p.online?(p.afk?'<span class=\"badge warn\">AFK</span>':'<span class=\"badge ok\">ONLINE</span>'):'<span class=\"badge\">OFFLINE</span>';\n    const lastSeen=p.online\n      ? `<span class=\"badge ok\">Now</span><div class=\"small\">Session ${esc(fmtAdminDuration(p.sessionSeconds||0))}</div>`\n      : `<b>${esc(fmtAdminRelativeTime(p.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds))}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(fmtAdminTime(p.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds))}</div>`;\n    const playerListClient=p.online?(p.playerListClientDetected?`<span class=\"badge ok\">Detected</span><div class=\"small\">${esc(p.playerListClientVersion||'version unknown')}</div>`:'<span class=\"badge\">Not detected</span>'):'—';\n    return `<tr data-ui-player=\"${esc(p.playerUid)}\"><td>${playerIdentityHtml(p,'name',true)}</td><td>${status}</td><td>${esc(p.role||'')}</td><td>${p.online?esc(p.pingMilliseconds)+' ms':'—'}</td><td>${playerListClient}</td><td>${lastSeen}</td><td>${esc(fmtAdminDuration(p.totalPlaySeconds))}</td><td>${esc(p.activeWarnings||0)}</td><td>${esc(restrictions)}</td><td><button onclick=\"selectAdminPlayer('${esc(p.playerUid)}')\">Manage</button></td></tr>`;\n  }).join(''):`<tr><td colspan=\"10\" class=\"muted\">No ${esc(adminPlayerTab)} players.</td></tr>`;\n}\n\nfunction setAdminPlayerTab(tab){\n  if(tab!=='online' && tab!=='offline')return;\n  adminPlayerTab=tab;\n  localStorage.setItem('nsu.adminPlayerTab',tab);\n  renderAdminPlayerList();\n}\n\nasync function loadAdmin(showLoading=true,refreshSelected=true){\n  if(adminListRequestInFlight)return;\n  adminListRequestInFlight=true;\n  if(showLoading){\n    $('adminState').textContent='Loading…';\n    $('adminPlayerRows').innerHTML='<tr><td colspan=\"10\" class=\"muted\">Loading players…</td></tr>';\n  }\n  try{\n    const [players,status]=await Promise.all([api('/api/admin/players'),api('/api/admin/status')]);\n    adminPlayersData=players.players||[];\n    adminStatusData=status||{};\n    const now=Date.now();\n    const online=adminPlayersData.filter(x=>x.online).length;\n    const afk=adminPlayersData.filter(x=>x.online&&x.afk).length;\n    const seen7d=adminPlayersData.filter(x=>x.online||(Number(x.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds||0)>0&&now-Number(x.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds)<7*86400000)).length;\n    const restricted=adminPlayersData.filter(x=>x.muted||x.banned||x.frozen||x.jailed).length;\n    const warnings=adminPlayersData.reduce((n,x)=>n+Number(x.activeWarnings||0),0);\n    const totalPlayerTimeSeconds=adminPlayersData.reduce((n,x)=>n+Math.max(0,Number(x.totalPlaySeconds||0)),0);\n    $('adminMetrics').innerHTML=[\n      ['Online Players',online,`${afk} AFK · ${adminPlayersData.length-online} offline`],\n      ['Player List Clients',adminPlayersData.filter(x=>x.online&&x.playerListClientDetected).length,'Companion handshakes detected'],\n      ['Supporter Nicknames',adminPlayersData.filter(x=>String(x.nickname||'').trim()).length,'Saved presentation-only nicknames'],\n      ['Seen in 7 Days',seen7d,`${adminPlayersData.length} total tracked players`],\n      ['Active Warnings',warnings,'Across tracked players'],\n      ['Restricted Players',restricted,'Muted / banned / frozen / jailed'],\n      ['Admin Audit',(status.audit||[]).length,'Recent entries loaded'],\n      ['Total Player Time',fmtAdminDuration(totalPlayerTimeSeconds),`Combined tracked playtime · ${adminPlayersData.length} players`]\n    ].map(x=>`<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"metricLabel\">${esc(x[0])}</div><div class=\"metricValue\">${esc(x[1])}</div><div class=\"small\">${esc(x[2])}</div></div>`).join('');\n\n    renderAdminPlayerList();\n\n    const m=status.maintenance||{};\n    $('adminMaintenanceState').textContent=m.enabled?`ON · ${m.reason||'Maintenance'}${m.untilUnixMilliseconds?` · until ${fmtAdminTime(m.untilUnixMilliseconds)}`:''}`:'OFF';\n    const sh=status.shutdown||{};\n    $('adminShutdownState').textContent=Number(sh.atUnixMilliseconds||0)>Date.now()?`Scheduled ${fmtAdminTime(sh.atUnixMilliseconds)} · ${sh.reason||''}`:'Not scheduled';\n    $('adminAuditRows').innerHTML=(status.audit||[]).length?(status.audit||[]).map(a=>`<tr><td>${esc(fmtAdminTime(a.unixMilliseconds))}</td><td>${esc(a.actor)}</td><td>${esc(a.action)}</td><td>${esc(a.targetName||'server')}</td><td>${esc(a.source)}</td><td>${esc(a.detail)}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No administration audit entries yet.</td></tr>';\n    const undo=status.undo||{};\n    $('adminUndo').disabled=!undo.available;\n    $('adminUndo').title=undo.available?`Undo: ${undo.description||''}`:'Nothing reversible to undo';\n    $('adminState').textContent=`${online} online · ${adminPlayersData.length} tracked${undo.available?` · Undo: ${undo.description}`:''}`;\n\n    if(refreshSelected&&adminSelectedPlayer)await selectAdminPlayer(adminSelectedPlayer,false);\n  }catch(e){\n    $('adminState').textContent=e.message;\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{adminListRequestInFlight=false;}\n}\n\nfunction dbStorageSeverityClass(value){\n  value=String(value||'Info').toLowerCase();\n  return value==='watch'||value==='warning'?'watch':'info';\n}\n\nfunction renderAdminDatabaseStorageGraph(){\n  const canvas=$('adminDatabaseStorageGraph');\n  const state=$('adminDatabaseStorageGraphState');\n  if(!canvas)return;\n  const dbs=(adminDatabaseStorageData?.databases||[]).filter(x=>x&&x.available!==false);\n  const {ctx,w,h}=resizeCanvas(canvas);\n  ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);\n  adminDatabaseStorageGraphHitAreas=[];\n  ctx.font='11px system-ui';\n\n  if(!dbs.length){\n    ctx.fillStyle='#8492a0';ctx.fillText('No database storage totals available.',18,26);\n    if(state)state.textContent='No storage data';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const rows=dbs.map(db=>{\n    const database=Math.max(0,Number(db.databaseBytes||0));\n    const wal=Math.max(0,Number(db.walBytes||0));\n    const shm=Math.max(0,Number(db.shmBytes||0));\n    const backups=Math.max(0,Number(db.backupBytes||0));\n    return{db,database,wal,shm,backups,total:database+wal+shm+backups};\n  });\n  const maxTotal=Math.max(1,...rows.map(x=>x.total));\n  const totalAll=rows.reduce((n,x)=>n+x.total,0);\n  const pad={l:145,r:86,t:26,b:34};\n  const plotW=Math.max(80,w-pad.l-pad.r),plotH=Math.max(80,h-pad.t-pad.b);\n  const rowH=plotH/Math.max(1,rows.length);\n  const barH=Math.min(34,Math.max(22,rowH*.42));\n  const colors={database:'#5d9bd0',wal:'#6fb8a8',shm:'#8794a0',backups:'#9a7cc1'};\n\n  ctx.fillStyle='#0b1218';ctx.fillRect(pad.l,pad.t,plotW,plotH);\n  ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(86,108,124,.18)';ctx.lineWidth=1;\n  for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){\n    const x=pad.l+plotW*i/4;\n    ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x,pad.t);ctx.lineTo(x,pad.t+plotH);ctx.stroke();\n    const label=formatBytesTotal(maxTotal*i/4);\n    ctx.fillStyle='#6f8292';ctx.font='10px system-ui';\n    const tw=ctx.measureText(label).width;\n    ctx.fillText(label,Math.max(pad.l,Math.min(w-pad.r-tw,x-tw/2)),h-9);\n  }\n\n  rows.forEach((row,i)=>{\n    const cy=pad.t+rowH*i+rowH/2;\n    const y=cy-barH/2;\n    const name=String(row.db.name||row.db.key||'Database');\n    ctx.font='11px system-ui';ctx.fillStyle=i===adminDatabaseStorageGraphHover?'#f0f6fb':'#c6d2dc';\n    const label=name.length>22?name.slice(0,21)+'…':name;\n    ctx.fillText(label,10,cy+4);\n\n    ctx.fillStyle='#111b23';ctx.fillRect(pad.l,y,plotW,barH);\n    ctx.strokeStyle=i===adminDatabaseStorageGraphHover?'#466984':'#263744';ctx.strokeRect(pad.l+.5,y+.5,plotW-1,barH-1);\n    let x=pad.l;\n    for(const key of ['database','wal','shm','backups']){\n      const value=row[key];\n      if(value<=0)continue;\n      const segW=(value/maxTotal)*plotW;\n      if(segW>0.4){ctx.fillStyle=colors[key];ctx.fillRect(x,y+1,Math.max(.5,segW),barH-2);}\n      x+=segW;\n    }\n    ctx.font='11px system-ui';ctx.fillStyle='#d8e3eb';\n    const totalLabel=formatBytesTotal(row.total);\n    ctx.fillText(totalLabel,w-pad.r+10,cy+4);\n    adminDatabaseStorageGraphHitAreas.push({index:i,x:0,y:pad.t+rowH*i,w,h:rowH,row});\n  });\n\n  if(state)state.textContent=`${formatBytesTotal(totalAll)} total`;\n}\n\nfunction renderAdminDatabaseStorage(){\n  const d=adminDatabaseStorageData||{};\n  const dbs=d.databases||[];\n  const totalLive=dbs.reduce((n,x)=>n+Number(x.databaseBytes||0)+Number(x.walBytes||0)+Number(x.shmBytes||0),0);\n  const totalBackups=dbs.reduce((n,x)=>n+Number(x.backupBytes||0),0);\n  const totalFree=dbs.reduce((n,x)=>n+Number(x.freeBytes||0),0);\n  const totalIndexes=dbs.reduce((n,x)=>n+Number(x.indexBytes||0),0);\n  const analyzed=!!d.detailedAnalysisAvailable||Number(d.detailedAnalysisUnixMilliseconds||0)>0;\n  const analyzedAt=Number(d.detailedAnalysisUnixMilliseconds||0);\n\n  $('adminDatabaseStorageState').textContent=analyzed\n    ? `Analyzed ${fmtAdminRelativeTime(analyzedAt)} · cached`\n    : 'File totals only · analysis not run';\n  $('adminDatabaseStorageSummary').innerHTML=[\n    ['Live SQLite + WAL',formatBytesTotal(totalLive),'Current database files and sidecars'],\n    ['Retained Backups',formatBytesTotal(totalBackups),`${dbs.reduce((n,x)=>n+Number(x.backupCount||0),0)} backup file(s)`],\n    ['Reclaimable Free Pages',analyzed?formatBytesTotal(totalFree):'Analyze',analyzed?'Allocated DB pages currently unused':'Requires page analysis'],\n    ['Index Footprint',dbs.every(x=>!x.available||x.detailed)?formatBytesTotal(totalIndexes):'Unknown','Exact sizes require SQLite page statistics']\n  ].map(x=>`<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"metricLabel\">${esc(x[0])}</div><div class=\"metricValue\" style=\"font-size:19px\">${esc(x[1])}</div><div class=\"small\">${esc(x[2])}</div></div>`).join('');\n  renderAdminDatabaseStorageGraph();\n\n  const recs=d.recommendations||[];\n  $('adminDatabaseStorageRecommendations').innerHTML=recs.length\n    ? recs.map(r=>`<div class=\"dbStorageRecommendation ${dbStorageSeverityClass(r.severity)}\"><b>${esc(r.database||'Database')} · ${esc(r.area||'Storage')}</b><div>${esc(r.finding||'')}</div><div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:4px\"><b>Improve:</b> ${esc(r.improvement||'')}</div><div class=\"small\"><b>Safety:</b> ${esc(r.safety||'Review first')}</div></div>`).join('')\n    : '<div class=\"infoBox\"><b>How to use this:</b> Analyze Storage calculates SQLite page ownership for each Suite table and its indexes. The recommendations explain which retention/configuration lever is safer than manually deleting database files or rows.</div>';\n\n  $('adminDatabaseStorageDatabases').innerHTML=dbs.length?dbs.map(db=>{\n    const live=Number(db.databaseBytes||0),wal=Number(db.walBytes||0),shm=Number(db.shmBytes||0),backups=Number(db.backupBytes||0);\n    const rows=db.tables||[];\n    const contents=db.contents||[];\n    const contentView=contents.length?`<div class=\"dbStorageContents\">\n      <div class=\"dbStorageContentsHeader\"><div><b>Stored contents</b><div class=\"small\">What this SQLite database actually contains.</div></div><div class=\"spacer\"></div><span class=\"small\">${db.detailed?'Record counts and sizes are from the last analysis.':db.payloadEstimates?'See labeled payload estimates below; exact page sizes are unavailable.':'Run Analyze Storage for approximate record counts and per-area size.'}</span></div>\n      <div class=\"dbStorageContentGrid\">${contents.map(x=>{\n        const analyzed=!!x.analyzed;\n        const present=x.present!==false;\n        const stats=analyzed&&present\n          ? `<div class=\"dbStorageContentStats\"><span><b>${Number(x.approxRows||0).toLocaleString()}</b> approx. records</span><span><b>${esc(formatBytesTotal(x.totalBytes||0))}</b> incl. indexes</span></div>`\n          : `<div class=\"dbStorageContentStats\"><span>${present?(db.payloadEstimates?'See payload estimates below':'Size/count pending analysis'):'Table not present'}</span></div>`;\n        return `<div class=\"dbStorageContent ${present?'':'missing'}\">\n          <div class=\"dbStorageContentTop\"><span class=\"dbStorageSubsystem\">${esc(x.subsystem||'Suite')}</span><code>${esc(x.tableName||'')}</code></div>\n          <b class=\"dbStorageContentTitle\">${esc(x.displayName||x.tableName||'Data')}</b>\n          <div class=\"small\">${esc(x.description||'')}</div>\n          <div class=\"dbStorageStoredFields\"><b>Stores:</b> ${esc(x.storedFields||'Suite-managed data')}</div>\n          ${stats}\n        </div>`;\n      }).join('')}</div>\n    </div>`:'';\n    const estimateView=db.payloadEstimates&&rows.length?`<div class=\"infoBox\"><b>Payload estimates · indexes excluded</b><p>${esc(db.analysisMessage)}</p></div><div class=\"tableWrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Data area</th><th>Subsystem / stored fields</th><th>Records</th><th>Estimated payload</th><th>Sample</th><th>Growth / safe improvement</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(x=>`<tr><td><b>${esc(x.displayName)}</b><br><code>${esc(x.name)}</code></td><td>${esc(x.subsystem)}<br>${esc(x.storedFields)}</td><td>${x.rowCountKnown?Number(x.approxRows).toLocaleString():'Unknown (scan limit)'}</td><td>${x.rowCountKnown&&x.sampledRows?esc(formatBytesTotal(x.estimatedPayloadBytes)):'Unknown'}</td><td>${Number(x.sampledRows||0)} records<br>${esc(formatBytesTotal(x.averagePayloadBytes||0))} avg. payload</td><td>${esc(x.growthDriver)}<br>${esc(x.improvement)}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`:'';\n    const detail=db.detailed&&rows.length?`<div class=\"tableWrap dataScroll\"><table>\n      <thead><tr><th>Data area</th><th>Subsystem / stored fields</th><th>Approx. records</th><th>Table data</th><th>Indexes</th><th>Total</th><th>Share</th><th>What grows it / how to improve</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>${rows.map(x=>{\n        const pct=Math.max(0,Math.min(100,Number(x.percentOfDatabase||0)));\n        return `<tr>\n          <td><b>${esc(x.displayName||x.name||'')}</b><div class=\"small\"><code>${esc(x.name||'')}</code></div></td>\n          <td class=\"dbStorageFields\"><b>${esc(x.subsystem||'Suite')}</b><div>${esc(x.storedFields||'Suite-managed data')}</div></td>\n          <td>${Number(x.approxRows||0).toLocaleString()}</td>\n          <td>${esc(formatBytesTotal(x.dataBytes))}</td>\n          <td>${esc(formatBytesTotal(x.indexBytes))}</td>\n          <td><b>${esc(formatBytesTotal(x.totalBytes))}</b></td>\n          <td class=\"dbStorageShare\"><b>${pct.toFixed(1)}%</b><div class=\"dbStorageBar\"><span style=\"width:${pct.toFixed(1)}%\"></span></div></td>\n          <td class=\"dbStorageGuidance\"><b>${esc(x.description||'')}</b><div>${esc(x.improvement||'')}</div><div class=\"growth\"><b>Growth driver:</b> ${esc(x.growthDriver||'')}</div><div class=\"small\"><b>Safety:</b> ${esc(x.safety||'Review first')}</div></td>\n        </tr>`;\n      }).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`\n      : `<div class=\"emptyAction\"><b>Detailed table usage has not been calculated for this database.</b><br>${esc(db.analysisMessage||'Press Analyze Storage to scan SQLite page metadata.')}</div>`;\n    return `<div class=\"dbStorageDatabase\">\n      <div class=\"dbStorageDatabaseHeader\"><div><h4>${esc(db.name||db.key||'Database')}</h4><div class=\"small\"><code>${esc(db.fileName||'database unavailable')}</code>${db.retentionDays>0?` · ${Number(db.retentionDays)} day retention`:''}</div></div><div class=\"spacer\"></div><div><b>${esc(formatBytesTotal(live))}</b><div class=\"small\">live DB</div></div></div>\n      ${contentView}\n      ${db.detailed?`<div class=\"infoBox\"><b>Largest contributors (including indexes)</b><br>${Object.entries(rows.reduce((map,x)=>{map[x.subsystem]=(map[x.subsystem]||0)+Number(x.totalBytes||0);return map;},{})).sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1]).map(([key,value])=>`${esc(key)}: <b>${esc(formatBytesTotal(value))}</b>`).join(' · ')}</div>`:''}\n      <div class=\"dbStorageBreakdown\">\n        <div class=\"miniStat\"><span class=\"small\">Database file</span><b>${esc(formatBytesTotal(live))}</b></div>\n        <div class=\"miniStat\"><span class=\"small\">WAL</span><b>${esc(formatBytesTotal(wal))}</b></div>\n        <div class=\"miniStat\"><span class=\"small\">Shared memory</span><b>${esc(formatBytesTotal(shm))}</b></div>\n        <div class=\"miniStat\"><span class=\"small\">Backups</span><b>${esc(formatBytesTotal(backups))}</b><span class=\"small\">${Number(db.backupCount||0)} file(s)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"miniStat\"><span class=\"small\">Free pages</span><b>${db.pageCount>0?esc(formatBytesTotal(db.freeBytes)):'—'}</b></div>\n        <div class=\"miniStat\"><span class=\"small\">SQLite overhead</span><b>${db.detailed?esc(formatBytesTotal(db.sqliteOverheadBytes)):'—'}</b></div>\n      </div>\n      ${estimateView||detail}\n    </div>`;\n  }).join(''):'<div class=\"emptyAction\"><b>No Suite SQLite databases are currently available.</b></div>';\n}\n\nasync function loadAdminDatabaseStorage(runAnalysis=false){\n  if(adminDatabaseStorageBusy){if(runAnalysis)adminDatabaseAnalysisPending=true;return;}\n  adminDatabaseStorageBusy=true;\n  const analyzeBtn=$('adminDatabaseStorageAnalyze');\n  const refreshBtn=$('adminDatabaseStorageRefresh');\n  if(analyzeBtn)analyzeBtn.disabled=true;\n  if(refreshBtn)refreshBtn.disabled=true;\n  try{\n    if(runAnalysis){\n      analyzeBtn.disabled=true;\n      analyzeBtn.textContent='Analyzing…';\n      $('adminDatabaseStorageState').textContent='Analyzing SQLite pages…';\n    }\n    adminDatabaseStorageData=await api('/api/admin/database-storage'+(runAnalysis?'/analyze':''),runAnalysis?{method:'POST',body:'{}'}:{});\n    renderAdminDatabaseStorage();\n    if(runAnalysis)toast('Database storage analysis complete.','success');\n  }catch(e){\n    $('adminDatabaseStorageState').textContent=e.message;\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{\n    adminDatabaseStorageBusy=false;\n    if(analyzeBtn){analyzeBtn.disabled=false;analyzeBtn.textContent='Analyze Storage';}\n    if(refreshBtn)refreshBtn.disabled=false;\n    // Queue at most one explicit page analysis behind a file-total request.\n    // Repeated refreshes never start concurrent scans or replace a newer result.\n    if(adminDatabaseAnalysisPending){adminDatabaseAnalysisPending=false;await loadAdminDatabaseStorage(true);}\n  }\n}\n\nasync function selectAdminPlayer(player,showLoading=true){\n  adminSelectedPlayer=player||'';\n  if(!adminSelectedPlayer)return;\n  const requestedPlayer=adminSelectedPlayer,requestVersion=++adminPlayerRequestVersion;\n  resetInvestigation();\n  adminInventoryStatus={message:'Loading inventory…'};adminInventoryData=[];adminInventorySnapshots=[];adminSelectedInventorySlot=null;renderAdminInventory();renderAdminInventorySnapshots();\n  $('adminPlayerDetail').style.display='block';\n  if(showLoading)$('adminPlayerTitle').textContent='Loading player…';\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/admin/player?details=summary&player='+encodeURIComponent(requestedPlayer));\n    if(requestVersion!==adminPlayerRequestVersion)return;\n    const p=d.player||{};\n    adminSelectedPlayer=p.playerUid||adminSelectedPlayer;\n    $('adminPlayerTitle').textContent=playerIdentityText(p)||adminSelectedPlayer;\n    $('adminPlayerMeta').textContent=`${p.nickname?`Real account: ${p.name||'—'} · `:''}${p.online?'Online':'Offline'} · ${p.role||''} · ${p.gameMode||''}`;\n    $('adminPlayerSummary').innerHTML=[\n      ['Identity',playerIdentityText(p)||p.name||'—',p.nickname?`Supporter nickname · authoritative account: ${p.name||'—'}`:`Authoritative account · ${p.playerUid||''}`],\n      ['Status',p.online?(p.afk?'AFK':'ONLINE'):'OFFLINE',p.online?`${p.pingMilliseconds||0} ms · idle ${fmtAdminDuration(p.idleSeconds||0)}`:'Not currently connected'],\n      ['Last Seen',p.online?'Online now':fmtAdminRelativeTime(p.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds),p.online?`Session started ${fmtAdminTime(Date.now()-Number(p.sessionSeconds||0)*1000)}`:fmtAdminTime(p.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds)],\n      ['First Seen',fmtAdminTime(p.firstSeenUnixMilliseconds),'First recorded by Server Essentials'],\n      ['Position',p.position||'—',p.online?'Current server position':'Offline'],\n      ['Health',p.online?`${Number(p.health||0).toFixed(1)} / ${Number(p.maxHealth||0).toFixed(1)}`:'—','Read from player entity'],\n      ['Playtime',fmtAdminDuration(p.totalPlaySeconds),p.online?`Current session ${fmtAdminDuration(p.sessionSeconds)}`:'Accumulated server playtime'],\n      ['Player List Client',p.online?(p.playerListClientDetected?'Detected':'Not detected'):'—',p.playerListClientDetected?`Newfie's Player List ${p.playerListClientVersion||'version unknown'}`:'Current connection has not sent a companion handshake'],\n      ['Warnings',p.activeWarnings||0,'Active staff warnings'],\n      ['Restrictions',[p.muted?'Muted':'',p.banned?'Temp banned':'',p.frozen?'Frozen':'',p.jailed?'Jailed':''].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')||'None','Suite-managed']\n    ].map(x=>`<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"metricLabel\">${esc(x[0])}</div><div class=\"metricValue\" style=\"font-size:18px\">${esc(x[1])}</div><div class=\"small\">${esc(x[2])}</div></div>`).join('');\n\n    $('adminWarningCount').textContent=`${(d.warnings||[]).filter(x=>!x.removed).length} active`;\n    $('adminWarningRows').innerHTML=(d.warnings||[]).length?(d.warnings||[]).map(w=>`<tr><td>#${esc(w.id)}</td><td>${esc(fmtAdminTime(w.unixMilliseconds))}</td><td>${esc(w.issuedBy)}</td><td>${esc(w.reason)}</td><td>${w.removed?'Removed':'Active'}</td><td>${w.removed?'':`<button onclick=\"adminRemoveWarning(${Number(w.id)})\">Remove</button>`}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No warnings.</td></tr>';\n    $('adminNoteCount').textContent=`${(d.notes||[]).length} notes`;\n    $('adminNoteRows').innerHTML=(d.notes||[]).length?(d.notes||[]).map(n=>`<tr><td>#${esc(n.id)}</td><td>${esc(fmtAdminTime(n.unixMilliseconds))}</td><td>${esc(n.author)}</td><td>${esc(n.text)}</td><td><button onclick=\"adminRemoveNote(${Number(n.id)})\">Remove</button></td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">No staff notes.</td></tr>';\n    adminInventoryData=d.inventory||[];\n    adminInventoryStatus=d.inventoryStatus||{};\n    adminInventorySnapshots=d.inventorySnapshots||[];\n    if(!p.online){adminSelectedInventorySlot=null;}\n    renderAdminInventory();\n    renderAdminInventorySnapshots();\n    renderAdminInventoryHistory(d.history||[]);\n    const blockActionNames=['Unknown','Block Break','Block Place','Block Use','Container Open','Container Take','Container Put','Entity Interact','Entity Spawn','Entity Death','Entity Despawn'];\n    const unified=[];\n    (d.history||[]).forEach(h=>unified.push({time:Number(h.unixMilliseconds||0),action:h.action,actor:h.actor,source:h.source,detail:h.detail}));\n    (d.blockHistory||[]).forEach(h=>{\n      const t=Date.parse(h.timestampUtc||'')||0;\n      const action=typeof h.action==='number'?(blockActionNames[h.action]||`BlockLogger ${h.action}`):String(h.action||'BlockLogger');\n      const detail=`${h.blockCode||''} @ ${h.x||0},${h.y||0},${h.z||0}${h.dimension?` · ${h.dimension}`:''}`;\n      unified.push({time:t,action,actor:h.playerName||p.name||'',source:'BlockLogger',detail});\n    });\n    unified.sort((a,b)=>b.time-a.time);\n    $('adminHistoryRows').innerHTML=unified.length?unified.slice(0,40).map(h=>`<tr><td>${esc(fmtAdminTime(h.time))}</td><td>${esc(h.action)}</td><td>${esc(h.actor)}</td><td>${esc(h.source)}</td><td>${esc(h.detail)}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">No suite or BlockLogger history for this player.</td></tr>';\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nfunction inventoryCanEdit(status){return currentSessionRole!=='ReadOnly'&&status?.available===true&&status?.readOnly===false&&status?.source==='live';}\nfunction inventoryEvidenceText(status){\n  const source=({live:'Live server inventory','disconnect-capture':'Disconnect capture','server-save-capture':'Server save capture','world-save':'Saved world inventory',snapshot:'Historical snapshot',unavailable:'Inventory unavailable'})[status?.source]||'Inventory unavailable';\n  const time=Number(status?.capturedUnixMilliseconds||0)>0?`Captured ${fmtAdminTime(status.capturedUnixMilliseconds)}`:Number(status?.readUnixMilliseconds||0)>0?`Read ${fmtAdminTime(status.readUnixMilliseconds)} · capture time unknown`:'Awaiting inventory data';\n  return `${source} · ${time}${status?.partial?' · Incomplete view':''}${inventoryCanEdit(status)?'':' · Read only'}`;\n}\nasync function refreshAdminInventory(){\n  const player=adminSelectedPlayer;if(!player)return;\n  const version=++adminPlayerRequestVersion;\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/admin/inventory?player='+encodeURIComponent(player));\n    if(version!==adminPlayerRequestVersion)return;\n    adminInventoryData=d.inventory||[];adminInventoryStatus=d.inventoryStatus||{};adminInventorySnapshots=d.inventorySnapshots||[];\n    const selected=adminSelectedInventorySlot;\n    adminSelectedInventorySlot=selected?adminInventoryData.find(x=>adminInventoryKey(x)===adminInventoryKey(selected))||null:null;\n    renderAdminInventory();renderAdminInventorySnapshots();renderAdminInventoryHistory(d.history||[]);\n  }catch(e){if(version===adminPlayerRequestVersion)toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nfunction adminInventoryKey(i){return `${i.inventory}\\n${Number(i.slot)}`;}\n\nfunction renderAdminInventory(){\n  const filter=String($('adminInventoryFilter').value||'').trim().toLowerCase();\n  const occupied=adminInventoryData.filter(x=>!x.empty).length;\n  const canEdit=inventoryCanEdit(adminInventoryStatus);\n  $('adminInventoryCount').textContent=adminInventoryStatus.available?`${occupied} occupied / ${adminInventoryData.length} slots`:'Inventory unavailable';\n  $('adminInventoryEvidence').textContent=inventoryEvidenceText(adminInventoryStatus)+'. '+String(adminInventoryStatus.message||'');\n  $('adminInventorySnapshot').disabled=!canEdit;\n  $('adminInventoryEditWorkbench').hidden=!canEdit;\n  if(!adminInventoryData.length){\n    $('adminInventoryGrid').innerHTML=`<div class=\"muted\">${esc(adminInventoryStatus.available?'This saved inventory contains no recorded slots.':adminInventoryStatus.message||'Inventory has not loaded yet.')}</div>`;\n    renderAdminSelectedSlot();\n    return;\n  }\n  const visible=adminInventoryData.filter(i=>{\n    if(!filter)return true;\n    return !i.empty && [i.name,i.code,i.inventory,i.section].some(v=>String(v||'').toLowerCase().includes(filter));\n  });\n  const groups={};\n  for(const i of visible){\n    const key=`${i.section||'Other'} · ${i.inventory||'inventory'}`;\n    (groups[key]||(groups[key]=[])).push(i);\n  }\n  const order=['Hotbar','Backpack','Equipment','Crafting','Cursor','Other'];\n  const keys=Object.keys(groups).sort((a,b)=>{\n    const ai=order.findIndex(x=>a.startsWith(x)),bi=order.findIndex(x=>b.startsWith(x));\n    return (ai<0?99:ai)-(bi<0?99:bi)||a.localeCompare(b);\n  });\n  $('adminInventoryGrid').innerHTML=keys.length?keys.map(key=>{\n    const rows=groups[key].sort((a,b)=>Number(a.slot)-Number(b.slot));\n    return `<div class=\"inventorySection\"><div class=\"inventorySectionTitle\">${esc(key)}<span class=\"small\">${rows.filter(x=>!x.empty).length}/${rows.length} occupied</span></div><div class=\"inventorySlotGrid\">${rows.map(i=>{\n      const selected=adminSelectedInventorySlot&&adminInventoryKey(adminSelectedInventorySlot)===adminInventoryKey(i);\n      const label=i.empty?'Empty':`${i.stackSize}x ${i.name||i.code}`;\n      const meta=i.empty?(i.storageType||''):`${i.code||''}${i.maxDurability?` · ${i.durability}/${i.maxDurability} dura`:''}`;\n      return `<button class=\"invSlot ${i.empty?'empty':''} ${selected?'selected':''}\" onclick=\"adminSelectInventorySlot('${encodeURIComponent(String(i.inventory||'')).replace(/'/g,'%27')}',${Number(i.slot)})\"><div class=\"slotNo\">#${Number(i.slot)}</div><div class=\"slotName\">${esc(label)}</div><div class=\"slotMeta\">${esc(meta)}</div></button>`;\n    }).join('')}</div></div>`;\n  }).join(''):'<div class=\"muted\">No inventory slots match the filter.</div>';\n  renderAdminSelectedSlot();\n}\n\nfunction adminSelectInventorySlot(encodedInventory,slot){\n  const inventory=decodeURIComponent(encodedInventory||'');\n  adminSelectedInventorySlot=adminInventoryData.find(i=>String(i.inventory)===inventory&&Number(i.slot)===Number(slot))||null;\n  renderAdminInventory();\n}\n\nfunction renderAdminSelectedSlot(){\n  const i=adminSelectedInventorySlot;\n  if(!i){\n    $('adminSelectedSlotState').textContent='None';\n    $('adminSelectedSlotDetail').innerHTML='Select a slot above to inspect it.';\n    $('adminSelectedSlotActions').innerHTML='';\n    return;\n  }\n  $('adminSelectedSlotState').textContent=`${i.inventory}[${i.slot}]`;\n  if(i.empty){\n    $('adminSelectedSlotDetail').innerHTML=`<b>Empty slot</b><div>Section: ${esc(i.section||'Other')}</div><div>Storage: ${esc(i.storageType||'—')}</div><div>Slot max: ${esc(i.maxSlotStackSize||0)}</div>`;\n    $('adminSelectedSlotActions').innerHTML=inventoryCanEdit(adminInventoryStatus)?'<button onclick=\"adminGiveSelectedItem(false)\">Give Selected Catalog Item Here</button>':'<span class=\"muted\">Read-only inventory view.</span>';\n    return;\n  }\n  $('adminSelectedSlotDetail').innerHTML=`<b>${esc(i.name||i.code)}</b><div><code>${esc(i.code||'')}</code></div><div>Quantity: ${Number(i.stackSize||0)} / ${Number(i.maxStackSize||0)}</div><div>${i.maxDurability?`Durability: ${Number(i.durability||0)} / ${Number(i.maxDurability||0)}<br>`:''}Temperature: ${Number(i.temperature||0).toFixed(1)}°C</div><div class=\"small\">Class ${esc(i.itemClass||'')} · Storage ${esc(i.storageType||'')}</div>`;\n  $('adminSelectedSlotActions').innerHTML=!inventoryCanEdit(adminInventoryStatus)?'<span class=\"muted\">Read-only inventory view.</span>':'<button onclick=\"adminEditInventoryQuantity()\">Edit Quantity</button><button onclick=\"adminMoveInventorySlot()\">Move / Swap</button><button onclick=\"adminReplaceSelectedItem()\">Replace</button><button class=\"danger\" onclick=\"adminRemoveSelectedInventorySlot()\">Remove</button>';\n}\n\nasync function adminInventoryMutation(payload,confirmText=''){\n  if(!inventoryCanEdit(adminInventoryStatus)){toast('This inventory is read only. Refresh after the player reconnects to edit it.','error');return null;}\n  if(!adminSelectedPlayer){toast('Select a player first.','error');return null;}\n  if(confirmText&&!confirm(confirmText))return null;\n  payload.player=adminSelectedPlayer;\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/admin/inventory/action',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(payload)});\n    toast(d.message||'Inventory action completed.','success');\n    await selectAdminPlayer(adminSelectedPlayer,false);\n    await loadAdmin(false);\n    return d;\n  }catch(e){\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n    if(String(e.message||'').toLowerCase().includes('changed while'))await selectAdminPlayer(adminSelectedPlayer,false);\n    return null;\n  }\n}\n\nasync function adminEditInventoryQuantity(){\n  const i=adminSelectedInventorySlot;if(!i||i.empty)return;\n  const raw=prompt(`Set quantity for ${i.name} (${i.inventory}[${i.slot}]). 0 removes it:`,String(i.stackSize||1));\n  if(raw===null)return;const quantity=Number(raw);if(!Number.isInteger(quantity)||quantity<0){toast('Quantity must be a whole number 0 or greater.','error');return;}\n  await adminInventoryMutation({action:'quantity',inventory:i.inventory,slot:Number(i.slot),quantity,fingerprint:i.fingerprint},`Change ${i.name} from ${i.stackSize} to ${quantity}? A snapshot will be created automatically.`);\n}\n\nasync function adminMoveInventorySlot(){\n  const i=adminSelectedInventorySlot;if(!i||i.empty)return;\n  const inv=prompt('Destination inventory ID:',String(i.inventory||''));if(inv===null||!inv.trim())return;\n  const slotRaw=prompt('Destination slot number:',String(Number(i.slot)+1));if(slotRaw===null)return;\n  const slot=Number(slotRaw);if(!Number.isInteger(slot)||slot<0){toast('Invalid destination slot.','error');return;}\n  const dest=adminInventoryData.find(x=>String(x.inventory)===inv.trim()&&Number(x.slot)===slot);\n  if(!dest){toast('That destination slot is not present in the current inventory view.','error');return;}\n  await adminInventoryMutation({action:'move',inventory:i.inventory,slot:Number(i.slot),toInventory:dest.inventory,toSlot:Number(dest.slot),fingerprint:i.fingerprint,toFingerprint:dest.fingerprint},`Move/swap ${i.inventory}[${i.slot}] with ${dest.inventory}[${dest.slot}]? A snapshot will be created first.`);\n}\n\nasync function adminRemoveSelectedInventorySlot(){\n  const i=adminSelectedInventorySlot;if(!i||i.empty)return;\n  await adminInventoryMutation({action:'remove',inventory:i.inventory,slot:Number(i.slot),fingerprint:i.fingerprint},`Remove ${i.stackSize}x ${i.name} from ${i.inventory}[${i.slot}]? A snapshot will be created automatically.`);\n}\n\nasync function adminSearchItems(){\n  const q=String($('adminItemSearch').value||'').trim();\n  if(q.length<2){$('adminItemSearchResults').innerHTML='<div class=\"small\" style=\"padding:8px\">Enter at least two characters.</div>';return;}\n  $('adminItemSearchResults').innerHTML='<div class=\"small\" style=\"padding:8px\">Searching…</div>';\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/admin/items?search='+encodeURIComponent(q)+'&limit=60');\n    const items=d.items||[];\n    $('adminItemSearchResults').innerHTML=items.length?items.map((x,idx)=>`<div class=\"itemSearchRow\"><div class=\"grow\"><b>${esc(x.name||x.code)}</b><div class=\"small\"><code>${esc(x.code)}</code> · ${esc(x.itemClass)} · max ${Number(x.maxStackSize||1)}</div></div><button onclick=\"adminSelectCatalogItem(${idx})\">Select</button></div>`).join(''):'<div class=\"small\" style=\"padding:8px\">No matching items/blocks.</div>';\n    window.adminItemSearchCache=items;\n  }catch(e){$('adminItemSearchResults').innerHTML=`<div class=\"bad\" style=\"padding:8px\">${esc(e.message)}</div>`;}\n}\n\nfunction adminSelectCatalogItem(index){\n  const items=window.adminItemSearchCache||[];\n  adminSelectedCatalogItem=items[Number(index)]||null;\n  $('adminCatalogSelected').textContent=adminSelectedCatalogItem?`${adminSelectedCatalogItem.name} · ${adminSelectedCatalogItem.code}`:'No item selected';\n  if(adminSelectedCatalogItem)$('adminGiveQuantity').max=String(Math.max(1,Number(adminSelectedCatalogItem.maxStackSize||1)));\n}\n\nfunction adminGiveQuantity(){\n  const max=Math.max(1,Number(adminSelectedCatalogItem?.maxStackSize||1));\n  const q=Math.max(1,Math.min(max,Math.floor(Number($('adminGiveQuantity').value||1))));\n  $('adminGiveQuantity').value=String(q);return q;\n}\n\nasync function adminGiveSelectedItem(auto){\n  if(!adminSelectedCatalogItem){toast('Search for and select an item first.','error');return;}\n  const q=adminGiveQuantity();\n  if(auto){\n    await adminInventoryMutation({action:'give',code:adminSelectedCatalogItem.code,quantity:q},`Give ${q}x ${adminSelectedCatalogItem.name} to this player? A snapshot will be created first.`);return;\n  }\n  const i=adminSelectedInventorySlot;if(!i||!i.empty){toast('Select an empty inventory slot first.','error');return;}\n  await adminInventoryMutation({action:'give',inventory:i.inventory,slot:Number(i.slot),code:adminSelectedCatalogItem.code,quantity:q,fingerprint:i.fingerprint},`Give ${q}x ${adminSelectedCatalogItem.name} to ${i.inventory}[${i.slot}]?`);\n}\n\nasync function adminReplaceSelectedItem(){\n  const i=adminSelectedInventorySlot;if(!i){toast('Select a target slot first.','error');return;}\n  if(!adminSelectedCatalogItem){toast('Search for and select a replacement item first.','error');return;}\n  const q=adminGiveQuantity();\n  await adminInventoryMutation({action:'replace',inventory:i.inventory,slot:Number(i.slot),code:adminSelectedCatalogItem.code,quantity:q,fingerprint:i.fingerprint},`Replace ${i.empty?'the empty slot':i.name} in ${i.inventory}[${i.slot}] with ${q}x ${adminSelectedCatalogItem.name}? A snapshot will be created first.`);\n}\n\nasync function adminCreateInventorySnapshot(){\n  if(!adminSelectedPlayer||!inventoryCanEdit(adminInventoryStatus))return;\n  const reason=prompt('Snapshot reason:','Manual inventory snapshot');if(reason===null)return;\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/admin/inventory/snapshot',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:'create',player:adminSelectedPlayer,reason})});\n    toast(d.message,'success');await selectAdminPlayer(adminSelectedPlayer,false);await loadAdmin(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nfunction renderAdminInventorySnapshots(){\n  $('adminSnapshotCount').textContent=`${adminInventorySnapshots.length} retained`;\n  $('adminSnapshotRows').innerHTML=adminInventorySnapshots.length?adminInventorySnapshots.map(x=>`<tr><td>#${Number(x.id)}</td><td>${esc(fmtAdminTime(x.unixMilliseconds))}</td><td>${esc(x.createdBy||'')}</td><td>${Number(x.occupiedSlots||0)}</td><td>${esc(x.reason||'')}</td><td>${adminInventoryStatus.source==='live'?`<button onclick=\"adminCompareInventorySnapshot(${Number(x.id)})\">Compare</button>`:'<span class=\"small\">Live compare requires online player</span>'} ${inventoryCanEdit(adminInventoryStatus)?`<button class=\"danger\" onclick=\"adminRestoreInventorySnapshot(${Number(x.id)})\">Restore</button>`:''}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No snapshots yet. A snapshot is also created automatically before each inventory edit.</td></tr>';\n}\n\nasync function adminCompareInventorySnapshot(id){\n  if(!adminSelectedPlayer)return;\n  $('adminSnapshotCompareState').textContent=`Comparing #${id}…`;\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/admin/inventory/compare?player='+encodeURIComponent(adminSelectedPlayer)+'&id='+Number(id));\n    const rows=d.differences||[];\n    $('adminSnapshotCompareState').textContent=rows.length?`${rows.length} changed slots vs #${id}`:`No changes vs #${id}`;\n    $('adminSnapshotCompareRows').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(r=>`<tr><td>${esc(r.inventory)}</td><td>${Number(r.slot)}</td><td>${esc(r.snapshotItem)}</td><td>${esc(r.currentItem)}</td><td class=\"inventoryDiff${esc(r.change)}\">${esc(r.change)}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"ok\">Current inventory matches this snapshot.</td></tr>';\n  }catch(e){$('adminSnapshotCompareState').textContent='Compare failed';toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nasync function adminRestoreInventorySnapshot(id){\n  if(!adminSelectedPlayer||!inventoryCanEdit(adminInventoryStatus))return;\n  if(!confirm(`Restore inventory snapshot #${id}? The current inventory will be snapshotted first so this restore can be rolled back.`))return;\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/admin/inventory/snapshot',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:'restore',player:adminSelectedPlayer,id:Number(id)})});\n    toast(d.message,'success');await selectAdminPlayer(adminSelectedPlayer,false);await loadAdmin(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nfunction renderAdminInventoryHistory(history){\n  const rows=(history||[]).filter(h=>String(h.action||'').startsWith('inventory-'));\n  $('adminInventoryHistoryRows').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.slice(0,80).map(h=>`<tr><td>${esc(fmtAdminTime(h.unixMilliseconds))}</td><td>${esc(h.actor)}</td><td>${esc(h.action)}</td><td>${esc(h.source)}</td><td>${esc(h.detail)}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">No inventory administration history for this player yet.</td></tr>';\n}\n\nasync function adminCopyPlayerSummary(){\n  if(!adminSelectedPlayer){toast('Select a player first.','error');return;}\n  const p=adminPlayersData.find(x=>String(x.playerUid)===String(adminSelectedPlayer));\n  if(!p){toast('Player summary unavailable.','error');return;}\n  const text=[\n    `Player: ${playerIdentityText(p)} (${p.playerUid})`,\n    `Status: ${p.online?'Online'+(p.afk?' / AFK':''):'Offline'}`,\n    `Role: ${p.role||'—'} / Game mode: ${p.gameMode||'—'}`,\n    `Last Seen: ${p.online?'Online now':fmtAdminTime(p.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds)+' ('+fmtAdminRelativeTime(p.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds)+')'}`,\n    `First Seen: ${fmtAdminTime(p.firstSeenUnixMilliseconds)}`,\n    `Total playtime: ${fmtAdminDuration(p.totalPlaySeconds)}`,\n    `Warnings: ${p.activeWarnings||0}`,\n    `Restrictions: ${[p.muted?'Muted':'',p.banned?'Temp banned':'',p.frozen?'Frozen':'',p.jailed?'Jailed':''].filter(Boolean).join(', ')||'None'}`\n  ].join('\\n');\n  try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);}catch{const ta=document.createElement('textarea');ta.value=text;document.body.appendChild(ta);ta.select();document.execCommand('copy');ta.remove();}\n  toast('Player summary copied.','success');\n}\n\nasync function postAdminAction(payload){\n  const d=await api('/api/admin/action',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(payload)});\n  toast(d.message||'Admin action completed.','success');\n  await loadAdmin(false);\n}\n\nasync function adminPromptAction(action){\n  if(!adminSelectedPlayer){toast('Select a player first.','error');return;}\n  const player=adminSelectedPlayer;\n  try{\n    if(action==='warn'){\n      const reason=prompt('Warning reason:',''); if(reason===null||!reason.trim())return;\n      await postAdminAction({action,player,reason}); return;\n    }\n    if(action==='mute'||action==='tempban'||action==='freeze'){\n      const def=action==='freeze'?'permanent':'30m';\n      const duration=prompt(`${action==='tempban'?'Temporary ban':action==='mute'?'Mute':'Freeze'} duration (30m, 6h, 3d, 2w${action!=='tempban'?', permanent':''}):`,def); if(duration===null||!duration.trim())return;\n      const reason=prompt('Reason:',''); if(reason===null)return;\n      if(!confirm(`Confirm ${action} for selected player?`))return;\n      await postAdminAction({action,player,duration,reason}); return;\n    }\n    if(action==='jail'){\n      const duration=prompt('Jail duration (10m, 2h, 3d, 1w, permanent):','30m'); if(duration===null||!duration.trim())return;\n      const reason=prompt('Jail reason:',''); if(reason===null)return;\n      if(!confirm('Confirm jail for selected player?'))return;\n      await postAdminAction({action,player,duration,reason}); return;\n    }\n    if(action==='note'){\n      const note=prompt('Staff note (not visible to the player):',''); if(note===null||!note.trim())return;\n      await postAdminAction({action:'note',player,note}); return;\n    }\n    const labels={unmute:'clear mute',unban:'clear temporary ban',unfreeze:'unfreeze',unjail:'release from jail',kick:'kick',heal:'heal',feed:'feed',revive:'revive',smite:'smite with lightning',sendback:'send back',allowcharselonce:'allow one character re-selection'};\n    let reason='';\n    if(action==='kick'){reason=prompt('Kick reason:','Kicked by staff')||''; if(!reason)return;}\n    if(action==='smite'){const entered=prompt('Smite reason (optional):',''); if(entered===null)return; reason=entered;}\n    if(!confirm(`Confirm ${labels[action]||action} for the selected player?`))return;\n    await postAdminAction({action,player,reason});\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nasync function adminRemoveWarning(id){\n  if(!confirm(`Remove warning #${id}?`))return;\n  try{await postAdminAction({action:'unwarn',player:adminSelectedPlayer,id});}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\nasync function adminRemoveNote(id){\n  if(!confirm(`Remove staff note #${id}?`))return;\n  try{await postAdminAction({action:'note-remove',player:adminSelectedPlayer,id});}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nasync function adminUndoLast(){\n  if(!confirm('Undo the most recent reversible suite admin action?'))return;\n  try{await postAdminAction({action:'undo',player:''});}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nasync function adminMaintenance(enabled){\n  try{\n    if(!enabled){if(!confirm('Disable maintenance mode?'))return; const d=await api('/api/admin/maintenance',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({enabled:false})});toast(d.message,'success');await loadAdmin(false);return;}\n    const duration=prompt('Optional maintenance duration (for example 30m or 2h). Leave blank for manual off:','30m'); if(duration===null)return;\n    const reason=prompt('Maintenance reason:','Server maintenance'); if(reason===null)return;\n    if(!confirm('Enable maintenance mode? New non-staff connections will be rejected.'))return;\n    const confirmation=prompt('Safety check: type MAINTENANCE to continue:','')||'';if(confirmation.toUpperCase()!=='MAINTENANCE')return;\n    const d=await api('/api/admin/maintenance',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({enabled:true,duration:duration.trim(),reason,confirmation})});toast(d.message,'success');await loadAdmin(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nasync function adminShutdown(schedule,restart=false){\n  try{\n    if(!schedule){if(!confirm('Cancel the scheduled shutdown?'))return; const d=await api('/api/admin/shutdown',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:'cancel'})});toast(d.message,'success');await loadAdmin(false);return;}\n    const duration=prompt(`${restart?'Restart':'Shutdown'} delay (for example 10m, 30s, 1h):`,'10m'); if(duration===null||!duration.trim())return;\n    const reason=prompt(`${restart?'Restart':'Shutdown'} reason:`,'Server maintenance'); if(reason===null)return;\n    if(!confirm(`Schedule a clean server ${restart?'restart':'shutdown'} in ${duration}?${restart?' The host/supervisor must restart the process.':''}`))return;\n    const expected=restart?'RESTART':'SHUTDOWN';const confirmation=prompt(`Safety check: type ${expected} to continue:`,'')||'';if(confirmation.toUpperCase()!==expected)return;\n    const d=await api('/api/admin/shutdown',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:restart?'restart':'schedule',duration,reason,confirmation})});toast(d.message,'success');await loadAdmin(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nasync function adminCleanup(confirmRun){\n  try{\n    if(confirmRun&&!confirm('Remove loaded dropped-item entities now? This cannot be undone.'))return;\n    let confirmation='';if(confirmRun){confirmation=prompt('Safety check: type CLEANUP to continue:','')||'';if(confirmation.toUpperCase()!=='CLEANUP')return;}\n    const d=await api('/api/admin/cleanup',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({confirm:!!confirmRun,maxRemove:100000,confirmation})});\n    $('adminCleanupState').textContent=d.dryRun?`Loaded ${d.loadedEntities||0} · creatures ${d.creatures||0} · inanimate ${d.inanimateEntities||0} · dead/despawning ${d.deadOrDespawning||0} · dropped ${d.droppedItems||0}`:`Removed ${d.removed||0} dropped items`;\n    toast(d.dryRun?`Scan: ${d.loadedEntities||0} loaded entities, ${d.droppedItems||0} dropped items.`:`Removed ${d.removed||0} dropped items.`,'success');\n    await loadAdmin(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nfunction logImpactClass(impact){\n  impact=String(impact||'').toLowerCase();\n  return impact==='critical'?'bad':impact==='high'?'orange':impact==='moderate'?'warn':impact==='low'?'muted':'';\n}\n\nfunction preflightClass(sev){\n  sev=String(sev||'').toLowerCase();\n  return sev==='critical'?'bad':sev==='high'?'orange':sev==='watch'?'warn':sev==='ok'?'good':'';\n}\n\nasync function loadServerStatus(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading)$('serverStatusState').textContent='Loading server status…';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-player-days]').forEach(btn=>btn.classList.toggle('active',Number(btn.dataset.playerDays)===playerAnalyticsDays));\n  try{\n    serverStatusData=await api(`/api/server-status?days=${playerAnalyticsDays}`);\n    playerAnalyticsData=serverStatusData.analytics||{};\n    renderServerStatus();\n    renderPlayerAnalytics();\n  }catch(e){\n    $('serverStatusState').textContent=e.message;\n    if(showLoading)toast(e.message,'error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction formatBytesTotal(value){\n  value=Math.max(0,Number(value||0));\n  if(value>=1024*1024*1024)return `${(value/(1024*1024*1024)).toFixed(2)} GB`;\n  if(value>=1024*1024)return `${(value/(1024*1024)).toFixed(2)} MB`;\n  if(value>=1024)return `${(value/1024).toFixed(1)} KB`;\n  return `${value.toFixed(0)} B`;\n}\n\nfunction renderServerStatus(){\n  const d=serverStatusData||{},srv=d.server||{},m=d.maintenance||{},sh=d.shutdown||{},r=d.reports||{},players=d.onlinePlayers||[];\n  const updated=d.generatedUnixMilliseconds?new Date(Number(d.generatedUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleTimeString():'—';\n  setNavStatus('serverStatus','good','Server status endpoint healthy');\n  setReportsNavState(r.open,r.investigating);\n  $('serverStatusState').textContent=`${Number(srv.onlinePlayers||0)} online · uptime ${fmtAdminDuration(Number(srv.uptimeSeconds||0))} · updated ${updated}`;\n  $('serverStatusMetrics').innerHTML=\n    metric('Online players',Number(srv.onlinePlayers||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Server uptime',fmtAdminDuration(Number(srv.uptimeSeconds||0)))+\n    metric('Average ping',`${Number(srv.averagePingMilliseconds||0).toFixed(0)} ms`)+\n    metric('Peak ping',`${Number(srv.maxPingMilliseconds||0).toFixed(0)} ms`)+\n    metric('Network out',formatBytesRate(Number(srv.sentBytesPerSecond||0)))+\n    metric('Network in',formatBytesRate(Number(srv.receivedBytesPerSecond||0)))+\n    metric('Loaded mods',Number(srv.loadedMods||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Tracked players',Number(srv.trackedPlayers||0).toLocaleString());\n\n  const maintenanceText=m.enabled\n    ? `<span class=\"warn\"><b>Maintenance ON</b></span> · ${esc(m.reason||'Maintenance')}${Number(m.untilUnixMilliseconds||0)>0?` · until ${esc(fmtAdminTime(m.untilUnixMilliseconds))}`:''}`\n    : '<span class=\"good\"><b>Maintenance OFF</b></span>';\n  const shutdownText=Number(sh.atUnixMilliseconds||0)>Date.now()\n    ? `<span class=\"warn\"><b>Scheduled server action</b></span> · ${esc(fmtAdminTime(sh.atUnixMilliseconds))} · ${esc(sh.reason||'')}`\n    : '<span class=\"muted\">No shutdown/restart scheduled.</span>';\n  $('serverStatusOpsMeta').textContent=`${Number(r.open||0)} open report(s) · ${Number(r.investigating||0)} investigating`;\n  $('serverStatusOps').innerHTML=`\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:9px\">${maintenanceText}</div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:9px\">${shutdownText}</div>\n    <div><b>Traffic totals:</b> ${esc(formatBytesTotal(srv.totalSentBytes))} sent · ${esc(formatBytesTotal(srv.totalReceivedBytes))} received</div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:7px\"><b>World runtime:</b> ${esc(fmtAdminDuration(Number(srv.worldPlayTimeSeconds||0)))} · <b>Server timezone:</b> ${esc(srv.serverTimeZone||'Local')}</div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:7px\"><b>Reports:</b> ${Number(r.open||0)} open · ${Number(r.investigating||0)} investigating · ${Number(r.total||0)} total</div>`;\n\n  $('serverStatusOnlineMeta').textContent=`${players.length} currently online`;\n  $('serverStatusOnlineRows').innerHTML=players.length?players.map(p=>`<tr><td>${playerIdentityHtml(p,'name',false)}</td><td>${Number(p.pingMilliseconds||0)} ms</td><td>${p.afk?'<span class=\"badge medium\">AFK</span>':'<span class=\"badge high\">ACTIVE</span>'}</td><td>${esc(fmtAdminDuration(Number(p.sessionSeconds||0)))}</td><td>${esc(p.role||'')}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">No players are currently online.</td></tr>';\n}\n\nfunction renderPlayerAnalytics(){\n  const d=playerAnalyticsData||{}, daily=d.daily||[], hourly=d.last24Hours||d.todayHourly||[], g=serverStatusData?.growth||{};\n  $('playerAnalyticsState').textContent=`${Number(d.currentPlayers||0)} online · ${daily.length} daily bucket(s) · updated ${d.generatedUnixMilliseconds?new Date(Number(d.generatedUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleTimeString():'—'}`;\n  $('playerAnalyticsTimezone').textContent=`Server local time: ${d.serverTimeZone||'Local'}`;\n  const weekGrowth=Number(g.newPlayerWeekGrowthPercent||0);\n  const weekGrowthText=`${weekGrowth>=0?'+':''}${weekGrowth.toFixed(0)}% vs prior 7d`;\n  $('playerAnalyticsMetrics').innerHTML=\n    metric('Online now',Number(d.currentPlayers||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Peak today',Number(d.todayHigh||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Average today',Number(d.todayAverage||0).toFixed(1))+\n    metric('New players · 24h',Number(g.newPlayers24Hours||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('New players · 7d',`${Number(g.newPlayers7Days||0).toLocaleString()} · ${weekGrowthText}`)+\n    metric('New players · 30d',Number(g.newPlayers30Days||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Active players · 24h',Number(g.activePlayers24Hours||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Active players · 7d',Number(g.activePlayers7Days||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Active players · 30d',Number(g.activePlayers30Days||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Returning players · 7d',Number(g.returningPlayers7Days||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('7-day return rate',`${Number(g.sevenDayReturnRate||0).toFixed(1)}% · cohort ${Number(g.sevenDayReturnCohort||0)}`)+\n    metric('30-day concurrency peak',Number(g.peakPlayers30Days||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Avg daily peak · 30d',Number(g.averageDailyPeak30Days||0).toFixed(1))+\n    metric('Total known players',Number(g.totalKnownPlayers||0).toLocaleString());\n\n  const observedHours=hourly.filter(x=>x.average!==null&&x.average!==undefined);\n  const peakHour=observedHours.length?observedHours.reduce((a,b)=>Number(b.high||0)>Number(a.high||0)?b:a):null;\n  const peakDay=daily.length?daily.reduce((a,b)=>Number(b.high||0)>Number(a.high||0)?b:a):null;\n  const newRows=g.dailyNewPlayers||[];\n  const newPeak=newRows.length?newRows.reduce((a,b)=>Number(b.count||0)>Number(a.count||0)?b:a):null;\n  $('playerDailyMeta').textContent=peakDay?`30-day peak ${Number(peakDay.high||0)} on ${peakDay.date}`:'No daily history yet';\n  $('playerHourlyMeta').textContent=peakHour?`24h peak ${Number(peakHour.high||0)} at ${peakHour.label}`:'No hourly history yet';\n  $('playerNewMeta').textContent=newPeak?`Best acquisition day: ${Number(newPeak.count||0)} new on ${newPeak.date}`:'No new-player history yet';\n  redrawPlayerAnalyticsCharts();\n}\n\nfunction drawPlayerChartGrid(ctx,w,h,pad,maxValue){\n  const plotH=Math.max(1,h-pad.t-pad.b),plotW=Math.max(1,w-pad.l-pad.r);\n  const yMax=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(maxValue));\n  ctx.font='10px system-ui';\n  chartPlotBackground(ctx,pad,w,h,4,6);\n  ctx.fillStyle='#748797';\n  for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){\n    const y=pad.t+plotH*i/4;\n    const value=yMax-(yMax*i/4);\n    ctx.fillText(String(Math.round(value)),Math.max(4,pad.l-34),y+3);\n  }\n  return{plotH,plotW,yMax,yFor:v=>pad.t+(1-clamp(Number(v||0)/yMax,0,1))*plotH};\n}\n\nfunction drawDailyPlayerChart(){\n  const canvas=$('playerDailyChart');\n  if(!canvas)return;\n  const rows=(playerAnalyticsData?.daily||[]);\n  const {ctx,w,h}=resizeCanvas(canvas);\n  ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);\n  const pad={l:42,r:12,t:14,b:34};\n  if(!rows.length){ctx.fillStyle='#8492a0';ctx.font='11px system-ui';ctx.fillText('No player-count history yet.',18,26);return;}\n\n  const maxValue=Math.max(1,...rows.map(x=>Number(x.high||0)));\n  const g=drawPlayerChartGrid(ctx,w,h,pad,maxValue);\n  const xFor=i=>pad.l+(rows.length<=1?g.plotW/2:(i/(rows.length-1))*g.plotW);\n\n  const highPoints=rows.map((row,i)=>[xFor(i),g.yFor(row.high)]);\n  const averagePoints=rows.map((row,i)=>[xFor(i),g.yFor(row.average)]);\n  ctx.save();ctx.beginPath();highPoints.forEach(([x,y],i)=>i?ctx.lineTo(x,y):ctx.moveTo(x,y));[...averagePoints].reverse().forEach(([x,y])=>ctx.lineTo(x,y));ctx.closePath();ctx.fillStyle='rgba(103,159,203,.10)';ctx.fill();ctx.restore();\n  chartLine(ctx,highPoints,'#75afe0',2.2);chartLine(ctx,averagePoints,'#7fbf79',1.8);chartEndPoint(ctx,highPoints,'#dcebf6');\n\n  ctx.fillStyle='#748392';ctx.font='10px system-ui';\n  const stride=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(rows.length/6));\n  rows.forEach((row,i)=>{\n    if(i%stride!==0&&i!==rows.length-1)return;\n    const x=xFor(i);const parts=String(row.date||'').split('-');const label=parts.length===3?`${parts[1]}/${parts[2]}`:String(row.date||'');\n    const tw=ctx.measureText(label).width;ctx.fillText(label,clamp(x-tw/2,pad.l,w-pad.r-tw),h-10);\n  });\n}\n\nfunction drawHourlyPlayerChart(){\n  const canvas=$('playerHourlyChart');\n  if(!canvas)return;\n  const rows=(playerAnalyticsData?.last24Hours||playerAnalyticsData?.todayHourly||[]);\n  const {ctx,w,h}=resizeCanvas(canvas);\n  ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);\n  const pad={l:42,r:12,t:14,b:34};\n  const valid=rows.map((x,i)=>({...x,_index:i})).filter(x=>x.average!==null&&x.average!==undefined);\n  if(!valid.length){ctx.fillStyle='#8492a0';ctx.font='11px system-ui';ctx.fillText('No observed player-count hours yet.',18,26);return;}\n\n  const maxValue=Math.max(1,...valid.map(x=>Math.max(Number(x.high||0),Number(x.average||0))));\n  const g=drawPlayerChartGrid(ctx,w,h,pad,maxValue);\n  const xFor=i=>pad.l+(rows.length<=1?g.plotW/2:(i/(rows.length-1))*g.plotW);\n\n  ctx.save();ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(214,170,97,.48)';ctx.lineWidth=1;\n  valid.forEach(row=>{const x=xFor(row._index),y1=g.yFor(row.low||0),y2=g.yFor(row.high||0);ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x,y1);ctx.lineTo(x,y2);ctx.stroke();});ctx.restore();\n  const avgPoints=valid.map(row=>[xFor(row._index),g.yFor(row.average||0)]);\n  chartAreaFill(ctx,avgPoints,pad.t+g.plotH,'rgba(93,155,208,.09)');chartLine(ctx,avgPoints,'#75afe0',2.2);chartEndPoint(ctx,avgPoints,'#dcebf6');\n\n  ctx.fillStyle='#748392';ctx.font='10px system-ui';\n  rows.forEach((row,i)=>{\n    if(i%4!==0&&i!==rows.length-1)return;\n    const label=String(row.label||'');const x=xFor(i),tw=ctx.measureText(label).width;\n    ctx.fillText(label,clamp(x-tw/2,pad.l,w-pad.r-tw),h-10);\n  });\n}\n\nfunction drawNewPlayerChart(){\n  const canvas=$('playerNewChart');\n  if(!canvas)return;\n  const rows=(serverStatusData?.growth?.dailyNewPlayers||[]);\n  const {ctx,w,h}=resizeCanvas(canvas);\n  ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);\n  const pad={l:42,r:12,t:14,b:34};\n  if(!rows.length){ctx.fillStyle='#8492a0';ctx.font='11px system-ui';ctx.fillText('No first-seen player history yet.',18,26);return;}\n  const maxValue=Math.max(1,...rows.map(x=>Number(x.count||0)));\n  const g=drawPlayerChartGrid(ctx,w,h,pad,maxValue);\n  const xFor=i=>pad.l+(rows.length<=1?g.plotW/2:(i/(rows.length-1))*g.plotW);\n  const points=rows.map((row,i)=>[xFor(i),g.yFor(row.count||0)]);\n  chartAreaFill(ctx,points,pad.t+g.plotH,'rgba(93,155,208,.09)');chartLine(ctx,points,'#75afe0',2.2);chartEndPoint(ctx,points,'#dcebf6');\n  ctx.fillStyle='#748392';ctx.font='10px system-ui';\n  const stride=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(rows.length/6));\n  rows.forEach((row,i)=>{if(i%stride!==0&&i!==rows.length-1)return;const parts=String(row.date||'').split('-');const label=parts.length===3?`${parts[1]}/${parts[2]}`:String(row.date||'');const x=xFor(i),tw=ctx.measureText(label).width;ctx.fillText(label,clamp(x-tw/2,pad.l,w-pad.r-tw),h-10);});\n}\n\nfunction redrawPlayerAnalyticsCharts(){\n  if(!playerAnalyticsData)return;\n  drawDailyPlayerChart();\n  drawHourlyPlayerChart();\n  drawNewPlayerChart();\n}\n\n$('serverStatusRefresh').onclick=()=>loadServerStatus(true);\n$('serverStatusReports').onclick=()=>setSection('reports',true);\n$('serverStatusPlayers').onclick=()=>setSection('admin',true);\n$('serverStatusOperations').onclick=()=>setSection('operations',true);\n$('serverStatusProfiler').onclick=()=>setSection('profiler',true);\n$('serverStatusCopy').onclick=async()=>{\n  const d=serverStatusData||{},s=d.server||{},a=d.analytics||{},r=d.reports||{};\n  const text=[\n    'Newfies Server Essentials - Server Status',\n    `Online: ${Number(s.onlinePlayers||0)} / tracked ${Number(s.trackedPlayers||0)}`,\n    `Uptime: ${fmtAdminDuration(Number(s.uptimeSeconds||0))}`,\n    `Ping: avg ${Number(s.averagePingMilliseconds||0).toFixed(0)} ms / max ${Number(s.maxPingMilliseconds||0).toFixed(0)} ms`,\n    `Today players: low ${Number(a.todayLow||0)} / avg ${Number(a.todayAverage||0).toFixed(1)} / high ${Number(a.todayHigh||0)}`,\n    `Network: ${formatBytesRate(Number(s.sentBytesPerSecond||0))} out / ${formatBytesRate(Number(s.receivedBytesPerSecond||0))} in`,\n    `Reports: ${Number(r.open||0)} open / ${Number(r.investigating||0)} investigating`\n  ].join('\\n');\n  await copyText(text,'Server status copied.');\n};\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-player-days]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>{\n  playerAnalyticsDays=Number(btn.dataset.playerDays||30);\n  localStorage.setItem('nsu.playerAnalyticsDays',String(playerAnalyticsDays));\n  loadServerStatus(true);\n});\n\nfunction reportStatusClass(status){\n  const s=String(status||'').toLowerCase();\n  return s==='resolved'?'reportStatusResolved':s==='investigating'?'reportStatusInvestigating':'reportStatusOpen';\n}\n\nasync function loadReports(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading)$('reportsState').textContent='Loading reports…';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-report-status]').forEach(btn=>btn.classList.toggle('active',btn.dataset.reportStatus===reportFilter));\n  try{\n    reportsData=await api(`/api/reports?status=${encodeURIComponent(reportFilter)}&limit=500`);\n    renderReports();\n  }catch(e){\n    $('reportsState').textContent=e.message;\n    if(showLoading)toast(e.message,'error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction renderReports(){\n  const d=reportsData||{}, rows=d.reports||[];\n  setReportsNavState(d.openCount,d.investigatingCount);\n  $('reportsState').textContent=(d.storageError?d.storageError+' · ':'')+`${Number(d.openCount||0)} open · ${Number(d.investigatingCount||0)} investigating · ${Number(d.resolvedCount||0)} resolved`;\n  $('reportsMetrics').innerHTML=\n    metric('Open',Number(d.openCount||0).toLocaleString(),Number(d.openCount||0)?'warn':'good')+\n    metric('Investigating',Number(d.investigatingCount||0).toLocaleString(),Number(d.investigatingCount||0)?'good':'')+\n    metric('Resolved',Number(d.resolvedCount||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Total reports',Number(d.totalCount||0).toLocaleString());\n  $('reportRootCommand').textContent=d.rootCommandRegisteredBySuite\n    ? '/report owned by Newfies Server Essentials'\n    : `/report left to ${d.rootCommandOwner||'another provider'} · /nse report is available`;\n  $('reportsQueueMeta').textContent=`Showing ${rows.length} ${reportFilter==='all'?'report(s)':reportFilter+' report(s)'}`;\n  $('reportsRows').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(r=>`<tr class=\"clickableRow\" data-report-id=\"${Number(r.id||0)}\">\n    <td><b>#${Number(r.id||0)}</b></td>\n    <td class=\"${reportStatusClass(r.status)}\"><b>${esc(r.status||'Open')}</b></td>\n    <td>${esc(r.reporterName||'Unknown')}</td>\n    <td class=\"reportReason\" title=\"${esc(r.reason||'')}\"><b>${esc(r.reason||'')}</b></td>\n    <td>${esc(r.assignedStaff||'Unassigned')}</td>\n    <td>${esc(fmtAdminRelativeTime(r.updatedUnixMilliseconds||r.createdUnixMilliseconds))}<div class=\"small\">${esc(fmtAdminTime(r.updatedUnixMilliseconds||r.createdUnixMilliseconds))}</div></td>\n  </tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No reports in this queue.</td></tr>';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-report-id]').forEach(row=>row.onclick=()=>showReport(Number(row.dataset.reportId||0)));\n\n  if(selectedReportId){\n    const selected=rows.find(x=>Number(x.id)===Number(selectedReportId));\n    if(selected)showReport(selectedReportId);\n    else if(reportFilter!=='all')$('reportDetail').innerHTML='<div class=\"emptyAction\"><b>The selected report is outside this filter.</b><br>Switch to All to view it again.</div>';\n  }\n}\n\nlet reportDetailRequest=0;\nasync function showReport(id,offset=0){\n  const request=++reportDetailRequest;\n  const requestedId=Number(id||0);\n  selectedReportId=requestedId;\n  try{\n    const row=await api(`/api/reports/detail?id=${requestedId}&offset=${Math.max(0,offset)}&limit=100`);\n    if(selectedReportId===requestedId&&request===reportDetailRequest)renderReportDetail(row);\n  }catch(e){if(selectedReportId===requestedId&&request===reportDetailRequest)$('reportDetail').textContent=e.message;}\n}\n\nfunction renderReportDetail(r){\n  const notes=r.notes||[], events=r.events||[];\n  const status=String(r.status||'Open');\n  const offset=Number(r.historyOffset||0), pageSize=Number(r.historyLimit||100), total=Math.max(Number(r.noteCount||0),Number(r.eventCount||0));\n  $('reportDetail').innerHTML=`\n    <div class=\"cardHeader\"><h3>Report #${Number(r.id||0)}</h3><div class=\"spacer\"></div><span class=\"${reportStatusClass(status)}\"><b>${esc(status)}</b></span></div>\n    <div class=\"grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(140px,1fr));margin-bottom:12px\">\n      <div><div class=\"metricLabel\">Reporter</div><b>${esc(r.reporterName||'Unknown')}</b></div>\n      <div><div class=\"metricLabel\">Type</div><b>General issue</b></div>\n      <div><div class=\"metricLabel\">Assigned</div><b>${esc(r.assignedStaff||'Unassigned')}</b></div>\n      <div><div class=\"metricLabel\">Created</div><b>${esc(fmtAdminTime(r.createdUnixMilliseconds))}</b></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"background:#10171d;margin-bottom:12px\"><div class=\"metricLabel\">Issue</div><div style=\"margin-top:7px;white-space:normal\">${esc(r.reason||'')}</div></div>\n    <div class=\"rowActions\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px\">\n      <button data-report-write onclick=\"reportAssignMe()\">Assign to Me</button>\n      <button data-report-write onclick=\"reportAssignCustom()\">Assign…</button>\n      <button data-report-write onclick=\"reportAction('unassign')\">Unassign</button>\n      ${status!=='Investigating'?'<button data-report-write onclick=\"reportAction(\\'investigate\\')\">Investigating</button>':''}\n      ${status!=='Resolved'?'<button data-report-write class=\"primary\" onclick=\"reportAction(\\'resolve\\')\">Resolve</button>':'<button data-report-write onclick=\"reportAction(\\'reopen\\')\">Reopen</button>'}\n      <button data-report-write onclick=\"reportAddNote()\">Add Note</button>\n      <button onclick=\"openReportPlayer()\">Open Player</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cardHeader\"><h4>Private Notes</h4><div class=\"spacer\"></div><span class=\"small\">${Number(r.noteCount??notes.length)} total · ${notes.length} on this page</span></div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">${notes.length?notes.map(n=>`<div class=\"reportTimelineItem\"><b>${esc(n.author||'Staff')}</b> <span class=\"small\">${esc(fmtAdminTime(n.unixMilliseconds))}</span><div style=\"margin-top:4px;white-space:normal\">${esc(n.text||'')}</div></div>`).join(''):'<div class=\"small\">No private staff notes yet.</div>'}</div>\n    <div class=\"cardHeader\"><h4>Timeline</h4><div class=\"spacer\"></div><span class=\"small\">${Number(r.eventCount??events.length)} total · ${events.length} on this page</span></div>\n    <div class=\"reportTimeline\">${events.length?events.map(e=>`<div class=\"reportTimelineItem\"><b>${esc(e.action||'Update')}</b> · ${esc(e.actor||'Staff')} <span class=\"small\">${esc(fmtAdminTime(e.unixMilliseconds))}</span><div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:3px;white-space:normal\">${esc(e.detail||'')}</div></div>`).join(''):'<div class=\"small\">No timeline events.</div>'}</div>\n    <div class=\"rowActions\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><button ${offset<=0?'disabled':''} onclick=\"showReport(${Number(r.id)},${Math.max(0,offset-pageSize)})\">Newer history</button><span class=\"small\">History ${Math.min(offset+1,total)}–${Math.min(offset+pageSize,total)} of ${total}</span><button ${offset+pageSize>=total?'disabled':''} onclick=\"showReport(${Number(r.id)},${offset+pageSize})\">Older history</button></div>`;\n  $('reportDetail').querySelectorAll('[data-report-write]').forEach(button=>button.disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly'||reportsData?.storageReady===false);\n}\n\nasync function reportAction(action,value='',note=''){\n  if(!selectedReportId)return;\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly'||reportsData?.storageReady===false){toast('Report changes are unavailable for this account or storage state.','error');return;}\n  try{\n    const result=await api('/api/reports/action',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({id:selectedReportId,action,value,note})});\n    toast(result.message||'Report updated.',result.success===false?'error':'success');\n    await loadReports(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nfunction reportAssignMe(){\n  const me=String($('headerUser')?.textContent||'admin').trim()||'admin';\n  reportAction('assign',me);\n}\n\nfunction reportAssignCustom(){\n  const staff=prompt('Assign this report to staff member:','');\n  if(staff===null||!staff.trim())return;\n  reportAction('assign',staff.trim());\n}\n\nfunction reportAddNote(){\n  const note=prompt('Private staff note:','');\n  if(note===null||!note.trim())return;\n  reportAction('note','',note.trim());\n}\n\nasync function openReportPlayer(){\n  const row=(reportsData?.reports||[]).find(x=>Number(x.id)===Number(selectedReportId));\n  if(!row)return;\n  setSection('admin',false);\n  await loadAdmin(true);\n  const key=row.targetUid||row.targetName||'';\n  if(key)await selectAdminPlayer(key,true);\n}\n\n$('reportsRefresh').onclick=()=>loadReports(true);\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-report-status]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>{\n  reportFilter=btn.dataset.reportStatus||'open';\n  localStorage.setItem('nsu.reportFilter',reportFilter);\n  loadReports(true);\n});\n\nasync function loadLogIntelligence(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading)$('logState').textContent='Loading log intelligence…';\n  try{\n    logIntelligenceData=await api('/api/log-intelligence');\n    renderLogIntelligence();\n  }catch(e){\n    $('logState').textContent=e.message;\n    if(showLoading)toast(e.message,'error');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction renderLogIntelligence(){\n  const d=logIntelligenceData||{}, cats=d.categories||[], issues=d.issues||[], pf=d.preflight||{}, changes=pf.modChanges||{};\n  const score=Number(d.score||0), state=d.state||'Unknown';\n  $('logState').textContent=`${state} · ${Number(d.uniqueIssues||0)} unique issue(s) · last scan ${d.lastScanUnixMilliseconds?new Date(Number(d.lastScanUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleTimeString():'not yet'}${Number(d.liveLogBacklogBytes||0)>0?` · catching up (${(Number(d.liveLogBacklogBytes)/1048576).toFixed(1)} MiB pending)`:''}${Number(d.oversizedLogLines||0)>0?` · ${Number(d.oversizedLogLines)} oversized line(s) skipped`:''}`;\n  $('logHero').innerHTML=`<div class=\"smartHero\"><div class=\"healthScore ${score>=90?'healthy':score>=75?'watch':score>=50?'investigate':'critical'}\">${score}</div><div><h3 style=\"margin-bottom:5px\">Log Health — ${esc(state)}</h3><div class=\"small\">Current source: <code>${esc(d.currentLogPath||'server-main.log not found yet')}</code></div><div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:5px\">Live collection tails only new data. Archived logs are scanned only when you press <b>Scan Archived Logs</b>.</div></div></div>`;\n  $('logMetrics').innerHTML=\n    metric('Critical',Number(d.critical||0).toLocaleString(),Number(d.critical||0)?'bad':'good')+\n    metric('High',Number(d.high||0).toLocaleString(),Number(d.high||0)?'orange':'good')+\n    metric('Moderate',Number(d.moderate||0).toLocaleString(),Number(d.moderate||0)?'warn':'good')+\n    metric('Low',Number(d.low||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Occurrences',Number(d.totalOccurrences||0).toLocaleString())+\n    metric('Unique signatures',Number(d.uniqueIssues||0).toLocaleString());\n\n  renderBadBlockEntities();\n  if($('logIssueClearAll'))$('logIssueClearAll').disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly'||issues.length===0;\n\n  $('logCategoryRows').innerHTML=cats.length?cats.map(x=>`<tr><td><b>${esc(x.category)}</b></td><td>${Number(x.occurrences||0).toLocaleString()}</td><td>${Number(x.uniqueIssues||0).toLocaleString()}</td><td class=\"${logImpactClass(x.impact)}\"><b>${esc(x.impact)}</b></td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"4\" class=\"muted\">No actionable warnings/errors have been grouped yet.</td></tr>';\n\n  $('logIssueRows').innerHTML=issues.length?issues.map((x,i)=>`<tr class=\"clickableRow\" data-log-issue=\"${i}\"><td class=\"${logImpactClass(x.impact)}\"><b>${esc(x.impact)}</b></td><td>${esc(x.category)}</td><td class=\"codeCell\"><b>${esc(x.title)}</b></td><td>${Number(x.occurrences||0).toLocaleString()}</td><td>${esc(x.likelyModName||x.likelyModId||'Unattributed')}</td><td>${esc(x.attributionConfidence||'Low')}</td><td>${x.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds?esc(new Date(Number(x.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleString()):'—'}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No actionable issue signatures found.</td></tr>';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-log-issue]').forEach(row=>row.onclick=()=>showLogIssue(Number(row.dataset.logIssue||0)));\n\n  $('preflightState').textContent=`${pf.status||'Unknown'} · ${Number(pf.loadedModCount||0)} loaded mods · game ${pf.loadedGameVersion||'unknown'} / target ${pf.targetGameVersion||'unknown'}`;\n  $('preflightMetrics').innerHTML=\n    metric('Preflight status',pf.status||'Unknown',pf.status==='Critical'?'bad':pf.status==='Investigate'?'orange':pf.status==='Watch'?'warn':'good')+\n    metric('Critical checks',Number(pf.critical||0).toLocaleString(),Number(pf.critical||0)?'bad':'good')+\n    metric('High checks',Number(pf.high||0).toLocaleString(),Number(pf.high||0)?'orange':'good')+\n    metric('Watch checks',Number(pf.watch||0).toLocaleString(),Number(pf.watch||0)?'warn':'good');\n  const checks=pf.checks||[];\n  $('preflightRows').innerHTML=checks.length?checks.map(x=>`<tr><td class=\"${preflightClass(x.severity)}\"><b>${esc(x.severity)}</b></td><td>${esc(x.category)}</td><td><b>${esc(x.title)}</b></td><td>${esc(x.detail)}</td><td>${esc(x.recommendedAction||'—')}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">No preflight checks available.</td></tr>';\n\n  const added=changes.added||[], removed=changes.removed||[], updated=changes.updated||[];\n  const list=(title,rows,klass)=>`<div class=\"card\"><h4 class=\"${klass}\">${title} (${rows.length})</h4><div class=\"small logListScroll\" style=\"margin-top:7px\">${rows.length?rows.map(x=>`<div>${esc(x)}</div>`).join(''):'None'}</div></div>`;\n  $('logModChanges').innerHTML=`<div class=\"grid\">${list('Added',added,'good')}${list('Updated',updated,'warn')}${list('Removed',removed,'bad')}</div>${changes.hasPreviousManifest?'':'<div class=\"infoBox\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">This boot established the first loaded-mod baseline. The next recorded boot will show additions, removals and version/file changes.</div>'}`;\n  enhanceTableByBodyId('logIssueRows');\n  enhanceTableByBodyId('preflightRows');\n}\n\nfunction renderBadBlockEntities(){\n  const d=((logIntelligenceData||{}).badBlockEntities||{}), rows=d.entries||[];\n  $('badBeState').textContent=`${Number(d.tracking||0)} active · ${Number(d.stopped||0)} stopped · ${Number(d.totalOccurrences||0).toLocaleString()} captured tick error(s)`;\n  $('badBeRows').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(x=>{\n    const key=esc(x.key||''), active=x.tracking!==false;\n    const pos=`${Number(x.x||0)}, ${Number(x.y||0)}, ${Number(x.z||0)}${Number(x.dimension||0)?` · dim ${Number(x.dimension||0)}`:''}`;\n    const when=`${x.firstSeenUnixMilliseconds?esc(new Date(Number(x.firstSeenUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleString()):'—'}<br><span class=\"small\">${x.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds?esc(new Date(Number(x.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleString()):'—'}</span>`;\n    let controls=`<button data-bbe-inspect=\"${key}\">Inspect</button>`;\n    if(currentSessionRole!=='ReadOnly'){\n      controls+=` <button data-bbe-teleport=\"${key}\">Teleport</button>`;\n      controls+=active?` <button data-bbe-stop=\"${key}\">Stop Tracking</button>`:` <button data-bbe-resume=\"${key}\">Resume</button>`;\n      controls+=` <button class=\"danger\" data-bbe-remove=\"${key}\">Remove Block Entity</button>`;\n      controls+=` <button class=\"danger\" data-bbe-replace=\"${key}\" data-block-code=\"${esc(x.blockCode||'')}\">Replace Block</button>`;\n    }\n    const lastAction=x.lastAction?`<div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:5px\">${esc(x.lastAction)}${x.lastActionBy?` · ${esc(x.lastActionBy)}`:''}</div>`:'';\n    return `<tr><td class=\"${active?'warn':'muted'}\"><b>${active?'Tracking':'Stopped'}</b>${lastAction}</td><td><code>${esc(pos)}</code></td><td><b>${esc(x.blockCode||'')}</b><div class=\"small\"><code>${esc(x.blockEntityType||'')}</code></div></td><td><b>${Number(x.occurrences||0).toLocaleString()}</b></td><td>${when}</td><td class=\"codeCell\">${esc(x.lastException||'Unknown exception')}<div class=\"small\">${esc(x.lastTopFrame||'')}</div></td><td><div class=\"rowActions\">${controls}</div></td></tr>`;\n  }).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No block-entity tick exceptions have been captured from the live server log.</td></tr>';\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-bbe-inspect]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>inspectBadBlockEntity(b.dataset.bbeInspect||''));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-bbe-teleport]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>teleportToBadBlockEntity(b.dataset.bbeTeleport||''));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-bbe-stop]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>badBlockEntityAction(b.dataset.bbeStop||'','stop'));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-bbe-resume]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>badBlockEntityAction(b.dataset.bbeResume||'','resume'));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-bbe-remove]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>removeBadBlockEntity(b.dataset.bbeRemove||''));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-bbe-replace]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>replaceBadBlockEntity(b.dataset.bbeReplace||'',b.dataset.blockCode||''));\n  const clearAll=$('badBeClearAll');\n  if(clearAll){\n    clearAll.disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly';\n    clearAll.onclick=async()=>{\n      if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly')return;\n      if(!confirm('Remove ALL saved Bad Block Entity Tracker entries? This clears tracker history only; it does NOT remove blocks or block entities from the world.'))return;\n      const ok=await badBlockEntityAction('','clearall');\n      if(ok)toast('Bad Block Entity Tracker entries cleared. World data was not changed.','success');\n    };\n  }\n  enhanceTableByBodyId('badBeRows');\n}\n\nasync function inspectBadBlockEntity(key){\n  try{\n    const d=await api(`/api/log-intelligence/block-entity?key=${encodeURIComponent(key)}`);\n    if(!d.success){toast(d.error||'Block inspection failed.','error');return}\n    const r=d.record||{}, live=d.live||{};\n    $('badBeDetail').style.display='block';\n    $('badBeDetail').innerHTML=`<div class=\"cardHeader\"><h3>Block Entity Inspection</h3><div class=\"spacer\"></div><button id=\"badBeDetailClose\">Close</button></div>\n      <div class=\"grid\">\n        ${metric('Position',`${Number(r.x||0)}, ${Number(r.y||0)}, ${Number(r.z||0)} · dim ${Number(r.dimension||0)}`)}\n        ${metric('Logged block',r.blockCode||'—',live.blockMatchesLogged?'good':'warn')}\n        ${metric('Live block',live.currentBlockCode||'—',live.blockMatchesLogged?'good':'warn')}\n        ${metric('Block ID',Number(live.blockId||0).toLocaleString())}\n        ${metric('Logged BE',r.blockEntityType||'—',live.blockEntityMatchesLogged?'good':'warn')}\n        ${metric('Live BE',live.blockEntityPresent?(live.blockEntityClass||'Present'):'None',live.blockEntityPresent?(live.blockEntityMatchesLogged?'good':'warn'):'bad')}\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"infoBox\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Last captured exception</b><br>${esc(r.lastException||'Unknown')}<br><code>${esc(r.lastTopFrame||'')}</code></div>\n      ${live.blockMatchesLogged?'':'<div class=\"warning\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Safety mismatch:</b> the live block no longer matches the tracked block. Remove/Replace actions will refuse to run until you refresh against the correct tracked state.</div>'}`;\n    $('badBeDetailClose').onclick=()=>{$('badBeDetail').style.display='none'};\n    $('badBeDetail').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'nearest'});\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n}\n\nasync function badBlockEntityAction(key,action,value=''){\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/log-intelligence/block-entity/action',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({key,action,value})});\n    if(d.snapshot){\n      if(!logIntelligenceData)logIntelligenceData={};\n      logIntelligenceData.badBlockEntities=d.snapshot;\n      renderBadBlockEntities();\n    }\n    toast(d.message||'Action completed.',d.success?'success':'error');\n    if(currentSection==='console')setTimeout(()=>loadConsole(false),100);\n    if(currentSection==='webmap')setTimeout(()=>loadWebMap(false),100);\n    return !!d.success;\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');return false}\n}\n\nasync function teleportToBadBlockEntity(key){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly')return;\n  const player=prompt('Online player name or UID to teleport to this block entity:',currentSessionUser||'');\n  if(player===null||!player.trim())return;\n  await badBlockEntityAction(key,'teleport',player.trim());\n}\n\nasync function removeBadBlockEntity(key){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly')return;\n  if(!confirm('Remove ONLY the block entity at this position? The block will remain, but it may become non-functional. This discards the block-entity state.'))return;\n  const ok=await badBlockEntityAction(key,'remove');\n  if(ok)await inspectBadBlockEntity(key);\n}\n\nasync function replaceBadBlockEntity(key,currentBlockCode){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly')return;\n  const target=prompt('Replacement block code. Use the same code to reset/recreate the block and its block entity, or game:air to remove it:',currentBlockCode||'game:air');\n  if(target===null||!target.trim())return;\n  if(!confirm(`Replace this block with \"${target.trim()}\"? Existing block-entity state will be discarded and NO item drops will be created.`))return;\n  const ok=await badBlockEntityAction(key,'replace',target.trim());\n  if(ok)await inspectBadBlockEntity(key);\n}\n\nfunction showLogIssue(index){\n  const x=((logIntelligenceData||{}).issues||[])[index];\n  if(!x)return;\n  const samples=x.samples||[];\n  $('logIssueDetail').style.display='block';\n  $('logIssueDetail').innerHTML=`<div class=\"cardHeader\"><h3>${esc(x.category)} — ${esc(x.impact)}</h3><div class=\"spacer\"></div><button id=\"logIssueClose\">Close</button></div>\n    <p><b>Signature:</b> <code>${esc(x.signature||'')}</code></p>\n    <p><b>Likely owner:</b> ${esc(x.likelyModName||x.likelyModId||'Unattributed')} · ${esc(x.attributionConfidence||'Low')} confidence</p>\n    <p><b>Occurrences:</b> ${Number(x.occurrences||0).toLocaleString()} · <b>First seen:</b> ${x.firstSeenUnixMilliseconds?esc(new Date(Number(x.firstSeenUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleString()):'—'} · <b>Last seen:</b> ${x.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds?esc(new Date(Number(x.lastSeenUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleString()):'—'}</p>\n    <div class=\"infoBox\"><b>Diagnosis</b><br>${esc(x.diagnosis||'')}</div>\n    <div class=\"infoBox\"><b>Health / profiler correlation</b><br>${esc(x.healthCorrelation||'')}</div>\n    <div class=\"warning\"><b>Recommended action</b><br>${esc(x.recommendedFix||'')}</div>\n    <h4 style=\"margin:12px 0 8px\">Captured context</h4>\n    ${samples.length?samples.map(s=>`<div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><div class=\"small\">${esc(s.sourceFile||'')} · ${s.archived?'archived':'live'} · ${s.unixMilliseconds?esc(new Date(Number(s.unixMilliseconds)).toLocaleString()):''}</div><pre class=\"status\" style=\"margin-top:5px;max-height:260px;overflow:auto\">${esc(s.context||'')}</pre></div>`).join(''):'<div class=\"muted\">No context sample retained.</div>'}`;\n  $('logIssueClose').onclick=()=>{$('logIssueDetail').style.display='none'};\n  $('logIssueDetail').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'nearest'});\n}\n\nasync function runLogScan(includeArchived){\n  const button=includeArchived?$('logScanArchived'):$('logScanCurrent');\n  button.disabled=true;\n  $('logState').textContent=includeArchived?'Scanning current + archived logs…':'Scanning current log…';\n  try{\n    logIntelligenceData=await api('/api/log-intelligence/scan',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({includeArchived})});\n    renderLogIntelligence();\n    toast(includeArchived?'Archived log scan completed.':'Current log scan completed.','success');\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}finally{button.disabled=false}\n}\n\nasync function runLogPreflight(){\n  $('logRunPreflight').disabled=true;\n  $('preflightState').textContent='Running preflight…';\n  try{\n    await api('/api/log-intelligence/preflight',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});\n    await loadLogIntelligence(false);\n    toast('Startup preflight re-checked.','success');\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}finally{$('logRunPreflight').disabled=false}\n}\n\n$('logRefresh').onclick=()=>loadLogIntelligence(true);\n$('logScanCurrent').onclick=()=>runLogScan(false);\n$('logScanArchived').onclick=()=>runLogScan(true);\n$('logRunPreflight').onclick=()=>runLogPreflight();\nif($('logIssueClearAll'))$('logIssueClearAll').onclick=async()=>{\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly')return;\n  if(!confirm('Clear ALL retained Issue Signatures? This does not delete server log files, startup preflight results, audit history, or Bad Block Entity Tracker history.'))return;\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/log-intelligence/issues/clear',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});\n    logIntelligenceData=d.logIntelligence||await api('/api/log-intelligence');\n    if($('logIssueDetail'))$('logIssueDetail').style.display='none';\n    renderLogIntelligence();\n    toast(d.message||'Issue signatures cleared.','success');\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n};\n\nfunction resolveWebMapUrl(d){\n  const configured=String(d?.mapUrl||'').trim();\n  if(configured)return configured;\n  const port=Number(d?.port||0);\n  if(port>0)return `http://${window.location.hostname}:${port}/`;\n  return '';\n}\n\nfunction fmtDurationMs(ms,calculating=false){if(calculating||!Number.isFinite(ms)||ms<0)return 'Calculating…';let sec=Math.max(0,Math.round(ms/1000)),h=Math.floor(sec/3600),m=Math.floor((sec%3600)/60),r=sec%60;return h?`${h}:${String(m).padStart(2,'0')}:${String(r).padStart(2,'0')}`:`${m}:${String(r).padStart(2,'0')}`}\n\nfunction webMapExportScheduleStateHtml(d){\n  if(d?.exportTerrainOnStart===true)return '<span class=\"warn\"><b>QUEUED FOR NEXT START</b></span>';\n  if(d?.automaticStartupExportEnabled===true){\n    const days=Math.max(1,Number(d.automaticStartupExportIntervalDays||7));\n    if(d?.automaticStartupExportDue===true)return `<span class=\"warn\"><b>AUTO DUE NEXT START · ${days}d</b></span>`;\n    const due=Number(d?.nextAutomaticStartupExportUnixMilliseconds||0);\n    return `<span class=\"good\"><b>AUTO ${days}d</b></span>${due>0?` · next due ${esc(fmtAdminTime(due))}`:''}`;\n  }\n  return '<span class=\"good\"><b>OFF</b></span>';\n}\n\nfunction webMapTerrainPhaseLabel(phase){const p=String(phase||'working').toLowerCase();return ({coverage:'Scanning explored terrain',rendering:'Rendering terrain',overview:'Building overview',pyramid:'Building zoom levels',finalizing:'Publishing map cache',complete:'Map update complete',cancelled:'Export cancelled',failed:'Export failed',waiting:'Waiting'})[p]||p.replace(/[-_]+/g,' ').replace(/\\b\\w/g,c=>c.toUpperCase())}\nfunction webMapTerrainProgressPercent(t){const direct=Number(t?.progressPercent);if(Number.isFinite(direct))return Math.max(0,Math.min(100,direct));const total=Number(t?.totalTiles||0),done=Number(t?.writtenTiles||0);return total>0?Math.max(0,Math.min(100,5+(done/total)*85)):0}\nfunction renderWebMapTerrainProgress(t){const box=$('webMapTerrainProgress');if(!box)return;const active=t?.state==='exporting';box.classList.toggle('active',active);if(!active)return;const pct=webMapTerrainProgressPercent(t),phase=webMapTerrainPhaseLabel(t?.phase);$('webMapTerrainProgressTitle').textContent=phase;$('webMapTerrainProgressPct').textContent=`${pct.toFixed(pct<10?1:0)}%`;$('webMapTerrainProgressFill').style.width=`${pct.toFixed(2)}%`;const elapsed=Number(t?.startedUnixMilliseconds||0)>0?Date.now()-Number(t.startedUnixMilliseconds):Number(t?.totalElapsedMilliseconds||0);const eta=Number(t?.estimatedRemainingMilliseconds);const parts=[`${Number(t?.writtenTiles||0).toLocaleString()} / ${Number(t?.totalTiles||0).toLocaleString()} tiles`,`${Number(t?.processedChunkColumns||0).toLocaleString()} chunk columns`,`elapsed ${fmtDurationMs(elapsed)}`,`ETA ${fmtDurationMs(eta,eta<0)}`];$('webMapTerrainProgressMeta').innerHTML=parts.map(x=>`<span>${esc(x)}</span>`).join('')}\nfunction scheduleWebMapTerrainProgressPoll(){if(webMapTerrainProgressTimer||document.hidden||currentSection!=='webmap'||webMapData?.terrain?.state!=='exporting')return;webMapTerrainProgressTimer=setTimeout(pollWebMapTerrainProgress,1000)}\nasync function pollWebMapTerrainProgress(){webMapTerrainProgressTimer=null;if(document.hidden||currentSection!=='webmap')return;try{const t=await api('/api/webmap/terrain/status');if(!webMapData)webMapData={};webMapData.terrain=t;renderWebMapTerrainProgress(t);$('webMapTerrainState').textContent=`${t.state||'unknown'}${t.serverLockActive?' · GAME SERVER LOCKED':''}`;$('webMapTerrainMessage').textContent=(t.message||'')+(t.lastError?` Error: ${t.lastError}`:'');if(t.state==='exporting'){scheduleWebMapTerrainProgressPoll()}else{await loadWebMap(false)}}catch{if(webMapData?.terrain?.state==='exporting')scheduleWebMapTerrainProgressPoll()}}\n\nfunction renderWebMap(d){\n  webMapData=d||{};\n  const readOnly=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly';\n  ['webMapSave','webMapTurnOff','webMapEnabled','webMapBind','webMapPort','webMapTitle','webMapPublicUrl','webMapDashboardUrl','webMapShowActivity','webMapShowPlayers','webMapShowWaypoints','webMapShowBadBe','webMapShowLeaderboards','webMapLeaderboardShowPlaytime','webMapLeaderboardShowXSkills','webMapLeaderboardTopPlayers','webMapLeaderboardRefreshSeconds','webMapPlayerIconRefreshSeconds','webMapExportNormalTerrain','webMapExportSepiaTerrain','webMapExportTopographicTerrain','webMapExportTerrainOnStart','webMapAutomaticStartupExportEnabled','webMapAutomaticStartupExportIntervalDays','webMapUseIncrementalTerrainExport','webMapLockDuringTerrainExport','webMapSaveExportSchedule','webMapUpdateTerrain','webMapForceTerrainExport','webMapTerrainTileSize','webMapActivityWindow','webMapActivityLimit','webMapPlayerMajorWaypointLimit','webMapPlayerMinorWaypointLimit','webMapMaximumZoomOutSpanBlocks','webMapDefaultViewSpanBlocks'].forEach(id=>{if($(id))$(id).disabled=readOnly;});\n  if($('webMapShowPlayers'))$('webMapShowPlayers').disabled=readOnly;\n  if($('webMapUpdateTerrain'))$('webMapUpdateTerrain').disabled=readOnly||d.enabled===false||d.terrain?.state==='exporting';if($('webMapForceTerrainExport'))$('webMapForceTerrainExport').disabled=readOnly||d.enabled===false||d.terrain?.state==='exporting';if($('webMapTurnOff'))$('webMapTurnOff').disabled=readOnly||d.enabled===false;\n  if($('webMapExportScheduleState'))$('webMapExportScheduleState').innerHTML=webMapExportScheduleStateHtml(d);\n  ['webMapWaypointName','webMapWaypointX','webMapWaypointY','webMapWaypointZ','webMapWaypointDimension','webMapWaypointType','webMapWaypointIcon','webMapWaypointColor','webMapWaypointDescription','webMapWaypointSave','webMapWaypointClear'].forEach(id=>{if($(id))$(id).disabled=readOnly;});\n  const url=resolveWebMapUrl(d);\n  setNavStatus('webmap',d.running?'good':(d.enabled?'bad':'neutral'),d.running?'Web Map listener running':(d.enabled?'Web Map enabled but listener stopped':'Web Map disabled'));\n  $('webMapState').textContent=`${d.running?'Listening':'Stopped'} · ${d.bindAddress||'0.0.0.0'}:${Number(d.port||0)}${d.lastError?` · ${d.lastError}`:''}`;\n  $('webMapMetrics').innerHTML=\n    metric('Native host',d.running?'Running':'Stopped',d.running?'good':d.enabled?'bad':'warn')+\n    metric('Map port',Number(d.port||0))+\n    metric('Terrain',esc(d.terrain?.state||'pending'),d.terrain?.state==='ready'?'good':d.terrain?.state==='failed'?'bad':'warn')+\n    metric('Terrain tiles',Number(d.terrainManifest?.tileCount||d.terrain?.writtenTiles||0))+\n    metric('Dirty map chunks',Number(d.pendingDirtyMapChunks||0),Number(d.pendingDirtyMapChunks||0)>0?'warn':'good')+\n    metric('Next-start export',d.exportTerrainOnStart===true?'QUEUED':'Off',d.exportTerrainOnStart===true?'warn':'good')+\n    metric('Automatic startup',d.automaticStartupExportEnabled===true?(d.automaticStartupExportDue===true?'DUE':`Every ${Number(d.automaticStartupExportIntervalDays||7)}d`):'Off',d.automaticStartupExportDue===true?'warn':d.automaticStartupExportEnabled===true?'good':'')+\n    metric('Incremental startup',d.useIncrementalTerrainExport!==false?'On':'Off',d.useIncrementalTerrainExport!==false?'good':'warn')+\n    metric('Player layer privacy',d.showPlayers===true?'Publishing':'Off',d.showPlayers===true?'warn':'good')+\n    metric('Players cache',Number((d.players||[]).length))+\n    metric('Waypoints',Number((d.waypoints||[]).length),Number((d.waypoints||[]).length)>0?'good':'')+\n    metric('Activity points',Number((d.activity||[]).length))+\n    metric('Bad BE markers',Number((d.badBlockEntities||[]).length),Number((d.badBlockEntities||[]).length)?'warn':'good')+\n    metric('Player icon refresh',`${Number(d.playerRefreshSeconds||60)}s`)+\n    metric('Map refresh',`${Number(d.publicRefreshSeconds||30)}s`);\n  $('webMapEnabled').checked=d.enabled!==false;\n  $('webMapBind').value=d.bindAddress||'0.0.0.0';\n  $('webMapPort').value=Number(d.port||9466);\n  $('webMapTitle').value=d.title||\"Newfie's Server Map\";\n  $('webMapPublicUrl').value=d.mapUrl||'';\n  $('webMapDashboardUrl').value=d.dashboardUrl||'';\n  $('webMapShowActivity').checked=d.showActivity===true;\n  $('webMapShowPlayers').checked=d.showPlayers===true;\n  $('webMapPlayerIconRefreshSeconds').value=d.playerRefreshSeconds??60;\n  $('webMapShowWaypoints').checked=d.showWaypoints!==false;\n  if($('webMapShowLeaderboards'))$('webMapShowLeaderboards').checked=d.showLeaderboards!==false;\n  if($('webMapLeaderboardShowPlaytime'))$('webMapLeaderboardShowPlaytime').checked=d.leaderboardShowPlaytime!==false;\n  if($('webMapLeaderboardShowXSkills'))$('webMapLeaderboardShowXSkills').checked=d.leaderboardShowXSkills!==false;\n  if($('webMapLeaderboardTopPlayers'))$('webMapLeaderboardTopPlayers').value=Math.max(3,Number(d.leaderboardTopPlayers??5));\n  if($('webMapLeaderboardRefreshSeconds'))$('webMapLeaderboardRefreshSeconds').value=Math.max(30,Number(d.leaderboardRefreshSeconds??60));\n  $('webMapShowBadBe').checked=d.showBadBlockEntities===true;\n  if($('webMapExportNormalTerrain'))$('webMapExportNormalTerrain').checked=d.exportNormalTerrain!==false;\n  if($('webMapExportSepiaTerrain'))$('webMapExportSepiaTerrain').checked=d.exportSepiaTerrain!==false;\n  if($('webMapExportTopographicTerrain'))$('webMapExportTopographicTerrain').checked=d.exportTopographicTerrain!==false;\n  $('webMapExportTerrainOnStart').checked=d.exportTerrainOnStart===true;\n  if($('webMapAutomaticStartupExportEnabled'))$('webMapAutomaticStartupExportEnabled').checked=d.automaticStartupExportEnabled===true;\n  if($('webMapAutomaticStartupExportIntervalDays'))$('webMapAutomaticStartupExportIntervalDays').value=Math.max(1,Number(d.automaticStartupExportIntervalDays||7));\n  $('webMapUseIncrementalTerrainExport').checked=d.useIncrementalTerrainExport!==false;\n  $('webMapLockDuringTerrainExport').checked=d.lockServerDuringTerrainExport!==false;\n  $('webMapTerrainTileSize').value=Number(d.terrainTileSize||256);\n  const terrain=d.terrain||{};\n  $('webMapTerrainState').textContent=`${terrain.state||'unknown'}${terrain.serverLockActive?' · GAME SERVER LOCKED':''}`;\n  $('webMapTerrainMetrics').innerHTML=metric('Mode',esc(terrain.exportMode||'pending'),String(terrain.exportMode||'').includes('incremental')?'good':String(terrain.exportMode||'').includes('full')?'warn':'')+metric('Phase',esc(webMapTerrainPhaseLabel(terrain.phase||terrain.state||'waiting')),terrain.state==='exporting'?'warn':terrain.state==='ready'?'good':'')+metric('Progress',`${webMapTerrainProgressPercent(terrain).toFixed(0)}%`,terrain.state==='exporting'?'warn':terrain.state==='ready'?'good':'')+metric('Trigger',esc(terrain.trigger||'startup'))+metric('ETA',terrain.state==='exporting'?fmtDurationMs(Number(terrain.estimatedRemainingMilliseconds||0),Number(terrain.estimatedRemainingMilliseconds)<0):'—',terrain.state==='exporting'?'warn':'')+metric('Avg / tile',Number(terrain.averageMillisecondsPerTile||0)>0?`${Number(terrain.averageMillisecondsPerTile).toFixed(0)} ms`:'—')+metric('Rendered tiles',`${Number(terrain.writtenTiles||0).toLocaleString()} / ${Number(terrain.totalTiles||0).toLocaleString()}`)+metric('Reused tiles',Number(terrain.reusedTiles||0).toLocaleString(),'good')+metric('Dirty chunks',Number(terrain.dirtyChunkCount||0).toLocaleString(),Number(terrain.dirtyChunkCount||0)>0?'warn':'good')+metric('Chunk loads',Number(terrain.processedChunkColumns||0).toLocaleString())+metric('Coverage scan',`${Number(terrain.coverageScanMilliseconds||0).toLocaleString()} ms`)+metric('World reads',`${Number(terrain.worldReadMilliseconds||0).toLocaleString()} ms`)+metric('Render',`${Number(terrain.renderMilliseconds||0).toLocaleString()} ms`)+metric('PNG writes',`${Number(terrain.pngWriteMilliseconds||0).toLocaleString()} ms`)+metric('Overview',`${Number(terrain.overviewMilliseconds||0).toLocaleString()} ms`)+metric('LOD cache',`${Number(terrain.lodWriteMilliseconds||0).toLocaleString()} ms`)+metric('Total',`${Number(terrain.totalElapsedMilliseconds||0).toLocaleString()} ms`)+metric('Last export time',Number(d.lastTerrainExportDurationMilliseconds||0)>0?fmtDurationMs(Number(d.lastTerrainExportDurationMilliseconds||0)):'Never','good')+metric('Pooled tile buffer',`${(Number(terrain.peakWorkingBufferBytes||0)/1048576).toFixed(2)} MiB`)+metric('Palette cache',Number(terrain.blockColorCacheEntries||0).toLocaleString())+metric('Overview resolution',`${Number(d.terrainManifest?.overviewCellSizeBlocks||terrain.overviewCellSizeBlocks||0)||'—'} blocks/px`)+metric('Tile size',`${Number(terrain.tileSize||d.terrainTileSize||256)} px`)+metric('Last success',terrain.lastSuccessfulUnixMilliseconds?fmtAdminTime(terrain.lastSuccessfulUnixMilliseconds):'Never',terrain.lastError?'bad':'good');\n  $('webMapTerrainMessage').textContent=(terrain.message||'')+(terrain.lastError?` Error: ${terrain.lastError}`:'');\n  renderWebMapTerrainProgress(terrain);\n  if(terrain.state==='exporting')scheduleWebMapTerrainProgressPoll();\n  $('webMapActivityWindow').value=Number(d.activityWindowMinutes||60);\n  $('webMapActivityLimit').value=Number(d.maxActivityMarkers||150);\n  if($('webMapPlayerMajorWaypointLimit'))$('webMapPlayerMajorWaypointLimit').value=Math.max(0,Number(d.playerMajorWaypointLimit??5));\n  if($('webMapPlayerMinorWaypointLimit'))$('webMapPlayerMinorWaypointLimit').value=Math.max(0,Number(d.playerMinorWaypointLimit??10));\n  if($('webMapMaximumZoomOutSpanBlocks'))$('webMapMaximumZoomOutSpanBlocks').value=Math.max(2048,Number(d.maximumZoomOutSpanBlocks??50000));\n  if($('webMapDefaultViewSpanBlocks'))$('webMapDefaultViewSpanBlocks').value=Math.max(512,Number(d.defaultViewSpanBlocks??8000));\n  const liveGateNote=d.showPlayers===true?' Live player coordinates are currently enabled on the public map.':' Live player coordinates are currently disabled.';\n  $('webMapNote').textContent=(d.note||'')+liveGateNote+(url?` Public map: ${url}`:'');\n  const players=d.players||[];\n  $('webMapPlayerRows').innerHTML=players.length?players.map(x=>`<tr><td><b>${esc(x.name||'')}</b></td><td><code>${Number(x.x||0).toFixed(1)}, ${Number(x.y||0).toFixed(1)}, ${Number(x.z||0).toFixed(1)}</code></td><td>${esc(String(x.dimension??''))}</td><td>${Number(x.pingMilliseconds||0)} ms</td><td>${fmtAdminDuration(Number(x.totalPlaySeconds||0))}<div class=\"small\">session ${fmtAdminDuration(Number(x.sessionSeconds||0))}</div></td></tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">${d.showPlayers===true?'No players are currently online or the player snapshot has not populated yet.':'Player layer is disabled.'}</td></tr>`;\n  const waypoints=d.waypoints||[];\n  $('webMapWaypointRows').innerHTML=waypoints.length?waypoints.map(w=>{\n    const pos=`${Number(w.x||0).toFixed(1)}, ${Number(w.y||0).toFixed(1)}, ${Number(w.z||0).toFixed(1)}`;\n    const dot=`<span style=\"display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;background:${/^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$/.test(w.color||'')?w.color:'#38bdf8'};transform:rotate(45deg);margin-right:7px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0\"></span>`;\n    let controls=`<button data-map-waypoint-edit=\"${esc(w.id||'')}\">Edit</button>`;\n    if(currentSessionRole!=='ReadOnly')controls+=` <button class=\"danger\" data-map-waypoint-delete=\"${esc(w.id||'')}\">Delete</button>`;\n    return `<tr><td>${dot}<b>${esc(w.name||'')}</b> <span class=\"small\">${esc((w.type||'major').toUpperCase())} · ${esc((w.icon||'pin').toUpperCase())}${w.isPlayerWaypoint?' · PLAYER':''}</span><div class=\"small\">${esc(w.description||'')}</div></td><td><code>${esc(pos)}</code><div class=\"small\">Dimension ${Number(w.dimension||0)}</div></td><td>${w.updatedUnixMilliseconds?fmtAdminTime(w.updatedUnixMilliseconds):'—'}<div class=\"small\">${esc(w.updatedBy||w.createdBy||'')}</div></td><td><div class=\"rowActions\">${controls}</div></td></tr>`;\n  }).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"4\" class=\"muted\">No Web Map waypoints have been created for this world.</td></tr>';\n  const bes=d.badBlockEntities||[];\n  $('webMapBadBeRows').innerHTML=bes.length?bes.map(x=>{\n    const key=esc(x.key||''),pos=`${Number(x.x||0)}, ${Number(x.y||0)}, ${Number(x.z||0)}`;\n    let controls=`<button data-map-bbe-inspect=\"${key}\">Inspect</button>`;\n    if(currentSessionRole!=='ReadOnly')controls+=` <button data-map-bbe-teleport=\"${key}\">Teleport</button>`;\n    return `<tr><td><code>${esc(pos)}</code></td><td><b>${esc(x.blockCode||'')}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.blockEntityType||'')}</div></td><td class=\"warn\"><b>${Number(x.occurrences||0).toLocaleString()}</b></td><td><div class=\"rowActions\">${controls}</div></td></tr>`;\n  }).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"4\" class=\"muted\">Bad block layer is disabled or no tracked faults exist.</td></tr>';\n  const activity=d.activity||[];\n  $('webMapActivityRows').innerHTML=activity.length?activity.map(x=>`<tr><td><code>${Number(x.x||0)}, ${Number(x.y||0)}, ${Number(x.z||0)}</code><div class=\"small\">${esc(String(x.dimension??''))}</div></td><td>${esc(x.blockCode||'')}</td><td><b>${Number(x.eventCount||0).toLocaleString()}</b><div class=\"small\">${Number(x.distinctActions||0)} action types</div></td><td><button data-map-copy=\"${Number(x.x||0)} ${Number(x.y||0)} ${Number(x.z||0)}\">Copy coords</button></td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"4\" class=\"muted\">Activity layer is disabled, BlockLogger is unavailable, or the cache has not populated yet.</td></tr>';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-map-waypoint-edit]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>editWebMapWaypoint(b.dataset.mapWaypointEdit||''));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-map-waypoint-delete]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>deleteWebMapWaypoint(b.dataset.mapWaypointDelete||''));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-map-bbe-inspect]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>inspectBadBlockEntity(b.dataset.mapBbeInspect||''));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-map-bbe-teleport]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>teleportToBadBlockEntity(b.dataset.mapBbeTeleport||''));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-map-copy]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(b.dataset.mapCopy||'');toast('Coordinates copied.','success')}catch{toast('Could not copy coordinates.','error')}});\n}\n\nasync function loadWebMap(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading)$('webMapState').textContent='Loading…';\n  try{renderWebMap(await api('/api/webmap'));}\n  catch(e){$('webMapState').textContent='Load failed';toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nasync function saveWebMap(){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly')return;\n  const payload={\n    enabled:$('webMapEnabled').checked,\n    bindAddress:$('webMapBind').value.trim()||'0.0.0.0',\n    port:Number($('webMapPort').value||9466),\n    title:$('webMapTitle').value.trim(),\n    publicUrl:$('webMapPublicUrl').value.trim(),\n    dashboardUrl:$('webMapDashboardUrl').value.trim(),\n    showActivity:$('webMapShowActivity').checked,\n    allowLivePlayerData:$('webMapShowPlayers').checked,\n    showPlayers:$('webMapShowPlayers').checked,\n    playerIconRefreshSeconds:Math.max(1,Math.min(300,Math.round(Number($('webMapPlayerIconRefreshSeconds').value)||60))),\n    showWaypoints:$('webMapShowWaypoints').checked,\n    showBadBlockEntities:$('webMapShowBadBe').checked,\n    showLeaderboards:$('webMapShowLeaderboards')?$('webMapShowLeaderboards').checked:true,\n    leaderboardShowPlaytime:$('webMapLeaderboardShowPlaytime')?$('webMapLeaderboardShowPlaytime').checked:true,\n    leaderboardShowXSkills:$('webMapLeaderboardShowXSkills')?$('webMapLeaderboardShowXSkills').checked:true,\n    leaderboardTopPlayers:Math.max(3,Math.min(20,Number($('webMapLeaderboardTopPlayers')?.value??5))),\n    leaderboardRefreshSeconds:Math.max(30,Math.min(300,Number($('webMapLeaderboardRefreshSeconds')?.value??60))),\n    exportNormalTerrain:$('webMapExportNormalTerrain')?$('webMapExportNormalTerrain').checked:true,\n    exportSepiaTerrain:$('webMapExportSepiaTerrain')?$('webMapExportSepiaTerrain').checked:true,\n    exportTopographicTerrain:$('webMapExportTopographicTerrain')?$('webMapExportTopographicTerrain').checked:true,\n    exportTerrainOnStart:$('webMapExportTerrainOnStart').checked,\n    automaticStartupExportEnabled:$('webMapAutomaticStartupExportEnabled')?$('webMapAutomaticStartupExportEnabled').checked:false,\n    automaticStartupExportIntervalDays:Math.max(1,Math.min(365,Number($('webMapAutomaticStartupExportIntervalDays')?.value||7))),\n    useIncrementalTerrainExport:$('webMapUseIncrementalTerrainExport').checked,\n    lockServerDuringTerrainExport:$('webMapLockDuringTerrainExport').checked,\n    terrainTileSize:Number($('webMapTerrainTileSize').value||256),\n    activityWindowMinutes:Number($('webMapActivityWindow').value||60),\n    maxActivityMarkers:Number($('webMapActivityLimit').value||150),\n    playerMajorWaypointLimit:Math.max(0,Math.min(100,Number($('webMapPlayerMajorWaypointLimit')?.value??5))),\n    playerMinorWaypointLimit:Math.max(0,Math.min(100,Number($('webMapPlayerMinorWaypointLimit')?.value??10))),\n    maximumZoomOutSpanBlocks:Math.max(2048,Math.min(100000,Number($('webMapMaximumZoomOutSpanBlocks')?.value??50000))),\n    defaultViewSpanBlocks:Math.max(512,Math.min(Number($('webMapMaximumZoomOutSpanBlocks')?.value??50000),Number($('webMapDefaultViewSpanBlocks')?.value??8000)))\n  };\n  if(!payload.exportNormalTerrain&&!payload.exportSepiaTerrain&&!payload.exportTopographicTerrain){toast('Select at least one terrain export layer.','error');return;}\n  try{await api('/api/webmap/config',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(payload)});toast('Native Web Map settings saved. Terrain export layer choices apply to the next terrain update/rebuild.','success');await loadWebMap(false);}\n  catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\n\nasync function turnWebMapOff(){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly'||webMapData?.enabled===false)return;\n  const exporting=webMapData?.terrain?.state==='exporting';\n  const message=exporting?'Turn the Native Web Map OFF and cancel the active forced terrain export? The current chunk load will finish, then the previous published terrain cache will be kept.':'Turn the Native Web Map OFF? The listener will stop immediately and queued terrain exports will remain paused.';\n  if(!confirm(message))return;\n  $('webMapEnabled').checked=false;\n  await saveWebMap();\n}\n\nasync function saveWebMapExportSchedule(){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly')return;\n  const payload={\n    exportTerrainOnStart:$('webMapExportTerrainOnStart').checked,\n    automaticStartupExportEnabled:$('webMapAutomaticStartupExportEnabled')?$('webMapAutomaticStartupExportEnabled').checked:false,\n    automaticStartupExportIntervalDays:Math.max(1,Math.min(365,Number($('webMapAutomaticStartupExportIntervalDays')?.value||7))),\n    useIncrementalTerrainExport:$('webMapUseIncrementalTerrainExport').checked,\n    lockServerDuringTerrainExport:$('webMapLockDuringTerrainExport').checked\n  };\n  try{await api('/api/webmap/export-schedule',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(payload)});toast('Export schedule saved without changing the Web Map enabled/listener settings.','success');await loadWebMap(false);}\n  catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nasync function updateWebMapTerrain(){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly')return;\n  try{\n    const r=await api('/api/webmap/terrain/update',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});\n    toast(r.message||'Changed terrain update started.','success');\n    await loadWebMap(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nasync function forceWebMapTerrainExport(){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly')return;\n  if(!confirm('Run a FULL terrain rebuild while the game server is running? This recreates the entire explored terrain cache and may temporarily increase disk/CPU load.'))return;\n  try{\n    const r=await api('/api/webmap/terrain/force',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});\n    toast(r.message||'Full terrain rebuild started.','success');\n    await loadWebMap(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nfunction clearWebMapWaypointForm(){\n  $('webMapWaypointId').value='';\n  $('webMapWaypointName').value='';\n  $('webMapWaypointX').value='';$('webMapWaypointY').value='';$('webMapWaypointZ').value='';\n  $('webMapWaypointDimension').value='0';if($('webMapWaypointType'))$('webMapWaypointType').value='major';if($('webMapWaypointIcon'))$('webMapWaypointIcon').value='pin';$('webMapWaypointColor').value='#38bdf8';$('webMapWaypointDescription').value='';\n  $('webMapWaypointSave').textContent='Add Waypoint';\n}\n\nfunction editWebMapWaypoint(id){\n  const w=(webMapData?.waypoints||[]).find(x=>String(x.id||'')===String(id||''));if(!w)return;\n  $('webMapWaypointId').value=w.id||'';$('webMapWaypointName').value=w.name||'';\n  $('webMapWaypointX').value=Number(w.x||0);$('webMapWaypointY').value=Number(w.y||0);$('webMapWaypointZ').value=Number(w.z||0);\n  $('webMapWaypointDimension').value=Number(w.dimension||0);if($('webMapWaypointType'))$('webMapWaypointType').value=(w.type==='minor'?'minor':'major');if($('webMapWaypointIcon'))$('webMapWaypointIcon').value=w.icon||'pin';$('webMapWaypointColor').value=/^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$/.test(w.color||'')?w.color:'#38bdf8';$('webMapWaypointDescription').value=w.description||'';\n  $('webMapWaypointSave').textContent='Save Waypoint';\n  $('webMapWaypointName').focus();\n}\n\nasync function saveWebMapWaypoint(){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly')return;\n  const x=Number($('webMapWaypointX').value),y=Number($('webMapWaypointY').value),z=Number($('webMapWaypointZ').value);\n  const name=$('webMapWaypointName').value.trim();\n  if(!name){toast('Waypoint name is required.','error');return}\n  if(!Number.isFinite(x)||!Number.isFinite(y)||!Number.isFinite(z)){toast('Enter valid X, Y and Z coordinates.','error');return}\n  const payload={id:$('webMapWaypointId').value.trim(),name,description:$('webMapWaypointDescription').value.trim(),type:$('webMapWaypointType')?.value||'major',icon:$('webMapWaypointIcon')?.value||'pin',x,y,z,dimension:Number($('webMapWaypointDimension').value||0),color:$('webMapWaypointColor').value||'#38bdf8'};\n  try{await api('/api/webmap/waypoint/save',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(payload)});toast(payload.id?'Waypoint updated.':'Waypoint created.','success');clearWebMapWaypointForm();await loadWebMap(false)}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n}\n\nasync function deleteWebMapWaypoint(id){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly'||!id)return;\n  const w=(webMapData?.waypoints||[]).find(x=>String(x.id||'')===String(id));\n  if(!confirm(`Delete waypoint \"${w?.name||'this waypoint'}\"?`))return;\n  try{await api('/api/webmap/waypoint/delete',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({id})});toast('Waypoint deleted.','success');if($('webMapWaypointId').value===id)clearWebMapWaypointForm();await loadWebMap(false)}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n}\n\nfunction openWebMap(){\n  const url=resolveWebMapUrl(webMapData||{});if(!url){toast('Map host is not configured.','error');return;}\n  window.open(url,'_blank','noopener,noreferrer');\n}\n\n$('webMapRefresh').onclick=()=>loadWebMap(true);$('webMapSave').onclick=saveWebMap;$('webMapTurnOff').onclick=turnWebMapOff;$('webMapOpen').onclick=openWebMap;$('webMapSaveExportSchedule').onclick=saveWebMapExportSchedule;$('webMapUpdateTerrain').onclick=updateWebMapTerrain;$('webMapForceTerrainExport').onclick=forceWebMapTerrainExport;$('webMapWaypointSave').onclick=saveWebMapWaypoint;$('webMapWaypointClear').onclick=clearWebMapWaypointForm;\n\n__NSS_PATCH_GENERATOR_SCRIPT__\n\nfunction customPatchFormPayload(){\n  return {\n    id:($('patchId')?.value||'').trim(),\n    name:($('patchName')?.value||'').trim(),\n    enabled:!!$('patchEnabled')?.checked,\n    assemblyName:($('patchAssembly')?.value||'').trim(),\n    typeName:($('patchType')?.value||'').trim(),\n    methodName:($('patchMethod')?.value||'').trim(),\n    parameterTypes:String($('patchParameters')?.value||'').split(',').map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean),\n    mode:$('patchMode')?.value||'Observe',\n    throttleMilliseconds:Math.max(50,Math.min(60000,Math.floor(Number($('patchThrottle')?.value||250)))),\n    notes:($('patchNotes')?.value||'').trim()\n  };\n}\nfunction clearCustomPatchForm(){\n  if($('patchId'))$('patchId').value='';\n  if($('patchName'))$('patchName').value='';\n  if($('patchEnabled'))$('patchEnabled').checked=false;\n  if($('patchAssembly'))$('patchAssembly').value='';\n  if($('patchType'))$('patchType').value='';\n  if($('patchMethod'))$('patchMethod').value='';\n  if($('patchParameters'))$('patchParameters').value='';\n  if($('patchMode'))$('patchMode').value='Observe';\n  if($('patchThrottle'))$('patchThrottle').value='250';\n  if($('patchNotes'))$('patchNotes').value='';\n  if($('patchEditorState'))$('patchEditorState').textContent='New patch · disabled until you explicitly enable it.';\n}\nfunction fillCustomPatchForm(def){\n  $('patchAdvancedRuntime').open=true;\n  def=def||{};\n  $('patchId').value=def.id||'';$('patchName').value=def.name||'';$('patchEnabled').checked=!!def.enabled;\n  $('patchAssembly').value=def.assemblyName||'';$('patchType').value=def.typeName||'';$('patchMethod').value=def.methodName||'';\n  $('patchParameters').value=(def.parameterTypes||[]).join(', ');$('patchMode').value=def.mode||'Observe';\n  $('patchThrottle').value=Number(def.throttleMilliseconds||250);$('patchNotes').value=def.notes||'';\n  $('patchEditorState').textContent=def.id?'Editing saved patch. Save reapplies enabled Patch Studio definitions.':'Generated template · review target before saving.';\n  window.scrollTo({top:Math.max(0,$('customPatches').offsetTop-90),behavior:'smooth'});\n}\nfunction renderCustomPatches(){\n  const d=customPatchesData||{}, rows=d.patches||[], suggestions=d.suggestions||[];\n  if($('patchStudioState'))$('patchStudioState').textContent=d.available===false?'Unavailable':`${rows.length} patch definition(s) · ${d.harmonyId||'Patch Studio'}`;\n  if($('patchStudioMetrics'))$('patchStudioMetrics').innerHTML=\n    metric('Definitions',rows.length)+metric('Enabled',rows.filter(x=>x.definition?.enabled).length,rows.some(x=>x.definition?.runtimeStatus==='Error')?'warn':'good')+\n    metric('Applied',rows.filter(x=>x.definition?.runtimeStatus==='Applied').length,'good')+metric('Errors',rows.filter(x=>x.definition?.runtimeStatus==='Error').length,rows.some(x=>x.definition?.runtimeStatus==='Error')?'bad':'good');\n  const body=$('patchRows');\n  if(body)body.innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map((r,i)=>{const x=r.definition||{},status=x.runtimeStatus||'Disabled',state=status==='Applied'?'good':status==='Error'?'bad':x.enabled?'warn':'muted';return `<tr><td><b>${esc(x.name||'Unnamed')}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.notes||'')}</div></td><td><code>${esc(x.assemblyName||'')}</code><div class=\"small\"><code>${esc(x.typeName||'')}.${esc(x.methodName||'')}(${esc((x.parameterTypes||[]).join(', '))})</code></div></td><td><b>${esc(x.mode||'Observe')}</b>${String(x.mode||'').toLowerCase()==='throttlevoid'?`<div class=\"small\">${Number(x.throttleMilliseconds||0)} ms</div>`:''}</td><td class=\"${state}\"><b>${esc(status)}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.runtimeMessage||'')}</div></td><td>${Number(r.calls||0).toLocaleString()} calls<div class=\"small\">${Number(r.skipped||0).toLocaleString()} skipped · avg ${Number(r.averageMilliseconds||0).toFixed(2)} ms · max ${Number(r.maxMilliseconds||0).toFixed(2)} ms</div></td><td><div class=\"rowActions\"><button data-patch-edit=\"${i}\">Edit</button><button data-patch-toggle=\"${esc(x.id||'')}\" data-patch-enabled=\"${x.enabled?'1':'0'}\">${x.enabled?'Disable':'Enable'}</button><button class=\"danger\" data-patch-delete=\"${esc(x.id||'')}\">Delete</button></div></td></tr>`}).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No custom patches. Generate or create one above.</td></tr>';\n  const sugg=$('patchSuggestions');\n  if(sugg)sugg.innerHTML=suggestions.length?suggestions.map(x=>`<tr><td><b>${esc(x.title||'Suggestion')}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.source||'Profiler')} · ${esc(x.confidence||'Low')} confidence</div></td><td>${esc(x.detail||'')}</td><td>${esc(x.recommendation||'')}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"3\" class=\"muted\">No profiler-backed patch suggestions yet. Run a manual profile during the slowdown to generate evidence.</td></tr>';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-patch-edit]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>{const row=rows[Number(btn.dataset.patchEdit||-1)];if(row)fillCustomPatchForm(row.definition)});\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-patch-toggle]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>customPatchAction(btn.dataset.patchEnabled==='1'?'disable':'enable',btn.dataset.patchToggle||''));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-patch-delete]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>{if(confirm('Delete this custom patch definition?'))customPatchAction('delete',btn.dataset.patchDelete||'')});\n}\nasync function loadCustomPatches(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading&&$('patchStudioState'))$('patchStudioState').textContent='Loading Patch Studio…';\n  try{customPatchesData=await api('/api/custom-patches');renderCustomPatches();await loadContentPatches(false);await pgEnsureLoaded();setPageStatus('customPatches',(customPatchesData?.patches||[]).some(x=>x.definition?.runtimeStatus==='Error')?'warn':'good',`${(customPatchesData?.patches||[]).length} patch definition(s)`)}catch(e){if($('patchStudioState'))$('patchStudioState').textContent='Load failed';setPageStatus('customPatches','bad',e.message);toast(e.message,'error')}\n}\nasync function generateCustomPatch(){\n  const p=customPatchFormPayload();\n  if(!p.typeName||!p.methodName||!p.assemblyName){toast('Enter assembly, type and method before generating a template.','error');return}\n  try{const d=await api('/api/custom-patches/generate',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(p)});if(d.generated)fillCustomPatchForm(d.generated);toast(d.message||'Template generated.','success')}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n}\nasync function saveCustomPatch(){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly'){toast('Read-only accounts cannot change patches.','error');return}\n  if(!currentSessionOwner){toast('Only the panel Owner can save or apply runtime patches.','error');return}\n  const p=customPatchFormPayload();\n  if(!p.name||!p.assemblyName||!p.typeName||!p.methodName){toast('Name, assembly, type and method are required.','error');return}\n  if(p.enabled&&!confirm('This definition is enabled. Saving it will immediately reapply Patch Studio Harmony patches. Continue?'))return;\n  try{const d=await api('/api/custom-patches/save',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(p)});toast(d.message||'Patch saved.','success');customPatchesData=d.snapshot||await api('/api/custom-patches');renderCustomPatches();clearCustomPatchForm()}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n}\nasync function customPatchAction(action,id){\n  if(!currentSessionOwner){toast('Only the panel Owner can enable, disable, or delete runtime patches.','error');return}\n  if(action==='enable'&&!confirm('Enable and apply this runtime patch now? Use Observe first whenever possible.'))return;\n  try{const d=await api('/api/custom-patches/action',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action,id})});toast(d.message||'Patch updated.','success');customPatchesData=d.snapshot||await api('/api/custom-patches');renderCustomPatches()}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n}\nif($('patchRefresh'))$('patchRefresh').onclick=()=>loadCustomPatches(true);\nif($('patchGenerate'))$('patchGenerate').onclick=generateCustomPatch;\nif($('patchSave'))$('patchSave').onclick=saveCustomPatch;\nif($('patchClear'))$('patchClear').onclick=clearCustomPatchForm;\n\n\nfunction contentPatchFormPayload(){\n  return {\n    id:($('contentPatchId')?.value||'').trim(),\n    name:($('contentPatchName')?.value||'').trim(),\n    enabled:!!$('contentPatchEnabled')?.checked,\n    file:($('contentPatchFile')?.value||'').trim(),\n    operation:$('contentPatchOperation')?.value||'add',\n    path:($('contentPatchPath')?.value||'').trim(),\n    fromPath:($('contentPatchFromPath')?.value||'').trim(),\n    valueJson:String($('contentPatchValue')?.value||'null').trim()||'null',\n    side:$('contentPatchSide')?.value??'server',\n    dependsOnModId:($('contentPatchDependsOn')?.value||'').trim(),\n    invertDependency:!!$('contentPatchInvertDependency')?.checked,\n    notes:($('contentPatchNotes')?.value||'').trim()\n  };\n}\nfunction clearContentPatchForm(){\n  if($('contentPatchId'))$('contentPatchId').value='';\n  if($('contentPatchName'))$('contentPatchName').value='';\n  if($('contentPatchPreset'))$('contentPatchPreset').value='generic';\n  if($('contentPatchFile'))$('contentPatchFile').value='';\n  if($('contentPatchOperation'))$('contentPatchOperation').value='add';\n  if($('contentPatchPath'))$('contentPatchPath').value='/';\n  if($('contentPatchFromPath'))$('contentPatchFromPath').value='';\n  if($('contentPatchValue'))$('contentPatchValue').value='null';\n  if($('contentPatchSide'))$('contentPatchSide').value='server';\n  if($('contentPatchDependsOn'))$('contentPatchDependsOn').value='';\n  if($('contentPatchInvertDependency'))$('contentPatchInvertDependency').checked=false;\n  if($('contentPatchIngredient'))$('contentPatchIngredient').value='A';\n  if($('contentPatchQuantity'))$('contentPatchQuantity').value='1';\n  if($('contentPatchCode'))$('contentPatchCode').value='game:stick';\n  if($('contentPatchRecipeEnabled'))$('contentPatchRecipeEnabled').checked=true;\n  if($('contentPatchEnabled'))$('contentPatchEnabled').checked=false;\n  if($('contentPatchNotes'))$('contentPatchNotes').value='';\n}\nfunction fillContentPatchForm(def){\n  $('patchAdvancedJson').open=true;\n  def=def||{};\n  $('contentPatchId').value=def.id||'';$('contentPatchName').value=def.name||'';$('contentPatchEnabled').checked=!!def.enabled;\n  $('contentPatchFile').value=def.file||'';$('contentPatchOperation').value=def.operation||'add';$('contentPatchPath').value=def.path||'/';\n  $('contentPatchFromPath').value=def.fromPath||'';$('contentPatchValue').value=def.valueJson??'null';$('contentPatchSide').value=def.side??'server';$('contentPatchDependsOn').value=def.dependsOnModId||'';$('contentPatchInvertDependency').checked=!!def.invertDependency;$('contentPatchNotes').value=def.notes||'';\n  window.scrollTo({top:Math.max(0,$('customPatches').offsetTop-90),behavior:'smooth'});\n}\nfunction renderContentPatches(){\n  const d=contentPatchesData||{},rows=d.patches||[];\n  if($('contentPatchState'))$('contentPatchState').textContent=d.available===false?'Unavailable':`${rows.length} definition(s)${d.restartRequired?' · RESTART REQUIRED':''}`;if($('pgManagedState'))$('pgManagedState').textContent=$('contentPatchState').textContent;\n  const body=$('contentPatchRows');\n  if(body)body.innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map((x,i)=>`<tr><td><b>${esc(x.name||'Unnamed')}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.notes||'')}</div></td><td><code>${esc(x.file||'')}</code><div class=\"small\"><code>${esc(x.path||'/')}</code></div></td><td><b>${esc(x.operation||'add')}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.side||'both')}</div></td><td class=\"${x.enabled?'good':'muted'}\"><b>${x.enabled?'Enabled':'Disabled'}</b>${d.restartRequired?'<div class=\"small warn\">restart pending</div>':''}</td><td><div class=\"rowActions\"><button data-content-edit=\"${i}\">Edit</button><button data-content-toggle=\"${esc(x.id||'')}\" data-content-enabled=\"${x.enabled?'1':'0'}\">${x.enabled?'Disable':'Enable'}</button><button class=\"danger\" data-content-delete=\"${esc(x.id||'')}\">Delete</button></div></td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">No JSON/content patches yet.</td></tr>';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-content-edit]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>{const row=rows[Number(btn.dataset.contentEdit||-1)];if(row)fillContentPatchForm(row)});\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-content-toggle]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>contentPatchAction(btn.dataset.contentEnabled==='1'?'disable':'enable',btn.dataset.contentToggle||''));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-content-delete]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>{if(confirm('Delete this JSON/content patch? A restart is required to remove any already-loaded effect.'))contentPatchAction('delete',btn.dataset.contentDelete||'')});\n}\nasync function loadContentPatches(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading&&$('contentPatchState'))$('contentPatchState').textContent='Loading JSON patches…';\n  try{contentPatchesData=await api('/api/content-patches');renderContentPatches();const runtimeErr=(customPatchesData?.patches||[]).some(x=>x.definition?.runtimeStatus==='Error');setPageStatus('customPatches',runtimeErr||contentPatchesData?.restartRequired?'warn':'good',contentPatchesData?.restartRequired?'JSON patch restart pending':`${(customPatchesData?.patches||[]).length} runtime · ${(contentPatchesData?.patches||[]).length} JSON`)}catch(e){if($('contentPatchState'))$('contentPatchState').textContent='Load failed';toast(e.message,'error')}\n}\nasync function generateContentPatch(){\n  const preset=$('contentPatchPreset')?.value||'generic';\n  const p={...contentPatchFormPayload(),preset,ingredientKey:($('contentPatchIngredient')?.value||'A').trim(),quantity:Math.max(1,Math.floor(Number($('contentPatchQuantity')?.value||1))),code:($('contentPatchCode')?.value||'').trim(),enabled:!!$('contentPatchRecipeEnabled')?.checked,dependsOnModId:($('contentPatchDependsOn')?.value||'').trim(),invertDependency:!!$('contentPatchInvertDependency')?.checked};\n  if(!p.file){toast('Enter the target asset file first.','error');return}\n  try{const d=await api('/api/content-patches/generate',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(p)});if(d.generated)fillContentPatchForm(d.generated);toast(d.message||'Template generated.','success')}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n}\nasync function saveContentPatch(){\n  if(!currentSessionOwner){toast('Only the panel Owner can save generated content patches.','error');return}\n  const p=contentPatchFormPayload();\n  if(!p.name||!p.file||!p.path){toast('Name, target asset file, and JSON pointer path are required.','error');return}\n  if(p.enabled&&!confirm('Save this enabled JSON/content patch? It will be written into the managed patch mod and will take effect after the next server restart.'))return;\n  try{const d=await api('/api/content-patches/save',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(p)});toast(d.message||'Content patch saved.','success');contentPatchesData=d.snapshot||await api('/api/content-patches');renderContentPatches();clearContentPatchForm()}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n}\nasync function contentPatchAction(action,id){\n  if(!currentSessionOwner){toast('Only the panel Owner can change generated content patches.','error');return}\n  try{const d=await api('/api/content-patches/action',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action,id})});toast(d.message||'Content patch updated.','success');contentPatchesData=d.snapshot||await api('/api/content-patches');renderContentPatches()}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n}\nif($('contentPatchGenerate'))$('contentPatchGenerate').onclick=generateContentPatch;\nif($('contentPatchSave'))$('contentPatchSave').onclick=saveContentPatch;\nif($('contentPatchClear'))$('contentPatchClear').onclick=clearContentPatchForm;\n\nasync function loadCompatibility(deep=false){\n  $('compatState').textContent=deep?'Running deep Harmony inspection…':'Loading compatibility checks…';\n  try{\n    compatibilityData=await api(deep?'/api/compatibility/deep':'/api/compatibility');\n    const d=compatibilityData,checks=d.checks||[],commands=d.commandOwnership||[],h=d.harmony||{};\n    setCompatibilityNavState(d);\n    $('compatState').textContent=`${d.summary||'Unknown'} · ${Number(d.loadedModCount||0)} loaded mods${deep?' · deep scan complete':''}`;\n    $('compatMetrics').innerHTML=\n      metric('Compatibility',d.summary||'Unknown',d.summary==='Conflict'?'bad':d.summary==='Watch'?'warn':'good')+\n      metric('Critical',Number(d.criticalCount||0),Number(d.criticalCount||0)>0?'bad':'good')+\n      metric('Watch',Number(d.watchCount||0),Number(d.watchCount||0)>0?'warn':'good')+\n      metric('Loaded mods',Number(d.loadedModCount||0).toLocaleString())+\n      metric('Harmony overlaps',deep?Number(h.conflictCount||0).toLocaleString():'Manual',deep&&Number(h.conflictCount||0)>0?'warn':'');\n    $('compatChecks').innerHTML=checks.length?checks.map(x=>`<tr><td class=\"${x.severity==='Critical'?'bad':x.severity==='Watch'?'warn':x.severity==='OK'?'good':''}\"><b>${esc(x.severity)}</b></td><td>${esc(x.category)}</td><td><b>${esc(x.title)}</b></td><td>${esc(x.detail)}</td><td>${esc(x.action||'—')}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">No compatibility checks.</td></tr>';\n    $('compatCommands').innerHTML=commands.map(x=>`<tr><td><code>${esc(x.command)}</code></td><td><b>${esc(x.owner)}</b></td><td>${esc(x.suiteFallback||'—')}</td><td class=\"${x.status==='OK'?'good':''}\">${esc(x.status)}</td></tr>`).join('');\n    $('compatHarmonyState').textContent=deep?`${Number(h.patchedMethodCount||0)} patched method(s) · ${Number(h.conflictCount||0)} overlap(s)`:String(h.message||'Manual deep scan not run.');\n    const rows=h.conflicts||[];\n    $('compatHarmony').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.slice(0,200).map(x=>`<tr><td class=\"${x.severity==='High'?'warn':''}\"><b>${esc(x.severity)}</b></td><td><code>${esc(x.declaringType)}.${esc(x.method)}</code><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.signature||'')}</div></td><td>${(x.owners||[]).map(o=>`<code>${esc(o)}</code>`).join('<br>')}</td><td>${esc(x.note||'')}</td></tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan=\"4\" class=\"${deep?'good':'muted'}\">${deep?'No multi-owner Harmony overlaps found in the inspected set.':'Deep Harmony scan not run.'}</td></tr>`;\n  }catch(e){$('compatState').textContent='Load failed';toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n$('compatRefresh').onclick=()=>loadCompatibility(false);\n$('compatDeep').onclick=()=>loadCompatibility(true);\n\nasync function loadMods(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading){\n    $('modsCount').textContent='Loading…';\n    $('modsRows').innerHTML='<tr><td colspan=\"11\" class=\"muted\">Loading mod inventory, profiler attribution and cached update status…</td></tr>';\n  }\n  try{\n    const [d,u]=await Promise.all([api('/api/server/mods'),api('/api/mod-updates').catch(()=>({mods:[]}))]);\n    loadedMods=d.mods||[];\n    modUpdatesData=u||{mods:[]};\n    const checked=Number(modUpdatesData.checkedUnixMilliseconds||0);\n    $('modsUpdateState').textContent=checked?`${Number(modUpdatesData.updateCount||0)} update(s) · checked ${new Date(checked).toLocaleString()}${modUpdatesData.restartRequired?' · RESTART REQUIRED':''}${modUpdatesData.lastWarning?' · '+modUpdatesData.lastWarning:''}`:'Updates not checked yet';\n    loadedModsMeta=d||{};\n    const completed=Number(d.profileCompletedUnixMilliseconds||0);\n    $('modsProfileState').innerHTML=d.profileAvailable\n      ? `<b>Last manual profile:</b> ${completed?esc(new Date(completed).toLocaleString()):'available'} · ${Number(d.profileDurationSeconds||0)}s · P95 ${Number(d.profileP95TickMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms · max ${Number(d.profileMaxTickMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms. <span class=\"muted\">Impact scores are evidence-weighted and confidence-adjusted; click a row for the exact markers.</span>`\n      : 'No manual engine profile has been captured yet. <b>Run Profile 10s or Profile 30s while the slowdown is happening.</b> Until then every mod remains Not measured.';\n    renderMods();\n    if(selectedModPerformanceId && loadedMods.some(x=>String(x.modId).toLowerCase()===selectedModPerformanceId.toLowerCase())){\n      openModPerformance(selectedModPerformanceId,false);\n    }\n  }catch(e){\n    $('modsCount').textContent='Load failed';\n    $('modsRows').innerHTML=`<tr><td colspan=\"11\" class=\"bad\">${esc(e.message)}</td></tr>`;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction setModsTab(tab,persist=true){\n  modsActiveTab=tab==='updates'?'updates':'installed';\n  if(persist)localStorage.setItem('nsu.modsTab',modsActiveTab);\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-mod-tab]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.modTab===modsActiveTab));\n  const installed=$('modsInstalledPanel'),updates=$('modsUpdatesPanel');\n  if(installed)installed.style.display=modsActiveTab==='installed'?'block':'none';\n  if(updates)updates.style.display=modsActiveTab==='updates'?'block':'none';\n  renderMods();\n}\n\nfunction updateModsUpdateNotification(){\n  const count=Number(modUpdatesData.updateCount||0);\n  setModUpdatesNavState(modUpdatesData);\n  const badge=$('modsUpdatesBadge');\n  if(badge){badge.textContent=String(count);badge.style.display=count>0?'inline-block':'none';}\n  const button=document.querySelector('[data-mod-tab=\"updates\"]');\n  if(button)button.title=count>0?`${count} compatible mod update${count===1?'':'s'} available`:'No compatible mod updates available from the latest check';\n}\n\nfunction renderAvailableModUpdates(){\n  updateModsUpdateNotification();\n  const checked=Number(modUpdatesData.checkedUnixMilliseconds||0);\n  const q=String($('modsFilter')?.value||'').trim().toLowerCase();\n  const updates=(modUpdatesData.mods||[]).filter(u=>u?.status==='Update').filter(u=>{\n    if(!q)return true;\n    const m=loadedMods.find(x=>String(x.modId||'').toLowerCase()===String(u.modId||'').toLowerCase())||{};\n    return [u.modId,u.installedVersion,u.recommendedVersion,u.detail,m.name,m.fileName].some(v=>String(v||'').toLowerCase().includes(q));\n  });\n  const total=Number(modUpdatesData.updateCount||updates.length);\n  const summary=$('modsUpdatesSummary');\n  if(summary){\n    if(!checked)summary.textContent='Updates not checked yet.';\n    else if(total>0)summary.textContent=`${total} update${total===1?'':'s'} available · checked ${new Date(checked).toLocaleString()}`;\n    else summary.textContent=`No updates available · checked ${new Date(checked).toLocaleString()}`;\n  }\n  const body=$('modsUpdateRows');\n  if(body){\n    if(!checked){\n      body.innerHTML='<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">Run Check Updates to find compatible updates.</td></tr>';\n    }else if(!updates.length){\n      body.innerHTML=q?'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No available updates match the current filter.</td></tr>':'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"good\">All checked loaded mods are current for this Vintage Story version.</td></tr>';\n    }else{\n      body.innerHTML=updates.map((u,i)=>{\n        const m=loadedMods.find(x=>String(x.modId||'').toLowerCase()===String(u.modId||'').toLowerCase())||{};\n        const pageUrl=String(u.modPageUrl||('https://mods.vintagestory.at/'+encodeURIComponent(String(u.modId||''))));\n        const actions=`<div class=\"rowActions\"><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-open-mod-page=\"${esc(pageUrl)}\">Open page</button>${u.autoUpdateSupported?`<button class=\"iconBtn primary\" data-update-mod=\"${esc(u.modId)}\">Update</button>`:`<button class=\"iconBtn\" disabled title=\"${esc(u.autoUpdateReason||'Automatic update is unavailable for this package.')}\">Manual only</button>`}</div>`;\n        return `<tr><td><b>${i+1}</b></td><td><b>${esc(u.modId||'')}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(m.name||'')}</div></td><td>${esc(u.installedVersion||m.version||'—')}</td><td><span class=\"updateBadge update\">${esc(u.recommendedVersion||'?')}</span></td><td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(m.fileName||'')}\">${esc(m.fileName||'—')}</td><td class=\"small\" style=\"white-space:normal;min-width:280px\">${esc(u.detail||'Compatible update available.')}</td><td>${actions}</td></tr>`;\n      }).join('');\n    }\n  }\n  if(modsActiveTab==='updates')$('modsCount').textContent=checked?`${updates.length} shown · ${total} update${total===1?'':'s'} available`:'Updates not checked yet';\n  document.querySelectorAll('#modsUpdatesPanel [data-open-mod-page]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=(ev)=>{ev.stopPropagation();const url=String(btn.dataset.openModPage||'');if(url)window.open(url,'_blank','noopener,noreferrer');});\n  document.querySelectorAll('#modsUpdatesPanel [data-update-mod]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=(ev)=>{ev.stopPropagation();stageModUpdate(btn.dataset.updateMod||'',btn);});\n}\n\nfunction modImpactBadge(x){\n  const label=String(x.impact||'Not measured');\n  const score=Number(x.impactScore||0);\n  const cls=label==='Severe'?'critical':label==='High'?'high':label==='Moderate'?'medium':label==='Low'?'low':'muted';\n  return `<span class=\"badge ${cls}\">${esc(label)}</span>${x.measured?` <b>${score}</b>/100`:''}`;\n}\n\nfunction modUpdateFor(modId){return (modUpdatesData.mods||[]).find(x=>String(x.modId||'').toLowerCase()===String(modId||'').toLowerCase())||null;}\nfunction modUpdateBadge(x){\n  if(x.core)return '<span class=\"updateBadge unknown\">Core</span>';\n  const u=modUpdateFor(x.modId);if(!u)return '<span class=\"updateBadge unknown\">Not checked</span>';\n  if(u.status==='Update')return `<span class=\"updateBadge update\">${esc(u.installedVersion||x.version)} → ${esc(u.recommendedVersion||'?')}</span>`;\n  if(u.status==='Staged')return `<span class=\"updateBadge current\" title=\"${esc(u.detail||'Update staged; restart required.')}\">Restart required</span>`;\n  if(u.status==='Current')return '<span class=\"updateBadge current\">Current</span>';\n  return `<span class=\"updateBadge unknown\" title=\"${esc(u.detail||u.status||'Unknown')}\">${esc(u.status||'Unknown')}</span>`;\n}\n\nfunction modUpdateActions(x){\n  if(x.core)return '';\n  const u=modUpdateFor(x.modId);\n  const pageUrl=String(u?.modPageUrl||('https://mods.vintagestory.at/'+encodeURIComponent(String(x.modId||''))));\n  let html=`<div class=\"small\" style=\"display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:5px\"><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-open-mod-page=\"${esc(pageUrl)}\" title=\"Open this mod on the official Vintage Story Mod DB\">Open page</button>`;\n  if(u?.status==='Update'){\n    if(u.autoUpdateSupported)html+=`<button class=\"iconBtn primary\" data-update-mod=\"${esc(x.modId)}\" title=\"Download, validate, back up and stage ${esc(u.recommendedVersion||'the compatible update')}\">Update</button>`;\n    else html+=`<button class=\"iconBtn\" disabled title=\"${esc(u.autoUpdateReason||'Automatic update is unavailable for this package.')}\">Manual only</button>`;\n  }\n  html+='</div>';\n  return html;\n}\n\nasync function checkModUpdates(){\n  const btn=$('modsCheckUpdates');btn.disabled=true;btn.textContent='Checking…';$('modsUpdateState').textContent='Contacting official Vintage Story Mod DB…';\n  try{modUpdatesData=await api('/api/mod-updates/check',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});const checked=Number(modUpdatesData.checkedUnixMilliseconds||0);$('modsUpdateState').textContent=`${Number(modUpdatesData.updateCount||0)} update(s) · ${Number(modUpdatesData.currentCount||0)} current · checked ${checked?new Date(checked).toLocaleString():'now'}${modUpdatesData.restartRequired?' · RESTART REQUIRED':''}${modUpdatesData.lastWarning?' · '+modUpdatesData.lastWarning:''}`;renderMods();toast(modUpdatesData.lastWarning?`Update check completed with warnings: ${modUpdatesData.lastWarning}`:`Mod update check complete: ${Number(modUpdatesData.updateCount||0)} update(s) available.`,modUpdatesData.lastWarning?'warn':'success');}\n  catch(e){$('modsUpdateState').textContent='Update check failed';toast(e.message,'error');}\n  finally{btn.disabled=false;btn.textContent='Check Updates';}\n}\n\nasync function stageModUpdate(modId,button){\n  const u=modUpdateFor(modId);\n  if(!u||u.status!=='Update')return;\n  const from=u.installedVersion||loadedMods.find(x=>String(x.modId).toLowerCase()===String(modId).toLowerCase())?.version||'?';\n  const to=u.recommendedVersion||'?';\n  const warning=`Stage ${modId} ${from} → ${to}?\\n\\nNSE will download the official compatible Mod DB release, validate its mod ID/version, check required dependencies, back up the current ZIP outside the Mods folder, and replace the package on disk.\\n\\nThe running server will keep the old code until you restart it.`;\n  if(!confirm(warning))return;\n  const oldText=button?.textContent||'Update';if(button){button.disabled=true;button.textContent='Staging…';}\n  try{\n    const r=await api('/api/mod-updates/apply',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({modId})});\n    modUpdatesData=await api('/api/mod-updates');\n    const checked=Number(modUpdatesData.checkedUnixMilliseconds||0);\n    $('modsUpdateState').textContent=`${Number(modUpdatesData.updateCount||0)} update(s) · checked ${checked?new Date(checked).toLocaleString():'recently'}${modUpdatesData.restartRequired?' · RESTART REQUIRED':''}`;\n    renderMods();\n    toast(r.message||`${modId} update staged. Restart required.`,'success');\n  }catch(e){toast(`Update failed: ${e.message}`,'error');if(button){button.disabled=false;button.textContent=oldText;}}\n}\n\nfunction renderMods(){\n  const q=String($('modsFilter').value||'').trim().toLowerCase();\n  const thirdParty=!!$('modsThirdParty').checked;\n  const measuredOnly=!!$('modsMeasuredOnly').checked;\n  const rows=loadedMods.filter(x=>{\n    if(thirdParty&&x.core)return false;\n    if(measuredOnly&&!x.measured)return false;\n    if(!q)return true;\n    const u=modUpdateFor(x.modId);\n    return [x.modId,x.name,x.version,x.type,x.side,x.fileName,x.topMarker,x.impact,u?.status,u?.recommendedVersion]\n      .some(v=>String(v||'').toLowerCase().includes(q));\n  });\n\n  const measuredCount=loadedMods.filter(x=>x.measured).length;\n  if(modsActiveTab==='installed')$('modsCount').textContent=`${rows.length} shown · ${measuredCount}/${loadedMods.length} measured`;\n  $('modsRows').innerHTML=rows.length\n    ? rows.map((x,i)=>`<tr class=\"clickableRow\" data-mod-performance=\"${esc(x.modId)}\" title=\"Open measured tick/profile evidence for ${esc(x.modId)}\">\n        <td><b>${i+1}</b></td>\n        <td>${modImpactBadge(x)}</td>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.modId)}</b>${x.core?' <span class=\"badge high\">core</span>':''}<div class=\"small\">${esc(x.name||'')}</div><button class=\"iconBtn\" data-pin-mod=\"${esc(x.modId)}\" title=\"Pin this mod to Dashboard\">Pin</button></td>\n        <td>${esc(x.version||'—')}</td>\n        <td>${modUpdateBadge(x)}${modUpdateActions(x)}</td>\n        <td>${x.measured?`<b>${Number(x.tickShare||0).toFixed(1)}%</b>`:'—'}</td>\n        <td>${x.measured?`${Number(x.maxSingleMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms`:'—'}</td>\n        <td>${x.measured?Number(x.slowSegments||0):'—'}</td>\n        <td>${x.measured?confidenceBadge(x.confidence):'<span class=\"muted\">none</span>'}</td>\n        <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.topMarker||'')}\">${x.measured?esc(x.topMarker||'No named marker'):'Run a profile'}</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.systems||0)}</td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"11\" class=\"muted\">No loaded mod matches the current filters.</td></tr>';\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-mod-performance]').forEach(row=>row.onclick=()=>openModPerformance(row.dataset.modPerformance||'',true));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-pin-mod]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=(ev)=>{ev.stopPropagation();addWatchItem('mod',btn.dataset.pinMod,btn.dataset.pinMod,'mods');});\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-open-mod-page]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=(ev)=>{ev.stopPropagation();const url=String(btn.dataset.openModPage||'');if(url)window.open(url,'_blank','noopener,noreferrer');});\n  document.querySelectorAll('#modsInstalledPanel [data-update-mod]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=(ev)=>{ev.stopPropagation();stageModUpdate(btn.dataset.updateMod||'',btn);});\n  renderAvailableModUpdates();\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-mod-tab]').forEach(btn=>btn.classList.toggle('active',btn.dataset.modTab===modsActiveTab));\n  if($('modsInstalledPanel'))$('modsInstalledPanel').style.display=modsActiveTab==='installed'?'block':'none';\n  if($('modsUpdatesPanel'))$('modsUpdatesPanel').style.display=modsActiveTab==='updates'?'block':'none';\n  setTimeout(enhanceImportantTables,20);\n}\n\nasync function openModPerformance(modId,scroll=true){\n  if(!modId)return;\n  selectedModPerformanceId=modId;\n  const host=$('modPerformanceDetail');\n  host.style.display='block';\n  host.innerHTML='<div class=\"muted\">Loading profiler evidence…</div>';\n  if(scroll)host.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});\n  try{\n    const payload=await api('/api/server/mods/detail?modId='+encodeURIComponent(modId));\n    const m=payload.mod||{};\n    const d=payload.details||{};\n    const summary=d.summary||null;\n    const listRow=loadedMods.find(x=>String(x.modId).toLowerCase()===String(modId).toLowerCase())||{};\n    const hotspots=d.hotspots||[];\n    const phases=d.phases||[];\n    const slow=d.slowTicks||[];\n    const off=d.offThreadReports||[];\n    const profileWhen=Number(d.profileCompletedUnixMilliseconds||0);\n\n    const hotspotRows=hotspots.length?hotspots.map(x=>`<tr>\n      <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.code)}\"><b>${esc(x.code)}</b></td>\n      <td>${Number(x.totalMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td><td>${Number(x.maxSingleMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td>\n      <td>${Number(x.calls||0).toLocaleString()}</td><td>${Number(x.percentOfProfileTickTime||0).toFixed(1)}%</td>\n      <td>${confidenceBadge(x.attributionConfidence)}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No individual tick marker was attributed to this mod in the retained profile.</td></tr>';\n    const phaseRows=phases.length?phases.map(x=>`<tr><td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.code)}\">${esc(x.code)}</td><td>${Number(x.averagePerTickMs||0).toFixed(2)}ms</td><td>${Number(x.maxSingleMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td><td>${Number(x.totalMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td><td>${Number(x.percentOfProfileTickTime||0).toFixed(1)}%</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">No root tick phase was directly attributed to this mod.</td></tr>';\n    const slowRows=slow.length?slow.map(x=>`<tr><td><b>${Number(x.tickMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</b></td><td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.topCauseSummary)}\">${esc(x.topCauseSummary)}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"muted\">This mod was not named in the retained worst-tick summaries.</td></tr>';\n    const offRows=off.length?off.map(x=>`<tr><td><b>${Number(x.durationMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</b></td><td>${confidenceBadge(x.confidence)}</td><td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.summary)}\">${esc(x.summary)}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"3\" class=\"muted\">No off-thread slow-profile report was attributed to this mod.</td></tr>';\n\n    host.innerHTML=`\n      <div class=\"cardHeader\"><div><h3 style=\"margin:0\">${esc(m.name||modId)} <span class=\"small\">${esc(modId)} ${esc(m.version||'')}</span></h3><div class=\"small\">${esc(m.fileName||'')} · ${Number(m.systems||0)} ModSystem(s) · ${esc(m.side||'')}</div></div><div class=\"spacer\"></div>${modImpactBadge(listRow)} <button id=\"modDetailClose\">Close</button></div>\n      <div class=\"grid\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\n        <div class=\"card\"><h4>Measured impact</h4>${summary?`<div style=\"font-size:28px;font-weight:800\">${Number(listRow.impactScore||0)}/100</div><div>${esc(listRow.impact||'')}</div><div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Tick share <b>${Number(summary.percentOfProfileTickTime||0).toFixed(1)}%</b> · total ${Number(summary.totalMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms · max segment ${Number(summary.maxSingleMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms · ${Number(summary.slowSegments||0)} segment(s) ≥10ms · ${confidenceBadge(summary.confidence)}</div>`:`<div class=\"muted\">${d.profileAvailable?'A profile exists, but no profiler work was attributed to this mod. That means <b>no measured attribution</b>, not proof of zero cost.':'No manual profile exists yet.'}</div>`}</div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><h4>Profile context</h4><div class=\"small\">${d.profileAvailable?`Captured ${profileWhen?esc(new Date(profileWhen).toLocaleString()):'previously'} for ${Number(d.profileDurationSeconds||0)}s · ${Number(d.profileTickCount||0)} ticks<br>Average tick ${Number(d.profileAverageTickMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms · P95 ${Number(d.profileP95TickMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms · P99 ${Number(d.profileP99TickMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms · max ${Number(d.profileMaxTickMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms`:'Run a 10s/30s profile while the performance issue is active.'}</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><h4>What part of the mod used tick time?</h4><p class=\"small\">These are the exact FrameProfiler markers attributed back to this mod. The first rows are the strongest evidence for which subsystem, behavior, event handler, or code path consumed time.</p><div class=\"tableWrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Profiler marker / path</th><th>Total</th><th>Max</th><th>Calls</th><th>Tick share</th><th>Confidence</th></tr></thead><tbody>${hotspotRows}</tbody></table></div></div>\n      <div class=\"grid\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\n        <div class=\"card\"><h4>Attributed tick phases</h4><div class=\"tableWrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Phase</th><th>Avg/tick</th><th>Max</th><th>Total</th><th>Share</th></tr></thead><tbody>${phaseRows}</tbody></table></div></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><h4>Worst ticks naming this mod</h4><div class=\"tableWrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Tick</th><th>Leading profiler causes</th></tr></thead><tbody>${slowRows}</tbody></table></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><h4>Off-thread evidence</h4><div class=\"tableWrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Duration</th><th>Confidence</th><th>Worker-thread report</th></tr></thead><tbody>${offRows}</tbody></table></div></div>\n      <p class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Interpretation:</b> ${esc(payload.note||'')} Impact score combines measured tick share, maximum segment, repeated ≥10ms segments and off-thread stalls, then reduces the score when ownership confidence is weaker.</p>`;\n    $('modDetailClose').onclick=()=>{host.style.display='none';selectedModPerformanceId='';};\n  }catch(e){host.innerHTML=`<div class=\"bad\"><b>Could not load mod evidence:</b> ${esc(e.message)}</div>`;}\n}\n\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-mod-tab]').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>setModsTab(btn.dataset.modTab||'installed'));\n$('modsFilter').addEventListener('input',renderMods);\n$('modsThirdParty').addEventListener('change',renderMods);\n$('modsMeasuredOnly').addEventListener('change',renderMods);\n$('modsRefresh').onclick=()=>loadMods(true);\n$('modsCheckUpdates').onclick=checkModUpdates;\n$('modsProfile10').onclick=async()=>{await startProfile(10);setTimeout(()=>loadMods(false),1200);};\n$('modsProfile30').onclick=async()=>{await startProfile(30);setTimeout(()=>loadMods(false),1200);};\n$('modsCopy').onclick=async()=>{\n  if(!loadedMods.length)await loadMods(false);\n  const text=loadedMods.map((x,i)=>`${i+1}. ${x.modId} ${x.version||''} | ${x.impact||'Not measured'} ${x.measured?`${x.impactScore}/100 · ${Number(x.tickShare||0).toFixed(1)}% tick share`:''}`.trim()).join('\\n');\n  try{\n    await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);\n    toast('Ranked mod performance list copied.','success');\n  }catch{\n    toast('Browser blocked clipboard access.','error');\n  }\n};\n\nasync function openModFilter(modId){\n  setSection('mods',false);\n  setModsTab('installed');\n  $('modsFilter').value=modId||'';\n  if(!loadedMods.length)await loadMods(true);else renderMods();\n  if(modId)openModPerformance(modId,true);\n}\n\nconst chartDefs=[\n  {canvas:'chartDelay',tip:'tipDelay',meta:'metaDelay',key:'mainThreadDelayMs',label:'Delay',suffix:'ms',zeroBase:true,thresholds:[50,100],incidents:true},\n  {canvas:'chartCpu',tip:'tipCpu',meta:'metaCpu',key:'cpuPercent',label:'CPU',suffix:'%',zeroBase:true,fixedMax:100,thresholds:[90]},\n  {canvas:'chartHeap',tip:'tipHeap',meta:'metaHeap',key:'managedHeapMb',label:'Heap',suffix:' MB',zeroBase:false},\n  {canvas:'chartEntities',tip:'tipEntities',meta:'metaEntities',key:'loadedEntities',label:'Entities',suffix:'',zeroBase:false,integer:true},\n  {canvas:'chartQueue',tip:'tipQueue',meta:'metaQueue',key:'blockLoggerQueue',label:'Queue',suffix:'',zeroBase:true,integer:true,thresholds:[1000]},\n  {canvas:'chartWriter',tip:'tipWriter',meta:'metaWriter',key:'blockLoggerWriterMs',label:'Writer',suffix:'ms',zeroBase:true,integer:true,thresholds:[100]}\n];\n\nfunction fmtValue(v,def){\n  if(def.integer)return Math.round(v).toLocaleString()+def.suffix;\n  if(Math.abs(v)>=1000)return Math.round(v).toLocaleString()+def.suffix;\n  return Number(v).toFixed(v<10?1:0)+def.suffix;\n}\n\nfunction chartStats(samples,key){\n  const vals=samples.map(x=>Number(x[key]||0)).filter(Number.isFinite);\n  if(!vals.length)return{current:0,avg:0,max:0,min:0};\n  return{\n    current:vals[vals.length-1],\n    avg:vals.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)/vals.length,\n    max:Math.max(...vals),\n    min:Math.min(...vals)\n  };\n}\n\nfunction setChartMeta(def,samples){\n  const st=chartStats(samples,def.key);\n  $(def.meta).innerHTML=`<span>Now <b>${fmtValue(st.current,def)}</b></span><span>Avg <b>${fmtValue(st.avg,def)}</b></span><span>Max <b>${fmtValue(st.max,def)}</b></span>`;\n}\n\nfunction nearestIndexByTime(samples,target){\n  if(!samples.length)return-1;\n  let lo=0,hi=samples.length-1;\n  while(lo<hi){\n    const mid=Math.floor((lo+hi)/2);\n    if(Number(samples[mid].unixMilliseconds)<target)lo=mid+1;else hi=mid;\n  }\n  if(lo>0){\n    const a=Math.abs(Number(samples[lo].unixMilliseconds)-target);\n    const b=Math.abs(Number(samples[lo-1].unixMilliseconds)-target);\n    if(b<a)return lo-1;\n  }\n  return lo;\n}\n\nfunction resizeCanvas(canvas){\n  const rect=canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n  const dpr=Math.min(2,window.devicePixelRatio||1);\n  const width=Math.max(200,Math.floor(rect.width*dpr));\n  const height=Math.max(120,Math.floor(rect.height*dpr));\n  if(canvas.width!==width||canvas.height!==height){\n    canvas.width=width;canvas.height=height;\n  }\n  const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');\n  ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);\n  return{ctx,w:rect.width,h:rect.height};\n}\n\nfunction chartPlotBackground(ctx,pad,w,h,rows=4,cols=4){\n  const pw=Math.max(1,w-pad.l-pad.r),ph=Math.max(1,h-pad.t-pad.b);\n  ctx.save();\n  ctx.fillStyle='#0b1218';ctx.fillRect(pad.l,pad.t,pw,ph);\n  ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(86,108,124,.22)';ctx.lineWidth=1;\n  for(let i=0;i<=rows;i++){const y=pad.t+ph*i/rows;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(pad.l,y);ctx.lineTo(pad.l+pw,y);ctx.stroke();}\n  ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(86,108,124,.11)';\n  for(let i=1;i<cols;i++){const x=pad.l+pw*i/cols;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x,pad.t);ctx.lineTo(x,pad.t+ph);ctx.stroke();}\n  ctx.restore();\n}\n\nfunction chartAreaFill(ctx,points,bottom,fill='rgba(93,155,208,.10)'){\n  if(!points.length)return;\n  ctx.save();ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(points[0][0],bottom);\n  points.forEach(([x,y])=>ctx.lineTo(x,y));\n  ctx.lineTo(points[points.length-1][0],bottom);ctx.closePath();ctx.fillStyle=fill;ctx.fill();ctx.restore();\n}\n\nfunction chartLine(ctx,points,color='#71aee0',width=2){\n  if(!points.length)return;\n  ctx.save();ctx.strokeStyle=color;ctx.lineWidth=width;ctx.lineJoin='round';ctx.lineCap='round';ctx.beginPath();\n  points.forEach(([x,y],i)=>i?ctx.lineTo(x,y):ctx.moveTo(x,y));ctx.stroke();ctx.restore();\n}\n\nfunction chartEndPoint(ctx,points,color='#dcebf6'){\n  if(!points.length)return;const [x,y]=points[points.length-1];\n  ctx.save();ctx.fillStyle=color;ctx.strokeStyle='#0b1218';ctx.lineWidth=2;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(x,y,3.5,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.stroke();ctx.restore();\n}\n\nfunction drawHealthChart(def,samples,incidents){\n  const canvas=$(def.canvas),tip=$(def.tip);\n  const {ctx,w,h}=resizeCanvas(canvas);\n  ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);\n\n  const pad={l:44,r:10,t:10,b:26};\n  const pw=Math.max(1,w-pad.l-pad.r),ph=Math.max(1,h-pad.t-pad.b);\n  ctx.font='10px system-ui';\n  ctx.lineWidth=1;\n\n  if(!samples.length){\n    ctx.fillStyle='#8492a0';ctx.fillText('No samples in this range',pad.l,pad.t+18);\n    tip.style.display='none';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const vals=samples.map(x=>Number(x[def.key]||0));\n  let minVal=def.zeroBase?0:Math.min(...vals);\n  let maxVal=def.fixedMax||Math.max(...vals,1);\n\n  if(!def.zeroBase){\n    const span=Math.max(1,maxVal-minVal);\n    minVal=Math.max(0,minVal-span*.15);\n    maxVal=maxVal+span*.15;\n  }else{\n    maxVal=Math.max(maxVal*1.12,1);\n  }\n\n  if(def.thresholds){\n    for(const t of def.thresholds)maxVal=Math.max(maxVal,t*1.08);\n  }\n  if(maxVal<=minVal)maxVal=minVal+1;\n\n  const firstTime=Number(samples[0].unixMilliseconds);\n  const lastTime=Number(samples[samples.length-1].unixMilliseconds);\n  const timeSpan=Math.max(1,lastTime-firstTime);\n  const xForTime=t=>pad.l+clamp((t-firstTime)/timeSpan,0,1)*pw;\n  const yForValue=v=>pad.t+(1-clamp((v-minVal)/(maxVal-minVal),0,1))*ph;\n\n  chartPlotBackground(ctx,pad,w,h,4,4);\n  ctx.fillStyle='#748797';\n  for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){\n    const y=pad.t+ph*i/4;\n    const value=maxVal-(maxVal-minVal)*i/4;\n    ctx.fillText(fmtValue(value,def),3,y+3);\n  }\n\n  if(def.thresholds){\n    ctx.save();ctx.setLineDash([5,5]);ctx.font='9px system-ui';\n    def.thresholds.forEach((t,idx)=>{\n      const y=yForValue(t);const critical=idx===def.thresholds.length-1;\n      ctx.strokeStyle=critical?'rgba(208,91,91,.62)':'rgba(206,168,80,.56)';\n      ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(pad.l,y);ctx.lineTo(pad.l+pw,y);ctx.stroke();\n      ctx.setLineDash([]);ctx.fillStyle=critical?'#cf8585':'#cbb879';ctx.fillText(fmtValue(t,def),pad.l+5,Math.max(pad.t+9,y-4));ctx.setLineDash([5,5]);\n    });\n    ctx.restore();\n  }\n\n  if(def.incidents){\n    (incidents||[]).forEach(x=>{\n      const t=Number(x.unixMilliseconds||0);\n      if(t<firstTime||t>lastTime)return;\n      const xPos=xForTime(t);\n      ctx.strokeStyle=String(x.severity||'').toLowerCase()==='critical'?'#ff7474':'#ffad66';\n      ctx.globalAlpha=.58;\n      ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(xPos,pad.t);ctx.lineTo(xPos,pad.t+ph);ctx.stroke();\n      ctx.globalAlpha=1;\n    });\n  }\n\n  const seriesPoints=samples.map(row=>[xForTime(Number(row.unixMilliseconds)),yForValue(Number(row[def.key]||0))]);\n  chartAreaFill(ctx,seriesPoints,pad.t+ph,'rgba(93,155,208,.085)');\n  chartLine(ctx,seriesPoints,'#75afe0',2.2);\n  chartEndPoint(ctx,seriesPoints,'#dcebf6');\n\n  const timeLabels=[firstTime,firstTime+timeSpan/2,lastTime];\n  ctx.fillStyle='#748392';\n  timeLabels.forEach((t,i)=>{\n    const label=new Date(t).toLocaleTimeString([], {hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',second:profilerRangeSeconds<=300?'2-digit':undefined});\n    const x=pad.l+pw*i/2;\n    const width=ctx.measureText(label).width;\n    ctx.fillText(label,clamp(x-width/2,pad.l,pad.l+pw-width),h-7);\n  });\n\n  if(chartHoverTimestamp!==null){\n    const idx=nearestIndexByTime(samples,chartHoverTimestamp);\n    if(idx>=0){\n      const row=samples[idx];\n      const x=xForTime(Number(row.unixMilliseconds));\n      const y=yForValue(Number(row[def.key]||0));\n      ctx.strokeStyle='#dbe8f4';ctx.lineWidth=1;\n      ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x,pad.t);ctx.lineTo(x,pad.t+ph);ctx.stroke();\n      ctx.fillStyle='#dbe8f4';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(x,y,3,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();\n\n      let extra='';\n      if(def.incidents){\n        const near=(incidents||[]).find(e=>Math.abs(Number(e.unixMilliseconds)-Number(row.unixMilliseconds))<=1800);\n        if(near)extra=`<br><span class=\"${severityClass(near.severity)}\"><b>${esc(near.severity)}</b></span> ${esc(near.evidence)}`;\n      }\n\n      tip.innerHTML=`<b>${esc(def.label)}: ${esc(fmtValue(Number(row[def.key]||0),def))}</b><br>${esc(new Date(Number(row.unixMilliseconds)).toLocaleString())}${extra}`;\n      tip.style.display='block';\n      const left=clamp(x+10,6,w-220);\n      const top=clamp(y-48,6,h-82);\n      tip.style.left=left+'px';tip.style.top=top+'px';\n    }\n  }else{\n    tip.style.display='none';\n  }\n}\n\nfunction redrawProfilerCharts(){\n  if(!lastProfilerPayload)return;\n  const samples=lastProfilerPayload.samples||[];\n  const incidents=lastProfilerPayload.diagnosticIncidents||[];\n  chartDefs.forEach(def=>{\n    setChartMeta(def,samples);\n    drawHealthChart(def,samples,incidents);\n  });\n}\n\nchartDefs.forEach(def=>{\n  const canvas=$(def.canvas);\n  canvas.addEventListener('mousemove',e=>{\n    if(!lastProfilerPayload)return;\n    const samples=lastProfilerPayload.samples||[];\n    if(!samples.length)return;\n    const rect=canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    const padLeft=44,padRight=10;\n    const x=clamp(e.clientX-rect.left-padLeft,0,Math.max(1,rect.width-padLeft-padRight));\n    const ratio=x/Math.max(1,rect.width-padLeft-padRight);\n    const first=Number(samples[0].unixMilliseconds),last=Number(samples[samples.length-1].unixMilliseconds);\n    chartHoverTimestamp=first+(last-first)*ratio;\n    if(def.incidents){\n      const incidents=lastProfilerPayload.diagnosticIncidents||[];\n      const hit=incidents.map(i=>({i,px:padLeft+((Number(i.unixMilliseconds||0)-first)/Math.max(1,last-first))*Math.max(1,rect.width-padLeft-padRight)})).sort((a,b)=>Math.abs(a.px-(e.clientX-rect.left))-Math.abs(b.px-(e.clientX-rect.left)))[0];\n      canvas.classList.toggle('lagIncidentMarkerHover',!!hit&&Math.abs(hit.px-(e.clientX-rect.left))<=9);\n      canvas.title=hit&&Math.abs(hit.px-(e.clientX-rect.left))<=9?`${hit.i.severity||'Lag'} spike — click for full incident breakdown`:'';\n    }\n    redrawProfilerCharts();\n  });\n  canvas.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>{\n    chartHoverTimestamp=null;canvas.classList.remove('lagIncidentMarkerHover');canvas.title='';\n    redrawProfilerCharts();\n  });\n  if(def.incidents)canvas.addEventListener('click',e=>{\n    if(!lastProfilerPayload)return;const samples=lastProfilerPayload.samples||[],incidents=lastProfilerPayload.diagnosticIncidents||[];if(!samples.length||!incidents.length)return;\n    const rect=canvas.getBoundingClientRect(),padLeft=44,padRight=10,first=Number(samples[0].unixMilliseconds),last=Number(samples[samples.length-1].unixMilliseconds),plot=Math.max(1,rect.width-padLeft-padRight),cx=e.clientX-rect.left;\n    const hit=incidents.map(i=>({i,px:padLeft+((Number(i.unixMilliseconds||0)-first)/Math.max(1,last-first))*plot})).sort((a,b)=>Math.abs(a.px-cx)-Math.abs(b.px-cx))[0];\n    if(hit&&Math.abs(hit.px-cx)<=10)openLagIncidentDrawer(Number(hit.i.unixMilliseconds||0));\n  });\n});\n\nwindow.addEventListener('resize',()=>{\n  if(chartResizeTimer)clearTimeout(chartResizeTimer);\n  chartResizeTimer=setTimeout(()=>{\n    redrawProfilerCharts();\n    renderPerformanceTimeline();\n    renderMemoryChart();\n    redrawPlayerAnalyticsCharts();\n    renderAdminDatabaseStorageGraph();\n  },100);\n});\n\nfunction confidenceBadge(v){\n  const x=String(v||'Low').toLowerCase();\n  return `<span class=\"badge ${x}\">${esc(v||'Low')}</span>`;\n}\n\nfunction renderDiagnosis(p){\n  const d=p.diagnosticSummary||{};\n  const smart=p.smartAnalysis||{};\n  const state=smart.available?String(smart.state||'Watch'):String(d.state||'Disabled');\n  const stateClass=state==='Critical'?'bad':state==='Investigate'?'orange':state==='Watch'?'warn':'good';\n  const score=smart.available?Number(smart.healthScore||0):null;\n\n  $('profDiagnosis').innerHTML=`\n    <div class=\"card diagnosisMain\">\n      <div class=\"smartHero\">\n        ${score===null?'':`<div class=\"healthScore ${String(state).toLowerCase()}\">${score}</div>`}\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"state ${stateClass}\">${esc(state)}</div>\n          <div><b>${esc(smart.primaryFinding||d.summary||'No diagnostic evidence yet.')}</b></div>\n          <div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">${smart.available?`Finding confidence: ${esc(smart.primaryConfidence||'Low')} · Analysis confidence: ${esc(smart.analysisConfidence||'Low')} · data quality ${Number(smart.dataQualityScore||0)}/100 · ${esc(smart.recoveryState||'Unknown')}`:'Rolling five-minute correlation summary.'}</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card diagMetric\"><div class=\"small\">Worst delay</div><div class=\"value\">${Number(d.worstDelayMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card diagMetric\"><div class=\"small\">CPU avg / max</div><div class=\"value\">${Number(d.averageCpuPercent||0).toFixed(0)}% / ${Number(d.maxCpuPercent||0).toFixed(0)}%</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card diagMetric\"><div class=\"small\">Gen2 GC</div><div class=\"value\">+${Number(d.gen2Collections||0)}</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card diagMetric\"><div class=\"small\">BL max queue</div><div class=\"value\">${Number(d.maxBlockLoggerQueue||0).toLocaleString()}</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card diagMetric\"><div class=\"small\">BL max writer</div><div class=\"value\">${Number(d.maxBlockLoggerWriterMs||0)}ms</div></div>`;\n}\n\nfunction renderSmartAnalysis(p){\n  const smart=p.smartAnalysis||{};\n  const signals=smart.signals||[];\n  const trends=smart.trends||[];\n  const groups=smart.incidentGroups||[];\n  const baseline=smart.baseline||{};\n\n  $('smartFindingCount').textContent=smart.available?`${signals.length} finding(s)`:'not available';\n\n  $('smartSignals').innerHTML=signals.length\n    ? signals.slice(0,8).map(x=>{\n        const sev=String(x.severity||'Watch').toLowerCase();\n        return `<div class=\"card smartSignal ${sev}\">\n          <div class=\"signalMeta\">\n            <span class=\"badge ${String(x.confidence||'Low').toLowerCase()}\">${esc(x.confidence||'Low')} confidence</span>\n            <span class=\"${severityClass(x.severity)}\"><b>${esc(x.severity)}</b></span>\n            <span class=\"small\">${esc(x.category)}</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"signalTitle\">${esc(x.title)}</div>\n          <div class=\"small\">${esc(x.evidence)}</div>\n          <div class=\"nextAction\"><b>Next:</b> ${esc(x.nextAction)}</div>\n        </div>`;\n      }).join('')\n    : '<div class=\"empty\">No strong smart finding currently stands out.</div>';\n\n  const recs=smart.recommendations||[];\n  $('smartRecommendations').innerHTML=recs.length\n    ? `<ol style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px\">${recs.map(x=>`<li style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">${esc(x)}</li>`).join('')}</ol>`\n    : 'No targeted next step is currently required. Keep diagnostics running if the server is intermittently slow.';\n\n  $('baselineSamples').textContent=baseline.sampleCount?`${baseline.sampleCount} learned sample(s)`:'learning';\n  $('adaptiveBaseline').innerHTML=baseline.sampleCount\n    ? `<div class=\"tableWrap\"><table class=\"baselineTable\">\n        <thead><tr><th>Signal</th><th>Learned normal</th><th>Adaptive anomaly</th><th>Recent median</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Scheduler delay</td><td>${Number(baseline.delayMedianMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td><td>${Number(baseline.delayAnomalyMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td><td>${Number(smart.recentDelayMedianMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>CPU</td><td>${Number(baseline.cpuMedianPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%</td><td>${Number(baseline.cpuAnomalyPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%</td><td>${Number(smart.recentCpuMedianPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Managed heap</td><td>${Number(baseline.heapMedianMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB</td><td>trend-based</td><td>${Number(smart.recentHeapMedianMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Loaded entities</td><td>${Number(baseline.entityMedian||0).toFixed(0)}</td><td>jump/trend-based</td><td>${Number(smart.recentEntityMedian||0).toFixed(0)}</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>BL queue</td><td>${Number(baseline.queueMedian||0).toFixed(0)}</td><td>${Number(baseline.queueAnomaly||0).toFixed(0)}</td><td>${Number(smart.recentQueueMedian||0).toFixed(0)}</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>BL writer</td><td>${Number(baseline.writerMedianMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td><td>${Number(baseline.writerAnomalyMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td><td>${Number(smart.recentWriterMedianMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table></div>`\n    : 'The analyzer needs more samples before it can distinguish unusual behavior from this server’s normal background load.';\n\n  $('smartTrends').innerHTML=trends.length\n    ? trends.map(x=>`<div class=\"smartSignal ${String(x.severity||'Watch').toLowerCase()}\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;margin-bottom:8px\">\n        <b>${esc(x.name)}</b> <span class=\"${severityClass(x.severity)}\">${esc(x.severity)}</span><br>\n        <span class=\"small\">${Number(x.slopePerMinute||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(x.slopePerMinute||0).toFixed(1)} ${esc(x.unit)} · net ${Number(x.netChange||0)>=0?'+':''}${Number(x.netChange||0).toFixed(1)} · ${esc(x.interpretation)}</span>\n      </div>`).join('')\n    : 'No meaningful sustained upward memory/entity/queue trend is currently detected.';\n\n  $('incidentGroupCount').textContent=`${groups.length} grouped incident(s)`;\n  if($('profClearLagGroups'))$('profClearLagGroups').disabled=!groups.length;\n  $('incidentGroups').innerHTML=groups.length\n    ? groups.map((x,i)=>`<tr class=\"clickableRow\" data-incident-ts=\"${Number(x.startUnixMilliseconds||0)}\" title=\"${esc(x.evidence)}\">\n        <td><b>${esc(new Date(Number(x.startUnixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleTimeString())}</b></td>\n        <td>${Number(x.durationSeconds||0).toFixed(0)}s</td>\n        <td class=\"${severityClass(x.severity)}\">${incidentDot(x.severity)}<b>${esc(x.severity)}</b></td>\n        <td><b>${esc(x.primaryCategory)}</b></td>\n        <td>${x.likelyModId?`<b>${esc(x.likelyModName||x.likelyModId)}</b><br><span class=\"small\"><code>${esc(x.likelyModId)}</code> · ${esc(x.modConfidence||'Low')}</span>`:'<span class=\"muted\">Not attributed</span>'}</td>\n        <td>${confidenceBadge(x.confidence)}</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.worstDelayMs||0).toFixed(0)}ms</td>\n        <td>${Number(x.maxCpuPercent||0).toFixed(0)}%</td>\n        <td>+${Number(x.gen2Collections||0)}</td>\n        <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.nextAction)}\">${esc(x.nextAction)}</td>\n      </tr>`).join('')\n    : '<tr><td colspan=\"10\" class=\"muted\">No grouped lag incidents in the selected diagnostic history.</td></tr>';\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-incident-ts]').forEach(row=>{\n    row.onclick=()=>{\n      const ts=Number(row.dataset.incidentTs||0);\n      chartHoverTimestamp=ts;\n      redrawProfilerCharts();\n      setSection('performance',true);\n      setTimeout(()=>openPerformanceIncident(ts),80);\n    };\n  });\n\n  renderSavedBaselineComparison(smart,p);\n}\n\nfunction snapshotForBaseline(p){\n  const smart=p.smartAnalysis||{};\n  return {\n    savedAt:Date.now(),\n    healthScore:Number(smart.healthScore||0),\n    state:smart.state||'Unknown',\n    delayMedian:Number(smart.recentDelayMedianMs||0),\n    cpuMedian:Number(smart.recentCpuMedianPercent||0),\n    heapMedian:Number(smart.recentHeapMedianMb||0),\n    entityMedian:Number(smart.recentEntityMedian||0),\n    queueMedian:Number(smart.recentQueueMedian||0),\n    writerMedian:Number(smart.recentWriterMedianMs||0),\n    profileP95:Number((p.lastProfile||{}).p95TickMs||0),\n    profileP99:Number((p.lastProfile||{}).p99TickMs||0),\n    profileMax:Number((p.lastProfile||{}).maxTickMs||0),\n    topMods:(p.modHotspots||[]).slice(0,10).map(x=>({\n      modId:x.modId,\n      totalMs:Number(x.totalMs||0),\n      maxSingleMs:Number(x.maxSingleMs||0),\n      share:Number(x.percentOfProfileTickTime||0),\n      confidence:x.confidence\n    }))\n  };\n}\n\nfunction deltaCell(current,old,suffix='',lowerIsBetter=true){\n  const delta=Number(current||0)-Number(old||0);\n  const cls=Math.abs(delta)<0.01?'deltaNeutral':((lowerIsBetter?delta>0:delta<0)?'deltaUpBad':'deltaDownGood');\n  return `<span class=\"${cls}\">${delta>=0?'+':''}${delta.toFixed(Math.abs(delta)>=100?0:1)}${suffix}</span>`;\n}\n\nfunction renderSavedBaselineComparison(smart,p){\n  if(!savedBaseline){\n    $('baselineSavedAt').textContent='';\n    $('baselineCompare').innerHTML='Press <b>Save Baseline</b> during a known-good period. The browser will remember it locally and compare later captures against it.';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  $('baselineSavedAt').textContent='saved '+new Date(savedBaseline.savedAt).toLocaleString();\n  const lp=p.lastProfile||{};\n  $('baselineCompare').innerHTML=`<div class=\"tableWrap\"><table>\n    <thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Saved good</th><th>Current</th><th>Change</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>Health score</td><td>${savedBaseline.healthScore}/100</td><td>${Number(smart.healthScore||0)}/100</td><td>${deltaCell(Number(smart.healthScore||0),savedBaseline.healthScore,'',false)}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Delay median</td><td>${savedBaseline.delayMedian.toFixed(1)}ms</td><td>${Number(smart.recentDelayMedianMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td><td>${deltaCell(smart.recentDelayMedianMs,savedBaseline.delayMedian,'ms')}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>CPU median</td><td>${savedBaseline.cpuMedian.toFixed(1)}%</td><td>${Number(smart.recentCpuMedianPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%</td><td>${deltaCell(smart.recentCpuMedianPercent,savedBaseline.cpuMedian,'%')}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Heap median</td><td>${savedBaseline.heapMedian.toFixed(0)} MB</td><td>${Number(smart.recentHeapMedianMb||0).toFixed(0)} MB</td><td>${deltaCell(smart.recentHeapMedianMb,savedBaseline.heapMedian,' MB')}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Entities median</td><td>${savedBaseline.entityMedian.toFixed(0)}</td><td>${Number(smart.recentEntityMedian||0).toFixed(0)}</td><td>${deltaCell(smart.recentEntityMedian,savedBaseline.entityMedian,'')}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>BL queue median</td><td>${savedBaseline.queueMedian.toFixed(0)}</td><td>${Number(smart.recentQueueMedian||0).toFixed(0)}</td><td>${deltaCell(smart.recentQueueMedian,savedBaseline.queueMedian,'')}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Profile P95</td><td>${savedBaseline.profileP95.toFixed(1)}ms</td><td>${Number(lp.p95TickMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td><td>${deltaCell(lp.p95TickMs,savedBaseline.profileP95,'ms')}</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table></div>`;\n}\n\n$('profSaveBaseline').onclick=()=>{\n  if(!lastProfilerPayload || !(lastProfilerPayload.smartAnalysis||{}).available){\n    toast('Smart Analysis needs collected samples before saving a baseline.','error');\n    return;\n  }\n  savedBaseline=snapshotForBaseline(lastProfilerPayload);\n  localStorage.setItem('nsu.smartBaseline',JSON.stringify(savedBaseline));\n  renderSavedBaselineComparison(lastProfilerPayload.smartAnalysis||{},lastProfilerPayload);\n  toast('Known-good baseline saved in this browser.','success');\n};\n\n$('profClearBaseline').onclick=()=>{\n  savedBaseline=null;\n  localStorage.removeItem('nsu.smartBaseline');\n  if(lastProfilerPayload)renderSavedBaselineComparison(lastProfilerPayload.smartAnalysis||{},lastProfilerPayload);\n  toast('Saved baseline cleared.');\n};\n\nlet tickDebugRequestInFlight=false;\nlet tickDebugLastPayload=null;\n\nfunction fmtRate(bytesPerSecond){\n  const n=Number(bytesPerSecond||0);\n  if(n>=1024*1024)return `${(n/1024/1024).toFixed(2)} MB/s`;\n  if(n>=1024)return `${(n/1024).toFixed(1)} KB/s`;\n  return `${n.toFixed(0)} B/s`;\n}\nfunction fmtBytesCompact(bytes){\n  const n=Number(bytes||0);\n  if(n>=1024*1024*1024)return `${(n/1024/1024/1024).toFixed(2)} GB`;\n  if(n>=1024*1024)return `${(n/1024/1024).toFixed(1)} MB`;\n  if(n>=1024)return `${(n/1024).toFixed(1)} KB`;\n  return `${n.toFixed(0)} B`;\n}\nfunction tickDebugMetric(label,value,state='good',sub=''){\n  return `<div class=\"metric ${state}\"><div class=\"label\">${esc(label)}</div><div class=\"value\">${esc(value)}</div>${sub?`<div class=\"small\">${esc(sub)}</div>`:''}</div>`;\n}\nfunction renderTickDebug(d){\n  tickDebugLastPayload=d||{};\n  const enabled=d.enabled!==false;\n  const slow=d.slowTickCapture||{},last=d.lastAction||{},prof=d.profiler||{},diag=prof.diagnosticSummary||{},attr=d.modAttribution||{};\n  const delay=Number(d.currentMainThreadDelayMs||0),budget=Number(d.tickBudgetMs||0);\n  const delayState=budget>0&&delay>budget?'bad':delay>Math.max(20,budget*.5)?'warn':'good';\n  $('tickDebugMetrics').innerHTML=\n    tickDebugMetric('Tick budget',`${budget.toFixed(0)} ms`,'good','Configured server TickTime')+\n    tickDebugMetric('Main-thread delay',`${delay.toFixed(1)} ms`,delayState,'Lightweight scheduler sample')+\n    tickDebugMetric('Network out',fmtRate(d.sendBytesPerSecond),'good',`${fmtBytesCompact(d.totalSentBytes)} total`)+\n    tickDebugMetric('Network in',fmtRate(d.receiveBytesPerSecond),'good',`${fmtBytesCompact(d.totalReceivedBytes)} total`)+\n    tickDebugMetric('Loaded entities',Number(d.loadedEntities||0).toLocaleString(),Number(d.loadedEntities||0)>5000?'warn':'good')+\n    tickDebugMetric('Loaded chunks',Number(d.loadedChunks||0).toLocaleString(),'good');\n  const state=slow.running\n    ? `${slow.incidentCapture?'Incident capture':'Slow-tick capture'} running · ≥${Number(slow.thresholdMs||0)}ms · ${Number(slow.remainingSeconds||0)}s remaining`\n    : 'No native slow-tick capture is running.';\n  $('tickDebugState').textContent=state;\n  const safeMode=!!d.safeDiagnosticsMode;\n  setNavStatus('tickDebug',enabled?'good':'neutral',enabled?'Tick Debugging enabled':'Tick Debugging disabled');\n  if($('tickDebugNavState')){$('tickDebugNavState').textContent=enabled?'ON':'OFF';$('tickDebugNavState').className='navInlineState '+(enabled?'good':'neutral');}\n  if($('tickDebugEnabledToggle')){$('tickDebugEnabledToggle').textContent=enabled?'Tick Debugging: ON':'Tick Debugging: OFF';$('tickDebugEnabledToggle').className=enabled?'primary':'warnButton';$('tickDebugEnabledToggle').disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly';}\n  $('tickDebugStart').disabled=!enabled||!!slow.running||safeMode;\n  $('tickDebugIncident').disabled=!enabled||!!slow.running||!!prof.running||!prof.enabled||safeMode;\n  $('tickDebugEnableDiagnostics').style.display=prof.enabled?'none':'';\n  $('tickDebugEnableDiagnostics').disabled=!enabled;\n  $('tickDebugStop').disabled=!slow.running;\n  $('tickDebugDump').disabled=!enabled||safeMode;\n  $('tickDebugHandlers').disabled=!enabled;\n  $('tickDebugMainThread').disabled=!enabled;\n  $('tickDebugProfileState').textContent=safeMode?'Safe Diagnostics Mode is enabled: heavy captures, automatic attribution bursts, and detailed dumps are locked.':(!prof.enabled?'Lightweight profiler diagnostics are disabled. Enable them before using Incident Capture.':(prof.running?`Engine profile running · ${Number(prof.remainingSeconds||0)}s remaining`:(d.lastIncidentSummary||'Engine profiler idle.')));\n  const attrHost=$('tickDebugModAttribution');\n  if(attrHost){\n    attrHost.innerHTML=attr.available\n      ? `<div class=\"cardHeader\"><div><h3>Likely Mod Attribution</h3><div class=\"small\">Latest ${esc(attr.profileKind||'engine')} profile · ${attr.profileCompletedUnixMilliseconds?esc(new Date(Number(attr.profileCompletedUnixMilliseconds)).toLocaleString()):''}</div></div><div class=\"spacer\"></div>${confidenceBadge(attr.confidence||'Low')}<button id=\"tickDebugClearAttribution\" class=\"miniClear\" title=\"Clear retained mod-attribution results\">Clear</button></div><div style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:850\">${esc(attr.modName||attr.modId)}</div><div class=\"small\"><code>${esc(attr.modId||'')}</code> · ${Number(attr.tickSharePercent||0).toFixed(1)}% of profiled tick time · max segment ${Number(attr.maxSegmentMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms · ${Number(attr.slowSegments||0)} segment(s) ≥10ms</div><div class=\"compactNote\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">${esc(attr.note||'')}</div><div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"><b>Top marker:</b> <code>${esc(attr.topMarker||'')}</code></div>${Number(attr.worstProfileTickMs||0)>0?`<div class=\"compactNote\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Worst profiled tick:</b> ${Number(attr.worstProfileTickMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms<br><span class=\"small\">${esc(attr.worstProfileTickTopCauses||'No per-tick cause summary available.')}</span></div>`:''}`\n      : `<div class=\"cardHeader\"><div><h3>Likely Mod Attribution</h3><div class=\"small\">Measured engine-profiler ownership only.</div></div><div class=\"spacer\"></div><button id=\"tickDebugClearAttribution\" class=\"miniClear\" title=\"Clear retained mod-attribution results\">Clear</button></div><div class=\"empty\">${esc(attr.note||'No strong mod attribution is available yet. Run Incident Capture during the slowdown.')}</div>`;\n    if($('tickDebugClearAttribution'))$('tickDebugClearAttribution').onclick=()=>clearProfilerList('mods',true);\n  }\n  $('tickDebugActionOutput').textContent=last.output||'No native debug command has been run from this page yet.';\n  $('tickDebugSlowOutput').textContent=slow.lastExcerpt||'No slow-tick capture has completed yet.';\n  $('tickDebugLogPath').textContent=slow.logPath||'Current server log path will appear when a capture starts.';\n  if($('tickDebugClearAction'))$('tickDebugClearAction').disabled=!String(last.output||'').trim();\n  if($('tickDebugClearSlow'))$('tickDebugClearSlow').disabled=!String(slow.lastExcerpt||'').trim()&&!String(d.lastIncidentSummary||'').trim();\n  $('tickDebugStatus').textContent=`Updated ${new Date().toLocaleTimeString()} · CPU ${Number(d.cpuPercent||0).toFixed(0)}% · ${Number(d.players||0)} player(s) · lag markers are clickable in Performance/Profiler graphs`;\n}\nasync function loadTickDebug(showLoading=true){\n  if(tickDebugRequestInFlight)return;\n  tickDebugRequestInFlight=true;\n  if(showLoading&&$('tickDebugStatus'))$('tickDebugStatus').textContent='Loading native tick diagnostics…';\n  try{renderTickDebug(await api('/api/tick-debug'));}\n  catch(e){if($('tickDebugStatus'))$('tickDebugStatus').textContent=e.message;}\n  finally{tickDebugRequestInFlight=false;}\n}\nasync function startTickDebugCapture(incident=false){\n  const threshold=clamp(Number($('tickDebugThreshold').value||100),20,1000);\n  const duration=clamp(Number($('tickDebugDuration').value||30),5,incident?30:120);\n  const endpoint=incident?'/api/tick-debug/incident':'/api/tick-debug/slow-start';\n  try{\n    const r=await api(endpoint,{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({thresholdMs:threshold,durationSeconds:duration})});\n    toast(r.message||'Native tick capture started.','success');\n    await loadTickDebug(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\nasync function stopTickDebugCapture(){\n  try{const r=await api('/api/tick-debug/slow-stop',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});toast(r.message||'Capture stopped.','success');await loadTickDebug(false);}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\nasync function runTickDebugAction(action){\n  try{\n    const r=await api('/api/tick-debug/action',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action})});\n    toast(r.message||'Native debug command completed.','success');\n    await loadTickDebug(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');await loadTickDebug(false);}\n}\n\nif($('tickDebugRefresh'))$('tickDebugRefresh').onclick=()=>loadTickDebug(true);\nif($('tickDebugEnabledToggle'))$('tickDebugEnabledToggle').onclick=async()=>{\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly')return;\n  const next=!(tickDebugLastPayload?.enabled!==false);\n  try{const d=await api('/api/tick-debug/enabled',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({enabled:next})});toast(d.message||'Tick Debugging updated.','success');await loadTickDebug(false);}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}\n};\nif($('tickDebugStart'))$('tickDebugStart').onclick=()=>startTickDebugCapture(false);\nif($('tickDebugIncident'))$('tickDebugIncident').onclick=()=>startTickDebugCapture(true);\nif($('tickDebugEnableDiagnostics'))$('tickDebugEnableDiagnostics').onclick=async()=>{try{await api('/api/profiler/enabled',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({enabled:true})});toast('Lightweight diagnostics enabled.','success');await loadTickDebug(false);}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error')}};\nif($('tickDebugStop'))$('tickDebugStop').onclick=stopTickDebugCapture;\nif($('tickDebugHandlers'))$('tickDebugHandlers').onclick=()=>runTickDebugAction('tickhandlers');\nif($('tickDebugMainThread'))$('tickDebugMainThread').onclick=()=>runTickDebugAction('mainthreadstate');\nif($('tickDebugDump'))$('tickDebugDump').onclick=()=>runTickDebugAction($('tickDebugDumpType').value||'dump-gtentity');\n\nasync function clearTickDebugOutput(target){\n  try{\n    const r=await api('/api/tick-debug/clear',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({target})});\n    toast(r.message||'Tick Debugger output cleared.','success');\n    await loadTickDebug(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\nif($('tickDebugClearAction'))$('tickDebugClearAction').onclick=()=>clearTickDebugOutput('action');\nif($('tickDebugClearSlow'))$('tickDebugClearSlow').onclick=()=>clearTickDebugOutput('slow');\n\nasync function clearProfilerList(target,refreshTickDebug=false){\n  try{\n    const r=await api('/api/profiler/clear',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({target})});\n    if(r.success===false)throw new Error(r.message||'Could not clear profiler results.');\n    toast(r.message||'Profiler results cleared.','success');\n    await loadProfiler(false);\n    if(refreshTickDebug&&currentSection==='tickDebug')await loadTickDebug(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nasync function clearLagHistory(){\n  if(!confirm('Clear retained lag diagnostic history? This removes archived Performance/Profiler lag incidents and graph markers, but does not touch BlockLogger or admin audit history.'))return;\n  try{\n    const r=await api('/api/performance/lag-history/clear',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});\n    if(r.success===false)throw new Error(r.message||'Could not clear lag history.');\n    incidentCompareStarts=[];\n    selectedPerformanceIncidentStart=0;\n    chartHoverTimestamp=null;\n    lagIncidentDrawerPayload=null;\n    closeLagIncidentDrawer();\n    toast(r.message||'Lag diagnostic history cleared.','success');\n    if($('perfIncidentDetailCard'))$('perfIncidentDetailCard').style.display='none';\n    if(currentSection==='performance')await Promise.allSettled([loadPerformanceOverview(true),loadPerformanceTimeline(false)]);\n    await loadProfiler(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n\nfunction profilerPointsForRange(){\n  if(profilerRangeSeconds<=60)return 120;\n  if(profilerRangeSeconds<=300)return 240;\n  if(profilerRangeSeconds<=900)return 300;\n  return 360;\n}\n\nfunction setRange(seconds){\n  profilerRangeSeconds=clamp(Number(seconds)||300,60,1800);\n  localStorage.setItem('nsu.profilerRange',String(profilerRangeSeconds));\n  document.querySelectorAll('#rangeButtons button').forEach(btn=>btn.classList.toggle('active',Number(btn.dataset.range)===profilerRangeSeconds));\n  chartHoverTimestamp=null;\n  loadProfiler(true);\n}\ndocument.querySelectorAll('#rangeButtons button').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=()=>setRange(btn.dataset.range));\n\nasync function loadProfiler(showLoading=true){\n  if(profilerRequestInFlight)return;\n  profilerRequestInFlight=true;\n  if(showLoading)$('profState').textContent='Loading diagnostics…';\n\n  try{\n    const q=new URLSearchParams({window:String(profilerRangeSeconds),points:String(profilerPointsForRange())});\n    const p=await api('/api/profiler?'+q);\n    lastProfilerPayload=p;\n    $('profState').textContent=p.profileRunning\n      ? `Engine profile running · about ${p.profileRemainingSeconds}s remaining`\n      : (p.enabled?`Diagnostics enabled · graph window ${Math.round(profilerRangeSeconds/60)}m`:'Diagnostics disabled');\n\n    renderDiagnosis(p);\n    renderSmartAnalysis(p);\n    redrawProfilerCharts();\n\n    $('profMods').innerHTML=(p.modHotspots||[]).length\n      ? (p.modHotspots||[]).slice(0,18).map(x=>`<tr class=\"${x.modId&&x.modId!=='<unattributed>'?'clickableRow':''}\" ${x.modId&&x.modId!=='<unattributed>'?`data-mod-id=\"${esc(x.modId)}\"`:''}><td><b>${esc(x.modId||'unattributed')}</b></td><td>${Number(x.totalMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td><td>${Number(x.maxSingleMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</td><td>${Number(x.slowSegments||0)}</td><td>${Number(x.percentOfProfileTickTime||0).toFixed(1)}%</td><td>${confidenceBadge(x.confidence)}</td></tr>`).join('')\n      : '<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">Run Profile 10s or Profile 30s to generate per-mod attribution.</td></tr>';\n    if($('profClearMods'))$('profClearMods').disabled=!(p.modHotspots||[]).length;\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-mod-id]').forEach(row=>{\n      row.onclick=()=>openModFilter(row.dataset.modId||'');\n    });\n\n    $('profTicks').innerHTML=(p.profileSlowTicks||[]).length\n      ? (p.profileSlowTicks||[]).slice(0,15).map(x=>`<tr><td class=\"bad\"><b>${Number(x.tickMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms</b></td><td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.topCauseSummary)}\">${esc(x.topCauseSummary)}</td></tr>`).join('')\n      : '<tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"muted\">No ≥50ms ticks captured in the latest engine profile.</td></tr>';\n    if($('profClearTicks'))$('profClearTicks').disabled=!(p.profileSlowTicks||[]).length;\n\n    const incidents=p.diagnosticIncidents||[];\n    $('incidentCount').textContent=`${incidents.length} event(s) in selected range`;\n    if($('profClearLagSamples'))$('profClearLagSamples').disabled=!incidents.length;\n    $('profIncidents').innerHTML=incidents.length\n      ? incidents.slice(0,40).map(x=>{\n          const entityDelta=Number(x.entityDelta||0),chunkDelta=Number(x.chunkDelta||0);\n          return `<tr class=\"clickableRow\" data-prof-lag=\"${Number(x.unixMilliseconds||0)}\" data-prof-lag-index=\"${incidents.indexOf(x)}\">\n            <td><b>${esc(new Date(Number(x.unixMilliseconds||0)).toLocaleTimeString())}</b></td>\n            <td class=\"${severityClass(x.severity)}\">${incidentDot(x.severity)}<b>${esc(x.severity)}</b></td>\n            <td>${Number(x.delayMs||0).toFixed(0)}ms</td>\n            <td>${Number(x.cpuPercent||0).toFixed(0)}%</td>\n            <td>+${Number(x.gen0Delta||0)}/+${Number(x.gen1Delta||0)}/+${Number(x.gen2Delta||0)}</td>\n            <td>${Number(x.blockLoggerQueue||0).toLocaleString()} / ${Number(x.blockLoggerWriterMs||0)}ms</td>\n            <td>${Number(x.loadedEntities||0).toLocaleString()} (${entityDelta>=0?'+':''}${entityDelta})</td>\n            <td>${Number(x.loadedChunks||0).toLocaleString()} (${chunkDelta>=0?'+':''}${chunkDelta})</td>\n            <td class=\"codeCell\" title=\"${esc(x.evidence)}\">${esc(x.evidence)}</td>\n          </tr>`;\n        }).join('')\n      : '<tr><td colspan=\"9\" class=\"muted\">No correlated lag events recorded in the selected graph range.</td></tr>';\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-prof-lag-index]').forEach(row=>{\n      row.onclick=()=>{\n        const x=incidents[Number(row.dataset.profLagIndex||0)]||{};\n        openLagIncidentDrawer(Number(x.unixMilliseconds||0));\n      };\n    });\n  }catch(e){\n    $('profState').textContent=e.message;\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{\n    profilerRequestInFlight=false;\n  }\n}\n\n$('profRefresh').onclick=()=>loadProfiler(true);\nif($('profClearMods'))$('profClearMods').onclick=()=>clearProfilerList('mods');\nif($('profClearTicks'))$('profClearTicks').onclick=()=>clearProfilerList('ticks');\nif($('profClearLagGroups'))$('profClearLagGroups').onclick=clearLagHistory;\nif($('profClearLagSamples'))$('profClearLagSamples').onclick=clearLagHistory;\nif($('perfClearLagHistory'))$('perfClearLagHistory').onclick=clearLagHistory;\n\nasync function setProfilerEnabled(enabled){\n  try{\n    await api('/api/profiler/enabled',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({enabled})});\n    toast(enabled?'Profiler diagnostics enabled.':'Profiler diagnostics disabled.','success');\n    await loadProfiler(true);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\n$('profEnable').onclick=()=>setProfilerEnabled(true);\n$('profDisable').onclick=()=>setProfilerEnabled(false);\n\nasync function startProfile(seconds){\n  const buttons=seconds===10?[$('prof10'),$('modsProfile10')]:[$('prof30'),$('modsProfile30')];\n  buttons.filter(Boolean).forEach(btn=>btn.disabled=true);\n  try{\n    const result=await api('/api/profiler/start',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({seconds})});\n    toast(result.message||`${seconds}s engine profile started.`,'success');\n    await loadProfiler(false);\n    setTimeout(async()=>{\n      await loadProfiler(false);\n      if(currentSection==='mods')await loadMods(false);\n    },(seconds+1)*1000);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n  finally{buttons.filter(Boolean).forEach(btn=>btn.disabled=false);}\n}\n$('prof10').onclick=()=>startProfile(10);\n$('prof30').onclick=()=>startProfile(30);\n\n$('profCopy').onclick=async()=>{\n  if(!lastProfilerPayload){toast('Load a profiler snapshot first.');return;}\n  const p=lastProfilerPayload;\n  const d=p.diagnosticSummary||{};\n  const smart=p.smartAnalysis||{};\n  const mods=(p.modHotspots||[]).slice(0,5);\n  const signals=(smart.signals||[]).slice(0,5);\n  const groups=(smart.incidentGroups||[]).slice(0,5);\n  const text=[\n    `Newfies Server Essentials Suite v__NSS_VERSION__ smart diagnostic report`,\n    `Health: ${smart.available?`${smart.healthScore}/100 ${smart.state}`:'not available'}`,\n    `Primary finding: ${smart.primaryFinding||d.summary||'None'} (${smart.primaryConfidence||'Low'} finding confidence)`,\n    `Analysis confidence/data quality: ${smart.analysisConfidence||'Low'} / ${Number(smart.dataQualityScore||0)}/100`,\n    `Recovery state: ${smart.recoveryState||'Unknown'}`,\n    `Worst scheduler delay: ${Number(d.worstDelayMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms`,\n    `CPU avg/max: ${Number(d.averageCpuPercent||0).toFixed(1)}% / ${Number(d.maxCpuPercent||0).toFixed(1)}%`,\n    `Gen2 in 5m: +${Number(d.gen2Collections||0)}`,\n    `Grouped incidents: ${groups.length}`,\n    ``,\n    `Smart findings:`,\n    ...signals.map(x=>`- [${x.severity}/${x.confidence}] ${x.title}: ${x.evidence} NEXT: ${x.nextAction}`),\n    ``,\n    `Profiled mod hotspots:`,\n    ...mods.map(x=>`- ${x.modId}: ${Number(x.totalMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms total, ${Number(x.maxSingleMs||0).toFixed(1)}ms max, ${Number(x.percentOfProfileTickTime||0).toFixed(1)}%, ${x.confidence||'Low'} confidence`)\n  ].join('\\n');\n\n  try{\n    await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);\n    toast('Smart diagnosis copied to clipboard.','success');\n  }catch{\n    const ta=document.createElement('textarea');ta.value=text;document.body.appendChild(ta);ta.select();document.execCommand('copy');ta.remove();\n    toast('Smart diagnosis copied to clipboard.','success');\n  }\n};\n\n$('profExport').onclick=()=>{\n  if(!lastProfilerPayload){toast('Load a profiler snapshot first.');return;}\n  const blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify(lastProfilerPayload,null,2)],{type:'application/json'});\n  const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n  const a=document.createElement('a');\n  a.href=url;\n  a.download=`newfies-profiler-${new Date().toISOString().replace(/[:.]/g,'-')}.json`;\n  document.body.appendChild(a);a.click();a.remove();\n  setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);\n  toast('Profiler snapshot exported.','success');\n};\n\n$('profExportFull').onclick=async()=>{\n  try{\n    toast('Building full diagnostic report…');\n    const q=new URLSearchParams({window:String(profilerRangeSeconds),points:String(profilerPointsForRange())});\n    const [dashboard,profiler,mods,web]=await Promise.all([\n      api('/api/dashboard'),\n      api('/api/profiler?'+q),\n      api('/api/server/mods'),\n      api('/api/web/status')\n    ]);\n\n    const report={\n      format:'newfies-server-utilities-diagnostic-v1',\n      exportedUtc:new Date().toISOString(),\n      graphWindowSeconds:profilerRangeSeconds,\n      dashboard,\n      profiler,\n      mods,\n      web:{\n        enabled:web.enabled,\n        running:web.running,\n        bindAddress:web.bindAddress,\n        port:web.port,\n        authenticationMode:web.authenticationMode,\n        secureCookies:web.secureCookies,\n        allowedNetworks:web.allowedNetworks,\n        lastError:web.lastError,\n        diagnostics:web.diagnostics||{}\n      },\n      browserBaseline:savedBaseline\n    };\n\n    const blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify(report,null,2)],{type:'application/json'});\n    const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n    const a=document.createElement('a');\n    a.href=url;\n    a.download=`newfies-full-diagnostics-${new Date().toISOString().replace(/[:.]/g,'-')}.json`;\n    document.body.appendChild(a);a.click();a.remove();\n    setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);\n    toast('Full diagnostic report exported.','success');\n  }catch(e){\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }\n};\n\nlet antiCheatSelectedPlayer='';\nlet antiCheatDrawerTab='overview';\nlet antiCheatPlayers=[];\nlet antiCheatClientModPlayers=[];\nlet antiCheatClientModsLoadedAt=0;\nlet antiCheatClientModsRequest=null;\nlet antiCheatPlayerSortKey='risk';\nlet antiCheatPlayerSortDir='desc';\nlet antiCheatModDbAutomaticConsequencesEnabled=false;\nlet antiCheatClientModDbVerificationEnabled=false;\nlet antiCheatStrictClientModDbEnforcementEnabled=false;\nlet antiCheatSnapshot={};\nlet antiCheatForbiddenMods=new Set();\nlet antiCheatRequiredMods=new Set();\nlet antiCheatConsequenceRules=[];\nlet antiCheatPacketGuard={};\nlet antiCheatOreShield={};\nlet antiCheatHistorySummary={};\nlet antiCheatApprovedHashes=new Set();\nlet antiCheatForbiddenFingerprints=new Map();\nlet antiCheatManualTarget='';\nlet antiCheatManualEditingId='';\nlet antiCheatInventoryData=[];\nlet antiCheatInventorySnapshots=[];\nlet antiCheatInventoryHistory=[];\nlet antiCheatInventorySelectedSlot=null;\nlet antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem=null;\nlet antiCheatInventorySearchCache=[];\nlet antiCheatInventoryLoadedFor='';\nlet antiCheatInventoryLoading=false;\nlet antiCheatInventoryPlayer={};\nlet antiCheatInventoryStatus={};\nfunction acStatusBadge(status){const s=String(status||'Unknown');const c=s==='Clean'?'low':(s==='Review'||s==='Scanning'||s==='AwaitingClient'?'medium':'high');return `<span class=\"badge ${c}\">${esc(s)}</span>`;}\nfunction acDate(ms){return Number(ms||0)>0?new Date(Number(ms)).toLocaleString():'—';}\nfunction acRelativeAge(ms){\n  const n=Number(ms||0);if(!n)return {text:'—',cls:'muted'};\n  const age=Math.max(0,Date.now()-n),sec=Math.round(age/1000);\n  if(sec<60)return {text:`${sec}s ago`,cls:'acFresh'};\n  const min=Math.round(sec/60);if(min<10)return {text:`${min}m ago`,cls:'acFresh'};\n  if(min<30)return {text:`${min}m ago`,cls:'acStale'};\n  const hr=Math.round(min/60);return {text:hr<24?`${hr}h ago`:`${Math.round(hr/24)}d ago`,cls:'acExpired'};\n}\nfunction acEvidenceDomainBadge(domain,serverAuthoritative=false){\n  const d=String(domain||'Other');\n  const server=serverAuthoritative||d==='ServerBehavior';\n  const cls=server?'server':(/Integrity|Patch|Static|Runtime/i.test(d)?'integrity':'');\n  const label=server?'Server authoritative':d.replace(/([a-z])([A-Z])/g,'$1 $2');\n  return `<span class=\"acDomainBadge ${cls}\">${esc(label||'Other')}</span>`;\n}\nfunction acRiskMeter(score){\n  const n=Math.max(0,Math.min(100,Number(score||0)));\n  return `<div class=\"acRiskMeter\"><div class=\"acRiskTrack\"><div class=\"acRiskFill\" style=\"width:${n}%\"></div><span class=\"acRiskMarker\" style=\"left:${n}%\"></span></div><div class=\"acRiskScale\"><span>Clean</span><span>Review 10</span><span>Suspicious 50</span><span>100</span></div></div>`;\n}\nfunction acStartupBadge(x){\n  const v=String(x?.startupGateVerdict||'NotStarted');\n  if(x?.startupGatePending)return '<span class=\"badge medium\">Pending</span>';\n  if(v==='Clean')return '<span class=\"badge low\">Clean</span>';\n  if(v==='Review')return '<span class=\"badge medium\">Review</span>';\n  if(v==='Suspicious')return '<span class=\"badge high\">Suspicious</span>';\n  return `<span class=\"badge\">${esc(v||'Not started')}</span>`;\n}\nfunction acFindingStrength(x){\n  const conf=Number(x?.confidenceScore||0), sev=Number(x?.severity||0), pts=Number(x?.riskPoints||0);\n  if(x?.serverAuthoritative&&conf>=70)return 'high';\n  if(conf>=85||sev>=4||pts>=25)return 'high';\n  if(conf>=55||sev>=2||pts>=5)return 'medium';\n  return 'low';\n}\nfunction acTimelineTone(action,code,severity=0){\n  const text=`${action||''} ${code||''}`.toLowerCase();\n  if(/kick|reject|timeout|missing|fail|mismatch|suspicious/.test(text)||Number(severity)>=4)return 'bad';\n  if(/retry|extend|stale|review|difference|warning/.test(text)||Number(severity)>=2)return 'warn';\n  if(/accept|clean|recover|complete|verified|official|captured/.test(text))return 'good';\n  return 'accent';\n}\nfunction acTimelineHtml(events,limit=30){\n  const list=(events||[]).filter(x=>Number(x.utc||0)>0).sort((a,b)=>Number(b.utc||0)-Number(a.utc||0)).slice(0,limit);\n  if(!list.length)return '<div class=\"muted\" style=\"padding:10px 30px\">No timeline events available.</div>';\n  return list.map(x=>{const tone=x.tone||acTimelineTone(x.action,x.code,x.severity);const age=acRelativeAge(x.utc);return `<div class=\"acTimelineItem ${tone}\"><span class=\"acTimelineDot\"></span><div class=\"acTimelineWhen\"><b>${esc(age.text)}</b><span title=\"${esc(acDate(x.utc))}\">${esc(new Date(Number(x.utc)).toLocaleTimeString())}</span></div><div class=\"acTimelineBody\"><div class=\"title\">${esc(x.title||x.code||x.action||'Anti-Cheat event')}</div><div class=\"meta\">${x.badge?`<span class=\"badge ${esc(x.badgeTone||'')}\">${esc(x.badge)}</span> `:''}${esc(x.detail||'')}${x.meta?`<br>${esc(x.meta)}`:''}</div></div></div>`;}).join('');\n}\nfunction setAntiCheatDrawerTab(tab,focus=false){\n  const allowed=new Set(['overview','anticheat','mods','inventory','connection','history','evidence']);\n  const next=allowed.has(String(tab||''))?String(tab):'overview';\n  antiCheatDrawerTab=next;\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-drawer-tab]').forEach(btn=>{\n    const active=String(btn.dataset.acDrawerTab||'')===next;\n    btn.classList.toggle('active',active);btn.setAttribute('aria-selected',active?'true':'false');btn.tabIndex=active?0:-1;\n    if(active&&focus)btn.focus({preventScroll:true});\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-drawer-panel]').forEach(panel=>{\n    const active=String(panel.dataset.acDrawerPanel||'')===next;\n    panel.classList.toggle('active',active);panel.hidden=!active;\n  });\n  const detail=$('acDetail');if(detail)detail.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'auto'});\n  if(next==='inventory')void loadAntiCheatInventory(false);\n}\nfunction setAntiCheatDrawerTabCount(id,value,tone=''){\n  const el=$(id);if(!el)return;const n=Math.max(0,Number(value||0));el.textContent=String(n);el.classList.remove('good','warn','bad');if(tone)el.classList.add(tone);\n}\nfunction acInventoryKey(i){return `${i?.inventory||''}\\n${Number(i?.slot||0)}`;}\nfunction acInventoryInitials(i){\n  const raw=String(i?.name||i?.code||'?').replace(/^.*:/,'').replace(/[-_./]+/g,' ').trim();\n  const parts=raw.split(/\\s+/).filter(Boolean);if(!parts.length)return '?';\n  return (parts.length>1?(parts[0][0]+parts[1][0]):parts[0].slice(0,2)).toUpperCase();\n}\nfunction acInventorySectionRank(section){return ({Hotbar:0,Backpack:1,Equipment:2,Crafting:3,Cursor:4,Other:5})[String(section||'Other')]??6;}\nfunction acInventoryColumns(section,count){const s=String(section||'Other');if(s==='Hotbar')return Math.min(10,Math.max(1,count));if(s==='Crafting')return Math.min(3,Math.max(1,count));if(s==='Equipment'||s==='Cursor')return Math.min(6,Math.max(1,count));return Math.min(10,Math.max(4,Math.min(count,10)));}\nfunction acInventorySlotHtml(i,filter=''){\n  const selected=antiCheatInventorySelectedSlot&&acInventoryKey(antiCheatInventorySelectedSlot)===acInventoryKey(i);\n  const hay=`${i?.name||''} ${i?.code||''} ${i?.inventory||''} ${i?.section||''}`.toLowerCase();\n  const hit=!filter||(!i.empty&&hay.includes(filter));const dim=filter&&!hit;\n  const title=i.empty?`${i.inventory}[${i.slot}] · Empty · ${i.storageType||''}`:`${i.inventory}[${i.slot}] · ${i.stackSize}x ${i.name||i.code}\\n${i.code||''}${i.maxDurability?`\\nDurability ${i.durability}/${i.maxDurability}`:''}${Number(i.temperature||0)?`\\nTemperature ${Number(i.temperature||0).toFixed(1)}°C`:''}`;\n  const cls=['acInvSlot',i.empty?'empty':'',selected?'selected':'',dim?'filterDim':'',filter&&hit?'filterHit':''].filter(Boolean).join(' ');\n  if(i.empty)return `<button class=\"${cls}\" title=\"${esc(title)}\" data-ac-inv-slot=\"${esc(encodeURIComponent(String(i.inventory||'')))}\" data-ac-inv-index=\"${Number(i.slot)}\"><span class=\"acInvSlotNo\">${Number(i.slot)}</span></button>`;\n  const dur=Number(i.maxDurability||0)>0?Math.max(0,Math.min(100,Number(i.durability||0)*100/Number(i.maxDurability||1))):0;\n  const type=String(i.itemClass||'').toLowerCase().includes('block')?'block':'';\n  return `<button class=\"${cls}\" title=\"${esc(title)}\" data-ac-inv-slot=\"${esc(encodeURIComponent(String(i.inventory||'')))}\" data-ac-inv-index=\"${Number(i.slot)}\"><span class=\"acInvSlotNo\">${Number(i.slot)}</span><span class=\"acInvGlyph ${type}\"><span>${esc(acInventoryInitials(i))}</span></span>${Number(i.stackSize||0)>1?`<span class=\"acInvCount\">${Number(i.stackSize)}</span>`:''}${dur?`<span class=\"acInvDurability\"><span style=\"width:${dur.toFixed(1)}%\"></span></span>`:''}</button>`;\n}\nfunction renderAntiCheatInventory(){\n  const filter=String($('acInventoryFilter')?.value||'').trim().toLowerCase();\n  const data=antiCheatInventoryData||[],occupied=data.filter(x=>!x.empty).length,empty=data.length-occupied;\n  const p=antiCheatInventoryPlayer||{},status=antiCheatInventoryStatus||{},canEdit=inventoryCanEdit(status);\n  if($('acInventorySnapshot'))$('acInventorySnapshot').disabled=!canEdit;\n  if($('acInventoryEditWorkbench'))$('acInventoryEditWorkbench').hidden=!canEdit;\n  if($('acInventoryState'))$('acInventoryState').textContent=antiCheatInventoryLoading?'Loading…':status.available?`${occupied} occupied / ${data.length} slots · ${status.source==='live'?'live':'saved read only'}`:'Inventory unavailable';\n  if($('acInventoryHero'))$('acInventoryHero').innerHTML=`\n    <div class=\"acInventoryMetric\"><div class=\"k\">Inventory status</div><div class=\"v ${p.online?'good':'muted'}\">${status.source==='live'?'LIVE':status.available?'SAVED':'UNAVAILABLE'}</div><div class=\"sub\">${esc(inventoryEvidenceText(status))}<br>${esc(status.message||'')}</div></div>\n    <div class=\"acInventoryMetric\"><div class=\"k\">Occupied slots</div><div class=\"v\">${occupied}</div><div class=\"sub\">${empty} empty · ${data.length} total</div></div>\n    <div class=\"acInventoryMetric\"><div class=\"k\">Snapshots</div><div class=\"v\">${antiCheatInventorySnapshots.length}</div><div class=\"sub\">Automatic rollback snapshots are created before edits.</div></div>\n    <div class=\"acInventoryMetric\"><div class=\"k\">Mutation access</div><div class=\"v ${canEdit?'good':'warn'}\">${canEdit?'ENABLED':'READ ONLY'}</div><div class=\"sub\">Conflict fingerprints protect against stale-slot edits.</div></div>`;\n  const grid=$('acInventoryGrid');if(!grid)return;\n  if(!data.length){grid.innerHTML=`<div class=\"acInventoryEmpty\"><b>${status.available?'No recorded slots':'Inventory unavailable'}</b><br>${esc(status.message||'No inventory data was returned.')}</div>`;renderAntiCheatInventorySelectedSlot();renderAntiCheatInventorySnapshots();renderAntiCheatInventoryHistory();return;}\n  const groups={};for(const i of data){const key=`${i.section||'Other'}\\u0000${i.inventory||'inventory'}`;(groups[key]||(groups[key]=[])).push(i);}\n  const keys=Object.keys(groups).sort((a,b)=>{const [as,ai]=a.split('\\u0000'),[bs,bi]=b.split('\\u0000');return acInventorySectionRank(as)-acInventorySectionRank(bs)||ai.localeCompare(bi);});\n  grid.innerHTML=keys.map(key=>{const [section,inventory]=key.split('\\u0000');const rows=groups[key].sort((a,b)=>Number(a.slot)-Number(b.slot));const used=rows.filter(x=>!x.empty).length,pct=rows.length?used*100/rows.length:0,cols=acInventoryColumns(section,rows.length);return `<div class=\"acInventorySection\"><div class=\"acInventorySectionHead\"><b>${esc(section)} · ${esc(inventory)}</b><div class=\"acInventoryFill\" title=\"${used}/${rows.length} occupied\"><span style=\"width:${pct.toFixed(1)}%\"></span></div><span class=\"small\">${used}/${rows.length}</span></div><div class=\"acInventoryGameGrid\" style=\"--ac-inv-cols:${cols}\">${rows.map(i=>acInventorySlotHtml(i,filter)).join('')}</div></div>`;}).join('');\n  grid.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-inv-slot]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const inv=decodeURIComponent(b.dataset.acInvSlot||'');const slot=Number(b.dataset.acInvIndex);antiCheatInventorySelectedSlot=data.find(i=>String(i.inventory)===inv&&Number(i.slot)===slot)||null;renderAntiCheatInventory();});\n  renderAntiCheatInventorySelectedSlot();renderAntiCheatInventorySnapshots();renderAntiCheatInventoryHistory();\n}\nfunction renderAntiCheatInventorySelectedSlot(){\n  const state=$('acInventorySelectedState'),detail=$('acInventorySelectedDetail'),actions=$('acInventorySelectedActions');if(!state||!detail||!actions)return;\n  const i=antiCheatInventorySelectedSlot;if(!i){state.textContent='None';detail.innerHTML='<div class=\"acInventoryEmpty\" style=\"padding:14px\">Select a slot in the grid to inspect it.</div>';actions.innerHTML='';return;}\n  state.textContent=`${i.inventory}[${i.slot}]`;\n  if(i.empty){detail.innerHTML=`<div class=\"acInvSelectedHero\"><div class=\"acInvSelectedGlyph\"></div><div><div class=\"name\">Empty slot</div><div class=\"small\">${esc(i.section||'Other')} · ${esc(i.storageType||'—')}</div></div></div><div class=\"acInvDetailGrid\"><div class=\"acInvDetailCell\"><div class=\"k\">Slot maximum</div><div class=\"v\">${Number(i.maxSlotStackSize||0)}</div></div><div class=\"acInvDetailCell\"><div class=\"k\">Fingerprint</div><div class=\"v\"><code>${esc(String(i.fingerprint||'empty').slice(0,16))}</code></div></div></div>`;actions.innerHTML=!inventoryCanEdit(antiCheatInventoryStatus)?'<span class=\"muted\">Read-only session.</span>':'<button onclick=\"acInventoryGiveSelectedItem(false)\">Give selected item here</button>';return;}\n  const dur=Number(i.maxDurability||0)>0?`${Number(i.durability||0)} / ${Number(i.maxDurability||0)}`:'—';const type=String(i.itemClass||'').toLowerCase().includes('block')?'block':'';\n  detail.innerHTML=`<div class=\"acInvSelectedHero\"><div class=\"acInvSelectedGlyph\"><span class=\"acInvGlyph ${type}\"><span>${esc(acInventoryInitials(i))}</span></span></div><div><div class=\"name\">${esc(i.name||i.code)}</div><code>${esc(i.code||'')}</code></div></div><div class=\"acInvDetailGrid\"><div class=\"acInvDetailCell\"><div class=\"k\">Quantity</div><div class=\"v\">${Number(i.stackSize||0)} / ${Number(i.maxStackSize||0)}</div></div><div class=\"acInvDetailCell\"><div class=\"k\">Durability</div><div class=\"v\">${esc(dur)}</div></div><div class=\"acInvDetailCell\"><div class=\"k\">Temperature</div><div class=\"v\">${Number(i.temperature||0).toFixed(1)}°C</div></div><div class=\"acInvDetailCell\"><div class=\"k\">Storage</div><div class=\"v\">${esc(i.storageType||'—')}</div></div></div>`;\n  actions.innerHTML=!inventoryCanEdit(antiCheatInventoryStatus)?'<span class=\"muted\">Read-only session.</span>':'<button onclick=\"acInventoryEditQuantity()\">Edit Quantity</button><button onclick=\"acInventoryMoveSlot()\">Move / Swap</button><button onclick=\"acInventoryReplaceSelectedItem()\">Replace</button><button class=\"danger\" onclick=\"acInventoryRemoveSlot()\">Remove</button>';\n}\nfunction renderAntiCheatInventorySnapshots(){\n  if($('acInventorySnapshotState'))$('acInventorySnapshotState').textContent=`${antiCheatInventorySnapshots.length} retained`;\n  if(!$('acInventorySnapshots'))return;\n  $('acInventorySnapshots').innerHTML=antiCheatInventorySnapshots.length?antiCheatInventorySnapshots.map(x=>`<div class=\"acInventorySnapshot\"><div class=\"head\"><b>#${Number(x.id)}</b><span class=\"small\">${esc(fmtAdminTime(x.unixMilliseconds))}</span><div class=\"spacer\"></div><span class=\"badge\">${Number(x.occupiedSlots||0)} slots</span></div><div class=\"reason\">${esc(x.reason||'Inventory snapshot')}</div><div class=\"meta\">Created by ${esc(x.createdBy||'server')}</div><div class=\"actions\">${antiCheatInventoryStatus.source==='live'?`<button data-ac-inv-compare=\"${Number(x.id)}\">Compare</button>`:'<span class=\"small\">Live compare requires online player</span>'}${!inventoryCanEdit(antiCheatInventoryStatus)?'':`<button class=\"danger\" data-ac-inv-restore=\"${Number(x.id)}\">Restore</button>`}</div></div>`).join(''):'<div class=\"muted\">No inventory snapshots have been retained yet.</div>';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-inv-compare]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>acInventoryCompareSnapshot(Number(b.dataset.acInvCompare)));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-inv-restore]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>acInventoryRestoreSnapshot(Number(b.dataset.acInvRestore)));\n}\nfunction renderAntiCheatInventoryHistory(){\n  if(!$('acInventoryHistoryRows'))return;const rows=antiCheatInventoryHistory||[];\n  $('acInventoryHistoryRows').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.slice(0,80).map(h=>`<tr><td>${esc(fmtAdminTime(h.unixMilliseconds))}</td><td>${esc(h.actor||'')}</td><td><code>${esc(h.action||'')}</code></td><td>${esc(h.source||'')}</td><td>${esc(h.detail||'')}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">No inventory administration history for this player yet.</td></tr>';\n}\nasync function loadAntiCheatInventory(force=false){\n  const player=antiCheatSelectedPlayer;if(!player||antiCheatInventoryLoading)return;\n  if(!force&&antiCheatInventoryLoadedFor===player){renderAntiCheatInventory();return;}\n  antiCheatInventoryLoading=true;if($('acInventoryState'))$('acInventoryState').textContent='Loading inventory…';if($('acInventoryGrid'))$('acInventoryGrid').innerHTML='<div class=\"acInventoryEmpty\">Loading server-authoritative inventory…</div>';\n  try{const d=await api('/api/admin/inventory?player='+encodeURIComponent(player));if(player!==antiCheatSelectedPlayer)return;antiCheatInventoryPlayer=d.player||{};antiCheatInventoryStatus=d.inventoryStatus||{};antiCheatInventoryData=d.inventory||[];antiCheatInventorySnapshots=d.inventorySnapshots||[];antiCheatInventoryHistory=d.history||[];antiCheatInventoryLoadedFor=player;antiCheatInventorySelectedSlot=null;antiCheatInventoryLoading=false;renderAntiCheatInventory();const occupied=antiCheatInventoryData.filter(x=>!x.empty).length;const badge=$('acTabInventoryCount');if(badge){badge.textContent=String(occupied);badge.classList.remove('good','warn','bad');badge.classList.add(antiCheatInventoryPlayer?.online?'good':'warn');}}\n  catch(e){if($('acInventoryState'))$('acInventoryState').textContent='Inventory unavailable';if($('acInventoryGrid'))$('acInventoryGrid').innerHTML=`<div class=\"acInventoryEmpty\"><b>Could not load inventory.</b><br>${esc(e.message)}</div>`;toast(e.message,'error');}\n  finally{antiCheatInventoryLoading=false;if(player!==antiCheatSelectedPlayer&&antiCheatDrawerTab==='inventory')void loadAntiCheatInventory(false);}\n}\nasync function acInventoryMutation(payload,confirmText=''){\n  if(!inventoryCanEdit(antiCheatInventoryStatus)||!antiCheatSelectedPlayer)return null;if(confirmText&&!confirm(confirmText))return null;payload.player=antiCheatSelectedPlayer;\n  try{const d=await api('/api/admin/inventory/action',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(payload)});toast(d.message||'Inventory action completed.','success');await loadAntiCheatInventory(true);return d;}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');if(String(e.message||'').toLowerCase().includes('changed while'))await loadAntiCheatInventory(true);return null;}\n}\nasync function acInventoryEditQuantity(){const i=antiCheatInventorySelectedSlot;if(!i||i.empty)return;const raw=prompt(`Set quantity for ${i.name} (${i.inventory}[${i.slot}]). 0 removes it:`,String(i.stackSize||1));if(raw===null)return;const quantity=Number(raw);if(!Number.isInteger(quantity)||quantity<0){toast('Quantity must be a whole number 0 or greater.','error');return;}await acInventoryMutation({action:'quantity',inventory:i.inventory,slot:Number(i.slot),quantity,fingerprint:i.fingerprint},`Change ${i.name} from ${i.stackSize} to ${quantity}? A rollback snapshot will be created automatically.`);}\nasync function acInventoryMoveSlot(){const i=antiCheatInventorySelectedSlot;if(!i||i.empty)return;const inv=prompt('Destination inventory ID:',String(i.inventory||''));if(inv===null||!inv.trim())return;const slotRaw=prompt('Destination slot number:',String(Number(i.slot)+1));if(slotRaw===null)return;const slot=Number(slotRaw);if(!Number.isInteger(slot)||slot<0){toast('Invalid destination slot.','error');return;}const dest=antiCheatInventoryData.find(x=>String(x.inventory)===inv.trim()&&Number(x.slot)===slot);if(!dest){toast('That destination slot is not present in the live inventory.','error');return;}await acInventoryMutation({action:'move',inventory:i.inventory,slot:Number(i.slot),toInventory:dest.inventory,toSlot:Number(dest.slot),fingerprint:i.fingerprint,toFingerprint:dest.fingerprint},`Move/swap ${i.inventory}[${i.slot}] with ${dest.inventory}[${dest.slot}]? A rollback snapshot will be created automatically.`);}\nasync function acInventoryRemoveSlot(){const i=antiCheatInventorySelectedSlot;if(!i||i.empty)return;await acInventoryMutation({action:'remove',inventory:i.inventory,slot:Number(i.slot),fingerprint:i.fingerprint},`Remove ${i.stackSize}x ${i.name} from ${i.inventory}[${i.slot}]? A rollback snapshot will be created automatically.`);}\nasync function acInventorySearchItems(){const q=String($('acInventoryItemSearch')?.value||'').trim();if(q.length<2){$('acInventoryItemSearchResults').innerHTML='<div class=\"small\" style=\"padding:7px\">Enter at least two characters.</div>';return;}$('acInventoryItemSearchResults').innerHTML='<div class=\"small\" style=\"padding:7px\">Searching…</div>';try{const d=await api('/api/admin/items?search='+encodeURIComponent(q)+'&limit=60');antiCheatInventorySearchCache=d.items||[];renderAntiCheatInventoryCatalog();}catch(e){$('acInventoryItemSearchResults').innerHTML=`<div class=\"bad\" style=\"padding:7px\">${esc(e.message)}</div>`;}}\nfunction renderAntiCheatInventoryCatalog(){if(!$('acInventoryItemSearchResults'))return;const items=antiCheatInventorySearchCache||[];$('acInventoryItemSearchResults').innerHTML=items.length?items.map((x,idx)=>{const selected=antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem&&String(antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem.code)===String(x.code);return `<div class=\"acInventoryCatalogRow ${selected?'selected':''}\"><div class=\"acInventoryCatalogIcon\">${esc(acInventoryInitials(x))}</div><div class=\"grow\"><b>${esc(x.name||x.code)}</b><code>${esc(x.code||'')}</code><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.itemClass||'')} · max ${Number(x.maxStackSize||1)}</div></div><button data-ac-inv-catalog=\"${idx}\">${selected?'Selected':'Select'}</button></div>`;}).join(''):'<div class=\"small\" style=\"padding:7px\">No matching items or blocks.</div>';document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-inv-catalog]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem=items[Number(b.dataset.acInvCatalog)]||null;if($('acInventoryCatalogSelected'))$('acInventoryCatalogSelected').textContent=antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem?`${antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem.name} · ${antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem.code}`:'No item selected';if(antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem&&$('acInventoryGiveQuantity'))$('acInventoryGiveQuantity').max=String(Math.max(1,Number(antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem.maxStackSize||1)));renderAntiCheatInventoryCatalog();});}\nfunction acInventoryGiveQuantity(){const max=Math.max(1,Number(antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem?.maxStackSize||1));const q=Math.max(1,Math.min(max,Math.floor(Number($('acInventoryGiveQuantity')?.value||1))));if($('acInventoryGiveQuantity'))$('acInventoryGiveQuantity').value=String(q);return q;}\nasync function acInventoryGiveSelectedItem(auto){if(!antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem){toast('Search for and select an item first.','error');return;}const q=acInventoryGiveQuantity();if(auto){await acInventoryMutation({action:'give',code:antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem.code,quantity:q},`Give ${q}x ${antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem.name} to this player? A rollback snapshot will be created first.`);return;}const i=antiCheatInventorySelectedSlot;if(!i||!i.empty){toast('Select an empty inventory slot first.','error');return;}await acInventoryMutation({action:'give',inventory:i.inventory,slot:Number(i.slot),code:antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem.code,quantity:q,fingerprint:i.fingerprint},`Give ${q}x ${antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem.name} to ${i.inventory}[${i.slot}]?`);}\nasync function acInventoryReplaceSelectedItem(){const i=antiCheatInventorySelectedSlot;if(!i){toast('Select a target slot first.','error');return;}if(!antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem){toast('Search for and select a replacement item first.','error');return;}const q=acInventoryGiveQuantity();await acInventoryMutation({action:'replace',inventory:i.inventory,slot:Number(i.slot),code:antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem.code,quantity:q,fingerprint:i.fingerprint},`Replace ${i.empty?'the empty slot':i.name} in ${i.inventory}[${i.slot}] with ${q}x ${antiCheatInventorySelectedCatalogItem.name}? A rollback snapshot will be created first.`);}\nasync function acInventoryCreateSnapshot(){if(!inventoryCanEdit(antiCheatInventoryStatus)||!antiCheatSelectedPlayer)return;const reason=prompt('Snapshot reason:','Manual inventory snapshot');if(reason===null)return;try{const d=await api('/api/admin/inventory/snapshot',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:'create',player:antiCheatSelectedPlayer,reason})});toast(d.message||'Snapshot created.','success');await loadAntiCheatInventory(true);}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}}\nasync function acInventoryCompareSnapshot(id){if(!antiCheatSelectedPlayer)return;if($('acInventoryCompare'))$('acInventoryCompare').style.display='block';if($('acInventoryCompareState'))$('acInventoryCompareState').textContent=`Comparing #${id}…`;try{const d=await api('/api/admin/inventory/compare?player='+encodeURIComponent(antiCheatSelectedPlayer)+'&id='+Number(id));const rows=d.differences||[];$('acInventoryCompareState').textContent=rows.length?`${rows.length} changed slots vs #${id}`:`No changes vs #${id}`;$('acInventoryCompareRows').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(r=>`<tr><td>${esc(r.inventory)}</td><td>${Number(r.slot)}</td><td>${esc(r.snapshotItem)}</td><td>${esc(r.currentItem)}</td><td class=\"inventoryDiff${esc(r.change)}\">${esc(r.change)}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"ok\">Current inventory matches this snapshot.</td></tr>';if($('acInventoryCompare'))$('acInventoryCompare').scrollIntoView({behavior:(currentMotionPreference==='off'?'auto':'smooth'),block:'nearest'});}catch(e){if($('acInventoryCompareState'))$('acInventoryCompareState').textContent='Compare failed';toast(e.message,'error');}}\nasync function acInventoryRestoreSnapshot(id){if(!inventoryCanEdit(antiCheatInventoryStatus)||!antiCheatSelectedPlayer)return;if(!confirm(`Restore inventory snapshot #${id}? The current inventory will be snapshotted first so this restore can be rolled back.`))return;try{const d=await api('/api/admin/inventory/snapshot',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:'restore',player:antiCheatSelectedPlayer,id:Number(id)})});toast(d.message||'Snapshot restored.','success');await loadAntiCheatInventory(true);}catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}}\n\nfunction renderAntiCheatPlayerConnection(d,playerDiagnostics){\n  const list=Array.isArray(playerDiagnostics)?[...playerDiagnostics].sort((a,b)=>Number(b.utc||0)-Number(a.utc||0)):[];\n  const hb=acRelativeAge(d?.lastHeartbeatUtc),hello=acRelativeAge(d?.helloUtc||d?.clientHelloUtc||0),scan=acRelativeAge(d?.lastScanUtc);\n  const expectedVersion=String(antiCheatSnapshot?.expectedClientVersion||'unknown');\n  const expectedProtocol=Number(antiCheatSnapshot?.protocolVersion||0),actualProtocol=Number(d?.protocolVersion||0);\n  const last=list[0];const problem=list.find(x=>/kick|reject|timeout|fail|mismatch/i.test(`${x.action||''} ${x.code||''}`));\n  if($('acPlayerConnectionSummary'))$('acPlayerConnectionSummary').innerHTML=`\n    <div class=\"acConnectionStat\"><div class=\"k\">Client version</div><div class=\"v ${d?.currentClientReleaseSupported?'good':'warn'}\">v${esc(d?.clientVersion||'missing')}</div><div class=\"sub\">Server requires v${esc(expectedVersion)}${d?.currentClientReleaseSupported?' · match':' · different version'}</div></div>\n    <div class=\"acConnectionStat\"><div class=\"k\">Protocol</div><div class=\"v ${!expectedProtocol||actualProtocol===expectedProtocol?'good':'warn'}\">${actualProtocol||'—'}</div><div class=\"sub\">Server protocol ${expectedProtocol||'—'} · hardened ${d?.hardenedCapabilitiesSupported?'yes':'compatibility mode'}</div></div>\n    <div class=\"acConnectionStat\"><div class=\"k\">Heartbeat</div><div class=\"v ${hb.cls==='acExpired'?'bad':hb.cls==='acStale'?'warn':'good'}\">${esc(hb.text)}</div><div class=\"sub\">Latest liveness signal from Client Integrity</div></div>\n    <div class=\"acConnectionStat\"><div class=\"k\">Last scan</div><div class=\"v ${scan.cls==='acExpired'?'warn':'good'}\">${esc(scan.text)}</div><div class=\"sub\">${d?.startupIntegrityVerified?'Startup attestation verified':'Startup attestation not yet verified'}</div></div>\n    <div class=\"acConnectionStat\"><div class=\"k\">Latest stage</div><div class=\"v\">${esc(last?.stage||'No events')}</div><div class=\"sub\">${last?`${esc(last.action||last.code||'Observe')} · ${esc(acRelativeAge(last.utc).text)}`:'No connection diagnostics recorded'}</div></div>\n    <div class=\"acConnectionStat\"><div class=\"k\">Recent failure</div><div class=\"v ${problem?'warn':'good'}\">${problem?esc(problem.code||problem.action||'Recorded'):'None'}</div><div class=\"sub\">${problem?esc(problem.detail||'Connection issue recorded.'):'No recent timeout/reject/failure event in retained diagnostics.'}</div></div>`;\n  if($('acPlayerConnectionState'))$('acPlayerConnectionState').textContent=list.length?`${list.length} retained event${list.length===1?'':'s'} · newest first`:'No connection events loaded.';\n  if($('acPlayerConnectionRows'))$('acPlayerConnectionRows').innerHTML=list.length?list.map(x=>{const action=String(x.action||'Observe');const tone=/kick|reject|timeout|fail/i.test(`${action} ${x.code||''}`)?'high':/recover|accept|complete/i.test(`${action} ${x.code||''}`)?'low':/retry|extend|stale|window/i.test(`${action} ${x.code||''}`)?'moderate':'';return `<tr><td>${esc(acDate(x.utc))}<div class=\"small\">${esc(acRelativeAge(x.utc).text)}</div></td><td><b>${esc(x.stage||'—')}</b></td><td><code>${esc(x.code||'')}</code></td><td><span class=\"badge ${tone}\">${esc(action)}</span></td><td>${x.clientInstalled?`v${esc(x.clientVersion||d?.clientVersion||'connected')}`:'Not handshaken'}<div class=\"small\">protocol ${Number(x.protocolVersion||actualProtocol||0)}</div></td><td>${esc(x.detail||'')}<div class=\"small\">status ${esc(x.status||d?.status||'—')}</div></td></tr>`;}).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No player-specific connection diagnostics loaded.</td></tr>';\n}\nfunction renderAntiCheatPlayerTimeline(d){\n  if(!$('acPlayerTimeline'))return 0;\n  const uid=String(d?.playerUid||''),name=String(d?.playerName||'');\n  const events=[];\n  const playerDiagnostics=Array.isArray(d?.recentConnectionDiagnostics)&&d.recentConnectionDiagnostics.length?d.recentConnectionDiagnostics:(antiCheatSnapshot?.recentConnectionDiagnostics||[]).filter(x=>(uid&&String(x.playerUid||'')===uid)||(!uid&&name&&String(x.playerName||'')===name));\n  playerDiagnostics.forEach(x=>events.push({utc:x.utc,title:`${x.stage||'Connection'} · ${x.code||x.action||'event'}`,detail:x.detail||'',meta:`${x.action||'Observe'} · client ${x.clientInstalled?(x.clientVersion||'connected'):'not handshaken'} · protocol ${Number(x.protocolVersion||0)}`,action:x.action,code:x.code,tone:acTimelineTone(x.action,x.code)}));\n  (d?.findings||[]).forEach(x=>events.push({utc:x.observedUtc,title:x.summary||x.code||'Finding',detail:x.subject||x.why||'',meta:`${x.code||''} · ${x.confidence||'Low'} ${Number(x.confidenceScore||0)}/100 · ${Number(x.riskPoints||0)} risk`,severity:x.severity,code:x.code,badge:x.serverAuthoritative?'Server evidence':(x.evidenceDomain||'Finding'),badgeTone:x.serverAuthoritative?'':'moderate'}));\n  (d?.collectedEvidence||[]).forEach(x=>events.push({utc:x.collectedUtc,title:`Evidence captured · ${x.modId||'mod'}`,detail:x.originalFileName||x.fileName||'',meta:`${formatBytesTotal(Number(x.bytes||0))} · ${String(x.sha256||'').slice(0,12)}…`,action:'Captured',code:'EVIDENCE_CAPTURED',tone:'good'}));\n  if(Number(d?.startupGateStartedUtc||0)>0)events.push({utc:d.startupGateStartedUtc,title:'Startup integrity gate started',detail:'Client startup attestation began.',action:'Startup',tone:'accent'});\n  if(Number(d?.startupGateCompletedUtc||0)>0)events.push({utc:d.startupGateCompletedUtc,title:`Startup integrity ${d.startupGateVerdict||'completed'}`,detail:'Startup gate completed and the verdict was recorded.',action:d.startupGateVerdict==='Suspicious'?'Suspicious':'Complete',tone:d.startupGateVerdict==='Clean'?'good':d.startupGateVerdict==='Suspicious'?'bad':'warn'});\n  if(Number(d?.lastScanUtc||0)>0)events.push({utc:d.lastScanUtc,title:'Latest integrity scan accepted',detail:`${Number(d.modCount||0)} mods · ${Number(d.assemblyCount||0)} assemblies · ${Number(d.findingCount||0)} findings`,action:'Accepted',tone:String(d.status||'').toLowerCase()==='clean'?'good':'accent'});\n  if(Number(d?.lastConsequenceUtc||0)>0&&d?.lastConsequence)events.push({utc:d.lastConsequenceUtc,title:`Consequence · ${d.lastConsequence}`,detail:'Recorded Anti-Cheat consequence for this session.',action:d.lastConsequence,code:'CONSEQUENCE'});\n  $('acPlayerTimeline').innerHTML=acTimelineHtml(events,36);\n  if($('acPlayerTimelineState'))$('acPlayerTimelineState').textContent=`${events.length} event${events.length===1?'':'s'} · newest first`;\n  return events.length;\n}\nfunction acRenderEvidenceDiff(x){\n  const status=String(x?.officialDiffStatus||'NotAnalyzed');\n  if(status==='NotAnalyzed')return '<span class=\"muted\">Not compared</span>';\n  const modified=Array.isArray(x.officialDiffModifiedPaths)?x.officialDiffModifiedPaths:[];\n  const added=Array.isArray(x.officialDiffAddedPaths)?x.officialDiffAddedPaths:[];\n  const removed=Array.isArray(x.officialDiffRemovedPaths)?x.officialDiffRemovedPaths:[];\n  const groups=[['modified',modified],['added',added],['removed',removed]];\n  const tone=status==='OfficialMatch'?'low':status==='Differences'?'high':'moderate';\n  const paths=groups.flatMap(([kind,arr])=>arr.map(path=>({kind,path})));\n  const first=paths.slice(0,8),rest=paths.slice(8);\n  const renderPath=p=>`<div class=\"acDiffPath ${p.kind}\"><span class=\"kind\">${esc(p.kind)}</span><code>${esc(p.path)}</code></div>`;\n  return `<div class=\"acDiffPanel\"><div class=\"acDiffHeader\"><span class=\"badge ${tone}\">${esc(status==='OfficialMatch'?'Official match':status)}</span>${x.officialDiffFileName?`<span class=\"small\">closest official: <b>${esc(x.officialDiffFileName)}</b></span>`:''}</div><div class=\"acDiffStats\"><span class=\"acDiffStat matched\">${Number(x.officialDiffMatchedFiles||0)} matched</span><span class=\"acDiffStat modified\">${Number(x.officialDiffModifiedFiles||0)} modified</span><span class=\"acDiffStat added\">${Number(x.officialDiffAddedFiles||0)} added</span><span class=\"acDiffStat removed\">${Number(x.officialDiffRemovedFiles||0)} removed</span></div><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.officialDiffSummary||'')}${Number(x.officialDiffCandidateCount||0)>1?` · compared ${Number(x.officialDiffCandidateCount)} official candidates`:''}${x.officialDiffManifestComplete===false?' · manifest incomplete':''}</div>${first.length?`<div class=\"acDiffList\">${first.map(renderPath).join('')}</div>`:''}${rest.length?`<details class=\"acDiffMore\"><summary>Show ${rest.length} more changed path${rest.length===1?'':'s'}</summary><div class=\"acDiffList\">${rest.map(renderPath).join('')}</div></details>`:''}</div>`;\n}\nfunction renderAntiCheatConnectionDiagnostics(rows){\n  const list=Array.isArray(rows)?rows:[];\n  if($('acConnectionDiagnosticsState'))$('acConnectionDiagnosticsState').textContent=list.length?`${list.length} recent event${list.length===1?'':'s'}`:'No diagnostics yet.';\n  if($('acConnectionTimeline'))$('acConnectionTimeline').innerHTML=acTimelineHtml(list.map(x=>({utc:x.utc,title:`${x.playerName||'Player'} · ${x.stage||'Connection'} · ${x.code||x.action||'event'}`,detail:x.detail||'',meta:`${x.action||'Observe'} · status ${x.status||'—'} · client ${x.clientInstalled?(x.clientVersion||'connected'):'not handshaken'}`,action:x.action,code:x.code})),24);\n  if(!$('acConnectionDiagnosticsRows'))return;\n  $('acConnectionDiagnosticsRows').innerHTML=list.length?list.slice(0,40).map(x=>{\n    const action=String(x.action||'Observe');\n    const tone=/kick|reject/i.test(action)?'high':/recover|accept/i.test(action)?'low':/retry|extend|window|stale/i.test(action)?'moderate':'';\n    return `<tr><td>${esc(acDate(x.utc))}</td><td><b>${esc(x.playerName||'')}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc((x.playerUid||'').slice(0,12))}${String(x.playerUid||'').length>12?'…':''}</div></td><td>${esc(x.stage||'—')}</td><td><code>${esc(x.code||'')}</code></td><td><span class=\"badge ${tone}\">${esc(action)}</span></td><td>${esc(x.detail||'')}<div class=\"small\">status ${esc(x.status||'—')} · client ${x.clientInstalled?`v${esc(x.clientVersion||'connected')}`:'not handshaken'} · protocol ${Number(x.protocolVersion||0)}</div></td></tr>`;\n  }).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"muted\">No recent client connection diagnostics.</td></tr>';\n}\nfunction renderAntiCheatModDbHealth(h){\n  const x=h||{};\n  const baseTotal=Number(x.serverBaselineTotal||0),baseFresh=Number(x.serverBaselineFresh||0),basePending=Number(x.serverBaselinePending||0),baseResolved=Number(x.serverBaselineResolved||0),baseNotFound=Number(x.serverBaselineNotFound||0),baseUnavailable=Number(x.serverBaselineUnavailable||0),baseOfficial=Number(x.serverBaselineOfficialMatches||0),baseCustom=Number(x.serverBaselineCustomBuilds||0),baseDiagnostic=Number(x.serverBaselineDiagnosticDifferences||0);\n  const baseReady=baseTotal>0&&baseFresh>=baseTotal&&basePending===0&&baseUnavailable===0;\n  if($('acModDbHealthState'))$('acModDbHealthState').textContent=x.enabled?`Verification ON · startup baseline ${baseFresh}/${baseTotal} fresh · ${Number(x.pending||0)} total pending · max ${Number(x.maxConcurrentRequests||0)} concurrent`:'Verification OFF';\n  if($('acModDbHealthGrid'))$('acModDbHealthGrid').innerHTML=metric('Server startup baseline',baseTotal?`${baseFresh}/${baseTotal} fresh`:'No eligible server mods',baseTotal?(baseReady?'good':'warn'):'')+metric('Baseline pending',basePending,basePending?'warn':'good')+metric('Baseline resolved',baseResolved,baseResolved?'good':'')+metric('Baseline not on DB',baseNotFound,baseNotFound?'':'good')+metric('Baseline unavailable',baseUnavailable,baseUnavailable?'warn':'good')+metric('Server = official',baseOfficial,baseOfficial?'good':'')+metric('Custom server builds',baseCustom,baseCustom?'warn':'good')+metric('Server package diagnostics',baseDiagnostic,baseDiagnostic?'warn':'good')+metric('Baseline queued',x.serverBaselineLastQueuedUtc?acRelativeAge(x.serverBaselineLastQueuedUtc).text:'—',x.serverBaselineLastQueuedUtc?'good':'')+metric('Cache entries',Number(x.cacheEntries||0))+metric('Fresh',Number(x.fresh||0),'good')+metric('Stale',Number(x.stale||0),Number(x.stale||0)?'warn':'')+metric('Resolved',Number(x.resolved||0),'good')+metric('Not on DB',Number(x.notFound||0))+metric('Unavailable',Number(x.unavailable||0),Number(x.unavailable||0)?'warn':'good')+metric('Pending',Number(x.pending||0),Number(x.pending||0)?'warn':'')+metric('Last resolved',x.lastResolvedUtc?acRelativeAge(x.lastResolvedUtc).text:'—',x.lastResolvedUtc?'good':'');\n}\nfunction renderAntiCheatPlayers(){\n  const search=String($('acPlayerSearch')?.value||'').trim().toLowerCase();\n  const filter=String($('acPlayerFilter')?.value||'all');\n  let rows=[...(antiCheatPlayers||[])];\n  if(search)rows=rows.filter(x=>[x.playerName,x.playerUid,x.platform,x.clientVersion,x.status,x.startupGateVerdict].some(v=>String(v||'').toLowerCase().includes(search)));\n  rows=rows.filter(x=>{\n    const status=String(x.status||'').toLowerCase();\n    if(filter==='suspicious')return status==='suspicious';\n    if(filter==='review')return status==='review';\n    if(filter==='clean')return status==='clean';\n    if(filter==='pending')return x.startupGatePending||!x.clientInstalled||['awaitingclient','scanning','timeout','missing'].some(v=>status.includes(v));\n    if(filter==='attention')return status!=='clean'||x.startupGatePending||!x.clientInstalled||Number(x.riskScore||0)>0;\n    return true;\n  });\n  const evidenceTuple=x=>{\n    const findings=Array.isArray(x.findings)?x.findings:[];\n    return [Number(x.findingCount||findings.length||0),Number(x.strongFindingCount??findings.filter(f=>Number(f.confidenceScore||0)>=75||Number(f.severity||0)>=3).length),Number(x.serverAuthoritativeFindingCount??findings.filter(f=>f.serverAuthoritative).length)];\n  };\n  const direction=antiCheatPlayerSortDir==='asc'?1:-1;\n  rows.sort((a,b)=>{\n    let cmp=0;\n    if(antiCheatPlayerSortKey==='player')cmp=String(a.playerName||'').localeCompare(String(b.playerName||''));\n    else if(antiCheatPlayerSortKey==='mods')cmp=Number(a.modCount||0)-Number(b.modCount||0);\n    else if(antiCheatPlayerSortKey==='scan')cmp=Number(a.lastScanUtc||0)-Number(b.lastScanUtc||0);\n    else if(antiCheatPlayerSortKey==='evidence'){\n      const av=evidenceTuple(a),bv=evidenceTuple(b);\n      cmp=av[0]-bv[0]||av[1]-bv[1]||av[2]-bv[2];\n    }else cmp=Number(a.riskScore||0)-Number(b.riskScore||0);\n    return cmp*direction||String(a.playerName||'').localeCompare(String(b.playerName||''));\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-sort]').forEach(btn=>{\n    const active=btn.dataset.acSort===antiCheatPlayerSortKey;\n    btn.classList.toggle('active',active);\n    const arrow=btn.querySelector('.acSortArrow');\n    if(arrow)arrow.textContent=active?(antiCheatPlayerSortDir==='asc'?'↑':'↓'):'↕';\n  });\n  if($('acPlayerCount'))$('acPlayerCount').textContent=`${rows.length} of ${antiCheatPlayers.length} player${antiCheatPlayers.length===1?'':'s'} · sorted ${antiCheatPlayerSortKey} ${antiCheatPlayerSortDir==='asc'?'low → high':'high → low'}`;\n  $('acRows').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(x=>{\n    const findings=Array.isArray(x.findings)?x.findings:[];\n    const strong=Number(x.strongFindingCount??findings.filter(f=>Number(f.confidenceScore||0)>=75||Number(f.severity||0)>=3).length);\n    const server=Number(x.serverAuthoritativeFindingCount??findings.filter(f=>f.serverAuthoritative).length);\n    const age=acRelativeAge(x.lastScanUtc);\n    return `<tr><td><button class=\"linkBtn\" data-ac-player=\"${esc(x.playerUid||x.playerName||'')}\"><b>${esc(x.playerName||'')}</b></button><div class=\"small\">${esc((x.playerUid||'').slice(0,12))}${String(x.playerUid||'').length>12?'…':''}</div></td><td>${acStatusBadge(x.status)}</td><td><b class=\"acRisk ${Number(x.riskScore||0)>=50?'bad':Number(x.riskScore||0)>=10?'warn':'good'}\">${Number(x.riskScore||0)}</b></td><td>${acStartupBadge(x)}</td><td>${x.clientInstalled?`v${esc(x.clientVersion||'connected')}`:'<span class=\"warn\">missing</span>'}</td><td>${esc(x.platform||'—')}</td><td>${Number(x.modCount||0)}</td><td><b>${Number(x.findingCount||0)}</b><div class=\"small\">${strong} strong · ${server} server</div></td><td><span class=\"${age.cls}\" title=\"${esc(acDate(x.lastScanUtc))}\">${esc(age.text)}</span></td><td><button data-ac-rescan=\"${esc(x.playerUid||x.playerName||'')}\">Rescan</button></td></tr>`;\n  }).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"10\" class=\"muted\">No players match the current Anti-Cheat filter.</td></tr>';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-player]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>loadAntiCheatPlayer(b.dataset.acPlayer));\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-rescan]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>requestAntiCheatRescan(b.dataset.acRescan));\n}\nfunction acComparisonClass(value,diagnostic=false){\n  const v=String(value||'Unavailable');\n  if(v==='Match')return 'match';\n  if(v==='Mismatch')return diagnostic?'diagnostic':'mismatch';\n  return 'unavailable';\n}\nfunction acRenderLiveModComparison(m,state){\n  const row=(label,value,note,diagnostic=false)=>`<div class=\"acCompareRow ${acComparisonClass(value,diagnostic)}\"><span class=\"acCompareKey\">${esc(label)}</span><span class=\"acCompareValue\">${esc(value||'Unavailable')}</span><span class=\"acCompareNote\">${esc(note||'')}</span></div>`;\n  const serverAvailable=!!m?.serverBaselineAvailable;\n  const serverPackageDiagnostic=String(m?.serverPackageComparison||'')==='Mismatch'&&String(m?.serverContentComparison||'')!=='Mismatch';\n  const serverBlock=serverAvailable?`<div class=\"acCompareGroup\"><div class=\"acCompareGroupHead\"><b>Server baseline</b><span class=\"badge ${String(m?.serverBaselineVerdict||'')==='Match'?'low':String(m?.serverBaselineVerdict||'')==='Mismatch'?'high':String(m?.serverBaselineVerdict||'')==='Diagnostic'?'moderate':''}\">${esc(m?.serverBaselineVerdict||'Unavailable')}</span></div><div class=\"small\">v${esc(m?.serverBaselineVersion||'—')} · ${esc(m?.serverBaselineFileName||'server-loaded copy')}</div><div class=\"acCompareGrid\">${row('Version',m?.serverVersionComparison,'Exact semantic version',false)}${row('Content',m?.serverContentComparison,'Normalized files',false)}${row('Package',m?.serverPackageComparison,serverPackageDiagnostic?'ZIP/repack difference':'Exact archive',serverPackageDiagnostic)}${row('DLL set',m?.serverDllLayoutComparison,'Layout / size diagnostic',true)}${row('Assembly',m?.serverAssemblyComparison,'Exact server DLL SHA-256',false)}</div><div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:5px\">${esc(m?.serverBaselineMessage||'')}</div></div>`:'';\n  const packageDiagnostic=String(m?.packageComparison||'')==='Mismatch'&&String(m?.contentComparison||'')!=='Mismatch';\n  const modDbBlock=`<div class=\"acCompareGroup\"><div class=\"acCompareGroupHead\"><b>Official ModDB</b>${serverAvailable&&m?.serverOfficialComparison?`<span class=\"badge ${String(m.serverOfficialComparison)==='Match'?'low':String(m.serverOfficialComparison)==='Mismatch'?'moderate':''}\">server ${esc(String(m.serverOfficialComparison).toLowerCase())}</span>`:''}</div><div class=\"acCompareGrid\">${row('Content',m?.contentComparison,'Normalized files',false)}${row('Package',m?.packageComparison,packageDiagnostic?'ZIP/repack difference':'Exact archive',packageDiagnostic)}${row('DLL set',m?.dllLayoutComparison,'Layout / size diagnostic',true)}${row('Assembly',m?.assemblyComparison,'Associated DLL hash',false)}</div><div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:5px\">basis ${esc(m?.comparisonBasis||'—')} · official comparison ${m?.comparedAgainstOfficial?'complete':'not available'}</div></div>`;\n  return `<div><span class=\"badge ${esc(state?.tone||'')}\">${esc(state?.label||'')}</span>${serverBlock}${modDbBlock}</div>`;\n}\nfunction acClientModState(mod){\n  // Shared mods trust the exact server-loaded baseline first. Public ModDB is secondary context.\n  if(mod?.loadedOnServer&&mod?.serverBaselineAvailable){\n    const sv=String(mod?.serverBaselineVerdict||'Unavailable');\n    if(sv==='Mismatch')return {key:'modified',label:'Differs from server',tone:'high'};\n    if(sv==='Diagnostic')return {key:'diagnostic',label:'Server diagnostic difference',tone:'moderate'};\n    if(sv==='Match'){\n      if(String(mod?.serverOfficialComparison||'')==='Mismatch')return {key:'official',label:'Server Match · Custom Server Build',tone:'low'};\n      return {key:'official',label:'Server Match',tone:'low'};\n    }\n  }\n  if(mod?.approvedCustomFingerprint)return {key:'approved',label:'Approved custom',tone:'low'};\n  const st=String(mod?.modDbStatus||'NotChecked');\n  const pkg=String(mod?.packageComparison||'Unavailable');\n  const content=String(mod?.contentComparison||'Unavailable');\n  const assembly=String(mod?.assemblyComparison||'Unavailable');\n  // Package/content SHA-256 beats supporting diagnostics. DLL layout never labels a mod\n  // modified by itself. Assembly mismatch is authoritative only when package/content hashes\n  // are unavailable and the server had comparable same-name DLL SHA-256 values.\n  const authoritativeMatch=content==='Match'||pkg==='Match';\n  const authoritativeMismatch=!authoritativeMatch&&(content==='Mismatch'||(content==='Unavailable'&&assembly==='Mismatch'));\n  const diagnosticMismatch=!authoritativeMatch&&!authoritativeMismatch&&(pkg==='Mismatch'||String(mod?.dllLayoutComparison||'')==='Mismatch');\n  const comparable=[pkg,content,assembly,String(mod?.dllLayoutComparison||'')].some(v=>['Match','Mismatch'].includes(v));\n  if(st==='Resolved'&&authoritativeMatch)return {key:'official',label:(content==='Match'||pkg==='Match')?'Official Match':'Official / diagnostic differences',tone:'low'};\n  if(st==='Resolved'&&authoritativeMismatch)return {key:'modified',label:'Modified',tone:'high'};\n  if(st==='Resolved'&&diagnosticMismatch)return {key:'diagnostic',label:'Diagnostic difference',tone:'moderate'};\n  if(st==='Resolved'&&comparable)return {key:'official',label:'Official / diagnostic differences',tone:'low'};\n  if(st==='Resolved')return {key:'official',label:'Official Release Found',tone:''};\n  if(st==='Pending'||st==='Refreshing'||st==='Stale')return {key:'pending',label:st==='Stale'?'Stale / refresh required':st,tone:'moderate'};\n  if(st==='NotFound')return {key:'notfound',label:'Not on ModDB',tone:''};\n  if(st==='Unavailable')return {key:'unavailable',label:'Unavailable',tone:'moderate'};\n  return {key:'unchecked',label:st||'NotChecked',tone:''};\n}\nasync function loadAntiCheatClientMods(force=false){\n  if(antiCheatClientModsRequest)return antiCheatClientModsRequest;\n  if(!force&&Date.now()-antiCheatClientModsLoadedAt<10000){renderAntiCheatClientMods();return;}\n  if($('acClientModsState'))$('acClientModsState').textContent='Loading client mod comparisons…';\n  antiCheatClientModsRequest=(async()=>{\n    try{\n      const players=await api('/api/anticheat/client-mods');\n      antiCheatClientModPlayers=Array.isArray(players)?players:[];\n      antiCheatClientModsLoadedAt=Date.now();\n      renderAntiCheatClientMods();\n    }catch(e){if($('acClientModsState'))$('acClientModsState').textContent=`Could not load client mod comparisons: ${e.message||e}`;}\n    finally{antiCheatClientModsRequest=null;}\n  })();\n  return antiCheatClientModsRequest;\n}\nfunction renderAntiCheatClientMods(){\n  if(!$('acClientModsRows'))return;\n  const search=String($('acClientModsSearch')?.value||'').trim().toLowerCase();\n  const filter=String($('acClientModsFilter')?.value||'all');\n  const shortHash=v=>{const s=String(v||'').trim();return s.length>24?`${s.slice(0,12)}…${s.slice(-8)}`:(s||'—');};\n  const hashLine=(label,value)=>{const s=String(value||'').trim();return `${esc(label)} <code title=\"${esc(s||'Unavailable')}\">${esc(shortHash(s))}</code>`;};\n  const all=[];\n  (antiCheatClientModPlayers||[]).forEach(p=>(p.mods||[]).forEach(m=>all.push({player:p,mod:m,state:acClientModState(m)})));\n  const unique=new Set(all.map(x=>`${String(x.mod.modId||'').toLowerCase()}@${String(x.mod.version||'').toLowerCase()}`));\n  const modified=all.filter(x=>x.state.key==='modified').length;\n  const diagnostic=all.filter(x=>x.state.key==='diagnostic').length;\n  const approvedCustom=all.filter(x=>x.state.key==='approved').length;\n  const pending=all.filter(x=>x.state.key==='pending').length;\n  const unavailable=all.filter(x=>x.state.key==='unavailable'||!x.player.packageMetricsSupported).length;\n  const official=all.filter(x=>x.state.key==='official').length;\n  const clusters=new Map(),releaseFingerprints=new Map();\n  all.forEach(x=>{\n    const modId=String(x.mod.modId||'').toLowerCase(),version=String(x.mod.version||'').toLowerCase();\n    const releaseKey=`${modId}@${version}`;\n    const fingerprint=String(x.mod.contentSha256||x.mod.sha256||'').toLowerCase()||'unavailable';\n    const key=`${releaseKey}|${fingerprint}`;\n    if(!clusters.has(key))clusters.set(key,{modId:x.mod.modId||'',version:x.mod.version||'',fingerprint,rows:[],states:[]});\n    const c=clusters.get(key);c.rows.push(x);c.states.push(x.state);\n    if(!releaseFingerprints.has(releaseKey))releaseFingerprints.set(releaseKey,new Set());\n    releaseFingerprints.get(releaseKey).add(fingerprint);\n  });\n  const multiVariantReleases=[...releaseFingerprints.values()].filter(x=>x.size>1).length;\n  if($('acClientModsSummary'))$('acClientModsSummary').innerHTML=metric('Reported rows',all.length)+metric('Unique releases',unique.size)+metric('Fingerprint groups',clusters.size)+metric('Multi-variant releases',multiVariantReleases,multiVariantReleases?'warn':'good')+metric('Verified / server match',official,official?'good':'')+metric('Modified',modified,modified?'bad':'good')+metric('Diagnostic',diagnostic,diagnostic?'warn':'good')+metric('Approved custom',approvedCustom,approvedCustom?'good':'')+metric('Pending',pending,pending?'warn':'')+metric('Unavailable / legacy',unavailable,unavailable?'warn':'');\n  if($('acClientModsState'))$('acClientModsState').textContent=`${all.length} player-mod rows · ${unique.size} unique ModID/version releases · ModDB ${antiCheatClientModDbVerificationEnabled?'verification ON':'verification OFF'} · strict ${antiCheatStrictClientModDbEnforcementEnabled?'KICK ON':(antiCheatModDbAutomaticConsequencesEnabled?'off · automatic consequences enabled':'off · advisory only')}`;\n  const customApprovals=Array.isArray(antiCheatSnapshot?.approvedClientModFingerprints)?antiCheatSnapshot.approvedClientModFingerprints:[];\n  if($('acApprovedCustomState'))$('acApprovedCustomState').textContent=`${customApprovals.length} exact custom fingerprint${customApprovals.length===1?'':'s'} approved`;\n  if($('acApprovedCustomRows'))$('acApprovedCustomRows').innerHTML=customApprovals.length?customApprovals.map(x=>`<tr><td><b>${esc(x.modId||'')}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.version||'—')}</div></td><td><b>${esc(x.label||'Custom approval')}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(x.notes||'No notes')}</div></td><td><code title=\"${esc(x.contentSha256||'')}\">${esc(shortHash(x.contentSha256||''))}</code><div class=\"small\">package ${esc(shortHash(x.packageSha256||''))}</div></td><td>${esc(x.approvedBy||'admin')}<div class=\"small\">${x.updatedUtc?esc(acDate(x.updatedUtc)):'—'}</div></td><td>${currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly'?'<span class=\"muted\">Read only</span>':`<button class=\"danger\" data-ac-custom-remove=\"${esc(x.id||'')}\">Remove</button>`}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"muted\">No custom fingerprints approved.</td></tr>';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-custom-remove]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>removeAntiCheatCustomFingerprint(b.dataset.acCustomRemove));\n  if($('acClientModClusterState'))$('acClientModClusterState').textContent=`${clusters.size} fingerprint group${clusters.size===1?'':'s'} · ${multiVariantReleases} release${multiVariantReleases===1?'':'s'} with multiple client fingerprints`;\n  if($('acClientModClusterBoard')){\n    const rank={modified:0,diagnostic:1,pending:2,unavailable:3,unchecked:4,notfound:5,approved:6,official:7};\n    const releases=new Map();\n    [...clusters.values()].forEach(c=>{\n      c.state=[...c.states].sort((a,b)=>(rank[a.key]??9)-(rank[b.key]??9))[0]||{key:'unchecked',label:'Not checked',tone:''};\n      c.players=[...new Set(c.rows.map(x=>String(x.player.playerName||'')))].sort((a,b)=>a.localeCompare(b));\n      const releaseKey=`${String(c.modId||'').toLowerCase()}@${String(c.version||'').toLowerCase()}`;\n      if(!releases.has(releaseKey))releases.set(releaseKey,{modId:c.modId,version:c.version,clusters:[]});\n      releases.get(releaseKey).clusters.push(c);\n    });\n    const releaseRows=[...releases.values()].map(r=>{r.total=r.clusters.reduce((n,c)=>n+c.players.length,0);r.clusters.sort((a,b)=>(rank[a.state.key]??9)-(rank[b.state.key]??9)||b.players.length-a.players.length);r.worst=r.clusters[0]?.state||{key:'unchecked'};r.dominant=Math.max(...r.clusters.map(c=>c.players.length),0);return r;}).sort((a,b)=>(b.clusters.length>1)-(a.clusters.length>1)||(rank[a.worst.key]??9)-(rank[b.worst.key]??9)||String(a.modId).localeCompare(String(b.modId)));\n    $('acClientModClusterBoard').innerHTML=releaseRows.length?releaseRows.slice(0,60).map(r=>`<div class=\"acClusterCard ${r.clusters.length>1?'multi':''}\"><div class=\"acClusterHead\"><div class=\"grow\"><div class=\"modName\">${esc(r.modId||'')}</div><div class=\"small\">${esc(r.version||'—')} · ${r.total} player${r.total===1?'':'s'}</div></div><span class=\"badge ${r.clusters.length>1?'medium':'low'}\">${r.clusters.length} fingerprint${r.clusters.length===1?'':'s'}</span></div><div class=\"acClusterVariants\">${r.clusters.map(c=>{const pct=r.total?Math.max(4,Math.round(c.players.length/r.total*100)):0;const outlier=r.clusters.length>1&&c.players.length===1;const dominant=r.clusters.length>1&&c.players.length===r.dominant&&!outlier;const fp=c.fingerprint==='unavailable'?'unavailable':shortHash(c.fingerprint);return `<div class=\"acClusterVariant\"><div class=\"acClusterVariantHead\"><span class=\"badge ${esc(c.state.tone||'')}\">${esc(c.state.label||'')}</span><b>${c.players.length}</b><span class=\"small\">player${c.players.length===1?'':'s'}</span>${outlier?'<span class=\"acClusterFlag outlier\">Outlier</span>':dominant?'<span class=\"acClusterFlag dominant\">Dominant</span>':''}</div><div class=\"fingerprint\"><code title=\"${esc(c.fingerprint)}\">${esc(fp)}</code></div><div class=\"acClusterBar\"><span style=\"width:${pct}%\"></span></div><div class=\"acClusterPlayers\">${c.players.slice(0,12).map(name=>`<button class=\"acClusterPlayer\" data-ac-cluster-player=\"${esc(name)}\">${esc(name)}</button>`).join('')}${c.players.length>12?`<span class=\"small\">+${c.players.length-12} more</span>`:''}</div></div>`;}).join('')}</div></div>`).join(''):'<div class=\"muted\" style=\"padding:10px\">No fingerprint clusters loaded.</div>';\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-cluster-player]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>loadAntiCheatPlayer(b.dataset.acClusterPlayer));\n  }\n  let rows=all.filter(x=>{\n    if(filter!=='all'&&x.state.key!==filter&&!(filter==='unavailable'&&!x.player.packageMetricsSupported))return false;\n    if(!search)return true;\n    const hay=[x.player.playerName,x.player.playerUid,x.mod.modId,x.mod.version,x.mod.fileName,x.mod.modDbMessage,x.mod.comparisonBasis].join(' ').toLowerCase();\n    return hay.includes(search);\n  });\n  const order={modified:0,diagnostic:1,pending:2,unavailable:3,unchecked:4,notfound:5,approved:6,official:7};\n  rows.sort((a,b)=>(order[a.state.key]??9)-(order[b.state.key]??9)||String(a.mod.modId||'').localeCompare(String(b.mod.modId||''))||String(a.player.playerName||'').localeCompare(String(b.player.playerName||'')));\n  $('acClientModsRows').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(({player:p,mod:m,state})=>{\n    const clientMetrics=Number(m.packageBytes||0)>0||Number(m.dllCount||0)>0||Number(m.dllBytes||0)>0;\n    const client=`${esc(m.fileName||'—')}<div class=\"small\">${clientMetrics?`${Number(m.packageBytes||0)>0?formatBytesTotal(Number(m.packageBytes||0)):'size unavailable'} · ${Number(m.dllCount||0)} DLL${Number(m.dllCount||0)===1?'':'s'} · ${Number(m.dllBytes||0)>0?formatBytesTotal(Number(m.dllBytes||0)):'DLL bytes unavailable'}`:'Package metrics unavailable'}${p.packageMetricsSupported?'':' · <span class=\"warn\">legacy client telemetry</span>'}</div><div class=\"small\">${hashLine('package SHA',m.sha256)} · ${hashLine('content SHA',m.contentSha256)}</div>`;\n    const candidateCount=Number(m.officialCandidateCount||0);\n    const official=m.officialFileName?`${esc(m.officialFileName)}<div class=\"small\">${Number(m.officialPackageBytes||0)>0?formatBytesTotal(Number(m.officialPackageBytes||0)):'size unavailable'} · ${Number(m.officialDllCount||0)} DLL${Number(m.officialDllCount||0)===1?'':'s'} · ${Number(m.officialDllBytes||0)>0?formatBytesTotal(Number(m.officialDllBytes||0)):'DLL bytes unavailable'}</div><div class=\"small\">Resolved ${candidateCount||1} official upload${(candidateCount||1)===1?'':'s'} for exact ${esc(m.modId||'')} ${esc(m.version||'')}</div><div class=\"small\">${hashLine('package SHA',m.officialPackageSha256)} · ${hashLine('content SHA',m.officialContentSha256)}</div>`:'<span class=\"muted\">No official package loaded</span>';\n    const canApproveCustom=!m.loadedOnServer&&!m.approvedCustomFingerprint&&String(m.contentSha256||'').length===64&&state.key!=='official';\n    const customInfo=m.approvedCustomFingerprint?`<div class=\"small good\"><b>${esc(m.approvedCustomLabel||'Approved custom fingerprint')}</b>${m.approvedCustomNotes?` · ${esc(m.approvedCustomNotes)}`:''}</div>`:'';\n    const approveBtn=canApproveCustom&&currentSessionRole!=='ReadOnly'?`<div style=\"margin-top:6px\"><button data-ac-custom-approve=\"1\" data-modid=\"${esc(m.modId||'')}\" data-version=\"${esc(m.version||'')}\" data-content=\"${esc(m.contentSha256||'')}\" data-package=\"${esc(m.sha256||'')}\">Approve exact fingerprint</button></div>`:'';\n    const compare=`${acRenderLiveModComparison(m,state)}${customInfo}${approveBtn}`;\n    const checked=m.modDbCheckedUtc?`<span title=\"${esc(acDate(m.modDbCheckedUtc))}\">${esc(acRelativeAge(m.modDbCheckedUtc).text)}</span><div class=\"small\">${esc(m.modDbMessage||'')}</div>`:`<span class=\"muted\">${esc(m.modDbMessage||'Not checked')}</span>`;\n    return `<tr><td><button class=\"linkBtn\" data-ac-clientmod-player=\"${esc(p.playerUid||p.playerName||'')}\"><b>${esc(p.playerName||'')}</b></button><div class=\"small\">Client Integrity ${esc((p.clientVersion||'missing'))}</div></td><td><b>${esc(m.modId||'')}</b><div class=\"small\">${esc(m.version||'—')} · ${esc(m.modType||'')}</div></td><td>${m.loadedOnServer?'<span class=\"badge low\">Shared</span>':'<span class=\"badge\">Client-only</span>'}</td><td>${client}</td><td>${official}</td><td>${compare}</td><td>${checked}</td></tr>`;\n  }).join(''):'<tr><td colspan=\"7\" class=\"muted\">No client mods match the current filter.</td></tr>';\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-clientmod-player]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{setAntiCheatTab('players');loadAntiCheatPlayer(b.dataset.acClientmodPlayer);});\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-ac-custom-approve]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>approveAntiCheatCustomFingerprint(b));\n  if($('acClientModsResolveAll'))$('acClientModsResolveAll').disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly';\n  ['acApprovalZip','acApprovalLabel','acApprovalNotes','acApprovalUploadButton'].forEach(id=>{const e=$(id);if(e)e.disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly'||antiCheatApprovalUploadActive;});\n}\nasync function approveAntiCheatCustomFingerprint(btn){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly')return;\n  const modId=String(btn?.dataset?.modid||'').trim(),version=String(btn?.dataset?.version||'').trim(),contentSha256=String(btn?.dataset?.content||'').trim(),packageSha256=String(btn?.dataset?.package||'').trim();\n  if(!modId||!version||contentSha256.length!==64){toast('A ModID, exact version and normalized content SHA-256 are required.','error');return;}\n  if(!confirm(`Approve only this exact normalized fingerprint for ${modId} ${version}?\\n\\nThis suppresses official ModDB mismatch findings for this exact content hash only.`))return;\n  const label=prompt('Approval label:',`${modId} ${version} custom`)||`${modId} ${version} custom`;\n  const notes=prompt('Optional notes (why this custom build is allowed):','')||'';\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/anticheat/moddb/approval',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:'approve',modId,version,contentSha256,packageSha256,label,notes})});\n    toast(d.message||'Custom fingerprint approved.','success');\n    await loadAntiCheat(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\nasync function removeAntiCheatCustomFingerprint(id){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly'||!id)return;\n  if(!confirm('Remove this exact custom fingerprint approval?'))return;\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/anticheat/moddb/approval',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:'remove',id})});\n    toast(d.message||'Custom fingerprint removed.','success');\n    await loadAntiCheat(false);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n}\nlet antiCheatApprovalUploadActive=false;\nfunction antiCheatUploadBase64(arrayBuffer){\n  const bytes=new Uint8Array(arrayBuffer);let binary='';\n  for(let i=0;i<bytes.length;i+=0x8000)binary+=String.fromCharCode(...bytes.subarray(i,Math.min(bytes.length,i+0x8000)));\n  return btoa(binary);\n}\nfunction setAntiCheatApprovalUploadUi(text,pct=0,detail=''){\n  if($('acApprovalUploadState'))$('acApprovalUploadState').textContent=text;\n  if($('acApprovalUploadBar'))$('acApprovalUploadBar').style.width=`${Math.max(0,Math.min(100,pct))}%`;\n  if(detail&&$('acApprovalUploadDetail'))$('acApprovalUploadDetail').textContent=detail;\n}\nasync function uploadAntiCheatApprovalZip(){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly'){toast('Read-only sessions cannot approve mod fingerprints.','error');return;}\n  if(antiCheatApprovalUploadActive)return;\n  const input=$('acApprovalZip'),file=input?.files?.[0];\n  if(!file){toast('Choose a Vintage Story mod ZIP first.','error');return;}\n  if(!/\\.zip$/i.test(file.name)){toast('Only .zip mod packages are accepted.','error');return;}\n  if(file.size<=0||file.size>96*1024*1024){toast('The mod ZIP must be 96 MB or smaller.','error');return;}\n  const button=$('acApprovalUploadButton');\n  antiCheatApprovalUploadActive=true;if(button)button.disabled=true;\n  let uploadId='';\n  try{\n    setAntiCheatApprovalUploadUi('Starting…',0,`${file.name} · ${formatBytesTotal(file.size)}`);\n    const start=await api('/api/anticheat/moddb/approval/upload',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:'start',fileName:file.name,sizeBytes:file.size,label:String($('acApprovalLabel')?.value||''),notes:String($('acApprovalNotes')?.value||'')})});\n    uploadId=String(start.uploadId||'');\n    const chunkSize=Math.min(72*1024,Math.max(16*1024,Number(start.maxChunkBytes||72*1024)));\n    let offset=0;\n    while(offset<file.size){\n      const end=Math.min(file.size,offset+chunkSize);\n      const dataBase64=antiCheatUploadBase64(await file.slice(offset,end).arrayBuffer());\n      const part=await api('/api/anticheat/moddb/approval/upload',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:'chunk',uploadId,offset,dataBase64})});\n      offset=Number(part.receivedBytes||end);\n      const pct=file.size?offset/file.size*100:0;\n      setAntiCheatApprovalUploadUi(`Uploading ${Math.round(pct)}%`,pct,`${formatBytesTotal(offset)} / ${formatBytesTotal(file.size)} · ${file.name}`);\n    }\n    setAntiCheatApprovalUploadUi('Hashing & validating…',100,'Reading root modinfo.json and calculating exact package/content SHA-256.');\n    const done=await api('/api/anticheat/moddb/approval/upload',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:'commit',uploadId})});\n    uploadId='';\n    setAntiCheatApprovalUploadUi('Approved',100,`${done.modId||'Mod'} ${done.version||''} · content ${shortHash(done.contentSha256||'')} · package ${shortHash(done.packageSha256||'')}`);\n    if(input)input.value='';\n    toast(done.message||'Exact mod fingerprint approved.','success');\n    await loadAntiCheat(false);\n  }catch(e){\n    if(uploadId){try{await api('/api/anticheat/moddb/approval/upload',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({action:'cancel',uploadId})});}catch{}}\n    setAntiCheatApprovalUploadUi('Upload failed',0,e.message||'Fingerprint approval failed.');\n    toast(e.message,'error');\n  }finally{\n    antiCheatApprovalUploadActive=false;\n    if(button)button.disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly';\n  }\n}\n\nasync function resolveAllAntiCheatModDbFingerprints(){\n  if(currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly')return;\n  const btn=$('acClientModsResolveAll');\n  const forceRefresh=!!$('acClientModsForceRefresh')?.checked;\n  if(btn){btn.disabled=true;btn.textContent=forceRefresh?'Refreshing fingerprints…':'Resolving fingerprints…';}\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/anticheat/moddb/resolve-all',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({forceRefresh})});\n    toast(d.message||'ModDB fingerprint resolution queued.','success');\n    if($('acClientModsState'))$('acClientModsState').textContent=`Queued ${Number(d.queued||0)} · fresh ${Number(d.freshCached||0)} · pending ${Number(d.alreadyPending||0)} · unique ${Number(d.uniqueTargets||0)}`;\n    setTimeout(()=>loadAntiCheat(false),700);\n  }catch(e){toast(e.message,'error');}\n  finally{if(btn){btn.disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly';btn.textContent='Resolve All DB Fingerprints';}}\n}\n\nasync function loadAntiCheat(showLoading=true){\n  if(showLoading)$('acState').textContent='Loading…';\n  try{\n    const d=await api('/api/anticheat');\n    const serverCompanionInstalled=!!d.serverCompanionInstalled;\n    const serverCompanionVersionMatches=!!d.serverCompanionVersionMatches;\n    const serverCompanionVersion=String(d.serverCompanionVersion||'');\n    const serverCompanionModId=String(d.serverCompanionModId||'newfiesanticheatclient');\n    const expectedClientVersion=String(d.expectedClientVersion||'');\n    antiCheatModDbAutomaticConsequencesEnabled=!!d.modDbAutomaticConsequencesEnabled;\n    antiCheatClientModDbVerificationEnabled=!!d.clientModDbVerificationEnabled;\n    antiCheatStrictClientModDbEnforcementEnabled=!!d.strictClientModDbEnforcementEnabled;\n    const serverCompanionHealthy=serverCompanionInstalled&&serverCompanionVersionMatches;\n    $('acState').textContent=!d.enabled?'Anti-Cheat enforcement disabled':(!d.available?`${String(d.availabilityReason||'Anti-Cheat runtime unavailable')} · PacketGuard configured ${d.packetGuard?.enabled?'ON':'OFF'}`:`Protocol ${Number(d.protocolVersion||0)} · companion marker ${serverCompanionHealthy?'OK':(serverCompanionInstalled?'UPDATE':'not installed')} · PacketGuard ${d.packetGuard?.enabled?'ON':'OFF'} · Ore Shield ${d.oreShield?.active?'ACTIVE':(d.oreShield?.enabled?'UNAVAILABLE':'OFF')} · rescan every ${Number(d.rescanMinutes||0)} min · dropped packets ${Number(d.networkPacketsDropped||0)}`);\n    if($('acModuleEnabled'))$('acModuleEnabled').checked=!!d.enabled;\n    if($('acModuleEnabled'))$('acModuleEnabled').disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly';\n    if($('acModuleSave'))$('acModuleSave').disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly';\n    if($('acModuleState'))$('acModuleState').innerHTML=d.enabled?(d.available?'<span class=\"good\"><b>ENABLED</b></span>':'<span class=\"bad\"><b>ENABLED / UNAVAILABLE</b></span>'):'<span class=\"muted\"><b>DISABLED</b></span>';\n    if($('acRequireClient'))$('acRequireClient').checked=!!d.requireClient;\n    if($('acStartupGateEnabled'))$('acStartupGateEnabled').checked=!!d.startupIntegrityGateEnabled;\n    if($('acStartupGateBlockInteractions'))$('acStartupGateBlockInteractions').checked=!!d.startupIntegrityGateBlockWorldInteractions;\n    if($('acStartupGateRequireClean'))$('acStartupGateRequireClean').checked=!!d.startupIntegrityGateRequireClean;\n    if($('acStartupGateDisconnectFailure'))$('acStartupGateDisconnectFailure').checked=!!d.startupIntegrityGateDisconnectOnFailure;\n    if($('acStartupGateNoticeCooldown')&&!$('acStartupGateNoticeCooldown').matches(':focus'))$('acStartupGateNoticeCooldown').value=String(Number(d.startupIntegrityGateNoticeCooldownSeconds||4));\n    if($('acClientModDbVerification'))$('acClientModDbVerification').checked=!!d.clientModDbVerificationEnabled;\n    if($('acStrictClientModDbEnforcement'))$('acStrictClientModDbEnforcement').checked=!!d.strictClientModDbEnforcementEnabled;\n    if($('acRequireHardenedCapabilities'))$('acRequireHardenedCapabilities').checked=!!d.requireHardenedClientCapabilities;\n    if($('acRequireCurrentClientRelease'))$('acRequireCurrentClientRelease').checked=!!d.requireCurrentClientRelease;\n    if($('acClientHelloGrace')&&!$('acClientHelloGrace').matches(':focus'))$('acClientHelloGrace').value=String(Number(d.clientHelloGraceSeconds||90));\n    if($('acClientHelloDisconnectDelay')&&!$('acClientHelloDisconnectDelay').matches(':focus'))$('acClientHelloDisconnectDelay').value=String(Number(d.clientHelloDisconnectDelaySeconds||60));\n    if($('acHeartbeatTimeout')&&!$('acHeartbeatTimeout').matches(':focus'))$('acHeartbeatTimeout').value=String(Number(d.heartbeatTimeoutSeconds||180));\n    if($('acRoutineChallengeTimeout')&&!$('acRoutineChallengeTimeout').matches(':focus'))$('acRoutineChallengeTimeout').value=String(Number(d.challengeTimeoutSeconds||30));\n    if($('acStartupChallengeTimeout')&&!$('acStartupChallengeTimeout').matches(':focus'))$('acStartupChallengeTimeout').value=String(Number(d.startupChallengeTimeoutSeconds||300));\n    if($('acStartupHeartbeatExtension')&&!$('acStartupHeartbeatExtension').matches(':focus'))$('acStartupHeartbeatExtension').value=String(Number(d.startupChallengeHeartbeatExtensionSeconds||120));\n    if($('acStartupHardLimit')&&!$('acStartupHardLimit').matches(':focus'))$('acStartupHardLimit').value=String(Number(d.startupChallengeHardLimitSeconds||900));\n    if($('acRescanMinutes')&&!$('acRescanMinutes').matches(':focus'))$('acRescanMinutes').value=String(Number(d.rescanMinutes||15));\n    if($('acRuntimeRescanOnChange'))$('acRuntimeRescanOnChange').checked=!!d.runtimeRescanOnChange;\n    if($('acRuntimeChangeCooldown')&&!$('acRuntimeChangeCooldown').matches(':focus'))$('acRuntimeChangeCooldown').value=String(Number(d.runtimeChangeRescanCooldownSeconds||30));\n    if($('acClientSettingsState'))$('acClientSettingsState').innerHTML=`Startup gate <b>${d.startupIntegrityGateEnabled?'ON':'OFF'}</b> · interaction quarantine <b>${d.startupIntegrityGateBlockWorldInteractions?'ON':'OFF'}</b> · ModDB <b>${d.clientModDbVerificationEnabled?'ON':'OFF'}</b> · strict DB <b>${d.strictClientModDbEnforcementEnabled?'KICK':'OFF'}</b> · server client v${esc(expectedClientVersion||'unknown')} <b>${d.requireCurrentClientRelease?'MATCH REQUIRED':'advisory'}</b> · hardened <b>${d.requireHardenedClientCapabilities?'REQUIRED':'compatible'}</b> · startup ${Number(d.startupChallengeTimeoutSeconds||0)}s → hard ${Number(d.startupChallengeHardLimitSeconds||0)}s · hello ${Number(d.clientHelloGraceSeconds||0)}s + ${Number(d.clientHelloDisconnectDelaySeconds||0)}s`;\n    if($('acServerVersionRequirementNote'))$('acServerVersionRequirementNote').innerHTML=`<b>Dynamic version match:</b> server companion detected as <b>v${esc(expectedClientVersion||'unknown')}</b>. When enabled, clients must report that same semantic version. Upgrading the server companion automatically changes this requirement; protocol and hardened-capability checks remain separate.`;\n    ['acRequireClient','acClientModDbVerification','acStrictClientModDbEnforcement','acRequireCurrentClientRelease','acRequireHardenedCapabilities','acStartupGateEnabled','acStartupGateBlockInteractions','acStartupGateRequireClean','acStartupGateDisconnectFailure','acStartupGateNoticeCooldown','acClientHelloGrace','acClientHelloDisconnectDelay','acHeartbeatTimeout','acRoutineChallengeTimeout','acStartupChallengeTimeout','acStartupHeartbeatExtension','acStartupHardLimit','acRescanMinutes','acRuntimeRescanOnChange','acRuntimeChangeCooldown','acClientSettingsSave'].forEach(id=>{if($(id))$(id).disabled=currentSessionRole==='ReadOnly';});\n    const forbidden=(d.forbiddenModIds||[]).map(x=>String(x||'').toLowerCase()).filter(Boolean);\n    const required=(d.requiredClientModIds||[]).map(x=>String(x||'').toLowerCase()).filter(Boolean);\n    const approved=(d.approvedClientBuildHashes||[]).map(x=>String(x||'').toLowerCase()).filter(Boolean);\n    antiCheatAppro