en chunks are only sent once.<br><b>Chunk workload:</b> ${chunkHookCalls.toLocaleString()} raw hook call(s), ${chunkUnique.toLocaleString()} unique packet(s), ${chunkEligible.toLocaleString()} mask-eligible packet(s), ${masked.toLocaleString()} masked, ${failClosedPackets.toLocaleString()} fail-closed packet(s), ${pass.toLocaleString()} pass-through, ${inspected.toLocaleString()} inspected.<br><b>LOS workload:</b> ${losPasses.toLocaleString()} pass(es), ${losPlayers.toLocaleString()} player check(s), ${losCandidates.toLocaleString()} exposed candidate(s), ${losChecks.toLocaleString()} ray test(s), ${losDiscoveries.toLocaleString()} discovery/ies. Scan budget: up to ${Number(os.maxLosChecksPerPass||96)} ray checks per player, with an adaptive global cap of about ${(Number(os.maxLosChecksPerPass||96)*4).toLocaleString()} checks per scan cycle, every ${Number(os.visibilityScanIntervalMs||250)} ms within ${Number(os.discoveryRangeBlocks||96)} blocks, ${Number(os.viewConeDegrees||140)}° view cone, idle safety rescan ${Number(os.idleRescanMs||3000)} ms. ${losSkips.toLocaleString()} stationary/no-turn passes skipped. Exposed index currently holds ${exposedIndexed.toLocaleString()} candidate(s).<br><b>Client sync:</b> protocol v${syncProtocol||'?'}${syncCapability?` · ${esc(syncCapability)}`:''}${syncBuild?` · ${esc(syncBuild)}`:''}. ${syncReady.toLocaleString()} ready client(s), ${syncHellos.toLocaleString()} hello(s), ${syncRejected.toLocaleString()} rejected hello(s), ${syncBatches.toLocaleString()} batch(es) / ${syncEntries.toLocaleString()} block state(s), ${syncPending.toLocaleString()} pending batch(es), ${syncAcks.toLocaleString()} final ACK(s), ${syncDeferred.toLocaleString()} deferred ACK(s), ${syncApplied.toLocaleString()} applied state(s), ${syncSkipped.toLocaleString()} unloaded/harmless skip(s), ${syncFailed.toLocaleString()} failed apply(s) across ${syncFailureBatches.toLocaleString()} batch(es), ${syncFailureResyncs.toLocaleString()} failure re-sync(s), ${sy