cks, no violations`:'not exercised yet'))}.<br><b>Compatibility:</b> ${hookDead?'<span class=\"bad\">recipient chunk masking hook has not executed</span>; ':hookIneligible?'<span class=\"bad\">chunk hook is running but no packets are mask-eligible</span>; ':maskingIneffective?'<span class=\"bad\">mask-eligible packets are flowing but no protected ore has been concealed</span>; ':''}${hookErrors?`${hookErrors.toLocaleString()} hook error(s)`:'no hook errors'}; ${unsupported?`${unsupported.toLocaleString()} unsupported codec packet(s)`:'no unsupported codec packets'}.<br><b>Reveal dispatch:</b> ${dispatchAttempts.toLocaleString()} requested cell(s), ${recipientMisses.toLocaleString()} player-resolution miss(es), ${staleKeySkips.toLocaleString()} stale/non-ore skip(s), ${syncUnsupported.toLocaleString()} unsupported client-sync skip(s), ${syncRejected.toLocaleString()} incompatible hello(s), ${syncPending.toLocaleString()} pending batch(es), ${syncSkipped.toLocaleString()} unloaded/harmless skip(s), ${syncFailed.toLocaleString()} client apply failure(s), ${syncFailureResyncs.toLocaleString()} failure re-sync(s), ${syncTimeouts.toLocaleString()} sync timeout(s), ${syncRetries.toLocaleString()} total sync retry/ies.<br><b>Exposure events:</b> ${exposureSync.toLocaleString()} scan-triggered sync(s), ${exposureEvaluated.toLocaleString()} protected ore cell(s) evaluated, ${exposureCorrections.toLocaleString()} authorized state update(s) dispatched.<br><b>Mining discovery:</b> ${miningPulses.toLocaleString()} post-break observation(s), ${veinDiscoveries.toLocaleString()} new vein discovery event(s), ${veinBlocks.toLocaleString()} vein block(s) revealed.<br><b>Targeted cache invalidations:</b> ${revisions.toLocaleString()} ore-relevant block/boundary change${revisions===1?'':'s'} observed.`;\n  if($('acOreShieldCoverage'))$('acOreShieldCoverage').innerHTML=`Ore Shield resolved <b>${protectedOres}</b> safe ore variant${protectedOres===1?'':'s'} across <b>${hosts}</b> host-rock variant${hosts===1?'':'s'}, skipped <b>${skipped}</b> unsafe or ambiguous candidate${skipped===1?'':'s'}, and has concealed <b>${hidden.toLocaleString()}</b> authoritative ore block${hidden===1?'':'s'} since the current runtime started. It does not create client-visible fake ore and does not rewrite vanilla prospecting data.`;\n  acSetChecked('acOreShieldEnabled',enabled);\n  acSetChecked('acOreShieldProtectModded',!!os.protectModdedOres);\n  acSetChecked('acOreShieldRevealUnknown',false);\n  acSetChecked('acOreShieldStrictMatching',os.strictOreMatching!==false);\n  acSetChecked('acOreShieldRevealVein',os.revealWholeVeinOnMine===true);\n  acSetChecked('acOreShieldCacheEnabled',os.chunkCacheEnabled!==false);\n  acSetChecked('acOreShieldLeakAudit',os.leakAuditEnabled!==false);\n  if($('acOreShieldMaxVein')&&!$('acOreShieldMaxVein').matches(':focus'))$('acOreShieldMaxVein').value=String(Number(os.maxVeinRevealBlocks??2048));\n  if($('acOreShieldDiscoveryRange')&&!$('acOreShieldDiscoveryRange').matches(':focus'))$('acOreShieldDiscoveryRange').value=String(Number(os.discoveryRangeBlocks??96));\n  if($('acOreShieldLosInterval')&&!$('acOreShieldLosInterval').matches(':focus'))$('acOreShieldLosInterval').value=String(Number(os.visibilityScanIntervalMs??250));\n  if($('acOreShieldLosChecks')&&!$('acOreShieldLosChecks').matches(':focus'))$('acOreShieldLosChecks').value=String(Number(os.maxLosChecksPerPass??96));\n  if($('acOreShieldViewCone')&&!$('acOreShieldViewCone').matches(':focus'))$('acOreShieldViewCone').value=String(Number(os.viewConeDegrees??140));\n  if($('acOreShieldIdleRescan')&&!$('acOreShieldIdleRescan').matches(':focus'))$('acOreShieldIdleRescan').value=String(Number(os.idleRescanMs??3000));\n  if($('acOreShieldCacheMiB')&&!$('acOreShieldCacheMiB').matches(':focus'))$('acOreShieldCacheMiB').value=String(cacheMiB);\n  if($('acOreShieldMaxChunks')&&!$('acOreShieldMaxChunks').matches(':focus'))$('acOreShieldMaxChunks').value=String(maxChunks);\n  if($('acOreShiel